001	GEN	003	001	Shooshshay GODAA Xoossay medhdhida do7a ubbaafe aadhdhida genanchcha; issi gallas shooshshay he maccassayo, «Xoossi tumu inttena, ‹Edenen diza miththa ayfe ubbaafekka moopite› gidee?» gi oychchides.
