002	EXO	007	004	izi intte yootizayssa siyenna. He wode tani ta kushe Gibxe asaa bolla denththana; tani ta dereta Isra7eele nayta wolqqama pirdan Gibxeppe kessana.
002	EXO	007	005	Qasse Gibxeti tani ta qese Gibxe asaa bolla denththada Isra7eele nayta istta giddofe kessiza wode tani GODAA gididayssa istti erana» gides.
002	EXO	007	006	Museynne Aarooney GODAY istta azazida mala ooththida.
002	EXO	007	007	Istti kawozas yootiza wode Muses layththay osppun tamma; Aarooney qasse 83 layththa asa.
002	EXO	007	008	GODAY Musenne Aaroone,
002	EXO	007	009	«Kawoy inttena, ‹Ane malaata tana bessite› giikko neni Aaroone, ‹Ne guufaa ekkada kawoza sinththan yegga› ga; histtiko izi shoosh gidana» gides.
002	EXO	007	010	Histtiin Museynne Aarooney kawozaakko gelidi GODAY istta azazida mala ooththida; Aarooney ba guufe kawoza sinththaninne daannata sinththan yeggiin guufezi shoosh gidides.
002	EXO	007	011	Hessafe guye kawozi daro eranchchatanne bitizayta xeygisiin Gibxe dere marotikka ba deren hessaththo ooththida.
002	EXO	007	012	Istti wurikka ba guufe guufe gaden yeggiin guufeti wurikka shoosh gidida shin Aaroone guufeya istta guufeta ubbaa mittadus.
002	EXO	007	013	Gidikkoka GODAY yootida mala kawoza wozinay minnida gishshas izi istta yo7o siyontta ixxides.
002	EXO	007	014	GODAY Muses, «Kawoza wozinay muumiin asaa izi yeddontta ixxida gishshas,
002	EXO	007	015	kawozi shaafa biza wode maaladora neni izakko baada izara gaaggana mala Abbaye shaafaa doonan eqqa; hee bashe shooshshan laamettida guufeza oykka ekkada ba.
002	EXO	007	016	Neni iza, ‹GODAA Ibraaweta Xoossay nena, «Bazzon taas goynnana mala ta asaa yedda» giidi tana neekko kiittides shin hanno gakkanaas neni ero gabeekka.
002	EXO	007	017	GODAY, «Tani GODAA gididayssa neni hayssan erana» gides. Tani Abbaye shaafa haaththaa ta kushen diza guufezan shocikko haaththay suuththan laamettana.
002	EXO	007	018	Abbaye shaafaa moleykka hayqqana; shaafaykka xinqqana; Gibxeti he shaafa haaththaa uyanaas dandayettenna› gaada yoota» gides.
002	EXO	007	019	GODAY Muses, «Neni Aaroones, ‹Ne guufe oykkada Gibxe haaththata bolla, shaafata bolla, zara haaththata bollanne eellida haaththi dizaso ubbaa bolla ne kushe piddisa› ga; izi ba kushe piddisikko haaththi wuri suuththan laamettana; Gibxe biitta ubbaan, haray attoshin, miththafenne shuchchafe wooci kessida haath tigiza miishshata ubbaan suuththi kumana» gides.
002	EXO	007	020	Museynne Aarooney GODAY azazida mala ooththida. Kawoza sinththaninne daannata sinththan Aarooney ba guufeza denththidi shaafa haaththaa shociin haaththi wuri suuththan laamettides.
002	EXO	007	021	He shaafa haaththaa giddon diza moleti hayqqida; shaafa haaththi keehi xinqqida gishshas Gibxe asay uyanaas dandaybeenna. Gibxe biittay kumeth suuth xalla gidides.
002	EXO	007	022	Gido attiin Gibxe maroti ba biittan izaththoka ooththida; GODAY yootida malakka kawoza wozinay minnida gishshas Museynne Aarooney yootidayssa siyontta ixxides.
