002	EXO	013	014	Wodeppe ne nay nena, ‹Hayssi aaza wogaa?› gi oychchiko, neni izas, ‹GODAY nuna ba wolqqama qesen aylleteththa biitta Gibxeppe kessides;
002	EXO	013	015	Gibxe kawoy ba wozina minththidi nuna yeddontta ixxiin GODAY Gibxe biittan diza bayra ubbaa, asappe doommidi mehe bayra gakkanaas wodhides. Tani aayi uloppe koyro yelettida adde mehe ubbaa GODAAS yarshizayssinne bayra gidida attuma nayta ubbaa wozzizayssi hessassa› ga.
