002	EXO	013	019	Yooseefey Isra7eele asaa, «Xoossi tumappe inttena maaddana yaana; he wode intte ta meqeththaa hayssafe inttenara ekki biite» giidi caaqeththi woththida gishshas Musey iza meqeththaa banara ekki bides.
