002	EXO	017	009	Musey Iyaaso, «Neni nuus asaa garsafe issi issi as doora ekkada wonto Amaaleeqetara olettana keza; tanikka Xoossa guufe oykkada dhoqqasohon eqqana» gides.
002	EXO	017	010	Iyaasoy Musey gida mala, Amaaleeqetara olettides. Musey, Aarooneynne Huurey dhoqqaso kezida.
