002	EXO	018	002	He wode Muse bollo Yootorey, Musey guye zaari moyzida Muse machcheyo Xipooronne izi nam7u nayta banara ekki yides. Museykka, «Tani asa biittan bete as gidadis» gishe bayra naaza Gershoome gi sunththides.
002	EXO	018	004	Qasseka, «Ta aawaa Xoossi tana maaddides; izi tana Gibxe kawo toorappe ashshides» gishe Nam7anththo naaza El7ezeere gi sunththides.
