002	EXO	018	008	GODAY Isra7eele asaa gishshas Gibxe kawo bollanne Gibxe asaa bolla ooththidayssa, oge bolla istta gakkida daaburanne GODAY istta ashshidayssa ubbaa Musey ba bollozas yootides.
