002	EXO	028	032	He adussa may7ozas hu7ey gelizaso giigsa. Hu7ey kezizasozi daakettontta mala soo bagga qalam7ada yuushsha aaththa sikka.
002	EXO	028	033	Adussa may7ozas garsa bagga maccaraa yuushon salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappe, oroomaane geetettiza miththa ayfe misleta medhdha. Histtada istta giddon worqqafe oosettida daalata walakan woththa.
