002	EXO	028	038	Histtidi Aarooney iza ba liiphen woththo; heen Isra7eele asay GODAAS imota immishe moorida miishshi diikkoka he mooroza Aarooney tookko. Asay ehizayssa GODAY ekkana mala izi he xaafettidayssa ubba wodekka ba liiphen woththanaas koshshees.
002	EXO	028	039	«Aaroone shamize lee7e laynoppe dadda; hu7en xaaxiza goossaka laynoppe giigsa. Qasse danccozakka xilpen alleqissada sikissa.
002	EXO	028	040	Aaroone naytas bonchchonne alleqo gidana mala, shamizeta, danccotanne hu7en xaaxiza goossata giigsa.
002	EXO	028	041	Neni ha may7ota ne isha Aaroonenne iza nayta mayzidaappe guye, istti qeeseteththan taas ooththana mala istta wogara zayte tiya; tiyada istti qeese gididi taas ooththana mala istta dummasa.
002	EXO	028	042	Istta kalloy kamettana mala garsara gixxiza gith, xeessaafe biidi wodira gakkanaas kammizaaz, liiqo layno qacinappe giigsa.
002	EXO	028	043	Aarooneynne iza nayti Xoossa Dunkaane giddo geliza wode woykko gibbe giddon qeeseteththan ooththanaas yarsho yarshizaso shiiqiza wode hayta may7ota may7etto. Hessaththo hankko istti bantta bolla qohonne hayqo ehettenna. Hayssi Aaroonessinne iza zereththatas mernaas woga gido.
002	EXO	029	001	«Aarooneynne iza nayti qeese gididi taas ooththana mala neni istta dummasanaas ooththa; wosoy baynda issi mirgonne nam7u dharshota ekka.
002	EXO	029	002	Lo7o gistte dhiille ekkada irsho yeggontta uketh uukka; qasseka irsho yeggontta zayten guuththa uketh uukka; hessaththoka irsho yeggontta qeeri uketh uukkada zayte tiya.
002	EXO	029	003	Neni heyta leematen woththada, mirgoza nam7u dharshotara issife taas shiishsha.
002	EXO	029	004	«Histtada Aaroonenne iza nayta Xoossa Dunkaaneza penge ehada haaththan meecca.
002	EXO	029	005	Hessafe guye may7ota ekkada, shamize, eefudeppe bollara may7iza adussa may7o, eefudenne tira kiise Aaroone mayzada eefudeza hiillan dadettida danccon danccisa.
002	EXO	029	006	Goossaza iza hu7en goozisada, ‹GODAAS geesh gidi dummatides› geetetti xaafettida alleqoza goossa bolla woththa.
