002	EXO	029	037	Yarshizasoza nagara geesho wogaa laappun gallas gakkanaas wursada iza dummaththa. Histtiko yarshizasozi dumma geeshshasoho gidana. Iza bochchizaadey ubbay geesh gidana bessees.
