002	EXO	029	041	Nam7anththo dharsho laaqqaza omarsa wode yarsha. Maaladoyssa gina dhiille, zaytenne woyne ushshu shiishsha. Hessika GODAAS taman xuugettidi sawo tunnu giza yarsho gidana.
