002	EXO	030	017	Hessafe guye GODAY Muses hizgides,
002	EXO	030	018	«Meechcha kerezanne kereza iza bolla woththiza miish xarqimalappe medhdha. Xoossa Dunkaanezappenne yarshizasozappe giddon woththada izan haath tiga.
