002	EXO	032	005	Aarooney hessa be7idi mara misleza sinththan yarshizaso giigsidi, «Wonto GODAAS ba7aale gallas gidana» gi awajjides.
002	EXO	032	006	Hessa gishshas wonteththa gallas asay wonttara dendidi xuugettiza yarshotanne issifeteththa yarshota yarshides. Histtidi asay maanaassinne uyanaas uttides. Mi uyi simmidi qasse duranaassinne guppanaas dendides.
002	EXO	032	007	Histtiin GODAY Muses, «Ne Gibxeppe kessa ehida ne asay nagara ooththidi banateththaa tunisida gishshas eeson duge wodhdha.
