002	EXO	039	018	He sansalatatas hankko bagga xeeraa qasse eefudezas sinththa baggara, hashe kaqo bolla diza shuch oykkizaytara gaththi qachchida.
002	EXO	039	019	Qasseka nam7u worqqa midigata medhdhidi eefudeppe kaalli diza tira kiisezas soo baggara diza nam7u xeeratan aaththida.
002	EXO	039	020	Hessaththoka worqqafe hara nam7u migidota medhdhidi, eefudezas sinththa baggara, hashe kaqozappe garsa baggara eefude xeessan qachchizayssafe qommora, sikoy gaaggizaso achchan istta oyththida.
002	EXO	039	021	GODAY Muse azazida mala tira kiisen diza migidota eefudezan diza migidotara gaththidi, salo misatiza suqeththan qachchida gishshas tira kiisezi xeessafe bollara diza gishshas, qashoy dol7enna.
002	EXO	039	022	Eefudezappe bollara may7iza qamisa istti mulera salo misatiza carqqafe giigsida; hessika shemmaane oosokko.
002	EXO	039	023	He qamisazas qoodhe aaththizaso medhdhida; qoodhesoy daakettontta mala, soo bagga qalam7idi yuushshi aaththi sikkida.
002	EXO	039	024	Istta qamisazas duge bagga maccara yuushon salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe oroomaane geetettiza miththa ayfe teera misleta medhdhida.
002	EXO	039	025	Qasseka worqqafe daalata medhdhidi qamisatas duge bagga xeera yuushshi aaththidi oroomaane misleta giddon aaththi aaththi walakkida.
002	EXO	039	026	GODAY Muses azazida mala istti Xoossa Dunkaane ooso ooththishe may7ana mala qamisazas duge bagga maccara yuushshi aaththidi daalanne oroomaane teera misle walakki aaththida.
002	EXO	039	027	GODAY Muse azazida mala istti Aaroonessinne iza naytas shemmaaney daddida liiqo laynoppe qolleta giigsida.
002	EXO	039	028	Qasse hu7en xaaxiza shaasheta, qoobetanne garsara may7iza may7ota liiqo laynoppe daddidi giigsida.
002	EXO	039	029	Hessaththoka qasse istti salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe daddidi kushe hiillan alleqissidi dancco giigsida.
002	EXO	039	030	Istti akilile misle walakay baynda worqqafe medhdhidi maatame bolla woociza mala iza bolla, «GODAAS geesh gididi dummatides» gizayssa wooci xaafida.
002	EXO	039	031	Hessafe guye hu7e goossa bolla kaqqana mala, GODAY Muse azazida mala salo misatiza baqeth izan aaththidi qachchida.
002	EXO	039	032	Xoossa Dunkaaneza oosoy wuri mulera polettides. Isra7eele asay ubbaa GODAY Muse azazida mala ooththides.
002	EXO	039	033	Hessafe guye istti Xoossa Dunkaaneza mulera ekkidi Musekko ehida; hessika dunkaanezanne iza miishshaza ubbaa, qapheta, tole miththata, penge gordiza miththata, tuussatanne istti eqqiza tohota,
002	EXO	039	034	bollara kammanaas dharshoza ite zo7o qalamen yeggi kessidayssa, qaacettida galba, genththiza magalasha,
002	EXO	039	035	Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa, iza tookkiza tooho miththata, atto geetettiza kamaa,
002	EXO	039	036	xaraphpheezanne iza miishshe ubbaa GODAA sinththan woththiza geeshsha ukeththaa,
002	EXO	039	037	walakay baynda worqqafe oosettida xomppe woththizasozanne izan maaran diza xomppeta, istta miishshata ubbaanne xomppe zayte,
002	EXO	039	038	worqqafe oosettida exaane cuwasizasoza, tiyettiza zayte, sawiza exaane, Xoossa Dunkaane penge magalasha,
002	EXO	039	039	xarqimalappe ooththida yarshizasoza, xarqimala zayzareza, iza tookkiza tooho mith, iza miishshata ubbaa, meechcha kerenne kereza iza bolla woththiza miishshata,
002	EXO	039	040	Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge godaa genththiza magalashata, iza tuussata, istti eqqiza tohota, Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge geliza pengeta magalashata, Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge wodorotanne dhishketa, Xoossa Dunkaanezas koshshiza miishshata ubba;
002	EXO	039	041	Qeeseti Geeshsha soon ooththidi may7anaas dadettida may7ota, Aarooneynne iza nayti qeeseteththan ooththishe may7iza may7ota.
002	EXO	039	042	Isra7eele asay oosoza ubbaa GODAY Muse azazida mala ooththides.
002	EXO	039	043	Musey oosoza xomosi xeellidi istta GODAY azazida mala ooththidayssa be7ides. Hessa gishshas Musey istta anjjides.
002	EXO	040	001	Hessafe guye GODAY Muse,
002	EXO	040	002	«Koyro aginan koyro gallas, neni Xoossa Dunkaane tola.
002	EXO	040	003	Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa iza giddon woththada Taabotaza magalashan genththa.
002	EXO	040	004	Xaraphpheezaa gelththada iza bolla wodhdhanaas koshshiza miishshata ubbaa iza bolla woththa. Histtada xomppeta iza bolla woththiza miishshaza soo gelththada iza bolla xomppeta woththa.
002	EXO	040	005	Worqqafe oosettida exaane cuwasizasoza Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa sinththan woththada, Xoossa Dunkaaneza giddo geliza penge magalashaza kaqqa.
002	EXO	040	006	«Xuugettiza yarsho yarshizasoza Xoossa Dunkaanezi geliza penge sinththan woththa.
002	EXO	040	007	Izan meecettiza kereza Xoossa Dunkaanezappenne yarshizasozappe giddon woththada haaththe izan tiga.
002	EXO	040	008	Xoossa Dunkaanezappe karera yuushsha aaththada Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge giigsada dubbushaa gelizason magalasha kaqqa.
002	EXO	040	009	«Tiyettiza zayteza ekkada Xoossa Dunkaanezanne iza giddon dizayssa ubbaa tiya; izanne iza giddon go7ettiza miishshata ubbaa dummasa; histtiko izi geesh gidana.
002	EXO	040	010	Hessafe guye xuugettiza yarsho yarshizasonne izas go7ettiza miishshaa ubbaa tiya; yarshizasoza dummasa; histtiko izi ubbaafe aadhdhida geesh gidana.
002	EXO	040	011	Meechcha kerezanne kereza iza bolla woththiza miishshata tiyada istta dummasa.
002	EXO	040	012	«Neni Aaroonenne iza nayta Xoossa Dunkaanezi geliza penge ehada haaththan meecca.
002	EXO	040	013	Hessafe guye qeeseteththa may7oza Aaroone mayzada izi taas qeeseteththan ooththana mala iza tiyada dummasa.
002	EXO	040	014	Iza attuma naytakka ehada qolle mayza.
002	EXO	040	015	Istti taas qeeseteththan ooththana mala, istta aawaa tiyda mala, isttaka tiya. Istta tiyeteththankka isttanne istta yeletay wuri qeese gididi ooththana mala ta ooththana» gides.
002	EXO	040	016	Musey ubbaaka GODAY bana azazida mala ooththides.
002	EXO	040	017	Hessa gishshas Gibxeppe istti kezida nam7anththo layththan, koyro aginan koyro gallassan Xoossa Dunkaaney tolettides.
002	EXO	040	018	Musey Xoossa Dunkaaneza essiza wode Dunkaaneza toho istta sohon sohon woththides; tole miththatanne tuussaa aaththides; gordiza miththatakka gelththides.
002	EXO	040	019	Hessafe guye Musey GODAY azazida mala dunkaaneza tolidi iza bollara kama kammides.
002	EXO	040	020	Histtidi tammu azazoti xaafettida masettida shuchchata efidi Taabotaza giddon woththides; tookkiza tooho miththata Taabotaan aaththides; maaroteththa kamaakka Taabotaa bolla woththides.
002	EXO	040	021	Hessafe guye Taabotaza Xoossa Dunkaaneza giddo gelththides; genththiza magalashaa kaqqidi, GODAY azazida mala Caaqo Qaala Taabotaza kammides.
002	EXO	040	022	GODAY Muse azazida mala, Musey xaraphpheezaza Xoossa Dunkaanezan gelththidi, magalashaappe karera hu7esora woththidi,
002	EXO	040	023	iza bolla GODAA sinththan woththiza geeshsha uketh giigsides.
002	EXO	040	024	GODAY Muse azazida mala, xomppe woththizasoza Xoossa Dunkaane giddo gelththidi, xaraphpheezas sinththa baggara, Xoossa Dunkaanezas tohosora woththides;
002	EXO	040	025	qasse xomppeta GODAA sinththan oyththides.
002	EXO	040	026	GODAY azazida mala, worqqafe oosettida exaane cuwasizasoza Xoossa Dunkaaneza giddo gelththidi magalashazas sinththa baggara woththidi,
002	EXO	040	027	iza bolla sawiza exaane cuwasides.
002	EXO	040	028	Hessafe guye Xoossa Dunkaaneza pengen magalashaa kaqqides.
002	EXO	040	029	Xuugettiza yarsho yarshizasoza Xoossa Dunkaane gelizaso penge achchan woththides; iza bolla xuugettiza yarshonne kaththa yarsho GODAY azazida mala yarshides.
002	EXO	040	030	Meechcha kereza Xoossa Dunkaanezappenne yarshizasozappe giddon woththides. Histtidi meecettanaas haaththe izan tigides.
002	EXO	040	031	Musey, Aarooneynne iza nayti ba kushenne ba toho izan meecettida.
002	EXO	040	032	GODAY Muse azazida mala, istti Xoossa Dunkaanen geliza wode woykko yarshizaso shiiqiza wode aydekka meecetteettes.
002	EXO	040	033	Xoossa Dunkaanen yarshizaso yuushshi aaththidi dubbusha giigsides; he dubbushaa pengen magalasha kaqqides. Hessaththo histtidi Musey oosoza polides.
002	EXO	040	034	Hessafe guye shaaray Xoossa Dunkaaneza kammides; GODAA bonchchoyka iza kumides.
002	EXO	040	035	Shaaray Xoossa Dunkaaneza bolla uttida gishshassinne GODAA bonchchoy iza giddon kumida gishshas Musey iza giddo gelanaas dandaybeenna.
002	EXO	040	036	Isra7eele asay ba oge ubbaan, he shaaray Xoossa Dunkaanezappe dendiza wode aydekka iza kaallidi beettes.
002	EXO	040	037	Gido attiin he shaaray dendontta ixxiko izi dendana gallassay gakkanaas isttika qaaxxettenna.
002	EXO	040	038	Istta oge ubbaan GODAA shaaray Isra7eele asay wuri be7ishin, gallas gallas Xoossa Dunkaane kammeessinne qamma qamma qasse tamay he shaaraa giddon eexxees.
#
# BOOK	003	LEV	Leviticus	Leweta Maxaafa
003	LEV	001	001	GODAY Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon dishe Muse xeygidi hizgi azazides,
003	LEV	001	002	«Isra7eele asay GODAAS yarsho shiishshiza wode istti naagana wogay hayssafe kaallizayssa; issi issi asi miizappe gidiin dorsafe woykko deyshafe gidiin ay qommo yarshoka shiishshiza wode,
003	LEV	001	003	hessika miizappe issaa xuugettiza yarshos shiishshanaas koykko issi boreykka iza bolla baynda mirgo boora dooridi eho; histtiko izi GODAA ufayssiza yarsho gidana mala Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza pengen shiishsho.
003	LEV	001	004	Xuugettiza yarsho shiishshizaadey ba shiishshiza booraa hu7e bolla ba kushe woththo; he yarshozikka iza nagaraa wursanaas GODAY ekkiza lo7o yarsho gidana.
003	LEV	001	005	Hessaadey mirgoza heen GODAA sinththan shukko; histtiko Aaroone zereththatappe gidida qeeseti booraza suuththaa GODAAS shiishshetto; Gaytoteththa Dunkaanen geliza penge baggara diza yarsho yarshizasoza bolla lanqera yuuyi aadhdhanaas suuththaa wuxxetto.
003	LEV	001	006	Hessafe guye he yarshoza shiishshizayssi he shukettida meheza galbaa shooqidi kesso; ashoza qommon qommon qanxxereththo.
003	LEV	001	007	Qeese Aaroone zereth gidida qeeseti yarsho yarshizasoza bolla mith gophidi tama eeththetto.
003	LEV	001	008	Qeeseza Aaroone zereth gidida qeeseti he meheza ashoza qommon qommon shaakkidi hu7ezanne handaza gujjidi yarsho shiishshizason korettida miththaa bolla woththetto.
003	LEV	001	009	He yarshoza shiishshizayssi he meheza qanththa ashozanne guye gedata haaththan meecco; qeesezi yarshoza ubbaa yarshizasoza bolla xuuggo; hayssa mala taman xuugettiza yarsho sawoy GODAA ufayssees.
003	LEV	001	010	«Izaadey ba dorsafe woykko ba deyshafe issaa xuugettiza yarshos shiishshana koykko issi borey iza bolla baynda dharsho woykko orge gido.
003	LEV	001	011	Hessaka yarsho shiishshizasozappe pudeha baggara Xoossa sinththan shukko; Aaroone zereth gidida qeeseti suuththaa ekkidi yarsho yarshizasoza bolla yuuyi aadhdhanaas wuxxetto.
003	LEV	001	012	He yarshaa shiishshizaadey he shukkida ashoza qommon qommon qanxxi kessidaappe guye he oosozas doorettida qeesey he kessida ashoza ubbaa hu7ezanne handazakka issife yarsho yarshizason gophettidi taman eexxiza miththaa bolla woththo;
003	LEV	001	013	Addezi he mehezas qanththa ashozanne nam7u gedata haaththan meecco; qeesezikka hessa ubbaa GODAAS yarsho ooththi shiishshidi yarsho shiishshizasoza bolla ubbaa xuuggo; hessa mala taman xuugettiza yarsho sawoy Xoossaa ufayssees.
003	LEV	001	014	«Issaadey GODAAS xuugettiza yarsho kafoppe shiishshana koykko haraphphe ciye woykko waanose geetettiza kafoppe gidanaas dandayees.
003	LEV	001	015	Qeesezikka he kafoza ekkidi gede yarshozaso shiishshidi kafoza qoodhe mirqqo; yarshoza shiishshida tamaan iza xuuggo; suuththika yarshoy iza bolla shiiqizayssa millera duge xoketto.
003	LEV	001	016	Baallezanne qanththa ashoza dumma shaakkidi yarsho iza bolla shiishshizasozappe arshey mokkiza baggara bidinththi qolettizason yegetto.
003	LEV	001	017	Qefeta oykkidi nam7u kessi phalqidi ashoza mulera shaakki yeggontta dishe yarsho shiishshizasoza bolla diza tamaan mulera xuuggo; hessa mala taman xuugettiza yarsho sawoy GODAA ufayssees.
003	LEV	002	001	«Ay asikka Xoossas kaththa yarsho shiishshiza wode liiqo dhiille shiishshana bessees; he dhiilleza bolla wogara zaytenne exaane gujjo;
003	LEV	002	002	Aaroone zereththafe gidida qeesetakko ekki yo; he wode iza ooso taray gakkida qeesey he dhiillezappe ba kuphpha kumeththa zaytezanne exaaneza ekkidi wurikka Xoossas shiiqidayssa erisanaas yarsho shiishshizayssa bolla taman xuuggo; hessa mala kaththa yarsho sawoy Xoossaa ufayssees.
003	LEV	002	003	Kaththa yarshofe attida dhiilley Aaroone zereththafe gidida qeesetas imetto; hessika Xoossas shiiqida yarshofe shaaketti ekettida gishshas haratappe keehi dummatees.
003	LEV	002	004	«Yarshozi ukeththi uukettiza bashen uukettidaa gidikkoka irshoy bochchonttaaz gido; izikka wogara miththa zaytera walakettidi liiqo dhiillera uukettida qeeri uketh woykko zayten gindetti uukettida uketh gidanaas bessees.
003	LEV	002	005	«Yarshozi tama coocen kompettidaaz gidikko irshoy bochchontta wogara miththa zaytey gujettidi liiqo dhiillefe giigettidaaz gido.
003	LEV	002	006	Ne ukeththaza basereththada iza bolla wogara miththa zayte gussada kaththa yarsho shiishsha.
003	LEV	002	007	«Yarshozi qeeri bashen uukettida ukeththa mala gidikko wogara miththa zaytey izan gujetti munuqettida liiqo dhiillefe giigidaaz gido.
003	LEV	002	008	Kaththa Yarsho Xoossas imettiza yarsho histta qeesezas imma; qeesezikka yarsho yarshizason yarsho.
003	LEV	002	009	Qeesezi hessa he yarshozappe baggaa ekkidi ubbaa GODAY izi shiishshidayssa yuushshi qoppana mala yarsho yarshizason diza tamaan xuuggo; hayssa mala taman xuugettiza yarsho sawoy GODAA ufayssees.
003	LEV	002	010	Yarshishin attidayssi qasse qeesetas imetto; hessika GODAAS shiiqida yarshofe shaaketti ekettida gishshas haratappe keehi dummatees.
003	LEV	002	011	«GODAAS xuugetti yarshettiza kaththa yarshora shiiqiza irsho gidiin woykko ees gidikkoka ne taman xuugganaas bessontta gishshas ne GODAAS shiishshiza kaththa yarshon ubbaan aykko irshoyka izan geloppo.
003	LEV	002	012	Layththan layththan kath shiishshiza wode koyro maxettida kaththaafe xeera yarsho ooththidi GODAAS ekki yiite; he yarshozi yarsho yarshizasozan taman xuugettofo.
003	LEV	002	013	Ay qommo kaththa yarshonkka maxiney dhayoppo; hessi neni ne Xoossaara caaqettida caaqo qaalaas malata; hessa gishshas ne shiishshiza kaththa yarsho ubbaa maxinera mal7inththa ooththa.
003	LEV	002	014	Kath shiishshiza koyro aginan kaththa xeera ne shiishshiza wode caacettidi shigechchettida tiya gido.
003	LEV	002	015	Hayssi kaththa yarsho gidida gishshas iza bolla wogara miththa zaytenne exaane gujja.
003	LEV	002	016	Qeesezikka he yarshozappe bagga ekkidi izi GODAAS shiiqidaaz gididayssa akeekissana mala zaytezakka, exaanezakka ubbaa kaththara issife xuuggo.
003	LEV	003	001	«Ay asikka saroteththa gishshas ba meheppe GODAAS issifeteththa yarsho shiishshiza wode iza bolla wosoy baynda mirgo woykko macca miiz dooridi eho.
003	LEV	003	002	Yarsho ehizaadey yarshos izi shiishshiza meheza bolla ba kushe woththidi Gaytoteththa Dunkaane penge matan shukko; Aaroone zereth gidida qeeseti suuththaa izappe ekkidi yarshoy yarshettizasoza milleza bolla yuuyi aadhdhanaas wuxxetto.
003	LEV	003	003	Issifeteththa yarshos shiiqiza yarshozappe GODAAS taman xuugettiza yarsho gidi shiiqanayti qanththa ashota goozi oykkida handaa kumeth,
003	LEV	003	004	kilahotanne istta bolla diza handaa hessaththoka tire goozi oykkida handatappe doorettidayta.
003	LEV	003	005	Qeeseti hessa ubbaa hara xuugettiza yarshora gaththi yarsho yarshizason xuugetto; hessa mala taman xuugettiza yarsho sawoy GODAA ufayssees.
003	LEV	003	006	«Issifeteththas shiiqiza yarshoy dorsafe woykko deyshafe gidikko adde woykko macca gididi istta bolla wosoy bayndayta gidetto.
003	LEV	003	007	Issi asi GODAAS shiishshiza yarshoy dorsa laaqqa gidikko,
003	LEV	003	008	ba kusheza laaqqaa hu7e bolla woththidi Dunkaaneza penge bolla shukko; qeeseti suuththaa izappe ekkidi yarsho yarshizasoza bolla milleza yuuyi aadhdhanaas wuxxetto.
003	LEV	003	009	Issifeteththa yarshos shiiqiza yarshozappe GODAAS taman xuugettiza yarsho gidi shiiqanayti handazanne zokko meqeththa garsafe qanxxettida goyna ubbaa, qanththa asho goozi oykkida handa ubbaa,
003	LEV	003	010	kilahotanne istta goozi oykkida handa ubbaa qasse tire kammi oykkida lo7o handa ubbaa,
003	LEV	003	011	qeesezikka hessa ubbaa GODAAS kaththa yarsho histti shiishshidi yarsho yarshizasoza bolla xuuggo.
003	LEV	003	012	«Issi asi GODAAS yarsho deyshe shiishshizaa gidikko,
003	LEV	003	013	ba kushe deyshaza hu7e bolla woththidi Dunkaaneza sinththan shukko; qeeseti suuththaa izappe ekkidi yarshoy yarshettizasoza bolla milleza yuuyi aadhdhanaas wuxxetto.
003	LEV	003	014	He shukettida ashozappe hayssafe kaalliza asho qommota kaththa yarsho ooththidi GODAAS shiishshetto; heytikka qanththa asho kammiza handa ubbaa,
003	LEV	003	015	kilahotanne istta goozi oykkida handaa, qasseka tire kammi oykkida lo7o handazappe ekketto.
003	LEV	003	016	Qeesezikka hessa taman xuugetti sawiza yarsho ooththidi yarsho yarshizason xuuggo; handay wuri GODAAS shaakettidi dummato.
003	LEV	003	017	Isra7eele naytappe handa mizaadey woykko mehe suuth uyizaadey dooppo; hessi wuri Isra7eele nayti dizasoninne istti diza wode ubbaan mernaas eqqi diza woga gido.»
003	LEV	004	001	Xoossi Muse hizgi azazides;
003	LEV	004	002	«Neni Isra7eele naytas yootanayssi hayssa; oonikka erontta baleteththan nagara ooththiko woykko erontta GODAA azazotappe issaa moorikko hayssafe kaalliza wogaa naago!
003	LEV	004	003	«He wode tiyettida qeesey nagara ooththidi derezi nagara ooththidaa misatissi beettiko iza bolla issi wosoykka baynda issi mirgo boora ehidi ba nagaraa gishshas GODAAS yarsho shiishsho.
003	LEV	004	004	Kormaza dunkaaneza penge ehidi ba kushe iza hu7e bolla woththidi GODAA sinththan shukko.
003	LEV	004	005	Hessafe guye qeeseta halaqay he booraza suuththaafe guuththara ekkidi gede dunkaaneza giddo gelo;
003	LEV	004	006	GODAA Keeththa magalashaas sinththa baggara eqqidi ba biradhdhe suuththaan gelththi gelththi kessidi laappunto gakkanaas wuxxo.
003	LEV	004	007	Izappe guuththa suuth ekkidi Dunkaaneza giddon exaane yarshizasozan oyddu baggara diza dhemota bolla woththo; hankko attida suuththaa dunkaanezan geliza penge baggara xuugettiza yarshoy yarshettizaso garsan gusso.
