003	LEV	018	018	«Ne machchiya paxa dishin izi michchiyo dawuth ekkofa; izirakka laymatoppa.
003	LEV	018	019	«Aginan aginan beettiza maccassa wogay yiza wode maccassara zin7ofa.
003	LEV	018	020	«Hara asa machchira zin7ada nerkka nena tunisoppa.
003	LEV	018	021	«Ne naytappe oonakka molooke geetettiza eeqas xuugettiza yarsho ooththa immofa; gaasoykka ne Xoossaa sunth tunisoppa; tani GODAA.
003	LEV	018	022	«GODAA sinththan ixettida miish gidida gishshas maccassara zin7iza mala addera zin7ofa.
003	LEV	018	023	«Adde gidiin woykko maccassi mehera parattidi banateththaa tunisoppo; hessa mala hanoy kawushshateththa.
003	LEV	018	024	«GODAY nena istta dere gelththanaas ne sinththafe diggana; hankko asay barkka ba ooson bana tunisidayssa mala istti ooththiza iita oosotappe issineynka inttena tunisopite.
003	LEV	018	025	Istta oosoy biitta tunisida gishshas tani he biittayo izi nagara gishshas qaxxayadis; biittayakka ba giddon diza asaa kessa cuttadus.
003	LEV	018	026	Intte gidikko ta azazotanne ta woga naagite; Isra7eele asaappe woykko intte giddon diza hara biitta asappe oonikka hayssa mala ay oosokka ooththofte.
003	LEV	018	027	Inttefe kase he biittayn diza asati heyta mala harassiza miish ooththida gishshas biittaya tunadus.
003	LEV	018	028	Intte hessaththo ooththiko biittaya kase inttefe sinththan diza kawoteththata cuttidayssaththo inttenakka cuttana.
003	LEV	018	029	«Hayta harassiza iita oosotappe issineyokka ooththizaadey ba dere asaa giddofe shaaketti dhayo.
003	LEV	018	030	Hessa gishshas inttefe kase sinththan biitta bolla diza asati ooththida tuna oosota ubbaa ooththidi intte tunontta mala ta azazota naagite; tani GODAA intte Xoossaa.»
003	LEV	019	001	GODAY Muse hizgides,
003	LEV	019	002	«Hayssa Isra7eele naytas yoota, ‹Tani GODAY intte Xoossay dumma gidida mala intteka dumma gidite.
003	LEV	019	003	«‹Inttefe oonikka attontta ba aawaanne ba aayo bonchcho; ta inttena azazida mala Sambata gallassata bonchcho; tani GODAA intte Xoossaa.
003	LEV	019	004	«‹Tana aggidi eeqatas goynnofte; woykko eeqa Xoossata biratappe seerisidi inttes medhdhofte; tani GODAA intte Xoossaa.
003	LEV	019	005	«‹Intte issifeteththa yarsho GODAAS shiishshiza wode he yarshoy intte gishshas ekettana bessiza mala yarshite.
003	LEV	019	006	Yarshoza shiishshida gallas woykko wonteththa gallas meetettanaas bessees; heedzdzanththo gallas gakkanaas gam7ida yarshoy wurikka taman xuugetto.
003	LEV	019	007	Heedzdzanththo gallassan iza miikko hessi tuna; hessa gishshas tani he yarshoza ekkike.
003	LEV	019	008	Izappe midaadey oonikka taas dummatidayssa hada miishsha mala qoodida gishshas izi ba nagaran oyshettana; hessaadey ba dere asaa giddofe shaaketti dhayo.
003	LEV	019	009	«‹Intte maxa wode intte kath maxishin gaxa bolla diza kath maxopite; intte maxishin geedon attida puushechcho maxanaas guye simmofte.
003	LEV	019	010	Neni ne woyne miththa ayfe maxishin hagga giddon qotetti attidayssa woykko gaden qoqofettidayssa qora ekkanaas guye simmofa; heytantta ubbaa manqotassinne bete yidaytas aggaaga; tani GODAA intte Xoossaa.
003	LEV	019	011	«‹Kaysotopite; as baleththofte; wordo haasayopite;
003	LEV	019	012	«‹Ta sunththan wordora caaqqofte; wordo caaqqidi intte Xoossa sunththaa tunisopite; tani GODAA intte Xoossaa.
003	LEV	019	013	«‹As baleththofa; woykko asa miishshe bonqqa ekkofa; miishshe immana gaada ne ooso oosisidaades miishshaa immontta dashe ne achchan issi qammaka ayssofa.
003	LEV	019	014	«‹Siyenna gaada tulle cayoppa; qooqey dhuphettidi kundana mala iza sinththan dhuphizaaz woththofa; ne Xoossas yayya; tani GODAA ne Xoossa.
003	LEV	019	015	«‹Neni pirda pirdiza wode pirda geellasoppa; manqo iza manqoteththa gishshas maadda pirdofa; gita asatas dumma bonchcho immofa; dere asaakka dumma maadda pirdofa; asa ubbaas tumu pirda pirda.
003	LEV	019	016	«‹Neni asa giddon zigirs ekkada yuuyoppa; ne shooroza hayqos gaththiza ay miishshika ooththofa; tani ne GODAA.
003	LEV	019	017	«‹Ne isha ne wozinan ixxofa; iza gaason nees nagara gidontta mala ne shooroza hanqa.
003	LEV	019	018	«‹As ubbaa ne nena siiqiza mala siiqa attiin ay asa bollaka ne ulon lancce oykkada halo kessofa; tani GODAA.
003	LEV	019	019	«‹Ta azazota naagite; dumma dumma qommo meheta issi bolla gaththi mehetisofte; nam7u qommo kaththa zereth walakkidi issi bolla zeropite; nam7u qommo miishshafe dadettida may7o may7ofte.
003	LEV	019	020	«‹Issaadey hara asara giigetta uttida aylleyra laymatikko izakka ba aylleteththafe wozzettonttaaro gidikko izaadey qaxxayetto; gidikkoka iza wozzettontta gishshas nam7ayka hayqqofetto.
003	LEV	019	021	Hessa mala qoho gaththidaadey qoho gishshas shiiqiza yarshos issi dharsho gaytoteththa dunkaane penge GODAA sinth eho.
003	LEV	019	022	Qeesezikka hessaade nagara wursanaas Xoossa sinththan qoho yarshos imettida dharshoza shiishsho; izaade nagaraykka atto geetettana.
003	LEV	019	023	«‹Intte Kanaane gelidi ayfe ayfiza mith tokkiko he ayfe ayfiza miththaya ayfe doommoosofe biidi heedzdzu layth gakkanaas immiza ayfey meetettontta digettidayssa erite; he layththatan he miththata ayfe moopite.
003	LEV	019	024	Oydanththo layththa bolla he miththaa ayfey ubbay GODAAS galatas shiishshiza yarsho gido.
003	LEV	019	025	Ichchashanththo layththan qasse miththaa ayfeza inttes miite; intte hessaththo histtiko ayfe ayfiza intte miththay woden woden inttes immiza ayfey kaseppe gede gujetti gujetti baana; tani GODAA intte Xoossaa.
003	LEV	019	026	«‹Suuththara diza ay ashokka moopite; maroththoftenne bita bitopite.
003	LEV	019	027	«‹Intte hu7e binana garsara yuushshi aaththidi qanxxofte; intte buuchchaaka qaanththan qanxxofte.
003	LEV	019	028	«‹Intte asateththa bolla niqse cach caddofte; woykko asi hayqqiko izas mishettidi intte bolla qanxxi madunththofte; tani GODAA.
003	LEV	019	029	«‹Biittaya laymaninne tunateththan kumontta mala ne nayo laymateththa oosos aaththa immada kawushshofa.
003	LEV	019	030	Ta Sambata gallassata naagite; ta keeththaa bonchchite; tani GODAA.
003	LEV	019	031	«‹Moytille haasayssizayta woykko iita ayanata haasayssizayta zore oychchofa; intte tunontta mala istta koyopite; tani GODAY intte Xoossa.
003	LEV	019	032	«‹Neeppe cimmidaade beykko ne uttidasohoppe denda eqqada bonchcha; taas Xoossas yashshateththan azazetta; tani GODAA.
003	LEV	019	033	«‹Hara biittafe yiidi intte giddon diza asata qohopite.
003	LEV	019	034	Intte intte dere asas ooththiza mala isttaskka lo7o ooththite; intte inttena siiqiza mala isttaka siiqite; kase intteka Gibxe biittan beteta gididayssa yuushshi qopite; tani GODAA intte Xoossaa.
003	LEV	019	035	«‹Maka miishshen gidiin woykko meezaanen woykko wadha miishshan as cimmofte.
003	LEV	019	036	As cimmontta tumu meezaaney, maka miishshinne mixe miishshi inttes de7o; tani inttena Gibxeppe kessida GODAA intte Xoossa.
003	LEV	019	037	«‹Ta inttes immida ta azazotanne ta wogata ubbaa naagitenne ooththite; tani intte GODAA.›»
003	LEV	020	001	GODAY Muse hizgides,
003	LEV	020	002	«Isra7eele nayta, ‹Inttena gidikkonne intte giddon diza hara dere asatappe oonikka molooke geetetti xeygettiza eeqa xoossas ba naytappe issaa aaththi immi beettiko kumeththa Isra7eele dere asay hessaade shuchchan caddi wodho.
003	LEV	020	003	Oonikka ba naytappe issaade molookes aaththi immidi ta keeththaa tunisida gishshassinne geeshshaa sunththaa tayssa kawushshida gishshas ta hessaade bolla qixaate yeddana; hessafe guye ta izaades morkke gidada dere giddofe iza shaakka dhayssana.
003	LEV	020	004	Iza dere asay izaadey ooththoyssa ubbaaka wudettontta bessi aggikonne wodhontta aggiko,
003	LEV	020	005	tani ta baggara hessaadenne izaadeso asaa qasseka taas ammanettontta molookes goynnon izara issife gididayta ubbaa bolla iita hanqo yeddana; hessafe guye heytantta tani istta istta dereza giddofe shaakka dhayssana.
003	LEV	020	006	«‹Oonikka isttafe zore oychchanaas moytille xeygizaytakkonne marotakko biikko hessaade bolla ta iita hanqo yeddana; hessafe guye hessaade tani iza dere giddofe shaakka dhayssana.
003	LEV	020	007	«‹Intte asateth ubbaa geeshshite; dummatite; gaasoykka tani GODAA intte Xoossaa.
003	LEV	020	008	Ta azazoyo naagitenne polite; gaasoykka tani inttena taas dummasida intte GODAA.
003	LEV	020	009	«‹Ba aawa woykko ba aayo cayizaadey hayqon qaxxayetto; izi hayqon qaxxayettizay ba mooronna.
003	LEV	020	010	«‹Issi asi hara asa machchira laymatikko he laymatida addezaranne maccassayra nam7ayka hayqon qaxxayettetto.
003	LEV	020	011	Issi asi ba aawa machchira laymatikko ba aawa kawushshida gishshas he laymatidayti nam7ayka hayqon qaxxayettetto; istti hayqon qaxxayettizay ba moorida mooronna.
003	LEV	020	012	Issi asi baas naaza machchira laymatikko he laymatidayti nam7ayka hayqon qaxxayettetto; asho dabboteth layman tunisida gishshas istti hayqon qaxxayettizay ba moorida mooronna.
003	LEV	020	013	«‹Issi asi maccara zin7iza mala addey addera zin7iko nam7ayka yeellachchiza miish ooththida gishshas hayqon qaxxayettetto; istti hayqon qaxxayettizay ba moorida mooronna.
003	LEV	020	014	«‹Issi asi aayeyonne nayo machcho ekkiko heytantti ooththida harassiza hanoza gishshas heedzdzayka taman xuugetti hayqqetto; heytantta mala iita hanoy intte giddon polettanaas bessenna.
003	LEV	020	015	«‹Ay asikka mehera paratikko izaadeynne he mehezi nam7ay hayqqetto.
003	LEV	020	016	«‹Issi maccassi mehera paratikko izanne he iza parattida mehey nam7ay hayqqetto; istti hayqqizay ba moorida mooronna.
003	LEV	020	017	«‹Issi asi ba michchiyo, baas aayi nayo woykko aawa nayo machcho ekkiko hessi yeellachchizaaza; hessa gishshas istti bantta dere giddofe shaaketti dhayetto; ba ooththida mooro gishshas ba qixaate ekketto.
003	LEV	020	018	«‹Issi asi aginan aginan beettiza maccassa wogay beettida maccassara zin7iko izaadey izi kalloteth qaarida gishshassinne izakka ba kalloteththaa qaara bessida gishshas nam7ayka bantta dere giddofe shaaketti dhayetto.
003	LEV	020	019	«‹Ay asikka ba aawa michchira woykko ba aayi michchira zin7ofo; hessaththo ooththizaa gidikko nam7ayka bantta dabboteththa kawushshiza gishshas ba moorida mooron oyshettana.
003	LEV	020	020	«‹Ay asikka ba aawa isha machchira woykko ba aayey isha machchira laymatikko ba aawa isha machcho woykko ba aayi isha yeellasida gishshas laymatidayti nam7ayka oyshettananne yeloy baynda attana.
003	LEV	020	021	Ay asikka ba isha machcho ekkizaa gidikko hessi tuna ooththees; ba ishaza bonchcho kawushshida gishshas nam7ayka naa yelontta attana.
003	LEV	020	022	«‹Ta inttena izin gelththana Kanaane biittaya inttena cutta diggontta mala intte ta azazotanne ta wogata naagitenne polite.
003	LEV	020	023	Tani intte sinththafe dhayssiza kawoteththata lose woga kaallofte; istti heytantta ubbaa ooththida gishshas ta istta shaatettadis.
003	LEV	020	024	Ta qasse izippe maaththinne eessi goggiza he cilila biittayo inttena gelththanaas caaqqadis; izokka ta inttes immana; hankko dereppe intte taas shaakettidayta gidana mala ooththiday tana GODAA intte Xoossaa.
003	LEV	020	025	«‹Hessa gishshas intte geesh gidida mehetanne kafota tuna gididaytappe lo7eththidi shaakki erite; tani haytanti inttes tuna ga woththida mehetan, kafotaninne biitta bolla qaaxxiza ay miishshankka inttena tunisopite.
003	LEV	020	026	Intte taas dumma shaakettidayta gidite; gaasoykka tani GODAY dumma Xoossa; intte ta dereta gidana mala Ayzaabeta giddofe tani inttena taas dummasa shaakkadis.
003	LEV	020	027	«‹Ay asikka intte giddofe moytille xeygizaa woykko marotizaade gidikko izi shuchchan cadetti hayqo; hessaththo ooththizaadey ay asikka hayqon qaxxayettizay ba ooththida mooronna› ga yoota.»
003	LEV	021	001	GODAY Muses, «Aaroone naytas qeesetas, ‹Inttefe oonikka ba dabbota garsafe asi hayqqiko izaade aha bochchidi bana tunisoppo.
003	LEV	021	002	Mata dabbotappe aaya woykko aaway woykko ba nay woykko ba ishay hayqqiko,
003	LEV	021	003	hessaththoka azina gelontta ixxada diza michcheya hayqqiko istta aha bochchanaas dandayees.
003	LEV	021	004	Gido attiin geloninne ekon dabbotidayti aha bochchidi bana tunisopetto.
003	LEV	021	005	«‹Qeesetappe oonikka hayqqidaades mishettidi ba hu7e binana buucoppo; ba buuchcheka buucoppo; ba bollaka qaaci madunththofo.
003	LEV	021	006	Qeesey wurikka taas dumma gido; bantta Xoossaa sunththaa tunisopetto; gaasoykka istti Xoossas taman xuugettiza yarshonne GODAAS kaththa yarsho shiishshizayta gidida gishshas istti geesh gidetto.
003	LEV	021	007	«‹Qeese gididaadey layma maccas woykko geela7oteththi ekettida geela7oyo woykko gela kezida maccas machcho ekkofo; gaasoykka qeeseti Xoossas dummatidayta;
003	LEV	021	008	qeesey intte Xoossas kaththa yarsho shiishshizayssa gidida gishshas izi hara asappe dumma gido; tani inttena geeshshiza intte GODAY geeshsha; izikka geesh gido.
003	LEV	021	009	Qeese macca nay laymatikko iza ba aawaa kawushshida gishshas taman xuugetta hayqqu.
003	LEV	021	010	«‹Qeeseta halaqay izi ba hu7e tiyettiza zaytey tiyettida gishshassinne qeeseteththa may7o may7ana mala dummatidaade gidida gishshas asi hayqqiko hayqqidaades izi mishettizayssa erisanaas ba hu7e binana buucoppo; ba may7oka daakkofo.
003	LEV	021	011	Ahay dizasokka izi geloppo; haray attoshin ba aawa woykko ba aayey ahakka bochchidi bana tunisoppo.
003	LEV	021	012	Iza dummasanaas tiyda Xoossa zaytey iza bolla diza gishshas qeesey Xoossa Keeththafe kezi biidi Xoossa Keeththaa tunisoppo.
003	LEV	021	013	«‹Qeesey ekkana machcha geela7o gidu.
003	LEV	021	014	Azinay hayqqidaaro woykko gela kezidaaro woykko layma maccas ekkofo; gelontta geela7o xalla ba dere asaa giddofe doori ekko.
003	LEV	021	015	Hessaththo histtontta aggiko izi ba dere giddon ba nayta tunisana; iza dumma shaakkida GODAY tana Xoossaa› ga yoota» gides.
003	LEV	021	016	GODAY Muse hizgi azazides;
003	LEV	021	017	«Aaroones, ‹Ne qommotappe iza asateththaa bolla wosoy dizaadey oonikka taas yarsho shiishshofo; hayssi ha wogay buro sinththafe yaana yeletan ubbaan naagetti de7o.
003	LEV	021	018	Pace asateththi dizaadey oonikka hessika qooqey woykko wobbey woykko medho iitay woykko asateththay borsizaadey,
003	LEV	021	019	kushey woykko tohoy silidaadey,
003	LEV	021	020	zokko quunay woykko dinkey, ayfey sakkizaadey woykko iza bolla uzazizaazi dizaadey woykko shuufay kaththa yarsho taas shiishshanaas bessenna.
003	LEV	021	021	Aaroone zereth kumeththaa giddofe asateththa bolla wosoy diza asi oonikka xuugettiza yarshonne yarsho ba GODAAS yarshanaas yooppo.
003	LEV	021	022	Hessa mala asi nam7u qommo kaththa yarshota maanaas dandayees; heytikka dummatida kaththinne keehi dummatida yarsho kaththa.
003	LEV	021	023	Gidikkoka iza asateththan borey diza gishshas ta keeththaa tunisontta mala izaadey gede yarsho yarshizaso woykko gede magalashakko shiiqoppo; gaasoykka istta dumma ooththa shaakkiday tana Xoossa› gaada yoota.»
003	LEV	021	024	Museykka hessa ubbaa Aaroonessinne Aaroone naytas kumeththa Isra7eele dere asaas yootides.
003	LEV	022	001	GODAY Muse hizgides,
003	LEV	022	002	«Aaroonessinne iza naytas, ‹Intte harappe dumma gidida ta sunththaa tunisontta mala Isra7eele nayti taas dummasidi shiishshiza yarsho ubbaa bonchchora ekkidi geeshshateththan naagite; tani GODAA.
003	LEV	022	003	«‹Intte zereththafe tunidaadey Isra7eele nayti taas dumma shaakki immida miish xalateththan bochchidaadey ta sinththafe dhayana; hayssi ha wogay hayssafe guye sinththara yaana yeleta ubbaan naagetto; tani GODAA.
003	LEV	022	004	«‹Aaroone zereththatappe ay asikka iza bolla asappe asan aadhdhiza galba hargey dizaadey woykko iza asateththafe goggi keziza miishshi dizaadey oonikka geeyana gakkanaas Xoossas dummatida miish mooppo; ahay bochchiin tunida miish bochchidaadey woykko iza bollafe zereththa haaththi xokettizaade bochchidaadey,
003	LEV	022	005	hessaththoka biittara gooshettizaytanne ay miishshankka tunida as bochchidaadey,
003	LEV	022	006	hessa mala ay tuna miishshika bochchidaadey omars gakkanaas tuna gidees; hessafe guye izi ba bolla haaththan meecettontta dishe Xoossas dummatida kath mooppo.
003	LEV	022	007	Arshey wullidaappe guye qasse izi geesh gidees; hessafe guye dumma gidida kaththa yarshoza izas quma gidida gishshas maanaas dandayees.
003	LEV	022	008	Bawuti hayqqidaazinne do7ay wodhida mehe asho mooppo; izi hessa mizaaz gidikko tunees; tani GODAA.
003	LEV	022	009	«‹Qeeseti tani isttas immida wogaa naagetto; istti naagontta aggiko geesh gidida ta azazotas azazettontta ixxida gishshas isttas qoho gidiin istti hayqqana; istta dummasa shaakkiday tana GODAA.
003	LEV	022	010	«‹Taas dummatida yarshofe maanaas dandayzay qeesetanne isttaso as xalla attiin hara asi izappe mooppo; qeesera imaththi woykko oosos qaxxarettidi izara dizaadeyka mooppo.
003	LEV	022	011	Gido attiin qeesey ba miishshan shammida aylley woykko soon yelettida aylley qeeseza gishaappe mo.
003	LEV	022	012	Qeese gidontta hara as gelida qeeseza naya Xoossas dummatida yarshofe muuppu.
003	LEV	022	013	Gido attiin naa yelontta dishin izi azinay hayqqidaara woykko ba azinappe anjjettada ba aawa soo simmada diza qeese naya kase iza naateteththa wode ooththiza mala ba aawa gishaappe mu; gidikkoka qeeseso asappe attiin hara asi dummatida yarsho kaththaafe mooppo.
003	LEV	022	014	«‹Qeeseso as gidonttaadey oonikka erontta dishe GODAAS dummatidi imettida miish miikko he izi midayssa kumeththa wogaa xeetappe nam7u kushe gujjidi qeesezas qanxxo.
003	LEV	022	015	Isra7eele nayti Xoossas immiza dumma yarshota qeeseti tunisanaas bessenna.
003	LEV	022	016	Hessika izappe maanaas bessonttaades qeeseti immiko he midaades mooro gididi izaade bolla hanqo gaththana; imotata ubbaa taas dummasiday tana GODAA› ga yoota.»
003	LEV	022	017	GODAY Muse hizgides,
003	LEV	022	018	«Aaroones iza naytassinne Isra7eele dere ubbaas, ‹Isra7eele as gididay woykko Isra7eele nayta giddon diza imaththa asi adina gaththanaas woykko izi coo ufayssan mela immiza xuugettiza yarsho shiishshiko,
003	LEV	022	019	iza yarshoy ekettana mala issi borey iza bolla baynda korma boorappe, dharshofenne deysha orgefe gido.
003	LEV	022	020	Iza bolla wosoy diza mehe intte shiishshiko GODAY hessa ekkenna.
003	LEV	022	021	«‹Qasse oona gidikkoka ba adina gaththanaas issifeteththa yarsho GODAAS yarshiza wode woykko ba dosan ba mehetappe kiyateththa imota immizaa gidikko he imotaa ekkana mala izi immiza meheza bolla aykko wosoy bayndaaz gido.
003	LEV	022	022	Qooqe woykko meqo woykko qiisha woykko giiyza madunththara dizaa woykko gaaranda woykko shattora diza mehe GODAAS yarsho shiishshofa; hessantta mala mehe yarsho yarshizasozan xuugettiza yarsho histta yarshofa.
