004	NUM	035	001	Iyarkko ginara Yordaanoose shaafappe he pinththan diza Mo7aabe dembaa bolla GODAY Muses hizgides,
004	NUM	035	002	«Isra7eele asay ba gishaappe gishaappe Lewe zarkketi daana katamatanne he katamata yuushon istti ba mehe izan heemmana gade immana mala yoota.
