004	NUM	035	009	GODAY Muses hizgi yootides,
004	NUM	035	010	«Neni Isra7eele asaas, ‹Intte Kanaane dere gelanaas Yordaanoose shaafaa pinniza wode,
004	NUM	035	011	issi asi erontta dishe as wodhikko hessaadey baqati biidi attana katamata ne doora.
