004	NUM	035	014	He katamatappe heedzdzati Yordaanoose shaafaappe he pinththan arshey mokkiza baggara hankko heedzdzati qasse Kanaane biittan gidetto.
004	NUM	035	015	Ha usuppun katamati erontta dishe as wodhida Isra7eele asi, imaththatinne intte giddon diza hara dere asati baqati attizaso gidetto.
004	NUM	035	016	«‹Issi asi biratappe oosettidaazan as wodhidaa gidikko he shemppo wodhidaadey izikka asa kushen hayqqo.
004	NUM	035	017	Issi asi shuchchan caddidi as wodhidaa gidikko he shemppo wodhidaadey izikka asa kushen hayqqo.
004	NUM	035	018	Issi asi miththan caddi as wodhidaa gidikko he shemppo wodhidaadeyka asa kushen hayqqo.
004	NUM	035	019	He hayqqidayssas mata dabboy suuth azaranaas dandayza gishshas awanka demmiko wodhanaas dandayees.
004	NUM	035	020	«‹Issi asi odidi as sugi yeggi wodhikko woykko geemason uttidi issi miishshan caddi,
004	NUM	035	021	wodhikko morkketeththan dendidi icci wodhikko izi shemppo wodhida gishshas izikka asa kushen hayqqanaas bessees; he hayqqidayssas mata dabboy suuth accanaas dandayza gishshas awanka demmiko wodhanaas dandayees.
004	NUM	035	022	«‹Gido attiin issi asi erontta dishe as sugi wodhikko woykko qoppontta dishe issi miishshan caddi wodhikko,
004	NUM	035	023	woykko erontta dishe shuch iza bolla yeggi wodhizaa gidikko hessaadey iza qohanaas odi ooththontta gishshas,
004	NUM	035	024	derezi he wodhidayssa giddoninne hayqqidayssa dabbota giddon imettana pirday hayssafe kaallizayssa gido.
004	NUM	035	025	Erontta dishe as wodhidaadey suuth acciza asa kusheppe derezi ashshidi izi baqati attida katama zaaro; zayten tiyettida qeeseta halaqay hayqqana gakkanaas izi heen gam7o.
004	NUM	035	026	«‹As wodhidi kasasetidayssi baqati attiza katamaappe kare kezizaa gidikko,
004	NUM	035	027	suuththa accizaadey demmidi iza wodhikko suuththa acon oyshettenna.
004	NUM	035	028	As wodhidi kasasetidayssi qeeseta halaqay hayqqana gakkanaas baqati attiza katamaan gam7o; qeeseta halaqazi hayqqidaappe guye izi baso simmana dandayees.
004	NUM	035	029	«‹Hayssi ha wogazi intte diza dere ubbaan inttessinne intte zereththatas eqqi diza woga gido.
004	NUM	035	030	«‹Shempo wodhida ay asikka hayqo pirda pirdettanaas dandayzay iza bolla nam7u markkay woykko izappe bollara markkattiko attiin issi markkan xalla hayqo qixaate ekkenna.
004	NUM	035	031	Shemppo wodhiin hayqo pirday iza bolla pirdettida asi hayqqana bessees attiin ba wodhida shemppo gishshas miishshe qanxxi attanaas dandayenna.
004	NUM	035	032	Izan baqati attiza katama baqatida oonappeka qeeseta halaqay hayqqanaappe kase izi guye simmidi ba biittan de7ana mala giidi suuththa qanxxo ekkofte.
004	NUM	035	033	Intte hessaththo ooththizaa gidikko intte biittaa tuniseeta; gaasoykka asa suuth gussizayssi biitta tunisees; he biittay geeyanay asa suuth gussidaade suuththay gukkiin attiin haran geeyenna.
004	NUM	035	034	Tani intte GODAA gidida gishshassinne inttenara Isra7eele dereza giddon diza gishshas tani izan diza biittaa tunisopite› ga yoota.»
004	NUM	036	001	Yooseefe naa Minaasey yelida Maakire naa Gala7aade zarkketa kaaleththiza halaqati Musekkonne Isra7eele asaa kaaleththizaytakko shiiqidi,
004	NUM	036	002	«Neni hanno biittayo Isra7eele derezas saaman gishana mala GODAY nena nu godaza azazides; hessaththoka nu isha Xilofaade gisha iza macca naytas immana mala nena azazides.
004	NUM	036	003	Gido attiin istti geliza azinati hara qommofe gidikko istta gisha gadey nu zarkketa xinxxofe qanxxettidi he istti gelida azinata zarkketas gujettiza gishshas nu zarkketa xinxxozi kase ekettoyssafe pace gidees.
004	NUM	036	004	Wozzo layththay gakkiza wode istta gishazi istti gelida zarkkes gujettees; hessa gishshas istta xinxxoy nu zarkketa xinxxo pacinchchees» gida.
