005	DEU	004	006	Intte istta naagitenne polite; intte hessaththo ooththizaa gidikko intte ay keena aadho eranchchatanne akeekizayta hara dere asay inttena be7ana; istti ha azazota siyiza wode, ‹Tumukka ha gita kawoteththay aadho eranchchanne akeekanchcha dere› gaana.
005	DEU	004	007	GODAA nu Xoossay nu woossishin mata gidida mala iza GODAY izas mata gidida hara gita kawoteththi oonee?
