005	DEU	004	032	«Xoossay ase biitta bolla medhdhoosofe doommidi intte yelettanaappe kase aadhdhida wodeta xomosite; biitta gaxappe gaxa gakkanaas pilggi xeellite; hayssafe kase hayssa mala gita miishshi mulekka hani erizee? Woykko siyetti erizee?
