005	DEU	005	001	Museykka Isra7eele asaa ubbaa issi bolla xeygidi, «Isra7eele asawu! Tani hach inttes immiza wogaanne maaraa ane wozinan woththi siyite; istta lo7eththi tamaartenne minththi naagite.
