005	DEU	017	018	Izi ba kawoteththa algan uttiza wode Xoossa woga maxaafa Lewe qommo gidida qeeseta matappe baas duuqqi ekko.
005	DEU	017	019	He maxaafaza ba matan woththidi ba de7o layth ubbaan nababo; izi histtiko GODAA ba Xoossaa bonchchonne he maxaafan xaafettida wogatanne maarata keehi naagettidinne ammanettidi polo taamarana.
005	DEU	017	020	Histtiko izi ba wozinan, «Tani ta laggetappe aadhdhays» giidi Isra7eele asaa bolla otorettenna; GODAA ba Xoossaa wogappe hadirsinne ushach geenna; izi daro layth kawotana; iza naytikka Isra7eele biittan daro layth kawotana.
005	DEU	018	001	Lewetappe qeesetinne qasseka kumeththa Lewe qommoti hankko attida Isra7eele asaara biitta gishettiza wogay isttas baynda gishshas istti GODAAS yarshanaas shiishshiza yarshofe miidi detto.
005	DEU	018	002	Istta ishata Isra7eele asaa garsan isttas xinxxo gadey dooppo; izi isttas immida hidota qaala mala GODAY isttas xinxxo.
005	DEU	018	003	Wofano gidiin woykko dorsa yarshos shiishshiza wode qeeseti missata, banqilatanne ganjjeta ekketto.
005	DEU	018	004	Intte kaththafe xeera, woyne ushshafenne wogara zayteppe xeera, dorsa iskefe koyro qanxxettidayssa isttas immite.
005	DEU	018	005	Mernaas qeeseteththan ooththana mala hara qommota giddofe GODAA intte Xoossay Lewe qommota baas doorides.
005	DEU	018	006	Lewe qommotappe issi asi kase ba diza Isra7eele katamappe GODAY dooridaso baanaas daro amoy izas diikko,
005	DEU	018	007	biidi heen kase haggaziza Lewe qommoti ooththizayssaththo izikka GODAA sinththan ooththo.
005	DEU	018	008	Qasse ba aawa aqo bayziin bana gakkidayssa ekkidaa gidikkoka qeeseti go7ettizayssa ubbaa isttara gina gishetti ekko.
005	DEU	018	009	GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biittaa intte geliza wode he biittan diza kawoteththay ooththiza tuna ooso ooththofte.
005	DEU	018	010	Ba attuma naa woykko macca naa yarshos giidi taman xuuggiza ay asikka intte giddon dooppo; bitizay, marace xeellizay, muurennizaynne maroy intte giddon dooppo.
005	DEU	018	011	Qasseka daggamizaadey (gojizay), woykko moytille xeygizaadey woykko iita ayanatara haasayzaadey, woykko hayqqida asata ayanara haasayzaadey intte giddon dooppo.
005	DEU	018	012	Hessantta mala ooththiza ay asikka GODAA matan ixettidaade; istti hessa mala tuna ooththida gishshas GODAA intte Xoossay he kawoteththata intte sinththafe dhoqalli dhayssana.
005	DEU	018	013	GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan mulera intte ammanettizayta gidanaas bessees.
005	DEU	018	014	Ha intte laattanaas biza biittaan diza kawoteththati muurennizaytinne marace xeellizayti yootizayssa siyizayta. Intte gidikko hessaththo ooththontta mala GODAA intte Xoossay inttena diggides.
005	DEU	018	015	GODAA intte Xoossay intte zareppe ta mala nabe denththana; intte izi inttes yootizayssa siyidi azazettite.
005	DEU	018	016	Intte Siina zuma bolla shiiqida wode GODAA intte Xoossaa, «Nuni hayqqontta mala GODAA nu Xoossaa cenggurssaa zaari siyokko; qasseka ha wolqqama tamaakka nam7anththo be7okko» giidi oychchideta.
005	DEU	018	017	Hessa gishshas GODAY taas, «Istti oychchiza oyshay likke» gides.
005	DEU	018	018	Tani istta zareta giddofe isttas ne mala nabe denththana; izi haasayana qaala ta izas immana; ta azazizayssa ubbaa izi inttes yootana.
005	DEU	018	019	Ta sunththan yootiza he nabeza qaala siyontta as ta qaxxayana.
005	DEU	018	020	Gido attiin ta iza azazontta xalateththan ta sunththan yootiza nabey woykko eeqa xoossata sunththan yootiza nabey hayqqo.
005	DEU	018	021	Intte, «Nabey yootiza tinbite qaalay GODAAPPE gidonttayssa ta aazan shaakka eranee?» gi oychchana dandayeeta.
005	DEU	018	022	He nabezi yootiday GODAA sunththan yootiin izi yootida qaalay polettontta aggiko hessi GODAY yootonttayssa gididayssa ereeta; he nabezi wordo haasayda gishshas izas yayyofte.
005	DEU	019	001	GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biittan diza kawoteththata dhayssidi intte istta katamataninne keeththatan de7o doommiza wode,
005	DEU	019	002	GODAA intte Xoossay inttes xinxxo ooththidi immiza biittan diza katamatappe heedzdzu katamata inttes shaakkite.
