005	DEU	019	004	Issi asi kase izara morkketeththi bayndaade wodhana gi qoppontta dingate as wodhikko hessaadey katamatappe issineyn bi gelidi ba shemppo ashsho.
005	DEU	019	005	Leemisos nam7u asati mith qanxxana bidason istti mith qanxxishin miththaa qanxxiza beyixezi woykko kalttazi tuutezappe qoppontta koletti biidi izara dizaadeza wodhikko, he beyixey iza kusheppe koletti bi wodhidaadezi he heedzdzu katamatappe issi katamayo bi geli ba shemppo ashsho.
005	DEU	019	006	Qotetti attiza katamay eeson gakettontta haakoson dizaa gidikko ogey aduqqida gaason suuth azarizaadey keehi hanqettidi gooddi gakkidi hayqqanaas bessonttayssa wodhanaas dandayees; gaasoykka izi ba shooro wodhiday morkketeththi diza gishshas gidenna.
005	DEU	019	007	Intte heedzdzu katamata dumma shaakkana mala ta inttena azazizay hessa gishshassa.
005	DEU	019	008	GODAA intte Xoossay kase intte aawatas gelida hidota qaalaa mala izi intte zawa aassiko,
005	DEU	019	009	hach ta inttena azazidayssa ubbaa intte polikko, GODAA intte Xoossaka siiqikko qasse iza ogen biikko izi inttes hanno biittayo immiza gishshas asi isttan baqati biidi attana mala hara heedzdzu katamata gujji giigsite.
005	DEU	019	010	Intte hessaththo ooththiza gaasoykka intte izin daana mala GODAA intte Xoossay inttes xinxxo histti immiza biittayn xillo suuththi gukkontta malanne intteka suuththa acon oyshettontta malassa.
005	DEU	019	011	Gidikkoka issi asi morkketeththan dendidi geeman zamadi uttidi qadhetay baynda as wodhidaappe guye ba shemppo ashshanaas he katamatappe issineyn baqati biikko,
005	DEU	019	012	izi diza katamaa cimati izi baqati bida katamaappe as kiitti ehisidi hayqqidayssa suuth azarizaades aaththi immetto.
005	DEU	019	013	Izas aykkoka qadhettofte; inttes ubba miishshi lo7o gidana mala shemppo wodhizayta Isra7eele giddofe dhayssite.
005	DEU	019	014	GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza xinxxon beni asati inttessinne intte shooros giddon essida zawa shoddofte.
005	DEU	019	015	Asi moorida mooro shaakki eranaas issi markkay xalla gidenna; nam7u woykko heedzdzu markkay markkattana bessees.
005	DEU	019	016	Issi iita asi hara as wordora mootikko,
005	DEU	019	017	nam7atikka he wode GODAA sinththan ooththiza qeeseta sinththaninne pirdiza daannata sinththan eqqetto.
005	DEU	019	018	He pirdizaytikka he yo7oza lo7eththi pilggi xeelletto; he markkattizaadezi ba ishaza bolla wordora markkattidayssi tumu gidikko,
005	DEU	019	019	izi he mootoza ba ishaa qaxxayssanaas qoppida qixaatezan ba hu7es qaxxayetto; histtidi hessa mala iita ooththizayssa intte giddofe diggite.
005	DEU	019	020	Histtiko hara asay hessa siyidi babbana; hessa mala iita oosoy intte giddon oosettenna.
005	DEU	019	021	Hessa mala iita ooththizaytas mulekka qadhettofte; shemppo wodhidaade wodhite; ayfe toyssidaades ayfe toyssite; ach menththidaades ach menththite; kushe menththidaades kushe menththite; toho menththidaades toho menththite.
005	DEU	020	001	Intte intte morkketa olana bishin para-gaaretinne toga asati inttefe daro gidikko hessa be7idi dagammofte; gaasoykka inttena Gibxeppe kessida GODAA intte Xoossay inttenara diza gishshas babbofte.
005	DEU	020	002	Intte ola doommanaappe sinththatidi qeesezi ola asaakko shiiqidi,
005	DEU	020	003	«Isra7eele asawu! Haa ezgite! Intte hach intte morkketara olettanaas beeta; intte wozinay dagammofonne babbofo; istta sinththan kokkoropitenne shirotopite.
005	DEU	020	004	GODAA intte Xoossay intte morkketa olanaas inttenara biza gishshas izi inttena xoonisana» go.
005	DEU	020	005	Hessafe kaallidi ola asaa kaaleththizayti olanchchatas, «Ooraththa keeth keexxidi gelontta asi intte garsan diikko izi olaso bi hayqqiin hara asi iza keeththan gelontta mala baso guye simmo.
005	DEU	020	006	Woykko woyne tokkidi iza ayfe shiishshontta asi diikko izi olan hayqqiin hara asi iza woyne ayfe baas shiishshidi ufayettontta mala izi baso simmo.
005	DEU	020	007	Machcho ekkana giigsi woththida asi olan hayqqiin hara asi izo ekkontta mala izi baso simmo» getto.
005	DEU	020	008	Ola asaa kaaleththizayti, «Wozinay babbiza asi intte garsan diikko hankko ola asaa wozina hirgisontta mala izi baso simmo» getto.
005	DEU	020	009	Ola asaa kaaleththizayti hessa yooti wursidaappe guye ola asaa butten butten shaakkidi issi issi buttes kaaleththizayta dooretto.
005	DEU	020	010	Issi katama olanaas biidi intte isttako matiza wode koyrottidi saron istti kushe immana mala oychchite.
005	DEU	020	011	Istti inttena saron mokki ekkidi bantta gimbe penge doydi inttena gelththiko he katamaan diza asay ubbay inttes haggazonne deexo ooso ooththo.
005	DEU	020	012	Gido attiin he katamaa asay inttes saron ba kushe immontta ixxidi inttenara olettana koykko istta katamaa dooddite.
005	DEU	020	013	GODAA intte Xoossay he katamayo intte kushen aaththi immiza wode he katamayn diza attumasaa ubbaa wodhite.
005	DEU	020	014	Gido attiin maccassatanne guuththa nayta, mehenne he katamayn diza aqota ubbaa inttes di7i ekkite; qasse GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza intte morkketa aqota inttes go7ettite.
005	DEU	020	015	Qasseka intte dizasoppe haakki diza katamatakka intte oykkiza wode hayssafe kaallizayssa ooththite.
005	DEU	020	016	GODAA intte Xoossay inttes aaththi immida biitta bolla asaa intte oli oykkizaa gidikko asa ubbaa wodhite.
005	DEU	020	017	GODAY intte Xoossay inttena azazida mala Hiiteta, Amooreta, Kanaaneta, Paarizeta, Hiiwetanne Yaabuseta ubbaa wodhite.
005	DEU	020	018	Intte histtontta aggiko istti bantta eeqa xoossatas goynniza tuna ooso intte ooththana mala inttena tamaarsana; hessan GODAA intte Xoossaa bolla nagara ooththana.
005	DEU	020	019	Intte katamaa oykkanaas dooddi daro gallas olettishe gam7iza wode izan diza ayfe immiza miththata ayfe intte maana dandayza gishshas istta qanxxofte; istti ayfe ayfiza miththafe attiin asara olettiza as gidettenna; he demban diza miththata qanxxofte.
005	DEU	020	020	Hankko ayfe ayfontta miththata gidikko istta qanxxereththi yeggidi he katamaya kundana gakkanaas giddoththi naagana dandayeeta.
005	DEU	021	001	Intte laattana mala GODAA intte Xoossi inttes immiza biittayn ooni wodhidaakko erettontta asa ahay coo demban kundi beettiko,
005	DEU	021	002	intte daannatinne intte cimati biidi ahazi dizasoppe doommidi he heeran diza katamata gakkanaas diza haahoteththaa wadhdhetto.
005	DEU	021	003	Hessafe guye ahazi dizasos matiza katamayn diza kaaleththizayti oosos gakkontta buro qambaray izi morge bolla wodhdhontta issi ussu dooretto.
005	DEU	021	004	He ussiyo mulekka goyetti eronttaso, ay atakiltey toketti eronttasonne goggiza haaththi diza shoobba efidi heen ussay morge mirqqi menththetto.
005	DEU	021	005	Histtidi GODAA intte Xoossay ba sinththan ooththana mala, ba sunththan anjjana mala, mootonne shemppo daafa gelidi shaakki pirdana mala GODAA intte Xoossay Lewe naytappe doorida qeeseti ahazi dizaso mata betto.
005	DEU	021	006	Hessafe guye ahazi dizaso matan diza katamayo kaaleththiza cimati morge mirqqi menththida ussay bolla bantta kushe meecettetto.
005	DEU	021	007	Histtidi, «Hayssa nu wodhibeekko; ooni wodhidaakkoka nu beyibeekko.
005	DEU	021	008	GODAWU! Neni Gibxeppe wozzada kessida ne dere Isra7eele nagaraa wursa; nunakka maara; hayssa gukkida xillo suuththaa gishshas nuna oychchofa» getto.
005	DEU	021	009	Intte GODAA sinththan suure miish ooththidi xillo suuththi gukkida nagaraa intte giddofe diggite.
005	DEU	021	010	Ne morkketara ne olettanaas keziin GODAA ne Xoossi istta ne kushen aaththi immiin ne istta di7ida wode,
005	DEU	021	011	he di7ettidayta giddon mala lo7o maccas demmada izo nees machcho ekkanaas koykko,
005	DEU	021	012	izo neni neso ehikko iza ba hu7e meedettu; qasse ba xugunth iiru.
005	DEU	021	013	Kase iza di7etta yashe may7ida may7o laammu; issi agina gakkanaas neson uttada olan hayqqida ba aayssinne ba aawaas yeekku; hessafe guye izo nees machcho ekka.
005	DEU	021	014	Guyeppe neni izin ufayettontta aggiko izo anjja yeddanaas dandayaasa; kase izo wolqqara ekkiday nena gidida gishshas zaarada bayzanaassinne aylle mala qoodanaas bessenna.
005	DEU	021	015	Issi asi nam7u machcho ekkidi isttafe issineyo dosidi issineyo ixxiko he nam7atikka izas attuma nayta yelikko he yelettida naytappe bayrazi izi ixxizaari naa gidikko,
005	DEU	021	016	izi ba haaro ba naytas gishiza wode izi ixxizaarippe yelettida bayra naaza bayrateththaa kadhidi ba dosizaarippe yelettida naazas maaddidi aaththi immanaas bessenna.
005	DEU	021	017	Bayra naazi izi siiqontta machcheyfe yelettikokka izi izas koyro yelo gidida gishshas hankko naytappe aaththidi nam7u kushe aaththi immidi izi bayra gididayssa eriso.
005	DEU	021	018	Aawassinne aayis azazettontta ixxidi istti muriinkka simmontta ixxida makkallanchchanne wozina muume nay isttas diikko,
005	DEU	021	019	aayanne aaway bantti diza katamata garsan cimati pirdizaso ekki betto.
005	DEU	021	020	«Hayssi nu naazi wozina muume; makkallanchcha; nuus azazettenna; maththotteessinne miish coo dhayssees» gi cimatas yootetto.
005	DEU	021	021	He katamayn diza attuma asay ubbay iza shuchchan caddi wodhetto; intte hessaththo histtiko intte garsafe iita miishshi dhayana; Isra7eele deren dizay wuri hessa siyidi yayyana.
005	DEU	021	022	Issi asi ba ooththida gita mooro gaason miththa bolla kaqetti hayqqana mala pirdettiko,
005	DEU	021	023	miththa bolla kaqetti hayqqida asi Xoossi qanggidaade gidida gishshas iza ahay miththa bolla kaqetti aqopo; GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biitta tunisontta mala hayqqida ahaza he gallas moogite.
005	DEU	022	001	Isra7eele asaa booray woykko dorsi dhaydi wora bishin intte demmiko co7u gi aadhdhofte; iza godaas laagga efa imma.
005	DEU	022	002	Gido attiin mehaaddey dizasoy haaho gidikko woykko he mehaaddey oonakko ne erontta aggiko meheza neso ekkada ba; mehaaddey koyishe yiikko izayssa izas zaara.
005	DEU	022	003	May7o gidiin woykko hare gidiin woykko hara ay miishshika ne bagga Isra7eele asaappe dhayiin ne demmidaa gidikko zaarada izaades imma.
005	DEU	022	004	Ne bagga Isra7eele asaas harey woykko booray ogen kundiin ne be7idaa gidikko maaddada denththa attiin be7ashe yegga aadhdhofa.
005	DEU	022	005	GODAA intte Xoossay hessaththo ooththizayta ixxiza gishshas maccati attumasata may7o, attumasati maccassata may7o may7ofetto.
005	DEU	022	006	Ne oge bishin kafoy ba keeththan miththa bolla woykko biitta bolla yelida ciyeta woykko phuuphphulle haphpha diza kafo ne demmidaa kafoyo ciyetara gaththa neso efoppa.
005	DEU	022	007	Ciyeta neso ekka baanaas dandayaasa; aayeyo gidikko iza piradhdha baana mala yedda; neni hessaththo ooththiko nees lo7o gidananne ne daro layth daana.
005	DEU	022	008	Ne ooraththa keeth keexxashe he keeththaa kaarappe asi kundidi suuththa acon nena oyshisontta mala keeththaa kaara bolla teqe woththa.
005	DEU	022	009	Neni woyne mith tokkashe iza giddon hara zereth zeroppa; ne hara zerikko woyne miththaa ayfeppe gidiin woykko hara ne zeroo kaththaafe go7ettanaas dandayakka.
005	DEU	022	010	Booranne hare issife issi qambaran waaxa goyoppa.
005	DEU	022	011	Suufeppenne puuttofe walaketti dadettida may7o may7ofa.
005	DEU	022	012	Ne may7ana may7os oyddu baggarakka macara medhdha.
005	DEU	022	013	Issi asi machcho ekkida mala izira aqi simmidi izo ixxiko,
005	DEU	022	014	«Hanno maccassayo ekkadis shin izis geela7oteththa wogay baawa» giidi wordora izi sunththu moorikko,
005	DEU	022	015	he nayo yelidayti naya geela7o gididayssas markka ehidi he katamaan diza cimata bessetto.
005	DEU	022	016	Nay aaway isttas, «Tani ta nayo hayssa addezas immadis shin ha7i izi izo ixxidayssa qonccisides.
005	DEU	022	017	‹Ne nays geela7oteththi baawa› giidi ta nay sunththu moorides; ta nays geela7oteththi dizayssas hayssi markka» giidi he dere kaaleththizayta sinththan izi izo ekkishin may7o bolla gukkida suuththara diza malata carqqaza besso.
005	DEU	022	018	He katamayo kaaleththizayti addeza shoci qaxxayetto.
005	DEU	022	019	Qasseka izi Isra7eele naytappe geela7oteththara diza issiney sunththu moorida gishshas issi xeetu saqile bira nay aawaas magaco qanxxo; hessafe guye nayakka izas machcho gidu; izi shemppora paxa diza layth ubbaan izo anjji yeddanaas dandayenna.
005	DEU	022	020	Gido attiin izi gidayssi tumu gidi beettiko qasse iza geela7o gididayssa qonccisiza malatay baynda aggiko,
005	DEU	022	021	iza ba aawa soon dashe laymatada Isra7eele asaa yeellachchiza ooso ooththida gishshas izo izi aawa keeththa kare efetto; he katamaan diza asay izo shuchchara caddi wodho; hessaththo histtidi intte giddofe iita miish diggite.
005	DEU	022	022	Issi asi hara asa machchira zin7i beettiko nam7ayka hayqqetto; hessaththo histtidi intte giddofe iita miish diggite.
005	DEU	022	023	Ay asikka katama giddon azina gelana giiga uttida geela7oyra zin7idi beettiko,
005	DEU	022	024	nam7atakka he katamayppe kare kessidi shuchchan caddi wodhite; geela7oya katama giddon dashe, «Tana ashshite» gaada waassontta gishshas hayqqanaas bessees; qasse addezi hara asara giiga dizaarira zin7idi woga menththida gishshas hayqqanaas bessees; hessaththo histtidi intte giddofe iita miish diggite.
005	DEU	022	025	Issi asi hara asas giiga uttida geela7oyo iza diza katamappe harason demmi wolqqaththidi izi geela7oteththaa ekkidaa gidikko hessaadey xalla hayqqo.
005	DEU	022	026	Naya hayqos gaththiza nagara ooththontta gishshas izo bochchofte; hayssa mala oosoy issi asi genera ba laggeza shemppo wodhizayssara issi gina.
005	DEU	022	027	Hessika he addezi hara asas giigetta uttida geela7oya ba diza katamappe karen dishin demmidi izo oykkida gishshassinne iza waassidaakkoka izo ashshana asi baynda gishshassa.
005	DEU	022	028	Ay asikka hara asara giigettontta geela7oyra zin7ishe oykettiko,
005	DEU	022	029	nay aawaas ichchash tammu saqile bira qanxxidi izo baas machcho histto; wolqqan izira zin7ida gishshas hayqqana gakkanaaska izo anjji yeddanaas dandayenna.
005	DEU	022	030	Oonikka ba aawa machcho ekkidi woykko izira zin7idi ba aawa yeellasoppo.
005	DEU	023	001	Sangettida asi woykko qaaratettida asi GODAA dere duulatan beettofo.
005	DEU	023	002	Laggeththon yelettidaynne iza zereththi biidi tammanththo gakkanaas GODAA asa shiiqon geloppo.
005	DEU	023	003	Amoonenne Mo7aabe zereththati wurikka tammanththa yeleta gakkanaas GODAA asaa duulatan geloppetto.
005	DEU	023	004	Gaasoykka intte Gibxeppe kezidi yishin istti inttena kaththinne haath diggida; qasse Mesphexoomiya biittan Patoore katamaan diza Bi7oore naa Balaamey inttena qanggana mala miishshan shammida.
005	DEU	023	005	Gido attiin GODAA intte Xoossay inttena siiqiza gishshas Balaamey qanggiza qanggeththaa siyibeenna; izi qanggida qanggeththaa anjjon laammides.
005	DEU	023	006	He dere asati duretidi saron daana mala istta maaddofte.
005	DEU	023	007	Istti inttes dabbo gidida gishshas Eedoome asaa kadhidi ixxofte; qasse intte Gibxe biittan kase bete gididi de7ida gishshas Gibxe asatakka ixxofte.
005	DEU	023	008	Istta zereththi heedzdzanththo yeletappe doommidi GODAA asaa shiiqon walakettana dandayees.
005	DEU	023	009	Intte olas kezidi dunkaani uttidasohon inttena tunisiza miishshafe naagettite.
005	DEU	023	010	Issi asi omars agumora maallay iza bolla gukkiko asi diza heeraappe haraso biidi heen takko.
005	DEU	023	011	Omarsa wode ba bolla meecettidi arshey wullishin kase ba dizaso simmo.
005	DEU	023	012	Sheesh uttizaso intte dizaso heerappe karen giigsite.
005	DEU	023	013	Intte sheesh uttanaaso bookkanaassinne biitta zaari kammanaas go7iza miish intte ola massarara gaththi issife oykkite.
005	DEU	023	014	Gaasoykka GODAA intte Xoossay inttena naaganaassinne intte morkketa intte kushen aaththi immanaas intte guta giddon hemetettiza gishshas iza shaattiza miish be7idi guye simmontta mala intte diza heeray geesh gidana bessees.
005	DEU	023	015	Ba godaappe baqatidi neekko yida aylle zaarada iza godaas immofa.
005	DEU	023	016	Izi intte katamatappe ba koyidason inttenara de7o; iza un7eththofte.
005	DEU	023	017	Isra7eele asaappe ooninne attuma gidiin woykko macca gidiin eeqa xoossatas goynnizayti ooththizayssa mala laymatopite.
005	DEU	023	018	GODAA intte Xoossay layma ixxiza gishshas adde gidiin woykko maccassi laymateththan demmida miish adina gaso giidi GODAA intte Xoossa keeth ehopetto.
005	DEU	023	019	Ne zare gidida Isra7eele asaas miishshe, kath woykko hara miish tal7ada zaarashe dich ekkofa.
005	DEU	023	020	Hara biitta asaappe dichcha ekkanaas dandayaasa; gido attiin ne bagga gidida Isra7eele asaas dichchas tal7ofa; histtiko ne baada laattana biittayn GODAA ne Xoossay nena ubba baggarakka anjjana.
005	DEU	023	021	GODAA ne Xoossaas ne immana gaada adinettida miish gaththanaas gam7ofa; ne gida qaalaa ne polana mala GODAA ne Xoossi koyees; ne adinettida qaala gaththontta ixxiko hessi nees nagara gidees.
005	DEU	023	022	GODAA ne Xoossaas ne immana gaada adinettontta aggiko hessi nees nagara gidenna.
005	DEU	023	023	Gido attiin GODAA ne Xoossas ne dosan immana gaada ne gelida mala ne inxarsafe kezidayssa pola.
005	DEU	023	024	Asi tokkida woyne miththa giddora kanththa bashe ne koyida keena izappe maanaas dandayaasa; gido attiin ay miishshankka yeggada neso efoppa.
005	DEU	023	025	Asa kaththa giddora aadhdha bashe tiyappe xupha maana dandayaasa; gido attiin maxa ekkada neso booppa.
005	DEU	024	001	Issi asi machcho ekki simmidaappe guye izi bolla issi iita miish demmidi izo ixxiko izo anjji yeddishe izis waraqata xaafi immidi yeddo.
005	DEU	024	002	Izasoppe kezada hara azina gelikko,
005	DEU	024	003	he nam7anththo azinaykka izo dosontta ixxidi izis waraqata xaafi immidi ba sooppe izo kessi yeddiko, woykko izo ekkida he nam7anththo azinazi hayqqiko;
005	DEU	024	004	iza tunida gishshas koyro anjji yeddida azinazi nam7anththo izo zaaridi ekkofo; hessi GODAA matan ixettidayssa; qasse intteka GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immida biittan hayssa mala nagara ooththofte.
005	DEU	024	005	Mata wode machcho ekkida asi olas booppo; hara deexo oosokka iza oosisopite. Issi layththi aadhdhana gakkanaas bason gam7idi bananne ba ekkida machchiyo ufaysso.
005	DEU	024	006	Neni issaades miishshe tal7e tal7ashe kath gaacciza woxa woykko woxa mayde izappe oyththo ekkofa. Hessaththo oosoy asa shemppo oysora gina.
005	DEU	024	007	Ba isha gidida Isra7eele asaa garsafe dhanka barsi efidi baas aylle ooththizay woykko hara asas aylleteththas aaththi bayzizaadey oonikka hayqo. Hessaththo histtidi iita ooso intte giddofe diggite.
005	DEU	024	008	Issaafe issaan aadhdhiza galba hargefe keehi naagettite; tani istta azazida mala Lewe qommo gidida qeeseti inttes immiza wogata lo7eththi naagite.
005	DEU	024	009	Intte Gibxeppe kezi yishin GODAA intte Xoossi Maarami bolla ooththidayssa yuushshi qopite.
005	DEU	024	010	Neni issaades issi miishshe tal7e immashe izi nena oyththiza miish ekkanaas izaade soo geloppa.
005	DEU	024	011	Neni karen dishin izaadey ba kushera nees oyso eho.
005	DEU	024	012	Izaadey manqo gidikko ne oyso ekkada iza afala ne soon ayssofa.
005	DEU	024	013	Izi may7i aqana mala arshey wullontta dishin izas zaara; izikka nena galatana; hessi nees GODAA ne Xoossaa achchan xilloteththan qoodettana.
005	DEU	024	014	Ne bagga gidida Isra7eele asaappe gidiin woykko hara dereppe bete yiidi metotida manqo asi nees ooththiko, izaade wolqqa coo mela nees go7ettofa.
005	DEU	024	015	Izi hach ooththidayssa hach ekkanaas minththi koyza gishshas arshey wullontta dishin qanxxa; histtontta aggiko metotanchchay neeppe dendoyssan GODAAS waassiko nees nagara gidana.
005	DEU	024	016	Nayti moorida mooron yelidayti, qasse yelidayti moorida mooron istta nayti hayqon qaxxayettanaas bessenna; issoy issoy ba moorida mooroza gishshas hayqon qaxxayetto.
005	DEU	024	017	Hara biitta asatassinne yi7o naytas pirda geellasoppa; am7ey may7o iza tal7e ekkida miishsha gishshas gaada oyso ekkofa.
005	DEU	024	018	Kase intte Gibxe biittan aylleteththan de7idayssanne intte GODAA Xoossay inttena wozzi kessidayssa yuushshi qopite; tanikka hayta ha azazota inttes immizay hessassa.
005	DEU	024	019	Neni maxida kaththaa shiishshiin baletti guye attida mirqqey diikko iza ekkanaas guye simmofa; hessa hara biittafe yida bete asatas, yi7otassinne am7etas heen aggaaga. Ne hessaththo ooththiko ne ooththiza ooso ubbaan GODAA ne Xoossay nena anjjana.
005	DEU	024	020	Neni wogara miththa ayfe issito maxidaappe guye geedon attidayssa ekkanaas nam7anththo guye simmofa. Hessa hara biittafe bete yidaytas, yi7o naytassinne am7etas aggaaga.
005	DEU	024	021	Neni woyne miththa ayfe issito maxidaappe guye geedon attidayssa ekkanaas nam7anththo guye simmofa; hessa hara biittafe bete yidaytas, yi7o naytassinne am7etas aggaaga.
005	DEU	024	022	Nekka kase Gibxe biittan aylle gididayssa baloppa; tanikka hayta ha azazota inttes immizay hessassa.
005	DEU	025	001	Nam7u asati ba garsan palamettidi pirdaso biikko qohettidayssa ne xillo; qohidayssa, «Ne wordo» giidi pirdizayti pirdetto.
005	DEU	025	002	Qohidayssi garafetti qaxxayettanaas bessizaa gidikko pirdizayti izi zaqullidi garafettana mala azazetto; hessafe guye mooranchchay pirdizayta sinththan ba mooro keena garafetto.
005	DEU	025	003	Izi oyddu tammuto shocetto attiin hessafe aadho shocettanaas bessenna; hessafe bollara garafettiko ne ishazi ne sinththan kawuyana.
005	DEU	025	004	Kath booran bukkashe bukkiza boora doona qachchofa.
005	DEU	025	005	Issife de7iza ishanttafe issoy naa yelontta hayqqiko iza machcha kare baada allaga as geluppu; izi azinaa ishay izo laattidi izis koshshiza ubbaa kunththo.
005	DEU	025	006	Qasseka isttafe yelettida koyro nay Isra7eele biittan hayqqidaade sunththay dhayontta mala kase hayqqida ishaas naa gido.
005	DEU	025	007	Gido attiin izi ba ishaa machcheyo ayssanaas koyontta aggiko iza katama pengen uttida cimataakko baada, «Ta azinaa ishay ba ishaa sunththi Isra7eelen de7ana mala koyibeenna; tana ekkike giidi taas koshshiza miish kunththontta ixxides» gaada magannu.
005	DEU	025	008	Hessafe guye he katamayo kaaleththiza cimati addeza baakko xeygidi iza oychchetto. Izi ha7ikka maccassayo ekkontta ixxiko,
005	DEU	025	009	he hayqqidayssa machcheya he katamayo kaaleththiza cimata sinththi shiiqada he addeza tohoppe issi caamma shoddada iza ayfeson cuch cuttada, «Ba ishaas zereththi de7ana mala koyontta asa bolla hayssa mala kawushshateththi gakkanaas bessees» gu.
005	DEU	025	010	He addeza zarey Isra7eele asaa giddon, «Iza tohoppe caammay shodettidaade soo asata» geetetti kawushshan xeygettishe de7ana.
005	DEU	025	011	Nam7u asati wadhettishin isttafe issaa machcheya yaada ba azina ashshanaas ba kushe yeddada hankkoyssa attumateththa oykkiko,
005	DEU	025	012	he maccassay kushey maaroy baynda qanxxetto.
005	DEU	025	013	As baleththanaas gitanne guth gidida nam7u qommo geeddara miishshi ne matan dooppo.
005	DEU	025	014	As baleththanaas adussenne qaanth gidida nam7u qommo wadha miishshi ne soon dooppo.
005	DEU	025	015	GODAA ne Xoossay nees immana biittayn neni adussa wode de7ana mala ammanththizanne likke gidida geeddara miishshinne wadha miishshi nees do.
005	DEU	025	016	Geeddara miishshaninne wadha miishshan wordora as baleththiza asata ubbaa GODAA ne Xoossay ixxees.
005	DEU	025	017	Intte Gibxe biittafe kezi bishin Amaaleeqe asay intte bolla gaththida qohoza balopite.
005	DEU	025	018	Istti Xoossas yayyontta asa; intte ogen inttenara eqettida; intte hemettishin daaburdi guye attida asaa ubbaa wodhida.
005	DEU	025	019	Hessa gishshas GODAA intte Xoossay he biittayo inttena laatissidi inttena yuuyi aadhdhida intte morkketa ubbaafe shempisiza wode asi istta biitta bolla zaari qoppontta mala Amaaleeqe asaa wursa dhayssa; hessa mulekka baloppa.
005	DEU	026	001	GODAA ne Xoossay nena laatissana biittayo ne gela uttiza wode,
005	DEU	026	002	GODAA ne Xoossay nees immiza biittan mokkida kath ubbaafe xeera keeshera GODAA ne Xoossay ba sunththi hessan xeygettana mala dooridaso ekka ba.
005	DEU	026	003	Histtada he woden aawateththan ooththiza qeesezakko baada, «GODAA ne Xoossay nuus immana giidi kase nu aawatas caaqqida biittayo ta gelidayssa ne GODAA sinththan hach markkattays» ga.
005	DEU	026	004	Qeesezikka kaththara diza keesheza ekkidi GODAA ne Xoossas yarsho shiishshizasozas sinththa baggan woththo.
005	DEU	026	005	Hessafe guye neni GODAA ne Xoossaa sinththan, «Ta aaway kase coo yuuyi yuuyi diza Aaraame dere asa; izi qoodan guuththa asatara Gibxe wodhdhidi de7ishe heen gita wolqqamanne qoodan cora kawoteth gidides.
005	DEU	026	006	Gibxe asay gidikko nuus meqeth iitidi nuna un7eththidanne deexo ooso nu bolla caanida.
005	DEU	026	007	Histtiin nuni GODAA nu aawata Xoossako waassidos; izikka nu waasoza siyidi nu waayeza, nu daaburazanne nuni qohettidayssa be7ides.
005	DEU	026	008	Histtidi GODAY ba wolqqama qeseninne ba micettida kushen, gita dagaman, malataninne malalisiza ooraththa miish ooththidi Gibxe biittafe nuna kessides.
005	DEU	026	009	Nuna haa hayssa ehidi hanno maaththinne eessi izin kumida modhdho biittayo laatissides.
005	DEU	026	010	Hessa gishshas hekko tanikka izi taas immida gaden kaxxida kaththaafe xeera izas ekka yadis» gaada keesheza woththada GODAA ne Xoossaa sinththan hokka goynna.
005	DEU	026	011	Neessinne ne soo asaas GODAA ne Xoossay immida lo7o miishshaan ufayettidi GODAA galatite; Lewetinne intte giddon de7iza bete asati ubbayka inttenara ufayetetto.
005	DEU	026	012	Asraata kessiza heedzdzanththo layththan layththan mokkida kath ubbaafe asraata kessa wursidaappe guye ne katamaan de7iza Lewetas, bete asatas, yi7otassinne am7etas ne katamaan istti kalli maana mala imma.
005	DEU	026	013	Hessafe guye GODAA ne Xoossaa sinththan, «Ne azazida mala tani tasoppe nees dummatidayssa Lewe qommotas, bete asatas, yi7otassinne am7etas immadis; tani ne azazotappe issinokka menththabeekke; qasse issinokka doga aggabeekke.
005	DEU	026	014	Asi hayqqiin kayottashe izappe mabeekke; tani geeyontta dashe izappe aykkoka mabeekke; hayqqida asa gishshas shiiqiza yarshoska izappe aykkoka shiishshabeekke. Tani GODAA ta Xoossaas azazettadis; qasse neni tana azazida ubbaa poladis.
005	DEU	026	015	Neni salon de7iza geeshsha sohoppe haa duge xeella; ne dere Isra7eelenne kase nu aawatas ne immana gaada caaqqida mala nuus immida ha maaththinne eessi goggiza biittayo anjja» ga.
005	DEU	026	016	GODAA ne Xoossaa wogatanne maarata ne naagana mala hekko hach nena azazides; hessa gishshas neni kumeththa shemppofenne kumeththa wozinappe naaga.
005	DEU	026	017	GODAY nees Xoossaa gididayssa ne iza ogen baanayssa, iza wogaa, iza azazotanne iza maaraa neni polanayssa hach erisadasa.
005	DEU	026	018	Qasse GODAYKKA ba gelida qaalaa mala neni izas dumma as gididayssa, izas xinxxo gididayssanne neni iza azazo ubbaa naaganayssa erisides.
005	DEU	026	019	Neni hessa ooththiko izi medhdhida asa ubbaafe bollara galatan, sunththaninne bonchchon gita kawoteth ooththana; izi gelida caaqo qaalaa mala izas dumma dere ooththanayssa nees erisides.
005	DEU	027	001	Hessafe guye Musey Isra7eele asaa kaaleththizaytara derezas, «Tani inttes hach immiza azazota ubbaa naagite.
005	DEU	027	002	Intte Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnidi GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biittayo geliza wode amarda gita shuchchata essidi istta noora tiyite.
005	DEU	027	003	Kase GODAA intte aawata Xoossay eessinne maaththi kumida biittayo inttes immanaas caaqqida qaalaa mala he biittayo oykkanaas intte pinnida wode ha woga qaalata lochcha shuchchata bolla xaafte.
005	DEU	027	004	Intte Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnidi ta inttena hach azazida mala he shuchchata Eebaale zumaa bolla essidi istta bolla noora tiyite.
005	DEU	027	005	Heen GODAA intte Xoossaas biratay bochchontta shuchchata ekkidi yarsho yarshizaso giigsite.
005	DEU	027	006	GODAA intte Xoossaas yarsho yarshizaso masettontta shuchchafe ooththidi iza bollan GODAA intte Xoossaas xuugetti shiiqiza yarsho shiishshite.
005	DEU	027	007	Issifeteththa yarsho shiishshidi heen GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan ufayettishe miite.
005	DEU	027	008	He shuchchata bolla Xoossa wogata ubbaa nababettana mala qonccisi xaafte» gi azazides.
005	DEU	027	009	Museykka Lewe qommotappe qeesetara gididi Isra7eele asaa ubbaas, «Isra7eele asawu tani gizayssa wozinan woththa siya; hekko hach neni GODAA ne Xoossaa dere gidadasa.
005	DEU	027	010	Hessa gishshas tani nees hach immiza azazotanne wogata ne wursa naagada GODAA ne Xoossaa qaalas azazetta» gides.
005	DEU	027	011	He gallas Musey Isra7eele deraa hizgi azazides,
005	DEU	027	012	«Intte Yordaanoose pinnidaappe guye dereza anjjanaas Garizaane zumaa bolla eqqanaas bessizayti Simoona, Lewe, Yuhuda, Yisakoore, Yooseefe qommotanne Biniyaame qommota.
005	DEU	027	013	Dereza qangganaas Eebaale zumaa bolla eqqanaas bessizayti Oroobeele, Gaade, Aaseere, Zaabiloone, Daane qommotanne Niftaaleme qommota.»
005	DEU	027	014	Lewe qommoti ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi hayssafe kaalliza qaalaa Isra7eele asa ubbaas getto.
005	DEU	027	015	«GODAY eeqa xoossatas goyno ixxiza gishshas, miththafe massidi shuchchafe qoxxidinne birata seerisidi eeqa xoos giigsidi geeman goynnizaadey oonikka qanggettidaade gido!»Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	027	016	«Ba aawa woykko ba aayo kawushshizaadey qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	027	017	«Dhas shoddizaadey wuri qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	027	018	«Qooqe as hadirsa oge kaaleththiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	027	019	«Bete asata, yi7o naytanne am7eta pirda geellasi pirdiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	027	020	«Ba aawa machchira zin7idi ba aawa bonchcho kawushshiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	027	021	«Ay meherakka parattizaadey qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	027	022	«Ba michcheyra woykko ba aayi nayra woykko ba aawa nayra zin7iza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin» go.
005	DEU	027	023	«Ba bolloteyra zin7iza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin» go.
005	DEU	027	024	«Geemason zamadi uttidi ase wodhiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	027	025	«Miishshan shamettidi xillo shemppo wodhiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	027	026	«Hayta ha woga qaalata naagontta ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.
005	DEU	028	001	Neni GODAA ne Xoossaas azazettiko hach ta nees immiza azazota ne ubbaa ammanettada naagikko izi nena biitta bolla diza kawoteththata ubbaafe bollara dhoqqu dhoqqu histtana.
005	DEU	028	002	Neni GODAA ne Xoossaas azazettiko hayssafe kaalliza anjjoti wurikka neyta gidana.
005	DEU	028	003	Neni katamaninne gaxaren anjjettida as gidana.
005	DEU	028	004	Ne nayti, ne biittan diza kaththa ayfey, ne miizati, dorsatinne deyshati ubbay anjjettana.
005	DEU	028	005	Ne kaththa gootaraynne maadday anjjettana.
005	DEU	028	006	Neni geladakka kezadakka anjjettana.
005	DEU	028	007	Ne morkketi ne bolla meto gaththiza wode GODAY istta ne sinththan kundisana; istti ne bolla issi baggara yaana; gido attiin laappun ogera neeppe baqatana.
005	DEU	028	008	GODAY ne kushey oykkida ubbaanne ne gootara ubbaa anjjana; qasse izi nees immida biittankka nena anjjana.
005	DEU	028	009	Neni GODAA ne Xoossaas azazettikonne ne iza azazota ubbaa polikko izi nees caaqqida qaalaa mala izi nena baas dumma shaakettida dere histtana.
005	DEU	028	010	Hessafe guye biitta bolla diza derey wurikka GODAA sunththi nenan xeygettizayssa be7idi nees yayyana.
005	DEU	028	011	GODAY nees immanaas kase ne aawatas caaqqida biittaa bolla nees daro nayta, daro mehenne keehi daro kath immana.
005	DEU	028	012	Ne kushe ooso ubbaa anjjanaassinne GODAY ne biittaas ira wodera bukisanaas ba minjja keeththaa, salo penge nees doyana; qasse neni daro kawoteththatas tal7anaappe attiin ooppeka haa tal7e ekkaka.
005	DEU	028	013	GODAY nena hu7e histtanappe attiin goyna histtenna; hach tani nees immiza ne GODAA azazo siyada hessa neni minththada kaalliko neni ubbaafe bolla gidanaappe attiin garse gidakka.
005	DEU	028	014	Tani nees hach immida ha azazotappe kare kezada eeqa xoossatas goynnanaassinne isttas ooththanaas bessenna.
005	DEU	028	015	Qasse neni GODAA ne Xoossaas azazettontta ixxiko, tani nees immiza wogatanne azazota ne ammanettada naagontta ixxiko hayssafe kaalliza qanggeththati ne bolla gakkananne nena ekki baana.
005	DEU	028	016	Neni katamaninne gaxaren qanggettidaade gidana.
005	DEU	028	017	Ne kaththa gootaraynne maadday qanggettidaazi gidana.
005	DEU	028	018	Ne nayti, ne biittan diza kaththa ayfey, ne miizati, dorsatinne deyshati ubbay qanggettidaaz gidana.
005	DEU	028	019	Neni geladakka kezadakka qanggettidaade gidana.
005	DEU	028	020	Neni iita ooson GODAA aggida gishshas ne ooththiza ooson ubbaan ne mulera dhayana gakkanaas qanggeth, hirganne kawushshateth GODAY ne bolla ehana.
005	DEU	028	021	Neni laattanaas gelana biittayfe nena mulera dhayssana gakkanaas neeppe kichchontta iita harge GODAY ne bolla yeddana.
005	DEU	028	022	GODAY nena gilqateththan, mishoninne qoxon, madunththan, xuuggiza awaninne koshan nena dhayssana; ne kaththaa dhayssanaas kutul7enne lobe ne bolla yeddana.
005	DEU	028	023	Neeppe bollara ne ginan de7iza saloy xarqimala gidana; ne biittayka birata mala gidana.
005	DEU	028	024	GODAY ne biittan bukkiza iraa buuhenne gudulla kessana; neni biittafe dhayana gakkanaas gudullay saloppe duge bukkana.
005	DEU	028	025	GODAY ne morkketa sinththan neni xoonettana mala ooththana; neni istta bolla issi ogera baanashin isttafe attanaas laappunasora baqatana; biitta bolla diza kawoteththati ubbay ne bolla gakkizayssa be7idi hirgan kokkorana.
005	DEU	028	026	Ne ahay salo kafotassinne bazzo do7atas quma gidana; istta gooddana asikka deenna.
005	DEU	028	027	GODAY nena paxontta Gibxe dere hargen, kixan, giiyiza madunththaninne puuso hargen shocanna.
005	DEU	028	028	GODAY nena gooshshan, qooqeteththaninne dagaman yeggana.
005	DEU	028	029	Gallassa seetan neni qooqey tattafettiza mala tattafettana; ne ooththiza ubbay nees giigontta ixxana; neni ne de7o ubbaan un7etashenne bonqqettashe daana; nena maaddiza asekka demmaka.
005	DEU	028	030	Neni machcho ekkanaas geela7o giigsana; gido attiin hara asi izo dafi ekkana; ne keeth keexxanashin izan daakka; neni woyne mith tokkanashin iza ayfe go7ettaka.
005	DEU	028	031	Ne ayfey xeellishin ne mehe hara asi shukkana; gido attiin he ashozappe aykkoka maakka; ne harey neeppe bonqqetti ekettana; gido attiin nees guye simmenna; ne dorsati ne morkkes imettana; hessafe ashshanaas nena maaddanay deenna.
005	DEU	028	032	Ne ayfe sinththan ne attuma naytinne macca nayti hara kawoteththas imettana; istti simmiin be7ana gaada ne xeellishin ne ayfey doljumana; hessa digganaas nees ay wolqqayka deenna.
005	DEU	028	033	Ne biittaa kaththa ayfenne ne daabura kessida ubbaa hara dere asi maana; neni ne de7o ubbaan un7ettidaadenne qohettidaade gidana.
005	DEU	028	034	Neni ayfen be7iza ubbay nena gooshshana.
005	DEU	028	035	GODAY nees toho xugunththafe biidi hu7e binana gakkanaas miza paxontta iita madunththaninne kixan ne suulenne ne wodira shocanna.
005	DEU	028	036	GODAY nenanne neni ne bolla kawosana kawoza ha biittafe denththidi kase neninne ne aawati erontta hara kawoteth efana; intte heen miththafenne shuchchafe oosettida eeqa xoossatas goynnana.
005	DEU	028	037	GODAY neni laaletta biza kawoteththata ubbaa giddon nena qilccas, miichchassinne kadhes kessana.
005	DEU	028	038	Ne gaden ne daro kath zerana shin booley mishin attida guuththa kath shiishshana.
005	DEU	028	039	Neni woyne mith tokkanashin iza ayfeza go7ettaka; gaasoykka guxuney iza maana.
005	DEU	028	040	Ne deren awanka wogara miththi mokkanashin wodey gakkontta dishin ayfe qoqofana; hessa gishshas wogara zaytey nees deenna.
005	DEU	028	041	Neni macca naytanne attuma nayta yelanashin istti olan di7etti biikko ne mela attana.
005	DEU	028	042	Ne gaden diza miththaanne kaththaa ubbaa booley maana.
005	DEU	028	043	Ne wolqqay daaburi daaburi bishin ne deren diza bete asaa wolqqay minni minni baana.
005	DEU	028	044	Ne deren diza bete asay nees tal7e immana attiin ne isttas tal7aka; istti nees hu7e gidana; neni gidikko isttas goyna gidana.
005	DEU	028	045	Neni GODAA ne Xoossas azazettontta ixxida gishshassinne izi nees immida wogatanne azazota neni naagontta ixxida gishshas neni mulera dhayana gakkanaas hayti ha qanggeththati ubbay ne bolla gakkana.
005	DEU	028	046	Ha qanggeththati ubbay Xoossi ne bollanne ne zereththata bolla qixaates yeggida mernaas malaatanne malalisizaaz gidana.
005	DEU	028	047	GODAA ne Xoossay nena daro baggara anjjides; gido attiin ne galatashe ufayssan izas ooththabeekka.
005	DEU	028	048	Hessa gishshas neni gafan, saamon, kalloteththaninne meto ubbaan GODAY ne bolla yeddiza ne morkketas ne haarettana; GODAY nena dhayssana gakkanaas ne morgen birata qambara waaxana.
005	DEU	028	049	GODAY ne istta qaala erontta kawoteth haako dereppe ne bolla ehana; isttika golle kafo mala ne bolla wodhdhana.
005	DEU	028	050	Istti menxe iitata, cimmida asaa bonchchonttaytanne guuththa naytas mishettonttayta gidana.
005	DEU	028	051	Istti ne mehenne ne kath ubbaa pitti mizayta gidida gishshas neni hayqqana gakkanaas koshan waayana; istti ne dhayana gakkanaas ne kaththaafe issi ayfe, ne meheppe guuththa mari, ne dorsafe guuththa laaqqa, woyneppenne wogara miththa ayfeppe qii palakka ashshettenna.
005	DEU	028	052	Ne biittan de7iza neni isttan ammanettiza adussanne mino dirsati ubbasora laalettana gakkanaas ne katamata ubbaa yuushon dooddidi nena un7eththana. GODAA ne Xoossay nees immida biitta ubbaa yuushon dooddi ne miixata dippi histti dhayssana.
005	DEU	028	053	Ne morkketi ne katamata dooddidi nena un7eththiin nees mizaazi dhayiin ne metotiza wode GODAA ne Xoossay nees immida ne uloppe yelettida macca naytanne attuma nayta asho dosay baynda ne maana.
005	DEU	028	054	Ne giddon haray atto kase kiyanne injje duussi dees geetettiza asikka ba ishaas, ba siiqiza machcheyssinne ba yelida naytas qadhettenna.
