005	DEU	032	021	Tumu gidontta xoossatan tana mishisida; go7ay baynda ba eeqa xoossatan tana hanqeththida. Tanikka istta kadhettida kawoteththata istti miigettana mala ooththana. Ta istta akeekontta deretan hanqeththana.
005	DEU	032	022	Ta hanqoy tama mala eexxana; biittanne biitta bolla diza ubbaa xuuggana; he tamay si7oole ciimmaa gakkanaas eexxana; tamazi zumaas yoch gakkanaas maana.
005	DEU	032	023	Tani istta bolla zaareththa zaareththa bosha ehana; Taas diza wondafe ta istta bolla wursana.
005	DEU	032	024	Ta ubbaa wursiza kosha istta bolla yeddana; issaafe issaan aadhdhiza iita hargeninne boshan istti wurana; meto gaththiza iita do7atanne dukkiza marzera diza shooshshata ta istta bolla yeddana.
005	DEU	032	025	Oge ubbaan istta nayta olay wursana; keeththa giddonkka hirgay kumana; panththatinne geela7oti, guuththa naytinne cimati ubbay wurana.
005	DEU	032	026	Tani istta ubbaa laallana; Hessafe guye istta hassa7ana asi deenna.
005	DEU	032	027	Gido attiin istta morkketi, ‹Nuni nu wolqqan istta xoonidos attiin Xoos gidenna› giidi otoreteththan ceeqettidi tana hanqeththanaakko gaada qoppays.
005	DEU	032	028	Isra7eele asay yuushshi qoppontta kawoteth; isttas akeekay deenna.
005	DEU	032	029	Istti erata gididaakko hayssa istti kasetidi qoppana; bantta wurseththankka hananayssa yuushshi qoppanashin!
005	DEU	032	030	Istta medhdhidayssi istta aaththi immonttaako, GODAY istta yeggi aggonttaako, Issaadey 1,000 as wostti gooddandee? Woykko nam7ati 10,000 as wostti gooddanee?
005	DEU	032	031	Haray attoshin nu morkketi istta xoossay laafa gididayssanne Isra7eele Xoossaa mala gidonttayssa ereettes.
005	DEU	032	032	Nu morkketi Sodoomenne Gamoora dere asaa mala tuna; isttika camonne marzera diza ayfe ayfiza woyne miththa mala.
005	DEU	032	033	Istta woyne ushshay shooshsha marze mala; qasseka haso shooshsha marze mala.
005	DEU	032	034	«Hayssa tani dogadinaa? Ta mazgaban xaafetti uttides.
005	DEU	032	035	Istta morkketa bolla halo kessanay tana; ubbaasikka ta istta ooso ooso mala immana; isttas dhayo gallassi gakkida gishshas istti dhuphettana; eesonkka dhayana.»
005	DEU	032	036	Isttas wolqqay daaburdayssanne isttaka maaddizay bayndayssa be7idi, GODAY ba asaas pirdana; ba aylletaskka qadhettana.
005	DEU	032	037	GODAY ba asaa, «Istti ammanettiza istta xoossati awan dizoo? Istti baqati attiza zaallati awan dizoo?» gi oychchana.
005	DEU	032	038	Istti yarshos shiishshiza tolthoza midayti, istta woyne ushsha yarshoza uyida istta eeqa xoossati ane ha7i inttena dendi maaddetto; qasseka inttes duussaso immetto.
005	DEU	032	039	«Tani xalla Xoos gididayssa erite; taappe hara Xoossi deenna; wodhizaykka paxa woththizaykka tana; tani madunththayssinne paththays; ta kusheppe oonikka inttena ashshenna.
005	DEU	032	040	Tani ta kushe pude salo denththada, ‹Ta mernaas de7ays.
005	DEU	032	041	Wawaci giza ta giththa mashshaa leefana; ta kushey pirdas oykkana; ta morkketa bolla halo kessana; tana ixxizaytas ta istta ooso mala isttas immana.
005	DEU	032	042	Morkketa halaqata, madunxidaytanne di7ettidayta suuththan ta wondafeta ta maththosana; ta giththa mashshatikka ta morkketa asho maana› ga caaqqana.
005	DEU	032	043	«Intteno kawoteththatoo! GODAY ba oosanchchata suuth accana; morkketa bolla halo kessana; bana ixxizayta qaxxayana; ba dereza nagara wursana; biittayokka tunateththafe geeshshana; hessa gishshas intte iza asaara issife ufayettite» giidi,
005	DEU	032	044	Museynne Nawe naa Iyaasoy derezi siyishin ha mazamureza yootida.
005	DEU	032	045	Musey hayta ha qaalata kumeththa Isra7eele asaa sissidaappe guye,
005	DEU	032	046	izi, «Hayssa woga qaala ubbaa intte nayti lo7eththi naagana mala, istti ooththana malanne intte nayta intte azazana mala hach ta inttes markkattiza qaala ubbaa intte wozinan woththite.
005	DEU	032	047	Ha qaalay inttes de7oppe attiin coo mela qaalaa gidenna; ha qaala naagikko intte Yordaanoose pinnidi laattana biittankka adussa layth intte de7ana» gides.
005	DEU	032	048	He gallas GODAY Muses hizgides,
005	DEU	032	049	«Mo7aabe deren Iyarkko katama ginara diza Abaarime zumata giddofe Nebo zuma bolla keza; histtada tani Isra7eele asaas immana gida Kanaane biitta he pinththan xeella.
005	DEU	032	050	Ne isha Aarooney Hoore zumaa bolla hayqqidi kase hayqqida ba asatan gayttida mala nekka he zumaa bolla hayqqada ne asatan gayttana.
005	DEU	032	051	Intte nam7ayka Isra7eele asaa sinththan taas ammanettibeekketa; Xiine bazzon Qaadeese katamaa matan diza Mariiba haaththa achchan ta geeshshateththaa Isra7eele asaa bessibeekketa.
005	DEU	032	052	Hessa gishshas neni he biittayo haahon dashe be7ana attiin tani Isra7eele asaa laatissana biittayo neni gelakka.»
005	DEU	033	001	Xoossa as Musey hayqqanaappe kasetidi Isra7eele asaas woththida basse qaalay hayssafe kaalli dizayssa;
005	DEU	033	002	Musey, «GODAY Siina zumaappe yides; Eedoomeppe awa arshey nu bolla poo7ides; Paaraane zuma bollafekka nuus xolqides; izas ushachcha baggara tama lacoy dees; qooday baynda kiitanchchati izara issife deettes.
005	DEU	033	003	GODAWU! Neni deraa keeha siiqaasa; geeshshati ubbayka ne kushen deettes; ne toho garsan gulbati goynneettes; histtidi neeppe azazo ekkeettes.
005	DEU	033	004	Musey immida wogay Isra7eele asaas laata xinxxo.
005	DEU	033	005	Isra7eele qommoti ubbaynne deraa halaqati shiiqiin GODAY ba dere Isra7eele asaa bolla kawotides» gides.
005	DEU	033	006	Oroobeele qommota gishshas Musey, «Oroobeele qommoti detto attiin hayqqofetto; istta qoodaykka paccofo» gides.
005	DEU	033	007	Yuhuda qommota gishshas Musey, «GODAWU, Yuhuda qommota waaso siya; istti ba dabbotara issifeteththan daana mala ooththa; isttas gita wolqqa imma; istti ba morkketara olettishin neni istta maadda» gides.
005	DEU	033	008	Lewe qommota gishshas Musey, «Godawu! Neni istta Maasan paaccadasa; Mariiba haaththa achchan isttara palamettadasa; hessa gishshas Tumimeynne Urimey ne dosida ne oosanchchatas gido.
005	DEU	033	009	Ne gishshas giidi istti bana yelidayta balida; ba dabbotappe shaakettida; ba ishatappe shaakettida; ba nayta aggida; ne qaalaa bonchchida; ne immida caaqo qaalaakka naagida.
005	DEU	033	010	Istti ne woththida maaraa Yaaqoobe, ne wogaakka Isra7eele asaa tamaarseettes; istti ne sinththan exaane cuwaseettes; xuugettiza yarshoka yarsho yarshizasoza bolla shiishsheettes.
005	DEU	033	011	GODAWU! Ne istta de7o anjja; istti ooththiza ooso ubbaan ne ufayetta; istta morkketa shaya ne duuththa; istta ixxizayti nam7anththo dendontta mala digga!» gides.
005	DEU	033	012	Biniyaame qommota gishshas Musey, «GODAY siiqida asi izan ammanetti dees; ubba gallas istta izi naagees; ba hashen tookkidi shempisees» gides.
005	DEU	033	013	Yooseefe qommota gishshas Musey, «GODAY saloppe bukkiza iran, biittafe pude keziza pultton intte biittaa anjjo.
005	DEU	033	014	Awa wode kaxxiza lo7o ayfe immo; woden woden kaxxiza kaththa ayfen kumo.
005	DEU	033	015	Beniisofe diza istta zumatinne zumbullati coranne lo7o ayfen anjjettetto.
005	DEU	033	016	Istta biittay lo7o miishshan kumo; Xuugettiza tusha giddofe qonccida GODAA kiyateththi daro; Yooseefey ba ishata giddon halaqa gidida gishshas ha anjjoti ubbay iza gakketto.
005	DEU	033	017	Yooseefe teemay korma boora mala yashiso; iza kaceti menththa kace mala mino gidetto; iza kaceti shiyan qoodettiza Minaase zaretanne tammu shiyan qoodettiza Efreeme zareta; he kacetan izi kawoteththata qaycana; biitta gaxa gakkanaas istta izi gooddana» gides.
005	DEU	033	018	Zaabiloone qommota gishshassinne Yisakoore qommota gishshas Musey, «Zaabiloone! Neni ne kessan ufayetta; Yisakoore! Nenikka ne dunkaane giddon ufayetta.
005	DEU	033	019	Istti dereza pude zuma bolla xeygidi heen xilloteththa yarsho yarshana; banttas aqotanne dureteth abbafenne shaaminttafe demmana» gides.
005	DEU	033	020	Gaade qommota gishshas Musey, «Gaade qommota zawa aassida Xoossay galatetto; Gaadey morkketa menththereththanaas gaammo mala shankkatees.
005	DEU	033	021	Halaqatas bessiza biittazi iza naagees; izikka lo7o biitta baas doorides; deraa kaaleththizayti shiiqida wode izi GODAA shenenne xillo pirda pirdides» gides.
005	DEU	033	022	Daane qommota gishshas Musey, «Daaney Baasaaneppe guppi ke7iza wodalla gaammo mala» gides.
005	DEU	033	023	Niftaaleme qommota gishshas Musey, «Niftaalemey GODAA matan dosettides; GODAA anjjonka kumides; iza zaway abbaafe aadhdhidi dugeha bagga gakkides» gides.
005	DEU	033	024	Aaseere qommota gishshas Musey, «Aaseere qommoti hara qommotappe aadhdhi anjjettidayta gidetto; istti ba ishata giddon dosettidayta gidetto; istta biittay zayten kumo.
005	DEU	033	025	Istta katamata pengeti birataninne xarqimalan minni gordetetto; ba diza layth ubbaan istti wolqqama gidetto» gides.
005	DEU	033	026	Isra7eele asawu! Saloppe inttena maaddanaas ba teemara shaara bolla hemettiza intte Xoossa mala hara Xoossi deenna.
005	DEU	033	027	Mernaa Xoossay inttes duussaso; Mernaas diza iza qeseti inttefe garsara diidi kaafeettes; intte morkketa izi intte sinththafe gooddana; intte istta dhayssana mala izi inttena maaddana.
005	DEU	033	028	Hessa gishshas Isra7eele asay Saloppe iray izin bukkiza biittayn, kaththinne woyne ushshi izin kumida biittayn hirgay baynda saron de7ana.
005	DEU	033	029	Isra7eele asawu! Intte ay mala anjjettida deree! GODAY ashshida intte malay oonee? Izi inttes gondallenne inttena maaddizayssa; izan intte xooniza giththa mashsha; intte morkketi intte sinththan gufannana; intteka istti goynnizasota laallana.
005	DEU	034	001	Musey Mo7aabeppe dendi pude Nebo zumaa bolla kezides; Iyarkkofe arshey mokkiza baggara diza pude Pizga zuma xeera gakkides; izi heen dishin GODAY Gala7aadeppe biidi Daane gakkanaas diza biitta ubbaa bessides.
005	DEU	034	002	Niftaaleme biitta, Efreemenne Minaase biittaa ubbaa arshey wulliza baggara diza wogga gita abbaa gaxa gakkanaas diza Yuhuda biitta,
005	DEU	034	003	Negebenne zambay diza Iyarkko shoobbafe biidi Zo7aare gakkanaas dizaso ubbaa bessides.
005	DEU	034	004	GODAY Muses, «Abraames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobes, ‹Ta intte zereththata laatissana› ga caaqqida biittaya hannoko! Hekko neni ne ayfera be7ana mala ooththadis; gido attiin ne gelakka» gides.
005	DEU	034	005	Hessa gishshas GODAA oosanchcha Musey Mo7aabe biittan dishe GODAY izas yootida mala heen hayqqides.
005	DEU	034	006	GODAY Muse ahaa Mo7aabe deren diza Beeti-Pe7oore katamappe sinththan diza shoobbaan moogides; gido attiin izi moogettidaso shaakki eriza asi hach gakkanaas beettibeenna.
005	DEU	034	007	Musey hayqqishin izas layththay 120; gido attiin iza ayfey doljumibeenna; iza wolqqayka daaburbeenna.
005	DEU	034	008	Isra7eele asay Muses michay aadhdhana gakkanaas heedzdzu tammu gallas gakkanaas Mo7aabe demban kayottishe yeekkides.
005	DEU	034	009	Ba ollan izi ooththana mala Musey Nawe naa Iyaaso bolla ba kushe woththidi shuumida gishshas Iyaasoy aadho erateththaninne ayanan kumides; Isra7eele asay Iyaasos azazettides; GODAY Muse baggara isttas immida azazozakka naagida.
005	DEU	034	010	Asi asara haasayza mala GODAARA haasayda Muse mala nabey Isra7eele biittan dendibeenna.
005	DEU	034	011	GODAY Gibxe kawozaakko, izara ooththiza halaqataakkonne kumeththa asaakko yeddidi iza baggara ooraththinne malalisiza miish ubbaa ooththida Muse mala hara nabey oonikka deenna.
005	DEU	034	012	Musey Isra7eele asaa ubbaa sinththan ooththidayssa mala wolqqamanne babisiza malaatata ooththida hara nabey mulekka deenna.
#
# BOOK	006	JOS	Joshua	Iyaaso Maxaafa
006	JOS	001	001	GODAA aylle Musey hayqqidaappe guye GODAY Muse maaddiza Nawe naa Iyaasos,
006	JOS	001	002	«Hekko ta aylle Musey hayqqides; ha7i neninne hayssi derezi dendite; tani kase Isra7eele asaas immana gida biittaa gelanaas Yordaanoose shaafa pinnite.
006	JOS	001	003	Tani kase Muses immida hidota mala intte tohoy yedhdhiza biitta ubbaa ta inttes immana.
006	JOS	001	004	Intte biittaa zaway bazzofe doommidi Libaanoose, wogga shaafa Efiraaxiseppe biidi Hiite dere ubbaa oykkidi arshey wulliza baggara biidi wogga abbaa gakkanaassa.
006	JOS	001	005	Neni diza wode ubbaan nenara oonikka eqettana dandayenna; tani kase Musera gidida mala nenarakka gidana; mulekka ta nena yeggikenne aggike.
006	JOS	001	006	«Minna! Xala gida; tani kase istta aawatas immana gaada caaqqida biittaa ha dereza kaaleththada laatisanay nena gidida gishshas minna.
006	JOS	001	007	Aykkoy baa; neni mino xalla minna; ta aylle Musey nees immida wogaza ubbaa lo7eththa azazetta; ne bidaso ubbaan giiga gidana mala hadirs ushach gooppa.
006	JOS	001	008	Hayssi woga Maxaafay ne doonappe shaakettofo; iza giddon dizayssa ne lo7eththa naagettada polana mala gallas gidiin omars zaara zaara qoppa; ne hessaththo ooththiko ne qoppida ubbay nees suurananne hanana.
006	JOS	001	009	Neni bizason ubbaan GODAA ne Xoossay nenara diza gishshas aykkoy baa, minna, yayyofa, dagammofa gaada ta nena azazabeekkinaa!» gides.
006	JOS	001	010	Hessafe kaallidi Iyaasoy Isra7eele asaa,
006	JOS	001	011	«Intte gede asay dizaso biidi, ‹Intte heedzdzu gallassafe guye kase GODAA intte Xoossay inttena laatissanaas inttes immiza biittayo laattanaas Yordaanoose pinnana gishshas inttes shinqe giigsite› gi yootite» gi azazides.
006	JOS	001	012	Iyaasoy Oroobeele qommotas, Gaade qommotas, hessaththoka Minaase qommotappe baggaytas,
006	JOS	001	013	«GODAA aylle Musey, ‹GODAA intte Xoossay inttena shempisana; hanno biittayokka izi inttes immana› gi immida azazoza akeekite.
006	JOS	001	014	Intte machcheti, intte naytinne intte mehetikka kase Musey inttes Yordaanoose shaafappe he pinththan immidason heen diishetto; gido attiin intte ola asay ubbay kumeth ola miishshara intte baggata Isra7eele asaa maaddanaas kasetidi Yordaanoose pinnetto; intteka intte ishatara issife olaas kezite.
006	JOS	001	015	Hessika GODAY istta shempisana gakkanaassinne inttes izi ooththoyssaththo isttika GODAA intte Xoossay isttas immida biittaa gakki laattana gakkanaassa; hessafe guye intte simmi yiidi arshey mokkiza baggara Yordaanoose shaafappe he pinththan GODAA aylle Musey inttes immida biittaa intte laattana» gides.
006	JOS	001	016	Isttika Iyaasos, «Neni nuus yootoyssa nuni ubbaa polana; ne kiittizaso awakka baana.
006	JOS	001	017	Nuni Muses ubba wode azazettida mala neeskka azazettana; GODAA ne Xoossay kase Musera gidida mala nenarakka izi gido!
006	JOS	001	018	Nenara eqettizaadeynne nees azazettonttaade ubbay hayqqo; ne minna; aykkoy baa, ne mino minna» gida.
006	JOS	002	001	Nawe naa Iyaasoy biittaa wochchiza nam7u asata Shiixime geetettizasoppe qotan kiittides; kiittishe isttas, «Biite; biidi biitta wochchite; harappeka Iyarkko katamaa dummasi wochchite» gides. Histtiin istti biidi Era7aabo geetettiza layma maccassay soo gelidi aqida.
006	JOS	002	002	Histtiin Iyarkko kawoy, «Isra7eele asaappe kiitettidayti ha biitta wochchanaas omars yida» giza yo7o siyides.
006	JOS	002	003	Iyarkko kawoy Era7aabikko, «Ne soo yi gelida asata kessa imma. Ays giikko istti biitta ubbaa wochchanaas yida» giza kiita yeddides.
006	JOS	002	004	Gido attiin mishireya he nam7u asata qotta woththada, «Ee asati taakko yidaakkoshin istti awappe yidaakko ta erabeekke.
006	JOS	002	005	Omars katama penge gordana giza wode istti kezi bida; istti awa bidaakko ta erikke; eesotidi kaallizaa gidikko intte istta oykkana» gadus.
006	JOS	002	006	Gido attiin Era7aaba asata pooqe mala oosettidaso kessada micettida talbba buuxa giddon istta qotta woththadus.
006	JOS	002	007	Asati xomosizayta koyanaas kezidi Yordaanoose shaafa pinth efiza oge oykkidi bida; koyzayti katamaappe kezida mala katamaa pengey gordettides.
006	JOS	002	008	Wochchizayti dhiskanaappe kasetada iza isttako pude kezada isttas,
006	JOS	002	009	«GODAY ha biittaa inttes immidayssa, inttes yashshateththi nunan kumidayssanne ha biittan de7iza asaa wozinay inttes hirgan seeridayssa ta erays.
006	JOS	002	010	Gibxe biittafe intte kezida wode intte sinththan Zo7o abbaa GODAY wostti melissidaakko nuni siyidos; qasse Yordaanoose shaafappe arshe kessaso baggara diza Amoore biitta kawota nam7ata, Sihoonenne Aage intte wostti ubbaa dhayssidaakko nu siyidos.
006	JOS	002	011	Nu hessa siyida mala nu wozinay seerides; inttes yashshateththafe dendidayssan shirotontta asi deenna; GODAA intte Xoossay bolla salonkka garsa biittankka izi Xoossa.
006	JOS	002	012	Hessa gishshas tani inttes kiyida mala intteka ta aawa keeththa asaas kiyana mala taas GODAAN caaqqite; hessaska ammanththiza malata taas immite.
006	JOS	002	013	Ta aawaanne ta aayiyo, ta ishatanne ta michcheta isttas shemppora diza ubbaa wodhopite; nuna hayqoppe ashshite» gadus.
006	JOS	002	014	He asati, «Nu nees caaqqida qaalaa mala polontta aggiko Xoossi nuna wodho! Nu ooththidayssa ne oonaska yootontta aggiko, GODAY hanno biittayo nuus immiza wode nu nees lo7o ooththana mala caaqqoos» gida.
006	JOS	002	015	Era7aaba diza keeththay katamaa dirsaara oyketti keexetti uttida gishshas asata wodoron qachchada maskootera duge woththadus.
006	JOS	002	016	Era7aaba isttas, «Inttena koyzayti demmontta mala pude zumbullata bolla kezidi heen heedzdzu gallas qotettite; hessafe guye intte baanaaso biite» gadus.
006	JOS	002	017	Asatikka izis, «Nuni ne biitta geliza wode ha zo7o wodoroza neni nuna kessida maskoote bolla qachchontta aggiko ne aawa, ne aayiyo, ne ishatanne neso asaa ubbaa neso ehontta aggiko neni nuna caaqisida caaqoy nuus gomettenna.
006	JOS	002	019	Oonikka ne keeththafe kare kezi oge bolla beetti hayqqiko hessi iza gome; nuni hessan oyshshettoko; gido attiin nenara soon issife dizay oonikka boshettiko iza suuththa gomey nuna gakko.
006	JOS	002	020	Nu ooththizayssa ne haras yootizaa gidikko neni nuna caaqeththida caaqoy nuus gomettenna» gida.
006	JOS	002	021	Izakka, «Intte gida mala hano» gaada istta moyzadus; istti bidaappe guye zo7o wodoro ba maskoote bolla qaaphadus.
006	JOS	002	022	Istti pude zumbullatakko bida; goodeththizayti Iyarkko simmana gakkanaas heen heedzdzu gallas qotettida. Goodeththizayti oge ubbaan koyida shin istti demmibeettenna.
006	JOS	002	023	Hessafe guye he nam7u asati zumbullatappe wodhdhi Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnidi Nawe naa Iyaasokko biidi bana gakkida ubbaa izas yootida.
006	JOS	002	024	Istti Iyaasos, «GODAY tumappe biitta ubbaa nuus aaththi immides; qasse he biittan diza asay wuri nuus yashshateththafe dendidayssan istta wozinay seeridayssa nu be7idos» gida.
