006	JOS	024	011	«‹Heeppe intte Yordaanoose shaafa pinnidi Iyarkko yideta; Amooreti, Paarizeti, Kanaaneti, Hiiteti, Gergeseti, Hiiwetinne Yaabuseti inttenara olettida mala Iyarkko asay inttenara olettides; gido attiin tani istta intte kushen aaththa immadis.
006	JOS	024	012	Inttefe sinththe kazhe kiittada isttanne Amoore kawo nam7ata intte sinththafe gooddadis. Hayssi ubbay haniday intte mashshaninne intte wondafen gidenna.
006	JOS	024	013	Intte daaburontta biittanne intte keexxontta katamata tani inttes immadis; hekko intte tokkontta woyne ayfenne wogara ayfe meeta› gides.
006	JOS	024	014	«Hessa gishshas ha7ikka GODAAS yayyite; kumeththa wozinappe ammaneteththan izas haarettite; kase intte aawati Efiraaxise shaafappe he pinththaninne Gibxe biittan goynnida eeqa xoossata inttefe haassite; GODAAS xalla goynnite.
006	JOS	024	015	GODAAS goynoy koshshontta miish misati inttes beettiko kase intte aawati shaafappe he pinththan dishe goynnida eeqa xoossata woykko ha7i intte diza Amooreti goynniza xoossata goynnana gidikko intte goynnanayssa hach doorite; taninne ta keeththa asay gidikko GODAAS goynnana» gides.
006	JOS	024	016	Histtiin asay zaaridi, «GODAA aggidi hara eeqa xoossatas goynoy nuuppe haakko!
006	JOS	024	017	Gibxe aylleteththa biittafe, nunanne nu aawata kessidi ehiday, he gita malaatata nu sinththan ooththiday, nu biza oge ubbaaninne nu kanththida kawoteththata ubbaa giddon nuna naagiday GODAA nu Xoossaa.
006	JOS	024	018	Qasse GODAY he biittan diza Amooretara gujjiin deraa ubbaa nu sinththafe gooddides; hessa gishshas nuni GODAAS goynnana; izi nu Xoossa» gides.
006	JOS	024	019	Iyaasoykka deraas, «Intte GODAAS goynnanaas dandayekketa; izi geeshsha Xoossa; izi qanaatiza Xoossa; izi intte makkallateththaanne intte nagaraa atto geenna.
006	JOS	024	020	Intte GODAA aggidi allaga xoossatas goynniko izi inttes lo7o ooththidaappe guye simmi wodhdhidi izi intte bolla iita ooththananne inttena dhayssana» gides.
006	JOS	024	021	Histtiin derezi Iyaaso, «Akkay nuni GODAAS xalla goynnana» gides.
006	JOS	024	022	Hessafe guye Iyaasoy deraas, «Intte GODAAS goynnanaas doorida gishshas intte hu7es intte markka» gides. Isttika zaaridi, «Ee nuni markka!» gida.
006	JOS	024	023	Iyaasoy, «Histtiko, intte giddon diza allaga xoossata diggite; intte wozinaa GODAA Isra7eele Xoossaako zaarite» gides.
006	JOS	024	024	Derezikka Iyaasos, «Nuni GODAA nu Xoossas goynnana; izaskka azazettana» gida.
006	JOS	024	025	He gallas Iyaasoy dereza caaqeththides; istti kaallana wogaanne maara heen Seekeemen isttas immides.
006	JOS	024	026	Iyaasoy he qaalata Xoossa Woga Maxaafan xaafides. Hessafe guye issi gita shuch ekkidi Geesh gidida GODAA Dunkaaneza matan diza wola garsan essides.
006	JOS	024	027	Iyaasoy kumeththa deraas, «Be7ite; GODAY nuus haasayda qaala ubbaa ha shuchchay siyida gishshas izi nu bolla markka gidana. Intte Xoossa bollan makkalliko ha shuchchay intte bolla markka gidana» gides.
006	JOS	024	028	Hessafe guye Iyaasoy deraa ubbaa ba xinxxon xinxxon simmana mala moyzides.
006	JOS	024	029	Hessafe guye GODAA aylle, Nawe naa Iyaasos layththay 110 gidiin hayqqides.
006	JOS	024	030	Asay Ga7aashe zumaappe pudeha baggan, shaara menththon diza Efreeme deren diza iza xinxxon Teminaate-Seraahan moogides.
006	JOS	024	031	Iyaasoy paxa diza wode ubbaan, Iyaasoppe simmiin de7ida asatinne GODAY Isra7eeletas ooththida ooso ubbaa eriza cimati diza wode ubbaan Isra7eele asay GODAAS goynnides.
006	JOS	024	032	Isra7eele asay Gibxe biittafe ehida Yooseefe meqeththaa Seekeemen moogida. He sohoza Yaaqoobey Seekeeme aawa Emooreppe 100 saqile biran shammides; histtiin guyeppe Yooseefe zereththatas xinxxo gidides.
006	JOS	024	033	Qasseka Aaroone naa El7ezeerey hayqqides; izikka shaara menththon diza Efreeme deren iza naaza Finihaase saaman gakkida Gibi7a katamaan moogettides.
#
# BOOK	007	JDG	Judges	Daannata Maxaafa
007	JDG	001	001	Iyaasoy hayqqidaappe guye Isra7eele asay, «Kanaane biitta asaa olanaas nu zaretappe koyrottidi kezanay oonee?» giidi GODAA oychchides.
007	JDG	001	002	Histtiin GODAY, «Yuhuda zareti koyrotti kezetto; tani biittaa istta kushen aaththa immadis» gides.
007	JDG	001	003	Yuhuda asay bantta dabbota gidida Simoona zareta, «Nuni Kanaanetara olettana mala nuna shaakkiin gakkidaso nunara aadhdhite. Hessafe guye inttena shaakon gakkidaso inttenara issife baana» gida; histtiin Simoona zaretinne Yuhuda zareti olas issife bida.
007	JDG	001	004	Histtiin GODAY Kanaanetanne Paarizeta istta kushen aaththi immides; Beezeqen 10,000 as wodhida.
007	JDG	001	005	Beezeqe geetettizason Adooni-Beezeqe demmidi izara olettida; histtidi Kanaanetanne Paarizeta xoonida.
007	JDG	001	006	Adooni-Beezeqey baqatishin gooddi oykkidi, izas kushe manththa biradhdhetanne toho manththa biradhdheta qanxxi qanxxi yeggida.
007	JDG	001	007	Histtiin Adooni-Beezeqey, «Kushe manththa biradhdhetanne toho manththa biradhdheta tani qanxxa qanxxa yeggida laappun tammu kawoti ta maaddafe wodhdhida suuppa maxi shiishshidi meettes. Kase istta bolla ta ooththida gene mala Xoossi ta bolla ooththides» gides. Iza Yerusalaame ehiin heen hayqqides.
007	JDG	001	008	Yuhuda asay Yerusalaame oli oykkides; histtidi asaa giththa mashshan busakki wursidi katamaa taman xuuggides.
007	JDG	001	009	Hessafe guye Yuhuda asay gezzen, Negebeninne he dere gadhan diza Kanaaneta olanaas bides.
007	JDG	001	010	Histtidi kase Qiriyaate-Arba7e geetettiza Kebroone katamaan diza Kanaaneta olida; qasse Shashaye, Ahimaanenne Talimaye geetettiza qommota xoonida.
007	JDG	001	011	Hessafe dendidi Yuhuda asay Dabire geetettiza katamaan diza asaa olanaas bides; Dabire katamay kase, «Qiriyaate-Sefere» geetettees.
007	JDG	001	012	Kaalebey, «Qiriyaate-Sefere olidi oykkizaades tani ta nayo Akisa immana» gides.
007	JDG	001	013	Histtiin Kaalebes kaalo isha Qenaaze naa Otin7eeley he katamaa olidi oykkides; Kaalebeykka ba nayo Akisa izas immides.
007	JDG	001	014	Akisay Otin7eele geliza wode, iza ba aawappe gade oychcha ekkana mala Otin7eeley izo zorides; histtiin iza ba toggida mehe bollafe wodhdhadus; histtiin Kaalebey izo, «Ta nees ay ooththoo?» giidi oychchides.
007	JDG	001	015	Izakka, «Kase ne taas immida gadey haaththi bayndaso gidida gishshas pultto haaththara diza gade taas immarkkii!» gadus. Histtiin Kaalebey izis pude baggaranne duge baggara pulttora diza gadeta immides.
007	JDG	001	016	Muse bollo Qenaaweza zereththati Yuhuda asaara Zambay dari diza Iyarkko katamappe dendida; histtidi Araade geetettiza katamaappe dugeha baggara, Negeben diza Yuhuda bazzo bida; histtidikka heen diza asaa giddon uttida.
007	JDG	001	017	Yuhuda asay Simoona asaara issife biidi, Xafaate geetettiza katamaan diza Kanaaneta oli xoonides; katamayokka mulera dhayssides. Histtidi Horma giidi sunththides.
007	JDG	001	018	Yuhuda asay gujjidi Gaaza, Asqeloonanne Aqaroone katamata istta yuushon diza deretakka oli oykkides.
007	JDG	001	019	GODAY Yuhuda asaara diza gishshas, zumati darzaaso gezze biitta istti oykkida; gido attiin gars dembati uttida biittan diza asatas biratappe oosettida ola para-gaareti diza gishshas, Yuhuda asay istta denththi gooddanaas dandaybeenna.
007	JDG	001	020	Musey gida malan Kebroone katamaa Kaalebes immida; histtiin Kaalebey Enaaqe zare gidida heedzdzu qommota deraappe denththi gooddides.
007	JDG	001	021	Gido attiin Biniyaame zareti Yerusalaamen diza Yaabuse asata deraappe denththi gooddontta aggida gishshas hach gakkanaas Yaabuseti Biniyaame zaretara Yerusalaamen issife deettes.
007	JDG	001	022	Yooseefe qommoti Beetele olanaas worajjida; GODAYKKA isttara dees;
007	JDG	001	023	Isttika Beetele katamaa yuuyi xomosiza asata kiittida; kase he katamay sunththi Looza geetettees.
007	JDG	001	024	Kiittiin istti katamaappe kezi biza issi addeza demmidi, «Katamaa giddo waani gelanaas dandayettizaakko nuna bessa; ne bessiko nuni nees kiyana» gida.
007	JDG	001	025	Histtiin izi istta bessides; hessafe guye katamaan diza asaa giththa mashshan busakkida; gido attiin he addezanne izaso asaa ubbaa shemppo ashshida.
007	JDG	001	026	Guyeppe he addezi Hiite geetettiza dere biidi, heen katama essides; he katamay sunththaa Looza gi sunththides; he katamayakka hach gakkanaas he sunththaan xeygettawus.
007	JDG	001	027	Minaase zareti, Beeti-Sha7aane, Ta7inaake, Doore, Yibila7aamenne Magiddo katamataninne istta yuushon diza mooththatan diza asata kessi gooddontta aggida gishshas Kanaaneti heen bantta de7o minththi oykkida.
007	JDG	001	028	Isra7eele asay minnida wode Kanaaneta baas wolqqan oosisida; gido attiin istta mulera biittafe kessi gooddibeettenna.
007	JDG	001	029	Efreeme zaretikka Gezeere geetettiza katamaan diza Kanaaneta kessidi gooddontta aggida gishshas Kanaane asati heen isttara issife duus doommida.
007	JDG	001	030	Zaabiloone zareti Qitiroone katamaninne Nahilaale katamaan diza asata kessi gooddontta aggida gishshas Kanaaneti heen isttara issife de7ida; gido attiin Zaabiloone zareti istta baas wolqqan oosisida.
007	JDG	001	031	Aaseere zaretikka Akkon, Sidoonan, Ahilaaben, Akiziiben, Helben, Afeeqeninne Erahooben diza asata kessi gooddibeettenna.
007	JDG	001	032	Kanaaneti kezontta aggida gishshas Aaseere zareti isttara heen issife de7ida.
007	JDG	001	033	Niftaaleme zaretikka Beeti-Shemishe katamaninne Beeti-Anaate katamaan diza asata kessidi gooddibeettenna; gido attiin Kanaanetara heen issife de7ishin Beeti-Shemishenne Beeti-Anaate katama asata baas wolqqan oosisida.
007	JDG	001	034	Amooreti Daane zareta pude zumati dizaso gezzefe duge dembaso wodhdhontta mala diggida.
007	JDG	001	035	Amooreti Hari-Hereese deren, Ayaalooninne Sha7albime geetettiza katamatan de7o minththida; gido attiin Efreeme zaretinne Minaase zareti minni minni biidi banttas wolqqan oosisida.
007	JDG	001	036	Amooreta dere zaway Akirabime geetettizasora aadhdhi biidi Seelara kanththidi heera aadhdhi bees.
007	JDG	002	001	GODAA kiitanchchay Gelgelappe Bookime biidi Isra7eele asaas, «Tani inttena Gibxeppe kessada beni intte aawaas immana gaada ta caaqqida biitta inttena gelththadis; histtada ta inttes, ‹Tani inttenara caaqqida caaqo qaalaa mulekka laammike.
007	JDG	002	002	Intte ha biittan diza asatara caaqo caaqettofte; istti yarshizasota laallite› gadis; gido attiin intte taas azazettibeekketa; ays hessaththo hanidetii?
007	JDG	002	003	Hessa gishshas tani inttena, ‹Istta tani intte sinththafe kessa gooddike; istti inttes morkke gidana; istta eeqa xoossatikka inttes narxa mala gidana› gadis» gides.
007	JDG	002	004	GODAA kiitanchchay hessa Isra7eele asaa ubbaas yootida wode asay ba qaalaa dhoqqu histtidi yeekkides.
007	JDG	002	005	He sohoza Bookime giidi sunththides; histtidi he sozan Xoossas yarsho yarshides.
007	JDG	002	006	Iyaasoy Isra7eele asaa yeddidaappe guye asay issoy issoy shaakkiin bana gakkiza biitta ekkanaas bides.
007	JDG	002	007	Iyaasoy shemppora paxa diza layththa ubbaan asay GODAAS ooththides; izi hayqqidaappe guye GODAY Isra7eele asaas ooththida gita ooso ubbaa be7ida cimata wode ubbaankka GODAAS goynnizayssa aggibeenna.
007	JDG	002	008	GODAA aylle Nawe naa Iyaasos layththay 110 gidiin hayqqides;
007	JDG	002	009	Ga7aashe dereppe pudeha baggan Efreeme deren bolla gezze biittan Teminaate-Seraaha geetettizason diza iza gaden iza moogida.
007	JDG	002	010	He yeleta ubbay hayqqidaappe guye GODAANNE izi Isra7eele asaas ooththida lo7o ooso ubbaa erontta ooraththa yeletay dendides.
007	JDG	002	011	Hessafe guye Isra7eele asay GODAA sinththan iita miish ooththides; Ba7aale geetettiza eeqatas goynnides.
007	JDG	002	012	Gibxe biittafe istta kessida GODAA, bantta aawata Xoossaa aggaagida; bantta heeran diza asati goynniza eeqatakko simmidi isttas goynnida; hessan GODAA hanqeththida.
007	JDG	002	013	GODAAKKA aggidi Ba7aalessinne Astarootes goynnida.
007	JDG	002	014	Hessa gishshas GODAA hanqoy Isra7eele asaa bolla eexxi kezides; worajjizayti bonqqana mala istta morkketa kushen aaththi immides; istta heeran diza morkketas istta aaththi immides; hessafe guye istti bantta morkketara eqettanaas dandaybeettenna.
007	JDG	002	015	Istti olas keziza wode ubbaan GODAY kase isttas caaqqi yootoyssaththo istti xoonettana mala izi istta bolla dendides; hessafe dendoyssan istti keehi waayettida.
007	JDG	002	016	Hessafe guye GODAY Isra7eele asaa bolla worajjizayta kusheppe istta ashshiza daannata isttas denththides;
007	JDG	002	017	Gido attiin Isra7eele asay isttas pirdiza daannatas azazettibeenna; istti GODAAS ammanettontta ixxida; eeqa xoossatakko simmidi isttas goynnida; kase bantta aawata ogeppe kare kezida; istta aawati GODAAS azazettida mala istti azazettibeettenna.
007	JDG	002	018	GODAY isttas pirdiza daannata daannasida wode ubbaan izi he pirdiza daannatara issife diza gishshas he daannati shemppora paxa diza layth ubbaan istta morkketa kusheppe istta ashshides. Waayeynne tuggay istta bolla darida gaason istti waassizayssa siyidi GODAY isttas qadhettides.
007	JDG	002	019	Gido attiin istta kaaleththiza daannati hayqqida wode ubbaan asay guye simmidi, eeqa xoossata kaalon, isttas haggazoninne istta goynon kase istta aawati ooththida iita oosoppe aadhdhida iita ooson simmi gelida; bantta iita oosonne geella oge aggontta ixxida.
007	JDG	002	020	Hessa gaason GODAA hanqoy Isra7eele kawoteththaa bolla eexxi kezides; GODAY, «Ha asay tani kase istta aawatara gelida caaqo qaalaa yedhdhi aadhdhida gishshassinne taas azazettontta ixxida gishshas,
007	JDG	002	021	hachchife doommiin Iyaasoy hayqqida wode biittaa bollan attida kawoteththatappe issaadeka tani istta sinththafe kessa gooddike.
007	JDG	002	022	Ha Isra7eele asay kase bantta aawata mala ta oge kaallizaakkonne kaallonttaako tani istta paaccanaas hayssa ha dereta taas ola massara ooththada isttan go7ettana» gides.
007	JDG	002	023	Hessa gishshas GODAY he kawoteththa asay kezontta gam7ana mala ooththides. Izi istta eeson yedeththi kessibeenna; Iyaasoska istta aaththi immibeenna.
007	JDG	003	001	He wode Kanaanen ay olakka oletti erontta Isra7eele kawoteththaa paaccana mala GODAY ha asata ashshides.
007	JDG	003	002	Izi hessa ooththiday hayssafe kase ola oletti erontta Isra7eele yeletaa ola tamaarsanaassa.
007	JDG	003	003	He biittan attida asati, Filisxeeme katamata haariza ichchashata, Kanaaneta ubbaa, Sidoona katama asatanne Ba7aali-Hermoone geetettiza dereppe doommidi Hamaate gakkanaas Libaanoose zumata bolla diza Hiiweta.
007	JDG	003	004	GODAY Muse baggara kase Isra7eele aawatas immida azazo istti azazettizaakkonne azazettonttaako shaakki eranaas isttas paace gidana mala he attida asata heen ashshides.
007	JDG	003	005	Hessa gishshas Isra7eele asay Kanaanetara, Hiiwetara, Amooretara, Paarizetara, Hiitetaranne Yaabusetara issife de7ides.
007	JDG	003	006	Istta macca nayta baas machcho ekkida; bantta macca naytakka istta attuma naytas immida; istta eeqa xoossataska goynnida.
007	JDG	003	007	Isra7eele asay GODAA sinththan iita miish ooththides; istti GODAA bantta Xoossa aggidi Ba7aalenne Asheero geetettiza eeqa xoossatas goynnida.
007	JDG	003	008	Hessa gishshas GODAA hanqoy Isra7eele asaa bolla eexxi kezides; GODAY Masophexoomya biitta kawo Kushaan-Arishataye kushen istta aaththi immides; isttika izas osppun layth haarettida.
007	JDG	003	009	Gido attiin Isra7eele asay GODAAS waassida wode GODAY istta ashshanaas ashshizaade kiittides; izikka Kaalebes kaalo isha Qenaaze naa Otin7eele geetettees.
007	JDG	003	010	GODAA Ayanay iza bolla wodhdhiin izi Isra7eele dere ayssiza daanna gidides; izi olas kezida wode GODAY Masophexoomya biitta kawo Kushaan-Arishataye iza kushen aaththi immiin iza xoonides.
007	JDG	003	011	Hessa gishshas Qenaaze naa Otin7eeley hayqqana gakkanaas biittay oyddu tammu layth kumeth woppa demmides.
007	JDG	003	012	Isra7eele asay zaareththidikka GODAA sinththan iita miish ooththides; hessa gishshas GODAY Mo7aabe kawo Egilooney Isra7eele bolla wolqqamana mala ooththides.
007	JDG	003	013	Egilooney Amoonetanne Amaaleeqeta banara denththi ekki biidi Isra7eele asaa oli xoonides; Zamba katama geetettiza Iyarkko katamaakka oykkides.
007	JDG	003	014	Isra7eele asaykka Mo7aabe kawo Egiloones tammanne osppun layth haarettides.
007	JDG	003	015	Isra7eele asay GODAAKKO zaari waassida wode, istta ashshiza as kiittides; izikka Biniyaame zareppe Geera naa Ehuude geetettees; izi hadirsa kushen ooththiza asa; Isra7eele asay Ehuude Mo7aabe kawo Egiloonekko giirara kiittides.
007	JDG	003	016	Ehuudey nam7u baggara qarattida issi wadha gidiza giththa mashsha baas giigsides; ushachcha mille baggara may7o giddon gixxides.
007	JDG	003	017	Hessafe guye Mo7aabe kawo Egiloones giira ekki efidi immides; Egilooney keehi orde asa.
007	JDG	003	018	Ehuudey giiraza kawozas immidaappe guye giiraa tookkidi bida asata moyzides.
007	JDG	003	019	Gido attiin Ehuudey Gelgela matan diza masetti eqqida shuchchata matappe Egiloonekko guye simmi biidi, «Kawontoo! Tani inttes yootana xuura miishshi dees» gides. Histtiin kawoy, «Co7u ga!» gides; iza naagizayti ubbay kare kezida.
007	JDG	003	020	He wode kawoy pooqen diza issi carkiza kifilen barkka utti dishin Ehuudey izakko shiiqidi, «Xoossi nees yeddida kiitay dees» gides; kawozikka ba uttidasohoppe dendi eqqides.
007	JDG	003	021	Ehuudey hadirsa kushe yeddidi ushachcha bagga millefe giththa mashsha shoddidi kawozas ulon yeddides.
007	JDG	003	022	Histtiin giththa mashshaas tuutey attontta ulo giddo gelidi zokkora kanththi kezides; moodhezikka mashshaa may7ides; Ehuudey mashshaa shoddontta heen aggaagides.
007	JDG	003	023	Hessafe guye Ehuudey kare kezidi keeththa kare iza bolla gordi qulpides.
007	JDG	003	024	Ehuudey bidaappe guye kawaa aylleti yiidi pengey gordettidayssa be7ida; gido attiin kawoy giddo kifilen sheeshshas uttontta aggenna giidi qoppida.
007	JDG	003	025	Salettana gakkanaas karen eqqi naagida; gido attiin kawoy penge doyontta ixxiin qulpe ekkidi pengeza doyda; istta godaa ahay wuyge bolla porccu gi dizayssa be7ida.
007	JDG	003	026	Ashkarati heen penge bolla naagon dishin Ehuudey kessi ekkidi masetti eqqida shuchchasora aadhdhidi Seyre geetettizaso baqatides.
007	JDG	003	027	Izi he gakkida wode Efreeme deren bolla gezzezan Isra7eele asay olas shiiqana mala zaye punnides; asaykka iza kaallidi heeppe duge wodhdhides.
007	JDG	003	028	Izi isttas, «Tana kaallite; ays giikko GODAY intte morkketa, Mo7aabeta intte kushen aaththi immides» gides. Hizgiin iza kaalli wodhdhidi Yordaanoose shaafappe gede Mo7aabe pinththiza purdeza oykkidi issaadeyka heera kanththontta mala diggida.
007	JDG	003	029	He wode Mo7aabe asaappe tammu shii gidiza doorettida mino olanchchata wodhida; issi asikka kessi ekki attibeenna.
007	JDG	003	030	He gallas Isra7eele asay Mo7aabe asaa oli xoonides; hessa gaason biittay osppun tammu layth gakkanaas woppa demmides.
