# BOOK	008	RUT	Ruth	Uruti Maxaafa
008	RUT	001	001	Isra7eele biittaa daannati haariza wode he biittan koshay dendides. Histtiin issaadey ba machchonne nam7u attuma nayta ekkidi Yuhuda deren diza Beeteliheeme katamappe dendidi Mo7aabe biitta bides.
008	RUT	001	002	He addeza sunththi Abimelekke; machchey sunththi Nuhaamo; nam7u nayta sunththi Mahaloonenne Keloone geetettees. Istti Yuhuda biittan Beeteliheeme kataman Efraata dere as gidishe Mo7aabe dere biidi heen de7ida.
008	RUT	001	003	Heen dishin Nuhaami azina Abimelekkey hayqqiin iza ba naa nam7atara xalla attadus.
008	RUT	001	004	Izi nayti Mo7aabe biitta macca naytappe Orfanne Uruto machcho ekkida. Isttika heen tammu layththa keena de7ida.
008	RUT	001	005	Mahalooneynne Kelooney nam7atikka hayqqida. Nuhaama izi azinaynne nam7u nayti hayqqiin barkka attadus.
008	RUT	001	006	Iza Mo7aaben dishin GODAY ba asaa mokki xeellidi isttas kath immidayssa siyada nayta machcheta nam7ata banara ekkada ba dere simma baana kezadus.
008	RUT	001	007	Kase ba dizaso yeggada nayta machcheta nam7atara issife Yuhuda biitta efiza ogen gelidi buus doommida.
008	RUT	001	008	Hessafe guye Nuhaama ba nayta machcheta nam7atas, «Intte wurikka intte aayikko aayikko simmite; hayqqida intte azinatassinne taas intte lo7o ooththidayssaththo GODAYKKA inttes izaththo ooththo.
008	RUT	001	009	Intte issoy issoy gelana azinason GODAY inttes woppa immo» gaada istta yeeradus. Istti ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi yeekkida;
008	RUT	001	010	qasseka isttika izis, «Nuni nenara ne asaakko baana» gida.
008	RUT	001	011	Nuhaama isttas, «Ta naytoo guye intteso simmite; intte tanara ays beetii? Inttes azina gidana attuma nayta ta buro yelanaa inttes misatizee?
008	RUT	001	012	Ta naytoo tani hara azina gelontta mala keeha cimadis; tani hach azina gelada attuma naa yelizaakkoka,
008	RUT	001	013	istti dicci gakkanaashe intte istta naaganee? Istta naagishe intte azina gelontta gam7anee? Ta naytoo, hessi hanenna; GODAA kushey ta bolla dendida gishshas hayssi ha yo7oy inttefe bollara taas camo» gadus.
008	RUT	001	014	Hessa gishshas istti ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi qasseka yeekkida. Histtiin Orfay ba bolloteyo yeera ekkada simmadus. Gido attiin Uruta izippe shaakettana koyontta gishshas izo idimma oykkada yeddontta ixxadus.
008	RUT	001	015	Nuhaama izis zaarada, «Beya, ne azina ishaa machcheya ba asataakkonne ba eeqa xoossatakko simmadus. Nenikka izira simma ba» gadus.
008	RUT	001	016	Gido attiin Uruta zaarada, «Tani neeppe shaakettana mala woykko nena aggada guye simmana mala tana waayisoppa. Neni bizaso awakka ta baana; neni dizason awanka ta daana; ne asay ta as gidana; ne Xoossi ta Xoos gidana.
008	RUT	001	017	Ne hayqqizason ta hayqqana; heenkka tani moogettana; hayqoppe attiin haray tana neeppe shaakkiko GODAY ta bolla pirdo; hessafekka bollara hara iita izi ta bolla ooththo» gadus.
008	RUT	001	018	Uruta izira baanaas ba qofaa qachchidayssa Nuhaama erida wode ba gizayssa aggada co7u gadus.
008	RUT	001	019	Hessafe guye nam7atikka Beeteliheeme gakkanaas issife bida. Istti Beeteliheeme gakkiza wode he katama asay wuri istta hanotaan malalettides. Qasse maccassati, «Hanna Nuhaamii?» gida.
008	RUT	001	020	Iza zaarada isttas, «Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossi ta duussaa daro cameththida gishshas tana, ‹Camoyee!› giite attiin, ‹Nuhaamee› goopite.
008	RUT	001	021	Tani kumeth kezadis shin GODAY tana mela kushe zaarides. GODAY tana un7eththides; Ubbaa Dandayza GODAY ta bolla iita miish gaththides. Histtiin tana ays Nuhaamee gi xeygeetii?» gadus.
008	RUT	001	022	Hessafe guye Nuhaama ba naa machcho Urutira Mo7aabeppe simmadus. Istta banggay maxa doomettishin Beeteliheeme gakkida.
008	RUT	002	001	Nuhaamis izi azina Abimelekke baggara dabbotiza Boo7eeze geetettiza issi erettida dure asi dees.
008	RUT	002	002	Issi gallas Mo7aabe dere as Uruta Nuhaamo, «Ta iza sinththan puulattiin tana piixe shiishshisana as demmiko ane tani iza kaththi maxettizaso bays» gadus. Nuhaamakka zaarada izis, «Ee ta nayee ba» gadus.
008	RUT	002	003	Histtiin Uruta baada kath maxiza asaa guyeppe piixe shiisho doommadus; iza piixeza shiishshiza gadey Abimelekke dabbo Boo7eeze gade.
008	RUT	002	004	He wodekka Boo7eezey Beeteliheeme katamappe gakki wodhdhidi kath maxiza asaa, «GODAY inttes wolqqa immo» gides. Isttika zaaridi, «GODAY anjjo» gida.
008	RUT	002	005	Histtiin Boo7eezey kath maxizaytas kaabboza, «Hanna naateththa naya oonaarii?» gi oychchides.
008	RUT	002	006	Kaabbozi zaaridi, «Hanna Nuhaamira yida Mo7aabe dere macca naa.
008	RUT	002	007	Iza tana, ‹Kath maxizayta geedo kaallada mirqqe giddofe wodhdhida piixe shiishshoo?› gaada oychchadus. Histtada guuththa wode kuwattana shempoorippe attiin maaladoppe doommada ha7i gakkanaas piixashe gam7adus» gides.
008	RUT	002	008	Histtiin Boo7eezey Uruto, «Ta nayee siya; piixe shiishshanaas hara asa gade booppa; qasse hayssafe awakka qaaxxofa; taas ooththiza macca naytara hayssan pe7a.
008	RUT	002	009	Attuma asati maxizaso xeellada macca nayta kaalla; addeti nena bochchontta mala tani isttas yootadis; nena saamizaa gidikko addeti ehi woththida haaththaafe duuqqa duuqqa uya» gides.
008	RUT	002	010	Uruta ba hu7e biitta gaththa ziggada, «Tani asa dere as gidikkinaa? Ne taas mishettana mala ta waana ne sinththan saba demmadinaa?» gadus.
008	RUT	002	011	Boo7eezey zaaridi, «Ne azinay hayqqoosoppe neni ne bolloteys ooththida miish ubbaa ta siyadis. Qasse neni ne aayo, ne aawaanne ne yelettida biitta aggada hayssafe kase ne erontta deraara daanaas yidayssi taas yootettides.
008	RUT	002	012	Neni ooththidayssa kushe GODAY nees zaaro. Neni iza qefe garsan attanaas yida GODAA Isra7eele Xoossay nees dakko immo» gides.
008	RUT	002	013	Uruta, «Ta godoo, ta puulateththi ne sinththan gujetti gujetti bides; tani ne oosanchchatappe issiney mala gidikke shin ne taas lo7o haasayada tana keeha minththeththadasa» gadus.
008	RUT	002	014	Quma mishin Boo7eezey izo, «Haa shiiqa; ukeththaa ekkada usttara ma» gides; histtiin iza kath maxizaytara shiiqa uttadus; histtidi izis tiya hallahas immides; iza kallanaashe gakkanaas madus; qumazikka palahides.
008	RUT	002	015	Qasseka iza piixeza shiishshanaas dendiza wode Boo7eezey ba oosanchchata, «Mirqqeza garsafekka iza qorikko izo yeellachchofte.
008	RUT	002	016	Mirqqezappeka shoddidi izis yeggiko iza qoru; izo hanqofte» gides.
008	RUT	002	017	Heen Uruta omars gakkanaas piixeza zam7iin tammu kilo gidanaazi kezides.
008	RUT	002	018	Iza he kaththaa ba7a ekkada katama simmadus; ay gina kath shiishshidaakko izi bolloteya be7adus; qasseka Uruta kase mishin tirpi attidayssa izis kessa immadus.
008	RUT	002	019	Histtiin izi bolloteya izo, «Hach awan piixa pe7adii? Awan ooththa pe7adii? Nees hayssa kiya ooththidayssi anjjetto» gadus. Histtiin Uruta oonas ooththa pe7idaakko ba bolloteys, «Tani hach piixashe pe7ida gade goday Boo7eeze» ga yootadus.
008	RUT	002	020	Nuhaama ba naaza machcheys ba lo7eteththaa, «Hayqqidayta bollanne paxa dizayta bolla lo7o ooso aggontta GODAY iza anjjo» gadus. Kaaleththadakka, «He addezi nuus asho dabbo; nuna laatti ayssanaas bessiza asaappe issoy iza» gadus.
008	RUT	002	021	Qasseka Mo7aabe dere as Uruta, «Izi tana, ‹Ta kaththaa maxi wursanaashe gakkanaas ta oosanchchatappe shaakettontta piixa› gides» gadus.
008	RUT	002	022	Nuhaama ba naaza machcho Uruto, «Ta nayee, hessi nees lo7o; macca oosanchcha izaytara buussi nees lo7o; gaasoykka hara asa gade ne biikko addeti nena bochchana» gadus.
008	RUT	002	023	Hessa gishshas Uruta Boo7eeze macca oosanchchatakko shiiqada banggaynne gisttey maxetti wurana gakkanaas piixashe gam7adus. Qasse ba bolloteyra issife de7adus.
008	RUT	003	001	Issi gallas Nuhaama ba naaza machchiyo Uruto, «Ta nayee ne lo7o duus daana mala ta nees koyanaas bessennee?
008	RUT	003	002	Neni isttara gam7ida macca oosanchchati izas kiitettiza Boo7eezey nuna ashon laattiza dabbo. Haa siya, izi hach omars balen bangga bukkana.
008	RUT	003	003	Neni meecettada, shitto tiyettadanne lo7o may7o may7ada izi bukkiza bale ba; gido attiin baada Boo7eezey miidinne uyidi simmana gakkanaas iza ayfen beettofa.
008	RUT	003	004	Izi ichchizaso lo7eththa xeellada izas tohosora afala qaarada iza tohoson ichcha; hessafe guye ne hananayssa izi nees yootana» gadus.
008	RUT	003	005	Histtiin Uruta, «Ne gidayssa ubbaa ta ooththana» gadus.
008	RUT	003	006	Hessa gishshas Uruta duge baleza baada izi bolloteya izis yootidayssa ubbaa ooththadus.
008	RUT	003	007	Boo7eezey mi uyidi ufayettidaappe guye kaththa doore achchan ichchides; histtiin Uruta loddara izakko shiiqada iza afala tohosora qaarada tohoson ichchadus.
008	RUT	003	008	Giddi giddoth gidishin issi miishshi addeza daganththiin izi shirettishin issi maccassi iza tohosora ichchidaaro demmides.
008	RUT	003	009	Izikka izo, «Hanne ne oonee?» gi oychchiin iza, «Tani ne oosanchchayo Uruto; tana laattana bessiza mata dabboy nena gidida gishshas ne may7o macara tana mayza» gadus.
008	RUT	003	010	Boo7eezey zaaridi, «Ta nayee, GODAY nena anjjo! Hayssafe kase ne ooththoyssafe ha7i ne ooththoyssi aadhdhees. Dure gidiin woykko manqo yelaga attuma koshshu babeekka.
008	RUT	003	011	Ha7ikka ta nayee babbofa; neni oychchidayssa ubbaa ta nees ooththana; gaasoykka ta dere asay wuri neni lo7o haniza maccas gididayssa erees.
008	RUT	003	012	Tani laata dabbo gidikkoka nena laattanaas taappe matiza hara dabboy dees.
008	RUT	003	013	Ha7i hayssan aqa; bitanezi nena laattana koykko lo7o; izi nena laattana koyontta aggiko ta nees GODAAN caaqqays ta laata ekkana; gadey wonttana gakkanaas hayssan ichcha» gides.
008	RUT	003	014	Hessa gishshas Uruta gadey wonttana gakkanaas iza tohoson ichchadus; Boo7eezey, «Maccassi kaththa bale yidayssa oonikka eroppo» gida gishshas Uruta asi as shaakki erontta saaten koyrotta dendadus.
008	RUT	003	015	Boo7eezey izo, «Ne bollara may7ida may7oza haa bessa» gides. Iza bessiin nam7u tammu kilo gidiza bangga makki qolidi izo ba7issides. Izakka ba7ada katama badus.
008	RUT	003	016	Uruta ba bolloteyko biin Nuhaama izo, «Ta nayee ne bida yo7oy waanidee?» ga oychchiin, Uruta Boo7eezey izis ooththidayssa ubbaa yootadus;
008	RUT	003	017	Qasseka, «‹Ne bolloteyko mela kushe booppa› giidi hayssa 20 kilo bangga taas immides» gadus.
008	RUT	003	018	Nuhaamakka izo, «Ta nayee, buro aazi hananaakko erettana gakkanaas naagaashsha; addezi yo7oza hach wursontta shempenna» gadus.
008	RUT	004	001	Boo7eezey katamaa penge achchan diza dubbushaa kezidi heen uttides. Izi utti dishin izi kase iza gishshas yootida laata dabboy heera aadhdhizayssa be7idi, «Ta ishawu! Haa simmada hayssan utta» giin addezi simmidi uttides.
008	RUT	004	002	Boo7eezey he katamaa cimatappe tammu asata xeygidi, «Hayssan uttite» gi utisides.
008	RUT	004	003	Hessafe guye Boo7eezey laatas bessiza mata dabbozas, «Mo7aabe biittafe simma yida Nuhaama nu ishaa Abimelekke xinxxo gadeza bayzana gawus.
008	RUT	004	004	Ne hessa erana mala ta qoppida gishshas ha7i hayssan diza asaa sinththaninne ta deraa cimata sinththan gadeza ne shammana mala ta nena qofsana koyadis; ne wozzana koykko wozzanaas dandayaasa; neeppe kasetanaas bessiza hara asi deenna; ne hessa ooththontta aggiko neeppe kaallidi taas bessiza gishshas ta erana mala taas yoota» gides. Addezikka izas, «Ta wozzana» gides.
008	RUT	004	005	Hessafe guye Boo7eezey, «Histtiko neni gadeza Nuhaamippenne Mo7aabe as Urutippe ne wozzida gallas hayqqidayssa sunththiza biittan xeygisanaas iza machchiyokka ekka» gides.
008	RUT	004	006	Histtiin he mata dabbozikka zaaridi, «Hessa mala gidikko ta xinxxo meton yegganaas koyontta gishshas ta wozzanaas dandaykke; ne wozza» gides.
008	RUT	004	007	Beni wode Isra7eele biittan oonikka ba aqo wozzana koykko woykko haras aaththi immana koykko he yo7ozi minnana dandayzay nam7aafe issoy ba caamma tohoppe shoddidi hankkoyssas immiko hanees. Isra7eele biittan shama gidiin woykko bayzo gidiin yo7oy minnizay hessa malanna.
008	RUT	004	008	Hessa gishshas laatas bessiza mata dabbozi Boo7eezes, «Ne wozza» giidi ba caammaza tohoppe shoddi immides.
008	RUT	004	009	Boo7eezey cimatassinne dere ubbaas, «Tani Abimelekke aqotanne iza nayta Keloonenne Mahaloone aqota ubbaa Nuhaamippe shammidayssas hach intte wurikka markka.
008	RUT	004	010	Qasse hayqqidayssa sunththi isttaso asaa sunththa giddofe woykko katama asaa mazgabaappe dhayontta mala, iza sunththi iza xinxxo gaden xeygettana mala Mo7aabe dere maccassiyo Mahaloone machcho Uruto ta ekkadis; hessaska hach intte markka» gides.
008	RUT	004	011	Hessafe guye katamaa penge dubbushan diza cimatinne asay wuri, «Ee, hayssas nuni markka! GODAY hanno neso yida maccassayo, Isra7eele asaas issifeteththan ooththida Eraheeli malanne Liya mala ooththo. Nenikka Efraatan dure as gida; ne sunththi Beeteliheemen eretto.
008	RUT	004	012	GODAY ne keeththaa ha lo7o yelaga maccassayfe nees immiza zereththan, Ti7imaara Yuhudas yelida Paareese keeththa asa mala ooththo» gides.
008	RUT	004	013	Hessa gishshas Boo7eezey Uruto machcho ekkides; GODAY izis yelo immiin attuma naa yeladus.
008	RUT	004	014	Maccassatikka Nuhaamo, «Hach nena laattanaas mata dabbo dhayssontta GODAY galatetto!
008	RUT	004	015	Naazi ne sunththaa ooraxissana! Ne cimmishinkka izi nena heemmana; gaasoykka nena siiqizaara laappun attuma naappeka aadhdhizaara ne naaza machcheya iza yeladus» gida.
008	RUT	004	016	Hessafe guye Nuhaama qeeri naaza ekka idimmadus; histtada iza lo7aththa dichchadus.
008	RUT	004	017	Izi gutan diza maccassati, «Nuhaamis attuma nay yelettides» gida; iza sunththaaka Iyoobeede gida. Izi Dawite yelida Isseye aawa.
008	RUT	004	018	Paareese soo asaa yeletay hayssafe kaalli dizayssa; Paareesey Hexiroome yelides;
008	RUT	004	019	Hexiroomey Aaraame yelides; Aaraamey Aminadaabe yelides;
008	RUT	004	020	Aminadaabey Ne7asoone yelides; Ne7asooney Salmmoone yelides;
008	RUT	004	021	Salmmooney Boo7eeze yelides; Boo7eezey Iyoobeede yelides;
008	RUT	004	022	Iyoobeedey Isseye yelides; Isseyey Dawite yelides.
#
# BOOK	009	1SA	1 Samuel	1Sameela Maxaafa
009	1SA	001	001	Efreeme deren Eramaate-Zufime geetettiza shaara menththon diza Hilqaana geetettizaadey dees; izikka Efreeme dere asa; izi Yirohaame naa, Eelihu naa, Toohu naa, Zuufe naa.
009	1SA	001	002	Izas Haannanne Finaana geetettiza nam7u machcheti deettes; Finaanas nayti deettes; Haannas gidikko aykko naykka deenna.
009	1SA	001	003	Hilqaanay Ubbaa Dandayza GODAA goynnanaassinne izas yarsho shiishshanaas layththan layththan ba diza katamappe pude Seelo kezees; heen Eele naa nam7ati Afineynne Finihaasi GODAA qeeseta.
009	1SA	001	004	Hilqaanay Seelo biidi yarsho yarshiza wodey gakkida wode ubbaan ba machcho Finaanas, izi attuma naytassinne macca naytas ubbaas ashozappe istta gakkiza gisha isttas immees.
009	1SA	001	005	Gido attiin izi Haanna siiqiza gishshas ashozappe izis nam7u kushe immees; gidikkoka GODAY izo maynissi woththides.
009	1SA	001	006	GODAY izo maynissi woththida gishshas izi dawuththaya izo hanqeththawussinne yiillochchawus.
009	1SA	001	007	Hessika layththan layththan pacey baynda hanees; Haannay GODAA keeth yiza wode ubbaan iza yeekkanaashenne kaththa muussi izo xoonanaashe gakkanaas dawuththaya izo yiillochchawus.
009	1SA	001	008	Hessa geedon izi azina Hilqaanay izo, «Haannee! Ays yeekkay? Ays kath miikkii? Ne wozinay ays ceecizee? Tani nees tammu attuma naytappe aadhdhikinaa?» gishe takkides.
009	1SA	001	009	Issi gallas istti Seelon dishe miidinne uyidaappe guye Haannay denda eqqadus. He wode qeese Eeley Xoossa Keeththa pengen qosilaththa achchan oyde bolla uteththan dees.
009	1SA	001	010	Haannay izi wozinay meqqida gishshas hiqima yeekkashe GODAA woossadus.
009	1SA	001	011	Izakka, «Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAWU tana ne aylley kawushshateththaa ne haa xeellada tana ne qoppikonne tana ne aylleyo balontta ne taas attuma naa immiko izi ba de7o layth ubbaan nees gidana mala tani iza GODAAS immana; magallaykka iza hu7e binana bochchenna» gawus.
009	1SA	001	012	Haannay GODAA aggontta woossashe takkiin Eeley izi doona xeellides.
009	1SA	001	013	Haannay aykkoka qaala sissontta wozinan woossiza gishshas izis metershay xalla qaaxxees. Hessa gishshas Eeley izo maththottida asa mala qoodides.
009	1SA	001	014	Izikka izo, «Hanne ne ayde gakkanaas hayssaththo maththottanee? Neni hessa woyne ushshaa neeppe digga!» gides.
009	1SA	001	015	Haannayka izas, «Ta godawu ta maththottabeekke; tani keehippe wozinay meqqida maccassa; hessa gishshas tani ta wozina GODAA sinththan miccayssife attiin woyne ushshu gidiin woykko hara maththosiza ushshu ta uyabeekke.
009	1SA	001	016	Tani hayssa keena adussa woosa woossiday deexo metoynne ceecey tana gakkidayssafe dendidayssan gidida gishshas tana ne oosanchchayo issi go7ay baynda shufuro maccassa mala qoodoppa» gadus.
009	1SA	001	017	Eeleykka izo, «Saron ba, Isra7eele Xoossi ne woossoyssa nees immo» gides.
009	1SA	001	018	Izakka izas, «Ne aylleya ne sinththan teema demmu!» gadus. Iza dendada ba oge badus; kaththika madus; hessafe guye izi bolla ceecey beettibeenna.
009	1SA	001	019	Wonteththa gallas Hilqaanaynne izaso asay maalado wonttara dendidi GODAA goynnidaappe guye banttaso gede Eraama bida; Hilqaanay ba machcho Haannara aqides; GODAYKKA izo qoppides.
009	1SA	001	020	Histtiin Haannay qanththatadus; izis wodey wuriin attuma naa yeladus; naaza sunththaaka, «GODAAPPE woossada demmadis gashe Sameela» ga sunththadus.
009	1SA	001	021	Hilqaanay GODAAS layththan layththan shiishshiza yarshoza yarshanaassinne ba adinettida adinaa gaththanaas baso asaa ubbaa ekkidi Seelo kezides.
009	1SA	001	022	Gido attiin Haannay isttara babeekku; iza ba azinaas, «Yidhazi dhanth duuththidaappe guye tani efada GODAA sinth shiishshana; izikka ba de7o layth ubbaan heen de7ana» ga yootadus.
009	1SA	001	023	Izi azina Hilqaanaykka izis, «Nees lo7o misati beettidayssa ooththa; ne dhanththi duuththanaashe gakkanaas hayssan takka; Xoossi nees immida hidota qaalaa xalla polo» gides; hessa gishshas Haannay yidhaza dhanth duuththanaashe gakkanaas bason uttadus.
009	1SA	001	024	Naazi dhanth duuththidaappe guye izara heedzdzu layththa wofano, tammu kilo dhiillenne issi lukkamo kumeth woyne ushshu ekkada gede Seelon diza Xoossa keeth efadus; naazikka buro yidha.
009	1SA	001	025	Kormaza shukkidaappe guye yidhaza ekkidi Eelekko shiishshida.
009	1SA	001	026	Haannayka Eele, «Ta godawu, shemppo gam7a; hayssan ne sinththan eqqada GODAA woossida maccassaya tanakko!
009	1SA	001	027	He wode hayssa ha naaza immana mala woossadis; GODAYKKA ta woossidayssa taas immides.
009	1SA	001	028	Hessa gishshas tanikka ha7i zaarada GODAAS iza immays; izi ba de7o layth ubbaan GODAAS imettidayssa gidana» gadus; hessafe guye heen GODAAS goynnida.
