009	1SA	030	021	Hessafe guye Dawiti keehi daaburdi kaallanaas dandayontta gishshas Bosoore shaafan isttafe guye attida 200 asataakko simmi yides; isttika Dawitenne izara diza asaa mokkanaas kezida; Dawitinne izara diza asay isttako gakkida mala Dawiti istta sarokkides.
009	1SA	030	022	Gido attiin Dawite kaallizayta giddofe iita asatinne shufuro asati ubbay, «Istti nunara olaso bontta aggida gishshas nu di7i ehidayssafe isttas immoko; gido attiin istti issoy issoy ba machchetanne ba nayta ekki baanaas dandayeettes» gida.
009	1SA	030	023	Dawiti zaaridi, «Ta ishatoo! Nuna naagiday, nu bolla yida olaa nu kushen aaththi immiday GODAA; izi nuus immida miishshan intte hayssaththo ooththanaas bessenna.
009	1SA	030	024	Intte gizayssa oonee ekkanay? Ola miishshaa naagizayta gishaynne olaas bidayta gakkiza gishay dummatenna; ubbayka issi gina gishettana» gides.
009	1SA	030	025	Dawiti heedeppe doommidi hanno gakkanaas hayssa Isra7eeles woganne maara histti woththides.
009	1SA	030	026	Dawiti Xigilaage yida wode izas siiqo lagge gidida Yuhuda cimatas, «Inttes GODAA morkketappe nu di7i ekkidayssa hayssa inttes imota be7ite» giidi di7i ehoyssafe isttas shaakki yeddides.
009	1SA	030	027	Hessaka Beetelen, Eramooteppe dugeha baggan dizaytasinne Yetiren dizaytas,
009	1SA	030	028	Eri7ooren, Sifimooten, Eshttamo7anne
009	1SA	030	029	Erakkalen dizaytas hessaththoka Yerahim7eele qommotinne Qenaaweti diza katamatan dizaytas,
009	1SA	030	030	Horman, Borasaanen, Ataken
009	1SA	030	031	Kebroonen hessaththoka Dawitinne izara dizayti yuuyidason dizayta ubbatas yeddides.
009	1SA	031	001	He wode Filisxeeme asay Isra7eele asaa olides; Isra7eele asay istta sinththafe baqatides; daro asay Gilbo7a zumaa bolla cadetti hayqqides.
009	1SA	031	002	Filisxeeme asay qasse Sa7oolenne iza nayta kaaletti gakkidi Yoonataane, Abinadaabenne Malkeshu7a wodhida.
009	1SA	031	003	Olazi Sa7oole bolla minnides; wondafen dukkizayti iza dukkidi keehi madunththida.
009	1SA	031	004	Sa7ooli ba gondalle oykkizayssas, «Hayti qaxxarettonttayti tana caddontta malanne kawushshontta mala neni ne mashshan tana cadda» gides. Izas gondalle tookkizayssi keehi babbida gishshas caddontta ixxides. Histtiin Sa7ooli barkka ba giththa mashshaa bolla kundi hayqqides.
009	1SA	031	005	Iza gondalleza oykkizayssi Sa7ooli hayqqidayssa be7idi izikka ba giththa mashshaa bolla kundidi izara issife hayqqides.
009	1SA	031	006	Sa7oolinne iza naa heedzdzati, iza gondalle oykkizayssinne izara diza asati ubbay he gallas hayqqida.
009	1SA	031	007	Zullezappe he pinththaninne Yordaanoose shaafaappe pinththan diza Isra7eele asay, Isra7eele olanchchati baqatizayssa, Sa7oolinne iza nayti hayqqidayssa beyda wode bantta katamata yeddi baqatida; Filisxeeme asay yiidi he katamatan uttida.
009	1SA	031	008	Wonteththa gallas Filisxeeme asay hayqqida asaa bollafe ola miishshaa qaaratanaas yiza wode Sa7oolinne iza naa heedzdzati Gilbo7a zumaa bolla kundidayta be7ida.
009	1SA	031	009	Hessafe guye Sa7oole qoodhe qanxxidi, iza ola miishshaakka qaarati ekkidi, mishiraachchoza bantta eeqa xoossata keeththan keeththaninne bantta deraa giddon awajjana mala Filisxeeme dere ubbaakko qasttanne yeddida.
009	1SA	031	010	Iza ola miishshata Astaroote geetettiza eeqa xoossa keeththaan woththida; qasse iza ahaza Beeti-Saane katama gimbe bolla kaqqida.
009	1SA	031	011	Gala7aaden diza Yaabuse asay Filisxeeme asay Sa7oole bolla ooththidayssa siyida wode,
009	1SA	031	012	ola qarati ubbay omarsara Beeti-Saane bida; Sa7oole ahaanne iza nayta ahaa gimbeza bollafe woththida; histtidi Yaabuse katama ehidi tamaan xuuggida.
009	1SA	031	013	Hessafe guye istta meqeththata ekkidi Yaabusen katama giddon diza Tamarssike geetettiza miththa garsan moogida; histtidi laappun gallas xoomida.
#
# BOOK	010	2SA	2 Samuel	2Sameela Maxaafa
010	2SA	001	001	Sa7ooli hayqqidaappe guye Dawiti Amaaleeqe asaa oli xoonidi simmides; Xigilaagenkka nam7u gallas gam7ides.
010	2SA	001	002	Heedzdzanththo gallas daakettida may7o may7idi ba hu7e bolla gudulla laallidi issi naateththa naa dayssi Sa7oole gutappe yides. Dawitekko gakkida mala zaqulth zirxxi giidi bonchchos kushe denththides.
010	2SA	001	003	Dawitikka iza, «Ne awappe yadii?» giidi oychchides. Izi qasse, «Tani Isra7eele asay dizasoppe kessa ekka yadis» gides.
010	2SA	001	004	Dawiti qasse iza, «Aazee waaniday ane taas ubbaa yoota» giidi oychchides. Izikka Dawites, «Asazi olasoppe baqatides; daroy kundides; Sa7oolinne iza naa Yoonataaney hayqqida» gides.
010	2SA	001	005	Hessafe guye Dawiti woreza izas yootida naaza, «Sa7oolinne iza naa Yoonataaney hayqqidayssa aazan eradii?» gi oychchides.
010	2SA	001	006	Woreza izas yootida naateththa naazi izas zaaridi, «Toorontta dashe tani pude Gilbo7a zuma bolla kezadis; Sa7ooli heen ba toora bolla zemppi dishin para-gaaretinne toga asay goodereththishe iza bolla gakki wodhdhida.
010	2SA	001	007	Izikka guye simmi xeellidi tana be7idi xeygides; tanikka, ‹Ta nees ay ooththoo?› gadis.
010	2SA	001	008	«Izikka tana, ‹Ne oonee?› gi oychchides. Tanikka izas, ‹Tani Amaaleeqe asa› gaada yootadis.
010	2SA	001	009	«Izikka taas, ‹Ta hayqqanaas toqqays; gido attiin taas shemppoy kezontta ixxides; zay haa ya; tana shempisa› gides.
010	2SA	001	010	Histtiin tani izi kundichchidaappe guye izi attonttayssa erada ta izakko shiiqada iza wodhadis. Iza hu7e bolla diza kallachchazanne iza qese sagayoza ekkada hekko ta godaas ehadis» gides.
010	2SA	001	011	Hessafe guye Dawitinne izara diza asay ubbay bantta may7o daakkida.
010	2SA	001	012	Istti mashshan siifettida gishshas Sa7oolessinne iza naa Yoonataanes, GODAA olanchchatassinne kumeththa Isra7eele asaas kayottida, yeekkidanne omars gakkanaas xoomida.
010	2SA	001	013	Dawiti qasse he woreza izas ehida naateththaza, «Ne awappe yadii?» gi oychchides. Naazikka, «Tani ne deren beti diza Amaaleeqe asa naa» gides.
010	2SA	001	014	Dawiti qasse, «Histtiin neni GODAY tiydayssa dhayssanaas ne kushe waana xala denththadii?» gi oychchides.
010	2SA	001	015	Hessafe guye Dawiti naateththatappe issaa xeygidi, «Neni izakko shiiqada iza wodha» gides. He naateththazi Amaaleeqeza caddi wodhides.
010	2SA	001	016	Dawitikka Amaaleeqeza, «‹GODAY tiydayssa tani wodhadis› gaada ne bolla nerkka ne markkattida gishshas ne suuththaa gomey ne bolla gido!» gides.
010	2SA	001	017	Dawiti Sa7oole gishshassinne Yoonataane hayqo gishshas zilalishe yeekkides.
010	2SA	001	018	Qasseka, «Wondafe milas» geetettiza zilasaa Yuhuda deraa tamaarsana mala azazides. Hessi Yashaare Maxaafan xaafeti uttides.
010	2SA	001	019	«Haysso Isra7eelee! Ne bonchchoy zumbullata bolla cadetti hayqqides; ola qarati waani hayssaththo kundidoo!
010	2SA	001	020	«Filisxeeme macca nayti ufayettontta mala, qaxxarettontta asaa macca nayti ililontta mala, hayssa Geeten woresopite; Asqeloonankka awajjofte.
010	2SA	001	021	«Intteno Gilbo7a zumatoo! Intte bolla iray bukkofo; xaazaykka intte bolla dooppo; yarshos gidiza kaththi intte goshsha biittan mokkofo. Heen ola qaraza gondalley tunides; Sa7oole gondalley hayssafe guyen zayten qucettenna.
010	2SA	001	022	Yoonataane wondafey wodhontta simmi erenna; Sa7oole mashshayka morkke qanxxereththi yeggees; Wolqqamatakka menththereththi yeggees; iza morkketakka wodhides.
010	2SA	001	023	«Sa7oolinne Yoonataaney shemppora paxa dishe siiqettizaytanne qofan gayttizayta. Hayqqisheka shaakettonttayta; golle kafoppe pilatizayta; gaammofekka minnizayta.
010	2SA	001	024	«Intteno Isra7eele maccassatoo! Ochcha teera misatiza al7o qamisa inttena mayzida; intte may7oza worqqa xibaben alleqissida; Sa7ooles yeekkite.
010	2SA	001	025	«Ola qarati waani hayssa mala olason kundidoo! Yoonataaney ne zumbullata bolla cadetti hayqqides.
010	2SA	001	026	Ta isha Yoonataanee! Tani ne gishshas kayottadis; ne taas keeha al7okoshin; ne siiqoy tana malalisizaazakkoshin macca siiqoppeka keehi aadhdheeskoshin.
010	2SA	001	027	«Ola qarati waani kundidoo! Ola massaratikka waani hada gidanee!»
010	2SA	002	001	Hessafe guye Dawiti, «Tani Yuhuda katamatappe issineyn boo?» giidi GODAA oychchides. GODAYKKA, «Ee ba» gides. Dawiti zaaridi, «Katamatappe awaarin boo?» gi oychchides. GODAY qasse, «Kebroone ba» gides.
010	2SA	002	002	Histtiin Dawiti ba machcheta nam7atara Kebroone bides. Isttika Izra7eelen yelettida Ahinahoomonne Qarmeloose dere as hayqqida Naabaale machcho Abigaalo.
010	2SA	002	003	Hessaththoka Dawiti banara diza asaa isttaso asaara issife gaththi ehides. Isttika Kebroone katamatan uttida.
010	2SA	002	004	Hessafe guye Yuhuda asay Kebroone yides. Heen Dawite tiydi Yuhuda deraa bolla kawoththida. Gala7aade deren Yaabuse asay Sa7oole ahaa moogidayssa Dawites yootiin,
010	2SA	002	005	izikka Gala7aaden Yaabuse dere asaas hessa izas yootana mala qasttanne as yeddidi, «Hayssa mala ooththidi intte godaa Sa7oole moogidi intte lo7eteth bessida gishshas GODAY inttena anjjo.
010	2SA	002	006	Ha7ikka GODAY inttes ba mino siiqonne ammaneteth qoncciso; intte ooththida lo7eteththaa gishshas tanikka inttes lo7o miish ooththana.
010	2SA	002	007	Hessa gishshas minnite; goobite; intte goday Sa7ooli hayqqida gishshas Yuhuda asay tana tiydi ba bolla kawoththides» gides.
010	2SA	002	008	He wode Sa7oole ola asaa azaziza Neere naa Abineeri Sa7oole naa Iyaabuste ekkidi Mahanayme pinththides.
010	2SA	002	009	Izakka Gala7aade, Aaseere, Izra7eele, Efreeme, Biniyaame bollanne kumeththa Isra7eele bolla kawoththides.
010	2SA	002	010	Sa7oole naa Iyaabustey Isra7eele bolla kawotishin izas layththay oyddu tammu; izi nam7u layth haarides. Yuhuda asay gidikko Dawite kaallides.
010	2SA	002	011	Dawiti Kebroonen uttidi Isra7eele asaa laappun layththinne usuppun agina haarides.
010	2SA	002	012	Neere naa Abineeri Sa7oole naa Iyaabuste oosanchchatara issi bolla Mahanaymeppe dendidi Geba7oone bida.
010	2SA	002	013	Isttaka Xuriya naa Iyo7aabeynne Dawite asati ke7idi Geba7oone eele haaththa achchan gayttida. Issi baggay haaththaafe he pinththan, baggay haaththaafe ha pinththan uttida.
010	2SA	002	014	Hessafe guye Abineeri Iyo7aabes, «Ane nu baggafenne intte baggafe naateththa nayti dendidi nu sinththan ola tiran gayttetto» gides. Iyo7aabey, «Ero gayttetto» gides.
010	2SA	002	015	Hessa gishshas Biniyaame baggafe Iyaabustes tammanne nam7u asi qoodettides. Dawite baggafekka tammanne nam7u asi qoodettides.
010	2SA	002	016	Hessafe guye issoy issoy ba morkke hu7e oykkidi mashshan millera caddishe issife oyketti kundida. Hessa gishshas Geba7oonen diza he biittazi, «Mashsha biitta» geetettides.
010	2SA	002	017	He gallassa olay keehi deexo; Abineerinne Isra7eele asay Dawite asaan xoonettida.
010	2SA	002	018	Xuriya attuma naa heedzdzati Iyo7aabey, Abisayeynne Asaheeley heen deettes. Asaheeley woran diza genessa mala woththas pilata.
010	2SA	002	019	Izi Abineere oykkanaas hadirs ushach gontta iza geedora kaallides.
010	2SA	002	020	Abineeri guye simmi xeellidi, «Asaheelee! Nenee!» gi oychchides. Izikka, «Ee tanakko!» gi zaarides.
010	2SA	002	021	Histtiin Abineeri iza, «Neni ta geedoppe hadirsa bagga woykko ushachcha bagga simmada naateth issaafe iza ola massara bonqqa ekka» gides. Gido attiin Asaheeley kaalettidi iza geedoppe duuxxontta ixxides.
010	2SA	002	022	Qasseka Abineeri izas, «Ne ta geedo kaalettizayssa aggiko nees lo7o; tani nena ays biittara oyseththoo? Histtida tani ne isha Iyo7aabe ayfeso dhoqqu gaada wostta xeelloo?» gides.
010	2SA	002	023	Asaheeley gidikko iza kaaleteth aggibeenna; hessa gishshas Abineeri ba toora xeeran izas ulon caddiin toorazi izas zokkozara kanththi kezides. Asaheeley heen gade bolla kundida mala heerakka hayqqides. Oonikka Asaheeley kundi hayqqidaso gakkishe eqqi ekkees.
010	2SA	002	024	Iyo7aabeynne Abisayey gidikko Abineere kaalettida; iza goodereththishe Geba7oone bazzo efiza ogezara Aye matan diza Aama zumbulla heera gakkishin arshey wullides.
010	2SA	002	025	Hessafe Biniyaame asay Abineerekko shiiqidi zumbullaza xeeran issino gididi salfides.
010	2SA	002	026	Abineeri Iyo7aabe xeygidi, «Nuni mernaas ola olettishe daanee? Izas wurseththa gatey camo gididayssa ne waanada erontta aggadii? Ne asay ba ishata gooddizayssa aggana mala ne isttas azazo immonttay awude gakkanaassee?» gides.
010	2SA	002	027	Iyo7aabeykka zaaridi, «De7o Xoossay beyiin, ne hayssa yootontta aggidaakko asay wonttana gakkanaashe ba ishata goodo aggenna» gides.
010	2SA	002	028	Hessafe guye Iyo7aabey ba zaye punnides; asaykka ubbay Isra7eele gooddizayssa aggides. Olazi hessan eqqides.
010	2SA	002	029	Abineerinne iza asay omarsara Arabera kanththi bida; heeppe Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnidi ubbayka Bitiroonera kanththi Mahanayme yida.
010	2SA	002	030	Hessafe guye Iyo7aabey Abineere gooddizayssa aggi simmidi izi dereza shiishshida wode Dawite asaa giddofe Asaheeley attiin haray tammanne uddufun asi dhaydayssi erettides.
010	2SA	002	031	Dawite asay gidikko Biniyaame asaappe Abineere kaalliza 330 as wodhides.
010	2SA	002	032	Iyo7aabeynne izara diza asay Asaheeley kundidasohoppe iza ahaa denththidi Beeteliheemen iza aawa duufon moogida. Hessafe guye omars kumeth hemettishe aqidi buro gadey wontishin Kebroone gakkida.
010	2SA	003	001	Sa7oole keeththaa giddoninne Dawite keeththaa giddon diza olay daro wode gam7ides; Dawite baggay minni minni bishin Sa7oole baggay daaburi daaburi bides.
010	2SA	003	002	Dawiti Kebroonen dishin izas usuppun attuma nayti yelettida; izas bayra naazi Izra7eele dere as Ahinahoomppe Aminooney yelettides.
010	2SA	003	003	Nam7anththo naazi Qarmeloose dere as Naabaale machcho Abigaalippe Kil7aabey yelettides; heedzdzanththo naazi Geeshure kawo Talimaye biyo Ma7ikippe Abeseloomey yelettides.
010	2SA	003	004	Oydanththo naazi Adoniyaasi Hagitippe yelettides; ichchashanththo naazi Shafaaxiyay Abixaalippe yelettides;
010	2SA	003	005	Usuppunththo naazi Dawite machcho Eglippe Yitiraamey yelettides; hayti Dawiti Kebroonen dishin izas yelettidayta.
010	2SA	003	006	Sa7oole keeththinne Dawite keeththi olettishe diza wode Abineeri Sa7oole keeththan ba wolqqa minththishe dees.
010	2SA	003	007	Sa7ooli Aaya biyo Erxifo laggeththo oykkides; Iyaabustey Abineere, «Ne ays ta aawa laggeththoyra aqadii?» gides.
010	2SA	003	008	Abineeri Iyaabuste haasayan keehi hanqettida gishshas, «Yuhuda maaddanaas tani gooshsha kanee? Hach gakkanaas tani ne aawa Sa7oole keeththaas, iza ishatassinne iza dabbotas ta ammaneteth pacinchchabeekke; nenakka Dawites aaththa immabeekke; gido attiin neni ha7i hanno ha maccassayra ta hanida miishshas tana mootay?
010	2SA	003	009	GODAY Sa7oole keeththafe kawoteththaa woththi ekkidi Daaneppe biidi Bersaabehe gakkanaas diza Isra7eele bollanne Yuhuda bolla Dawite kawoteththaa caaqqi woththida caaqoza ta polontta aggiko Xoossi Abineere bolla iita miish eho» gides.
010	2SA	003	011	Iyaabustey Abineeres keehi babbida gishshas zaaridi issi qaala phoqqanaas dandaybeenna.
010	2SA	003	012	Hessafe guye Abineeri Dawites, «Hanna biittaya oonassee? Tanara qaala gela; be7a Isra7eele ubbay neekko simmana mala ta nena maaddana» gi yootana mala ogath yeddides.
010	2SA	003	013	Dawitikka, «Ero lo7o; ta nenara qaala gelana; gido attiin ta neeppe issi miish koyays; hessika koyro taakko yashe Sa7oole biyo Milkoolo ne taas ekka yaana mala koyays; histtontta aggiko taakko yooppa» gides.
010	2SA	003	014	Hessafe guye Dawiti, «Filisxeeme as xeetata attumateththaa ciloosha ciggada ekkida ta machcho Milkoolo taas imma» giidi Sa7oole naa Iyaabusteko ba qasttanneta kiittides.
010	2SA	003	015	Hessa gishshas Iyaabustey ba qasttanneta kiittidi izi azina Laysha naa Palti7eelesoppe kessi ekkides.
010	2SA	003	016	Izi azinay Bahirime gakkanaas yeekkishe izo kaalli bides. Hessafe guye Abineeri, «Ha7i nees gidana! Guye neso simma» gides.
010	2SA	003	017	Abineeri Isra7eele cimatara zorettishe isttas, «Kase aadhdhida woden Dawiti intte bolla kawotana mala koyideta.
010	2SA	003	018	GODAY Dawites, ‹Ta aylle Dawite baggara tani ta deraa Isra7eele istta morkketa kusheppenne Filisxeemeta kusheppe ashshana› giza hidota qaala immi woththida gishshas hayssa intte ha7ira ooththite» gides.
010	2SA	003	019	Hessaththoka Abineeri Biniyaame qommotas barkka biidi hayssa yootides; hessafe guye Isra7eele asay Biniyaame keeththa asay ubbay ooththanaas koyida ubbaa Dawites yootanaas Kebroone bides.
010	2SA	003	020	Abineeri 20 asatara Dawiti dizaso Kebroone bides; Dawitikka Abineeressinne izara diza as ubbaas gibira giigsides.
010	2SA	003	021	Hessafe guye Abineeri Dawites, «Nenara istti caaqettana mala, ne wozinaykka amottida mala ne ubbaa haarana mala eeson baada ta godaa kawozas kumeththa Isra7eele ane shiishshays» gides. Hessa gishshas Dawiti Abineere moyzides; izikka saron bides.
010	2SA	003	022	Iyo7aabeynne Dawite asay he wode daro miish di7i ekkidi olaappe simmida. Abineeri gidikko Dawiti saron iza moyzida gishshas Kebroonen deenna.
010	2SA	003	023	Iyo7aabeynne izara issife diza olanchcha ubbay hee gakkida mala Neere naa Abineeri kawozaakko yidayssa, kawozi iza moyzidayssanne izikka saron kezi bidayssa Iyo7aabey siyides.
010	2SA	003	024	Hessa gishshas Iyo7aabey kawozaakko gelidi, «Hayssi ne ooththidayssi aazee? Ane Abineeri ne kushen geliin waanada ne iza saron moyza yeddadii?
010	2SA	003	025	Neere naa Abineere ne eraasa; izi yiday nena baleththanaas, ne waana kezizaakkonne gelizaakko eranaassinne ne ooththiza ubbaa wochchanaas yides» gides.
010	2SA	003	026	Hessafe guye Iyo7aabey Dawite achchafe kezides; Abineere ekki yaana mala as kiittides; kiitettida qasttanneti iza Seyren diza haaththa olla mata gakkishin zaarida; hessi hanishin Dawiti eribeenna.
010	2SA	003	027	Abineeri guye Kebroone simmida wode Iyo7aabey iza xalla haasayssana koyza as misatidi issi bagga sher7i histtidi gede gimbeza penge efides; heen ba isha Asaheele suuth azarana koyidi izas ulon caddi wodhides.
010	2SA	003	028	Hessafe guye Abineere wodhidayssa Dawiti siyidi, «Taninne ta kawoteththay Neere naa Abineere suuththafe GODAA sinththan mernaas geeshsha.
