010	2SA	024	003	Iyo7aabey kawozas, «GODAA ne Xoossay ola asaa xeetu kushe darso; ta godaa kawo ayfey hessa gakki beyo; gido attiin ta godaa kawoy hessaththo ooththanaas ays koyidee?» gides.
010	2SA	024	004	Gidikkoka kawoza qaalay Iyo7aabenne ola asaa azazizayta xoonida gishshas Isra7eele ola asaa mazgabanaas iza sinththafe kezi bida.
