010	2SA	024	016	GODAA kiitanchchay Yerusalaame dippi histtidi dhayssanaas ba kushe yeddiin asaa bolla gakkida qohoy GODAA qadheththides; histtiin dereza wursiza kiitanchchaza, «Gidana! Agga!» gides. He wode GODAA kiitanchchay Yaabuse dere as Orna bale achchan eqqi dees.
010	2SA	024	017	Dawiti dereza bolla bosha gaththiza kiitanchchaza be7idi GODAAS, «Nagara ooththiday tana, balettiday tana; hayti gidikko dorsata; istti ay mooridoo? Ne kushey ta bollanne ta keeththa bolla gido» gides.
010	2SA	024	018	He gallas Gaadey Dawitekko biidi, «Pude Yaabuse dere as Orna bale kezada GODAAS yarsho yarshanaaso giigsa» gides.
