011	1KI	011	029	Issi gallassi Iyorba7aamey Yerusalaame katamappe bishin Seeloppe yida nabe Akayay izara ogen gayttides. He wode Akayay ooraththa may7o may7i uttides. He sohozan istti nam7ay xalla deettes.
