011	1KI	022	019	Mikiyaasi zaaridi, «Histtiko GODAY gizayssa siya! GODAY ba kawoteththa araatan uttiin salo olanchchati ubbay iza ushachcharanne hadirsara eqqidayta tani be7adis.
011	1KI	022	020	GODAY, ‹Akaabey Gala7aaden diza Eramoote katama biidi heen hayqqana mala iza baleththanay oonee?› gides. Issoy hayssa issoy hessa giza dumma dumma qaala haasayda.
