013	1CH	001	005	Yaafeetey, Goomere, Maagooge, Maadaye, Yaawaane, Tubaale, Mesheekenne Tiraase geetettiza attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	001	006	Goomere nayti Ashkenaaze, Erefasitenne Togarma.
013	1CH	001	007	Yaawaane nayti Elishe, Tarseese, Kiitimenne Oroodahime.
013	1CH	001	008	Kaame attuma nayti Kuushe, Mixirayme, Puuxenne Kanaane.
013	1CH	001	009	Kuushe nayti Seeba, Hawila, Saaba, Eraa7imenne Sabiteka; Eraa7ime attuma nayti Saabanne Dadaane.
013	1CH	001	010	Kuushey Namuruude yelides; Namuruudeyka alame bolla erettida wolqqama olanchcha gidides.
013	1CH	001	011	Mixiraymey Luudimeta, Anaameta, Lahaabeta, Naftuheta,
013	1CH	001	012	Phaxirooseta, Kaasiluhetanne Filisxeeme zareta yelida Kaftooreta yelides.
013	1CH	001	013	Kanaaney bayra naa Sidoonassinne iza kaalo Hiites aawa;
013	1CH	001	014	qasseka Kanaaney Yaabusetas, Amooretas, Gergesetas,
013	1CH	001	015	Hiiwetas, Arqetas, Siinetas,
013	1CH	001	016	Arwaadetas, Xamaaretassinne Hamaatetas aawa.
013	1CH	001	017	Seeme nayti, Elaame, Asoore, Arfaakiside, Luude, Aaraame, Uuxe, Huule, Geterenne Mesheeke;
013	1CH	001	018	Arfaakisidey Sheelahe yelides; Sheelahey Eboore yelides;
013	1CH	001	019	Eboorey nam7u attuma nayta yelides; issoy yelettida wode sa7ay shaakettida gishshas iza sunththi Peeleege geetettides; nam7anththozi Yoqixaane geetettides.
013	1CH	001	020	Yoqixaaney Almodaade, Shelefe, Haxarmaawete, Yerahe
013	1CH	001	021	Hadoraame, Uzaale, Diiqile
013	1CH	001	022	Eebaale, Abima7eele, Saaba,
013	1CH	001	023	Ofire, Hawilanne Yobaabe yelides; hayti wurikka Yoqixaane nayta.
013	1CH	001	024	Seemeppe biidi Abrahaame gakkanaas diza yeleta zarkkey hayssafe kaalli dizayta oykkees; isttika Seeme, Arfaakiside, Sheelahe,
013	1CH	001	025	Eboore, Peeleege, Era7e,
013	1CH	001	026	Saruge, Naakoore, Taaranne
013	1CH	001	027	guyeppe Abrahaame geetettida Abraame.
013	1CH	001	028	Abrahaamey Yisaaqanne Isma7eele yelides.
013	1CH	001	029	Abrahaamey Aggaarippe Isma7eele yelides; Isma7eeley yelida bayra naaza sunththi Nebayoote gidishin iza kaaloti Qeedaare, Adibi7eele, Mibisaame, Mishima7e, Duuma, Maasa, Hadaade, Teema,
013	1CH	001	031	Yixure, Nafishaanenne Qeedima geetetteettes.
013	1CH	001	032	Keexuray Abrahaames yelida usuppun attuma nayti Zimiraane, Yoqishaane, Maadda, Midiyaane, Yishibaaqenne Shuha geetetteettes. Yoqishaaney Saabanne Dadaane geetettiza nam7u attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	001	033	Midiyaaneykka Eefa, Efere, Heenooke, Abida7enne Elda7e geetettiza ichchashu attuma nayta yelides; hayti ubbay Keexura zereththata.
013	1CH	001	034	Abrahaamey Saarappe Yisaaqa yelides; Yisaaqi Eesawenne Isra7eele yelides.
013	1CH	001	035	Eesawey Elfaaze, Era7u7eele, Ya7uushe, Ya7ilaamenne Qoore yelides.
013	1CH	001	036	Elfaazey Temaane, Omaare, Xaafe, Ga7itaame, Qenaaze, Teminaa7enne Amaaleeqe geetettiza attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	001	037	Era7u7eeley Nahaate, Zaraahe, Shammahanne Miizahe geetettiza attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	001	038	Eedoomen koyro de7ida Seyre attuma nayti Looxa, Shobaale, Xiba7oone, Aana, Diisho, Exeerenne Dishaane.
013	1CH	001	039	Looxaane attuma nayti Hoorenne Homaame; Teminaa7a Looxaanes michcho.
013	1CH	001	040	Shobaale attuma nayti Aliwa, Manahaate, Eebaale, Sheefenne Oonname. Xiba7oone attuma nayti Aayanne Aana.
013	1CH	001	041	Aanay Dishoone yelides; Dishoone attuma nayti Hemda, Eshibaane, Yitiraanenne Kaaraane.
013	1CH	001	042	Exeere attuma nayti Bilihaane, Za7iwaanenne Yaqine. Dishaane attuma nayti Uuxenne Araane.
013	1CH	001	043	Isra7eelen ay kawoykka kawotanaappe kase Eedoome biittan kawotida kawoti hayssafe kaalli xaafettidayta. Bi7oore naa Beelay kawotides; iza katamaa sunththay Dinaabe.
013	1CH	001	044	Beelay hayqqiin izappe kaallidi Booxira dere as Zaraahe naa Yobaabey kawotides.
013	1CH	001	045	Yobaabey hayqqiin izappe kaallidi Temaane dere as Hushamey kawotides.
013	1CH	001	046	Hushamey hayqqiin izappe kaallidi Mo7aabe deren Midiyaameta xoonida Badaade naa Hadaadey kawotides; iza katamaya Awite geetettawus.
013	1CH	001	047	Hadaadey hayqqiin izappe kaallidi Maasireeqe dere as Sha7uley kawotides.
013	1CH	001	048	Sha7uley hayqqiin izappe kaallidi Efiraaxise shaafa matan diza Erahoobote dere as Sa7ooli kawotides.
013	1CH	001	049	Sa7ooli hayqqiin izappe kaallidi Akiboore naa Ba7aali-Hanaaney kawotides.
013	1CH	001	050	Ba7aali-Hanaaney hayqqiin izappe kaallidi Paa7u dere as Hadaadey kawotides; iza machcheyakka Mahexabi7eela Mezahaabe naa Maxireeda biyo; hessafe guye Hadaadey hayqqides.
013	1CH	001	051	Eedoomen keehi erettiza halaqati Teminaa7e, Aliwa, Yeteete,
013	1CH	001	052	Oholibaame, Eela, Pinoone,
013	1CH	001	053	Qenaaze, Temaane, Mibizaare,
013	1CH	001	054	Magidi7eelenne Iraame geetetteettes.
013	1CH	002	001	Yaaqoobey 12 attuma nayta yelides; heytikka Oroobeele, Simoona, Lewe, Yuhuda, Yisakoore, Zaabiloone,
013	1CH	002	002	Daane, Yooseefe, Biniyaame, Niftaaleme, Gaadenne Aaseere.
013	1CH	002	003	Yuhuday Kanaane dere as Shu7a biype Eera, Oonaanenne Seela geetettiza heedzdzu attuma nayta yelides; izas bayra naazi Eeray GODAA sinththan iita as gidida gishshas GODAY iza boshan wodhides.
013	1CH	002	004	Yuhudaykka ba naaza machcho Ti7imaarippe Paareesenne Zaraahe geetettiza nam7u attuma nayta yelides; Yuhuday ichchash attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	002	005	Paareeseykka Hexiroomenne Hamule geetettiza nam7u attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	002	006	Zaraahey ichchashu attuma nayta yelides; heytikka Zimire, Etaane Hemaane, Kalkolenne Daara.
013	1CH	002	007	Zaraahe zereththafe gidida Karme naa Akaaney Xoossas dummatida di7o miishshafe kaysotidi qottida gishshas Isra7eele deraa bolla meto ehides.
013	1CH	002	008	Etaaneykka Azaariya geetettiza issi attuma naa yelides.
013	1CH	002	009	Hexiroomey heedzdzu attuma nayta yelides; heytikka Yerahim7eele, Aaraamenne Kaalube.
013	1CH	002	010	Aaraamey Aminadaabe yelides; Aminadaabey Yuhuda naytas halaqa gidida Ne7asoone yelides.
013	1CH	002	011	Ne7asooney Salamo yelides; Salamoykka Boo7eeze yelides.
013	1CH	002	012	Boo7eezey Iyoobeede yelides; Iyoobeedeykka Isseye yelides.
013	1CH	002	013	Isseye bayra naazi Elyaabe; Elyaabe kaaloti Abinadaabe, Shim7a,
013	1CH	002	014	Natina7eele, Eraade,
013	1CH	002	015	Oxeemenne Dawite.
013	1CH	002	016	Istta michcheti Xuriyanne Abigaalo geetetteettes; Xuriyay Abisaye, Iyo7aabenne Asaheele geetettiza heedzdzu attuma nayta yeladus.
013	1CH	002	017	Abigaala Isma7eele zereththafe gidida Yootores Amasa geetettiza attuma naa yeladus.
013	1CH	002	018	Hexiroome naa Kaalebey Azubbo geetettizaaro machcho ekkidi Yir7aato geetettiza macca naa yelides; Yir7aatakka Yeshere, Shoobaabenne Ardoone geetettiza heedzdzu attuma nayta yeladus.
013	1CH	002	019	Azubba hayqqidaappe guye Kaalebey Efraato machcho ekkidi Huure geetettiza attuma naa yelides.
013	1CH	002	020	Huureykka Uure geetettiza attuma naa yelides; Uurey Basli7eele yelides.
013	1CH	002	021	Hexiroomey izas 60 layth kumishin Gala7aade aawa Maakire nayo machcho ekkidi Sagube yelides.
013	1CH	002	022	Sagubeykka Ya7ire yelides; Ya7irey Gala7aade deren diza 23 katamata ayssees.
013	1CH	002	023	Gido attiin Geeshureynne Aaraamey Qenaateninne izi heeran diza 60 qeeri katamatanne Ya7ire katamata oli oykkida; heyti ubbayka Gala7aade aawa Maakire zereththata.
013	1CH	002	024	Hexiroomey Kaalebe Efraata geetettizason hayqqidaappe guye iza machcha Abiyay Tequhe aawa Ashihuure izas yeladus.
013	1CH	002	025	Hexiroomes bayra naazi Yerahim7eeley 5 attuma nayta yelides; heytappe bayrazi Eraama, iza kaaloti Buna, Oore, Oxeemenne Akaya geetetteettes.
013	1CH	002	026	Yerahim7eeles Axaaro geetettiza hara machcha dawus; iza Oonname aayo.
013	1CH	002	027	Yerahim7eeles bayra naa Eraamay Maaxe, Yaaminenne Eqere geetettiza attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	002	028	Oonnamey Shamayenne Yaadda geetettiza attuma nayta yelides; Shamayey Nadaabenne Abishuure geetettiza attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	002	029	Abishuureykka Abihaylo geetettizaaro machcho ekkidi Ahibaanenne Moolide yelides.
013	1CH	002	030	Nadaabey Seledenne Afayme yelides; Seledey gidikko naa yelontta hayqqides.
013	1CH	002	031	Afaymey Yushi7e yelides; Yushi7ey Sheshaane yelides; Sheshaaney Ahilaye yelides.
013	1CH	002	032	Shamaye isha Yaadday Yootorenne Yoonataane yelides; Yootorey gidikko naa yelontta hayqqides.
013	1CH	002	033	Yoonataaney Paletenne Zaaza geetettiza 2 attuma nayta yelides; heyti wurikka Yerahim7eele zereththata.
013	1CH	002	034	Sheshaanes macca naytappe attiin hara attuma nay deenna; izas ooththiza Gibxe dere as Yaraha geetettiza oosanchchay dees.
013	1CH	002	035	Sheshaaney ba macca nayo Yarahas machcho gidana mala immides; izakka izas Attaye geetettiza attuma naa yeladus.
