013	1CH	002	045	Shamayey Ma7oone yelides; Ma7ooneykka Beeti-Xuure yelides.
013	1CH	002	046	Kaalebes Eefo geetettiza laggeththo machcha dawus; Kaalebey izippe Kaaraane, Moozanne Gazaze geetettiza hara 3 attuma nayta yelides; Haaraaneykka Gazaze geetettiza hara attuma naa yelides.
013	1CH	002	047	Yaahiday Ergeme, Iyo7aatame, Geshaane, Paleexe, Eefanne Sha7aafe geetettiza attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	002	048	Kaalebes Ma7ika geetettiza laggeththo machcha dawus; izakka Sheberenne Tirihaana geetettiza attuma nayta yeladus.
013	1CH	002	049	Qasseka Ma7ika Sha7aafenne Shawa yeladus; Sha7aafey Madimaana yelides; Shaway Makibaanenne Gibi7a yelides. Kaalebes Akisa geetettiza macca nay dawus.
013	1CH	002	050	Kaalebey yelida hara nayti hayssafe kaalli dizayta; Kaalebey Efraatippe bayra naaza Uure yelides; Uurey Qiriyaate-Yi7aarime aawa Shobaale.
013	1CH	002	051	Beeteliheeme aawaa Salamonne Beeti-Gadera aawaa Hareefe yelides.
013	1CH	002	052	Qiriyaate-Yi7aarime aawa Shobaale zereththati, Heroheetenne Manahaate qommotappe baggata.
013	1CH	002	053	Qasseka Qiriyaate-Yi7aarime zarkketi Yatireta, Puuteta, Shumaateta, Mishiirata, Xora7aatanne Eshtta7ooleta.
