013	1CH	003	002	Heedzdzanththoza Abeseloome Geeshure kawo Talimaye naa Ma7ikippe yelides. Oydanththoza Adoniyaasa Hagitippe yelides.
013	1CH	003	003	Ichchashanththoza Shafaaxiya Abixaalippe yelides Usuppunththoza Yitiraame Eglippe yelides.
013	1CH	003	004	Hayti usuppunati Dawiti Kebroonen laappun layththinne bagga deraa ayssiza wode yelettida; Dawiti Yerusalaamen 33 layth kawotides.
013	1CH	003	005	Izi heen dishe yelida attuma nayti hayssafe kaalli dizayta; Am7eele naa Bersaabeha Shim7a, Shoobaabe, Naataanenne Solomoone geetettiza oyddu attuma nayta izas yeladus.
013	1CH	003	006	Qasse hara uddufun attuma nayti izas deettes; heytikka Iyabeheere, Elsu7e, Elfaleexe
013	1CH	003	007	Nogahe, Nefege, Naafiya,
013	1CH	003	008	Elshama, El7aadanne Elfaleexe geetettizayta.
013	1CH	003	009	Heytappeka hara Dawiti garadetappe yelida attuma nayti deettes; isttaskka Ti7imaaro geetettiza michcha dawus.
013	1CH	003	010	Kawo Solonooney Erobi7aame yelides; Erobi7aamey Abiya yelides; Abiyay Aasa yelides; Aasay Iyoosaafixe yelides;
013	1CH	003	011	Iyoosaafixey Iyoraame yelides; Iyoraamey Akaziyaasa yelides; Akaziyaasi Iyo7aasa yelides;
