013	1CH	003	016	Iyo7aaqemey Ikoniyaanenne Sedeqiyaasa yelides.
013	1CH	003	017	Baabiloone di7etti bida Ikoniyaane nayti Salatiyaale,
013	1CH	003	018	Malikraame, Paddaya, Shenaxaare, Yiqaamiya, Hoshamenne Nadabiya geetettizayta.
013	1CH	003	019	Paddayay Zerubaabelenne Shim7e yelides; Zerubaabeleykka Mashulaame, Hanaaniyanne istta michcho Shalomito yelides.
013	1CH	003	020	Qasseka hara ichchash attuma nayti izas deettes; heytikka Hashube, Ohele, Baraakaye, Hasadiyanne Yoshaabi-Hesside.
013	1CH	003	021	Hanaaniyay Palaaxiyanne Yesha7iya geetettiza nam7u attuma nayta yelides; Yesha7iyaykka Erafaya yelides; Erafayay Ornaane yelides; Ornaaney Abdiyu yelides; Abdiyuy Shakaaniya yelides.
013	1CH	003	022	Shakaaniyaykka Shama7e yelides; Shama7ey Haxushe, Yigi7aale, Baaryahe, Narayanne Saafaaxe geetettizayta 5 attuma nayta yelides; Shakaaniya zereththati kumeththi usuppuna.
013	1CH	003	023	Narayay Elyo7enaye, Hizqiyaasanne Azirqaame geetettiza 3 attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	003	024	Elyo7enayey Hoddaye, Elyaasheebe, Pelaaya, Aqube, Yohanaane, Dallayanne Anaane geetettiza 7 attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	004	001	Yuhuda zereththati Paareese, Hexiroome, Karme, Huurenne Shobaale.
013	1CH	004	002	Shobaaley Era7aye yelides; Era7ayeykka Yahaate yelides; Yahaateykka Xora7aatas koyro aawa gididayta Ahumayenne Lahade yelides.
013	1CH	004	003	Huurey ba aayo Efraatas bayra naa; Huurey Beeteliheeme yelides; Exaame attuma nayti Izra7eele, Yushimanne Yidibaashe; isttas michcha Haxilelipoono geetettawus; Panu7eeley Gadoore yelides. Ezeerey Huushe yelides; hayti Huure zareta.
013	1CH	004	005	Tequhe aawa Ashihuures Heelonne Na7iro geetettiza nam7u machcheti deettes.
013	1CH	004	006	Ashihuurey Na7iro geetettiza ba machcheyfe Ahuzaame, Hefeere, Temenanne Ahashitaare geetettiza attuma nayta yelides.
013	1CH	004	007	Qasseka Heelippe Xerete, Xoohaare, Etinanne Qoxe yelides.
013	1CH	004	008	Haqoxey Anuube, Xobaabenne Haruume naa Aharheele zereththatas aawa.
013	1CH	004	009	Yabeexey ba ishata giddon keehi bonchchettida as gidides; iza aaya, «Tani iita miixan yelidayssa» gashe iza, «Yaabexe» ga sunththadus.
