013	1CH	011	040	Yatire as Ira, Yatire as Gaareebe,
013	1CH	011	041	Hiite as Ooriyo, Ahilaye naa Zabaade,
013	1CH	011	042	Oroobeele zarkkefe Shiiza naa Adiine; izi Oroobeele zarkketassinne banara issife diza 30 asatas halaqa.
013	1CH	011	043	Ma7ika naa Hanaane, Mitaane as Iyoosaafixe,
013	1CH	011	044	Ashtaarote as Uuziya, Aaro7eere dere as Hoottamo nayta Shaamenne Yi7i7eele,
013	1CH	011	045	Shimire naa Yidi7eelenne iza isha Tizeete dere as Yooha,
013	1CH	011	046	Mahaawe as El7eele, Elnaame nayta Yiribayanne Yooshaya, Mo7aabe dere as Yitima,
013	1CH	011	047	El7eele, Iyoobeedenne Xoobe dere as Ya7isi7eele.
013	1CH	012	001	Dawiti Qiise naa Sa7ooleppe baqatidi Xigilaagen uttida wode izakko yida asati hayssafe kaallizayta; isttika kase iza ola wode iza maaddida ola qarata giddon deettes.
013	1CH	012	002	Istti ushachcha kusheninne hadirsa kushen wondafe dukkanaassinne yanbarshe dhayqanaas dandayza olanchchata; isttika Biniyaame zare gidida Sa7ooles asho dabbota.
013	1CH	012	003	Istta halaqay Gibi7a as Shama7e naa Ahi7ezeerenne Iyo7aasa. Harati qasse Azimoote naa Yizi7eelenne Paleexe, Baraake, Anatoote as Iyu,
013	1CH	012	004	erettida 30 olanchchatas halaqanne erettida olanchcha Geba7oone dere as Yishima7e, Ermaasa, Yahazi7eele, Yohanaane, Gadeere dere as Yozabaade,
013	1CH	012	005	El7uzaye, Yarmoote, Ba7aaliya, Shamaariya, Harife as Shafaaxiya,
013	1CH	012	006	Qoore as Hilqaana, Yishiya, Azari7eele, Yo7eezerenne Yashobi7aame,
013	1CH	012	007	Gadoore as Yirohaame naa Yo7eelenne Zabaadiya.
013	1CH	012	008	Dawiti bazzon baqati attizason diza wode Gaade zarkketappe olanchchati izakko yida; isttika minonne olas giigettida asata; qasseka gondallenne toora oyth dandayzayta; istta ayfesoy gaammo mala babisees; istti zuma bolla guppiza genessa mala pilateettes.
013	1CH	012	009	Istta halaqay koyroyssi Eezere, nam7anththozi Abdiyu, heedzdzanththozi Elyaabe,
013	1CH	012	010	oydanththozi Mishimaane, ichchashanththozi Ermaasa,
013	1CH	012	011	usuppunththozi Attaye, laappunththozi El7eele,
013	1CH	012	012	osppunththozi Yohanaane; uddufunththozi Elzabaade;
013	1CH	012	013	tammanththozi Ermaasa; tammanne issinththozi Makibaanaye.
013	1CH	012	014	Hayti Gaade zarkketa garsan olanchchata halaqata; isttafe daroti shaalaqata mala, amardayti mato halaqata mala qoodettida.
013	1CH	012	015	Yordaanoose shaafay kixa salo shempida koyro aginan pinnidi zullaafe arshey mokkiza baggaranne arshey wulliza baggara dunkaani uttida asaa ubbaa yedeththida.
013	1CH	012	016	Biniyaame zarkketappenne Yuhuda zarkketappe amarda asati Dawiti dizaso miixa yida.
013	1CH	012	017	Histtiin Dawiti isttara gayttana ke7idi, «Intte tana maaddanaas saron taakko yidaa gidikko ta inttena ufayssan mokka ekkana; gido attiin intte tana ta morkketas aaththi immanaas yidaa gidikko nu aawata Xoossay hayssa be7idi pirdo!» gides.
013	1CH	012	018	Hessafe guye 30 asata halaqa Amasaye bolla Xoossa Ayanay wodhdhiin izi, «Dawitee! Nuni neyta! Isseye naa Dawitee! Nuni nenara issife doos! Neessinne nena maaddizaytas saroy gido! Ne Xoossay nena maaddana» gides. Hessa gishshas Dawiti mokki ekkidi ba olanchchata bolla halaqa histtides.
013	1CH	012	019	Dawiti Filisxeemetara issife gididi Sa7oole olanaas bida wode Minaase zarkkefe amarda asati Dawitekko biidi iza qoommida; gido attiin, «Dawitinne iza olanchchati istta kawoza Sa7ooles aaththi immanaakko» gi hirgida gishshas Filisxeeme asati keehi zorettidaappe guyen istta guye Xigilaage zaarida.
013	1CH	012	020	Dawiti Xigilaage katama simmishin iza maaddanaas Minaase zarkketappe kezi yida shaalaqati Adinahe, Yozabaade, Yidi7eele, Mika7eele, Yozabaade, Eelihunne Xiltaye.
013	1CH	012	021	Istti ubbatikka erettida mino olanchchata gidida gishshas Dawite ola wottadarata bolla halaqata gidida; Dawite morkketa olidi iza maaddida.
013	1CH	012	022	Dawite olanchchati Xoossa olanchchata mala corattana gakkanaas iza maaddiza asay gallas gallas gujettees.
013	1CH	012	023	GODAY immida hidota qaalaa mala Sa7oole kawoteththaa Dawites zaaranaas Dawitekko Kebroone yida ola tamaarda wottadarata qooday hayssafe kaallizayssa;
013	1CH	012	024	Gondallenne toora oykkidi olas giigettida Yuhuda zarkketi usuppun shiyanne osppun xeeta.
013	1CH	012	025	Simoona zarkkefe olas giigida minonne wolqqama olanchchati laappun shiyanne issi xeet.
013	1CH	012	026	Lewe zarkkefe oyddu shiyanne usuppun xeet,
013	1CH	012	027	Aaroone zarkketa halaqa Yoodahe gujjiin heedzdzu shiyanne laappun xeet.
013	1CH	012	028	Erettida olanchcha Saadooqe dabbota giddofe izara gujjiin nam7u tammanne nam7a.
013	1CH	012	029	Biniyaame zarkkefe Sa7oole dabboti heedzdzu shiya. Gido attiin Biniyaame zarkkefe dariza baggati Sa7oole keeththa asaas he wodey gakkanaas ammanettizayta.
013	1CH	012	030	Efreeme zarkkefe bantta aawata keeththan erettida minoti nam7u tammu shiyanne osppun xeet.
013	1CH	012	031	Dawite kawoththanaas doorettida Minaase zarkke baggaafe tammanne osppun shiya.
013	1CH	012	032	Isra7eele asay ay ooththanaas bessizaakko wodeza shaakki eriza aadho eranchchatinne Yisakoore zarkke halaqati nam7u xeet; isttara yida istta dabboti ubbay isttas azazetteettes.
013	1CH	012	033	Ola meezetidayti, ola massara ubbaan olettanaas dandayzaytinne wozinay ballatontta Dawite maaddanaas yida Zaabiloone baggati ichchash tammu shiya.
013	1CH	012	034	Niftaaleme zarkketas issi shiya halaqati deettes; gondallenne toora oykkida heedzdzu tammanne laappun shii asati isttara issife deettes.
013	1CH	012	035	Daane zarkkefe olas giigettida asati nam7u tammanne osppun shiyanne usuppun xeet.
013	1CH	012	036	Aaseere zarkkefe ola meezetidi giigettida olanchchati oyddu tammu shiya.
013	1CH	012	037	Yordaanoose shaafappe arshey mokkiza baggan diza Oroobeele zarkketappe, Gaade zarkketappenne Minaase zarkke baggaafe dumma dumma qommo massara oykkidi yida asati xeetanne nam7u tammu shiya.
013	1CH	012	038	Ha olas giigida olanchchati ubbay Dawite Isra7eele bolla kawoththanaas bantta qofaa issi bolla qachchidi Kebroone katama yida; qasse hankko attida Isra7eele dere ubbay Dawite kawoththanaas issi wozinan gidides.
013	1CH	012	039	Istta dabboti isttas koshshizayssa giigsi woththida gishshas mishenne uyishe Dawitekkon heedzdzu gallas gam7ida.
013	1CH	012	040	Isra7eele asaas gita ufays gidiza gishshas istta shooroppe doommidi haakon diza Yisakooreppe, Zaabilooneppenne Niftaalemeppe asay attontta kath, dhiille, balasenne zabibe kompa, woyne ushshinne wogara zayte haren, baqulon, gaamellaninne booran caanidi ehides; qasseka istti shukki maana mala miizatanne dorsata ekki yida.
013	1CH	013	001	Hessafe guye Dawiti shaalaqatara, mato halaqataranne olanchcha halaqata ubbatara zorettides.
013	1CH	013	002	Histtidi Isra7eele asaa ubbaas, «Inttes lo7o misatizayssa gidikkonne GODAA nu Xoossaa shene gidikko Isra7eele biittan mataninne haakon diza nu ishati qasseka bantta katamataninne bantta mehe heemmizasohotan diza qeesetinne Leweti nunara issife shiiqana mala ane kiita yeddoos.
013	1CH	013	003	Sa7oole kawoteththa wode nuni yeggi aggida nu Xoossa Taabotaa ane zaaridi ehoos» gides.
013	1CH	013	004	Dawiti yootidayssi ammanththizaaz gidida gishshas asay iza qofaa ekkides.
013	1CH	013	005	Hessa gishshas Dawiti Xoossaa Taabotaa Qiriyaate-Yi7aarimeppe ehana mala Gibxe zawappe doommidi Hamaate purde gakkanaas diza Isra7eele asaa ubbaa shiishshides.
013	1CH	013	006	Dawitinne Isra7eele asay ubbay kirubetappe giddon ba araata bolla uttida GODAA sunththan xeygettida Xoossa Taabotaa ehanaas Yuhuda biittan diza Ba7aala geetettiza Qiriyaate-Yi7aarime katama bida.
013	1CH	013	007	Xoossa Taabotaza Abinadaabe sooppe ooraththa para-gaare bolla woththi ehida; para-gaareza laaggizayti Oozanne Ahiyo.
013	1CH	013	008	Dawitinne Isra7eele asay ubbay diiththan maasinqon, karaben, daalaninne xurumban bantta kumeththa wolqqan Xoossa sinththan ufayettidi bonchchida.
013	1CH	013	009	Istti Kiidoona geetettizason diza kaththa balezakko gakkida wode caanida boorati bargagi dhuphettiin Oozay Taabotaza ashshanaas kushe yeddides.
013	1CH	013	010	Iza kushey Taabotaza bochchida gishshas GODAA hanqoy Ooza bolla eexxi kezides; hessa gishshas izi heen GODAA sinththan hayqqides.
013	1CH	013	011	GODAY hanqettidi Ooza wodhida gishshas Dawiti kayottides; hach gakkanaas he sohoy Ooza meqoso geetettees.
013	1CH	013	012	He gallas Dawiti Xoossas yayyida gishshas, «Xoossa Taabotaa taakko wostta ehanaas dandayazinaa?» gides.
013	1CH	013	013	Hessa gishshas Dawiti Taabotaza banara efanaappe Geete dere as Abidaareso efides.
013	1CH	013	014	Xoossa Taabotay Abidaareson izaso asatara heedzdzu agina gam7ides; GODAY iza keeththa asaanne izas diza miish ubbaa anjjides.
013	1CH	014	001	Xiroose Kawo Huraamey Dawites kawo keeth keexxana mala kiita asata, shuch massizaytanne anaaxeta ziga miththara Dawitekko yeddides.
013	1CH	014	002	GODAY Isra7eele bolla iza kawoththidayssanne ba asaa Isra7eele gishshas iza kawoteththa dhoqqu histti bonchchidayssa Dawiti akeekides.
013	1CH	014	003	Hessafe guye Dawiti Yerusalaamen hara machcheta gujji ekkidi attuma naytanne macca nayta yelides.
