015	EZR	010	038	Baane zereththafe, Shim7e, Shelemiya, Naataane, Adaya, Makinadabaye, Shashaye, Shaaraye, Azari7eele, Shelmiya, Shamaariya, Shaloome, Amaariyanne Yooseefe;
015	EZR	010	043	Nebo zereththafe, Yi7i7eele, Matitiya, Zabaade, Zebine, Yaddaya, Iyu7eelenne Bannaya;
