018	JOB	016	001	Iyoobikka hizgi zaarides;
018	JOB	016	002	«Tani hayssa mala haasaya daro wode siyadis; intte saleththiza zoranchchata.
018	JOB	016	003	Hayssa intte hada haasayas wurseththi bayee? Hayssa lagge tanara marshettana mala inttena denththeththiday aazee?
