018	JOB	019	001	Iyoobi hizgi zaarides;
018	JOB	019	002	«Intte tana awude gakkanaas waayisandetii? Awude gakkanaas yo7on taas meqeth menththandetii?
018	JOB	019	003	Hekko intte tana tammuto cayeeta; tana kawushshishekka yeellatekketa.
018	JOB	019	004	Tumukka tani balettidaa gidikko ta balay tana xalla qohana.
018	JOB	019	005	Tumu intte inttena dhoqqisidi ta kawushshateththaa inttes marshe miish ooththeeta.
018	JOB	019	006	Gidikkoka hayssa ubbaa metoza ta bolla gaththidaynne, gite giddo tana yeggiday Xoossa gididayssa intte erana mala ta koyays.
018	JOB	019	007	Ta qohettadis gaada woossiin tana siyiza as demmabeekke; ta qaala dhoqqu ooththada magannikokka suure pirda demmabeekke.
018	JOB	019	008	Xoossi taas ogeza gordida gishshas aadhdhanaasoy deenna; ta baanaasozakka dhuman gordides.
