018	JOB	019	010	Ta asateththa Ubbasora qoxereththidi mulera laallides; taas diza hidota xaphoppe shodettidi kundiza miththa mala ooththides.
018	JOB	019	011	Xoossi tana hanqettidi gita meto ta bolla gaththides; baas morkke mala tana qoodides.
