018	JOB	019	013	«Xoossi ta ishati taappe haakkana mala ooththides; tana eriza asati ubbay tana asa dere as kessida.
018	JOB	019	014	Ta dabboti taappe haakkida; ta laggetikka tana balida.
018	JOB	019	015	Tani tason imaththateth mokka ekkidayti ubbay tana balida; ta garadeti tana imaththa mala qoodida; allaga malakka xeellida.
