018	JOB	019	025	Gido attiin tana ashshizayssi paxa de7iza mala wurseththa woden tana wozzanaas biitta bolla izi eqqanayssa tani erays.
018	JOB	019	026	Taas galbazi meetetti wurikkoka tani ta asateththafe shaakettada tani Xoossaa beyanayssa erays.
018	JOB	019	027	Hara as gidontta izakka tani ta hu7en ta ayfera beyana; ta wozinayakka he gallassayo keehi laamotees.
