018	JOB	020	001	Na7imaane dere as Zoofaarey hizgi zaarides;
018	JOB	020	002	«Iyoobee! Tana yiillo qofay ne bolla zaaro immana mala sugides; hessa gishshassa ta haasayanawu eesotiday.
