018	JOB	020	029	Xoossi makkallanchchatas woththida qaaday, iita asati ekkana waagay hayssa.»
018	JOB	021	001	Iyoobikka hizgi zaarides;
018	JOB	021	002	«Ane ta haasaya wozinappe ezgite; hayssi intte tana minththeththida mala inttes qoodettana.
018	JOB	021	003	Issito haasayana mala taas gishi immite; hessafe guye intte koyida mala tana qidhanawu dandayeeta.
