018	JOB	040	023	Shaafa haaththa kixas izi dagammenna; Yordaanoose shaafay keehi kumidi goggiinkka izi yayyenna.
018	JOB	040	024	Iza ayfeta toyssidi iza oykkana asi dizee? iza siidhekka dafon qachchidi iza oykkanaas dandayzay oonee?
018	JOB	041	001	«Neni lewataane geetettiza abba giddon diza do7a mole oykkiza manxakon oykkanaas dandayay? Woykko iza inxarsaa wodoron qachchanaas dandayay?
018	JOB	041	002	Iza siidhezan dafo aaththada, woykko iza gacoza manxakon gelththada, oykkanaas dandayay?
018	JOB	041	003	Izi, ‹Tana maararkkii!› gi nena woossanee? Woykko lo7o qaalan nena oychchandee?
018	JOB	041	004	Nees mernaas aylle gididi nees ooththanawu izi nees qaala gelanee?
018	JOB	041	005	Asara meeze kafo mala ne iza nenara meezesanee? Woykko nees macca nayta kaassana mala ne qachcha woththanee?
018	JOB	041	006	Mole zal7anchchati iza shammanawu miishshan marshettanee? Woykko qanxxereththidi iza banttas gishettanee?
018	JOB	041	007	Iza galbakka ne koyidasora tooran cadda daakkanaas dandayay? Woykko iza hu7eza hoxe miishshan cadda lukkanawu dandayay?
018	JOB	041	008	Ane neni iza dandayana gidikko kushen bochcha! Izara ne baaxetida baaxe wodenawukka balakka; nam7anththo izara ne baaxetanaas kajjalakka.
018	JOB	041	009	Lewataane geetettiza abba giddo do7ara baaxetidi iza xoonana kajjalos dhaley deenna. iza be7iza ubbay babon kokkorees.
018	JOB	041	010	Iza bolla meto gaththana guussi, hessa keena deexo gidikko, histtiin tanara eqettanaas xalizaadey izi baas oonee?
018	JOB	041	011	Saloppe garsan diza miishshi wurikka taassa; histtiin ta izas zaarana mala taas tal7iday oonee?
018	JOB	041	012	Lewataane geetettiza abba do7a gishshas, iza mino wolqqa gishshassinne izas lo7iza bolla gishshas, ta qonccisontta aggike.
018	JOB	041	013	Orde gidida iza galba shooqanaas, woykko iza banqila poqqanawu dandayzay oonee?
018	JOB	041	014	Keehi yashissiza achchati diza iza banqilata pooqqana dandayzay oonee?
018	JOB	041	015	Izas zokko galbay maarara uttida gondalleta mala; addafe shiddi oykettidayta.
018	JOB	041	016	Istti issoy issaara shiphi gida gishshas Istta giddora haray attiin carkoyka aadhdhenna.
018	JOB	041	017	Istti ubbayka issoy issaara oyketti uttida gishshas ay miishshika istta shaakkanawu dandayenna.
018	JOB	041	018	Izi dhishiza wode xoxolqu giza poo7oy beettees; iza ayfetikka wontta maalado arshe mala poo7eettes.
018	JOB	041	019	Iza doonappe tama lacoy kezees; tamaa pinxeththika laalettishe beettes.
018	JOB	041	020	Penttiza disttey uttida coocen diza afiray cuwattiza mala; iza siidheppe cuway kezishe beettes.
018	JOB	041	021	Izi shempiza shemppoza seelay xiixinththa oyseththees; tama lacoykka iza doonappe kezees.
018	JOB	041	022	Iza morgen wolqqay kumida gishshas iza sinththay yashissees.
018	JOB	041	023	Iza ashoy dila7a gidida gishshas iza bollay birata mala minnees.
018	JOB	041	024	Izas tiray shuchcha mala mino; gaacciza woxa malakka mino.
018	JOB	041	025	Ha do7azi dendiza wode wolqqamati attontta babon kokkoreettes.
018	JOB	041	026	Ay mashshaninne tooran woykko wondafeninne caddizaazan, iza istti caddikokka xoonettenna.
018	JOB	041	027	Izi birata maqa mala menththereththees; Xarqimalakka musa miththa mala tiifereththees.
018	JOB	041	028	Iza bolla wondafe xongikokka izi yayyidi baqatenna; Yanbarsha shuchchika iza sinththan ishina mala.
018	JOB	041	029	Koxe maata mala qoodees; asi iza bolla toora xongishin qidhe miich miiccees.
018	JOB	041	030	Izas ulo galba hanchchazi izi urqqa giddora bishin biitta maarasha mala bookkees.
018	JOB	041	031	Abba haaththa pentta mala pocisees; oton penttiza zayte mala podhisees.
018	JOB	041	032	Izi aadhdhi biza ogey poo7isees; abba haaththaaka hoomo coppu histtees.
018	JOB	041	033	Izi yash erontta medheta; biitta bolla iza misatiza medhetay mulekka deenna.
018	JOB	041	034	Keehi gita gidida medhetatakka izi kadhees; izi do7a ubbaa bolla kawo.»
018	JOB	042	001	Hayssafe guyen Iyoobi Xoossas hizgi zaarides;
018	JOB	042	002	«Ta Godawu! Neni ubba miish ooththanaas dandayzayssa ta eradis; ne qofaakka dhuphi digganay deenna.
018	JOB	042	003	Ta erizaara keehi guuth gidishin ta daro haasayzayssa aazas gididaakko ne oychchadasa; tumukka tani eronttayssanne akeekontta ubbaa haasayadis.
018	JOB	042	004	‹Ta oyshaa ezga siyada taas zaaro imma› gadasa.
018	JOB	042	005	Ta hanno gakkanaas ne gishshas erizayssi asappe siyoyssan xalla; ha7i gidikko ta ayfetan ta nena beyadis.
018	JOB	042	006	Hessafe dendidayssan ta haasayda miishshati tana yeellachchida gishshas bidinththaninne gudullan uttada ta neeppe maarettana.»
018	JOB	042	007	Xoossi Iyoobera haytantta ubbaa haasayettidaappe guye Temaane dere as Elfaazes, «Intte ta aylle Iyoobe mala ta gishshas likke haasayontta gishshas tani ne bollanne ne laggeta bolla hanqettadis.
018	JOB	042	008	Hessa gishshas ha7i laappun wofanotanne laappun dharshota ekkidi ta oosanchcha Iyoobekko biite. Heen intte nagara gishshas xuugettiza yarsho shiishshite. Ta oosanchcha Iyoobi inttes woossana; tanikka iza woosa siyada inttena intte nagara mala qaxxaykke. Intte taas Iyoobe mala lo7o miish haasaybeekketa» gides.
018	JOB	042	009	Hessafe guye Temaane dere as Elfaazey, Shuha dere as Belidaadinne Na7imaane dere as Zoofaarey biidi Xoossi istta azazida mala ooththida. Xoossika Iyoobe woosa siyides.
018	JOB	042	010	Iyoobi ba heedzdzu laggetas woossidaappe guye Xoossi izi zaari durettana mala ooththides. Kase izas dizayssafe aaththidi dakko izas immides.
018	JOB	042	011	He wode Iyoobe ishati, iza michchetinne kase iza erizayti ubbay iza beyanaas yida. Izara issife izason kath mida; istti izas mishettizayssa qonccisidi Xoossi iza bolla gaththida metoza gishshas iza minththeththida. Issoy issoy birappenne worqqafe oosettida midiga izas imota immida.
018	JOB	042	012	Xoossi Iyoobes wurseththa de7oza koyroyssafe aaththi anjjides. Hessa gishshas Iyoobes 14,000 dorsi, 6,000 gaamellati, 1,000 waaththa boorati, 1,000 macca hareti deettes.
018	JOB	042	013	Qasseka laappun attuma naytanne heedzdzu macca nayta zaari yelides.
018	JOB	042	014	Macca naytappe koyroro Yimima, nam7anththayo Qexi7o, heedzdzanththoyo Qerene-Hafiko giidi sunththides.
018	JOB	042	015	Biitta bolla Iyoobe macca nayta mala medha lo7o maccay beettibeenna. Istta aaway isttas istta ishatara biitta laattana mala shaakki immides.
018	JOB	042	016	Hessafe guye Iyoobi 140 de7ides. Ba nayta oydanththo yeleta gakkanaas be7ides.
018	JOB	042	017	Iyoobi daro layth diidi lo7o cima cimmidi hayqqides.
#
# BOOK	019	PSA	Psalms	Mazamure Maxaafa
019	PSA	001	001	Iitata zoren bonttay, woykko nagaranchchata ogen eqqonttay, qilccizayta shiiqon uttonttay anjjettidaade.
019	PSA	001	002	Hessa mala asi GODAA wogan ufayettees; iza wogaa gallassinne qamma qoppees.
019	PSA	001	003	Hessaadey goggiza haaththa achchan tokettidi, hayththika qokkontta woden woden ayfe ayfiza miththa mala; izi ooththiza ubbay izas hanees.
019	PSA	001	004	Gido attiin iitati hessa mala gidettenna; carkoy pitti efiza suulla mala.
019	PSA	001	005	Hessa gishshas iitata bolla GODAY pirdana; nagaranchchatikka xillota shiiqon eqqettenna.
019	PSA	001	006	Ays giikko GODAY xillota oge erees; gido attiin iitata ogey istta dhayon gaththees.
019	PSA	002	001	Kawoteththati ays dendizoo? Qasse kawoteththay ays iita ooththanaas maqettizee?
019	PSA	002	002	Sa7a kawotinne daannati dendida; istti GODAA bollanne GODAY tiydayssa bolla dendanaas issife duulatida.
019	PSA	002	003	Istti, «Ane nuni istta sansalataa duuththoos; istti nuna qachchizayssaka kessi wora oloos» geettes.
019	PSA	002	004	Salon ba araata bolla uttidayssi istta bolla miiccees; Goday istta qidhees.
019	PSA	002	005	Goday ba hanqon istta seerees; ba wolqqama hanqon istta daganththees.
019	PSA	002	006	Goday, «Tani ta geeshsha zuma Xiyoone bolla ta kawoza kawoththadis» gees.
019	PSA	002	007	He kawoy, «Tani GODAA woga awajjana; GODAY tana, ‹Neni ta naa; tani nena hach yeladis.
019	PSA	002	008	Neni tana oychcha; tani kawoteththa ubbaa nees immana; sa7a ubbay nees gidana.
019	PSA	002	009	Neni birata guufen istta qoxereththana; istta neni mana miishshi meqqiza mala menththereththana› gees» gides.
019	PSA	002	010	Hessa gishshas intteno kawotoo akeekite; ha sa7a haarizaytoo intte naagettite!
019	PSA	002	011	GODAAS yashshateththan ooththite; izas kokkorsan haarettite.
019	PSA	002	012	GODAY hanqettiin ogen intte dhayontta mala izas suure wozinan goynnite; ays giikko iza hanqoy eeson eexxi kezana. Iza banttas zemppo ooththizayti anjjettidayta.
019	PSA	003	001	GODAWU! Ta morkketi ay keena corattidoo! Ta bolla aappunati dendidoo!
019	PSA	003	002	Daroti, «Xoossi iza ashshenna» giidi ta bolla haasayda.
019	PSA	003	003	Gido attiin GODAWU! Neni ta yuushon gondalle. Tana bonchchisizaynne minththeththizay nena.
019	PSA	003	004	Tani ta qaala dhoqqisada GODAAKKO waassana; histtiko izi ba geeshsha zuma bolla dishe ta woosa siyana.
019	PSA	003	005	GODAY tana naagiza gishshas, tani ichchada dhiskayssinne beegottays.
019	PSA	003	006	Tani tana giddoththi uttida cora morkketaska babbike.
019	PSA	003	007	Abeet GODAWU! Denda! Abeet ta Xoossawu! Tana ashsha! Neni ta morkketa ubbaa banqila shoca; iitata achchaaka menththa.
019	PSA	003	008	Maadoy GODAASSA; GODAWU ne anjjoy ne deraa bolla gido.
019	PSA	004	001	Abeet ta xillo Xoossawu! Tani xeygiza wode ne taas koya. Tani un7ettida wode, neni tana shempisadasa; taas qadhettada ta woosa siya.
019	PSA	004	002	Intteno asatoo! Intte awude gakkanaas ta bonchcho kawushshanee? Intte awude gakkanaas hada miish siiqanee? Intte awude gakkanaas wordo miish kaallanee?
019	PSA	004	003	GODAY xillo asata baas shaakki dumma woththidayssa intte erite; hessa gishshas tani GODAA xeygiza wode izi taas siyees.
019	PSA	004	004	Hanqettite; gido attiin intte hanqon nagara ooththofte. Hiixan ichchi diza wode sirphi giidi intte wozina qorite.
019	PSA	004	005	GODAAS bessiza yarsho yarshite; GODAANKKA Xoossankka ammanettite.
019	PSA	004	006	Daroti, «Nuna lo7o bessanay oonee?» geettes; Abeet GODAWU! Ne lo7o ayfesoy nu bolla poo7o.
019	PSA	004	007	Kaththinne woyne ushshu daro demmidi harati ufayettizayssafe aaththada neni ta wozina ufayssan kunththadasa.
019	PSA	004	008	Abeet GODAWU! Ne xalla tana saron naaga ayssiza gishshas tani ichchada saroteththan dhiskays.
019	PSA	005	001	Abeet GODAWU! Tani yootizayssa ezga; ta un7on woossiza woosaakka siya.
019	PSA	005	002	Ta kawozo Xoossoo! Ta nena woossiza gishshas tana maadda gaada ta waassiza waaso ne siya.
019	PSA	005	003	Abeet GODAWU! Maalado maalado guuran neni ta qaala siyaasa. Maalado maalado guuran tani ta woosa ne sinth shiishshada, neni taas immiza zaaro ekkana gaada naagays.
019	PSA	005	004	Neni iitateththan ufayettontta Xoossa; iitati nenara de7ettenna.
019	PSA	005	005	Ceeqettizayti ne sinththan eqqettenna; iita miish ooththiza ubbata neni ixxaasa.
019	PSA	005	006	Wordo haasayzayta neni dhayssaasa. Suuth gussizaytanne cimmiza asata neni harasettaasa.
019	PSA	005	007	Gido attiin tani ne maaro daron ne keeththa gelana. Ne geeshsha Keeththaako simmada bonchchoninne yashshateththan nees goynnana.
019	PSA	005	008	Abeet GODAWU! Ta morkketappe ne tana ashsha; tana ne xilloteththankka kaaleththa; ne oge ta sinththan suurisa.
019	PSA	005	009	Istta doonappe keziza qaalay tumu gidenna. Istta wozinankka geney kumides; istta doonay doyettida duufo mala; istti bantta inxarsan as cimmeettes.
019	PSA	005	010	Abeet Xoossoo! Istta bolla neni pirda; istta geney istta ekki bo. Istta nagaray daro; hessa gishshas neni istta goodda digga; ays giikko istti ne bolla geellattida.
019	PSA	005	011	Gido attiin nenan zemppida ubbati ufayetetto; istti mernaas ufayssan yexxetto. Ne sunththa siiqiza ubbati ufayetetto; isttika nenan naagettetto.
019	PSA	005	012	Abeet GODAWU! Neni xillota anjjaasa; Neni gondallen kammiza mala ne kiyateththan istta kammaasa.
019	PSA	006	001	Abeet GODAWU! Yiillon tana seeroppa; woykko ne hanqon tana qaxxayoppa.
019	PSA	006	002	Abeet GODAWU! Tani daaburanchcha gidida gishshas tana maara. Abeet GODAWU! Ta wozinay madunxida gishshas tana paththa.
019	PSA	006	003	Ta shemppoya keeha un7ettadus; histtiin GODAWU! Tana maaddanaas neni awude gakkanaas gam7anee?
019	PSA	006	004	Abeet GODAWU! Neni simmada tana ashsha; ne maaroteththa daron tana kessa ekka.
019	PSA	006	005	Hayqqida asi ooninne nena qoppenna; duufon nena galatizay deenna.
019	PSA	006	006	Ta ceecen xalla daaburadis; omars omars tani yeekkashe ta hiixa caphisays; ta borkoththaaka ta afunththan musissays.
019	PSA	006	007	Ta ayfeti daro afunxxida gishshas daaburda; ta morkketa ubbaa gaasonkka demo ixxida.
019	PSA	006	008	GODAY tani yeekkiza yeeho siyida gishshas, intteno iita ooththiza ubbatoo! Taappe haakkite.
019	PSA	006	009	GODAY ta shoobeththaa be7ides; ta woosaakka siyides.
019	PSA	006	010	Ta morkke ubbati yeellatananne dagammana; qoppontta kawuyidi guye simmana.
019	PSA	007	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ta Xoossawu neni taas qotettizaso; tana gooddiza ubbaafe neni tana ashsha.
019	PSA	007	002	Neni tana ashshontta aggiko, istti tana gaammo mala menththereththidi, ooninne ashshonttason puuzereththana.
019	PSA	007	003	Abeet GODAWU ta Xoossawu! Tani as qohidaa gidikko, taas lo7o ooththidaades iita zaaridaa gidikko, woykko gaasoykka baynda ta morkkefe bonqqidaa gidikko, heyta mala yo7otappe issinokka tani ooththidaa gidikko,
019	PSA	007	005	ta morkkey tana gooddi oykko; tana sa7ankka yedhereththo; tana biittan yeggidi ta bonchcho kawushsho.
019	PSA	007	006	Abeet GODAWU! Ne hanqon denda eqqa; eexxiza ta morkketa hanqo bolla denda; ta Xoossawu beegga; tumu pirda pirda.
019	PSA	007	007	Dereta duulatay ne yuushozan shiiqo; neni istta bolla kawota.
019	PSA	007	008	GODAY kawoteththata bolla pirdees. Abeet GODAWU! Taas ta xilloteththa malanne ta suureteththa mala pirda.
019	PSA	007	009	Qofanne wozina pilgga eriza xillo Xoossawu! Iitata geneza neni dhayssa; gido attiin xillota saron naaga.
019	PSA	007	010	Xoossi taas gondalle; wozina xillota izi ashshiza Xoossa.
019	PSA	007	011	Xoossay xillo pirdiza Xoossa; izi gallas gallas ba hanqo qonccisiza Xoossa.
019	PSA	007	012	Asi ba nagara paaxidi simmontta aggiko, Xoossi ba mashsha leefees; izi ba wondafeza dafi oykkees.
019	PSA	007	013	Izi wodhiza ola miishshata giigssees; tama laco mala popol7u giza ba toora yiishshaa giigssees.
019	PSA	007	014	Iitateth shaaridi, gene qanththatiday wordo yelees.
019	PSA	007	015	Hara asatas olla bookkida asi ba bookkida ollan simmi kundees.
019	PSA	007	016	Izi ehiza geney iza hu7es simmees; iza makkallaykka simmidi izas gidees.
019	PSA	007	017	GODAA xilloteththa gishshas tani iza galatana; qasse Ubbaafe Dhoqqa GODAA sunththas tani galata mazamure yexxana.
019	PSA	008	001	Abeet GODAWU! Nu Godawu ne sunththi biitta ubbaan keehi bonchchettides; neni ne bonchcho salotappe bollan dhoqqu dhoqqu histta woththadasa.
019	PSA	008	002	Neni ne morkketa gishshas ne baalgaaranne ne bolla mandizayssa sirphi ooththanawu guuththa nayta doonaninne dhammiza nayta doonan galata kunththadasa.
019	PSA	008	003	Neni ne kushen medhdhida salota, sohon sohon neni woththida aginanne xoolintteta tani be7iza wode,
019	PSA	008	004	neni asas qoppanawu asi aazee? Woykko neni asa naas wudettanawu izi aazee?
019	PSA	008	005	Iza neni kiitanchchatappe guuththara ziqqisadasa; bonchchonne gitateththa kallachcha iza hu7en goxxisadasa.
019	PSA	008	006	Iza neni ne medhdhida medheteththa ubbaa bollan haarizaade ooththada sunththadasa; ubbaaka izas haarisadasa.
019	PSA	008	007	Dorsatanne miizata, do7a ubbaa,
019	PSA	008	008	salo kafota, abba moletanne abba giddon diza medheta ubbaaka izas haarisadasa.
019	PSA	008	009	Abeet nu GODAA Xoossawu! Ne sunththi biitta ubbaa bolla keehi bonchchettides.
019	PSA	009	001	Abeet GODAWU! Tani nena kumeththa wozinappe galatana; malalisiza ne oosoza ubbaaka ta yootana.
019	PSA	009	002	Tani nenan ufayettananne hashshu gaana. Ubbaafe Dhoqqa Xoossawu! Tani ne sunththas galata mazamure yexxana.
019	PSA	009	003	Ne qoncciza wode ta morkketi guye simmana; ne sinththafekka dhuphetti dhayana.
019	PSA	009	004	Neni taas xillo pirda pirdadasa; neni xilloteththan pirdashe ne kawoteththa araatan uttadasa.
019	PSA	009	005	Neni kawoteththata seeradasa; iitatakka dhayssadasa; neni istta sunththaa meri mernaaskka qucca diggadasa.
019	PSA	009	006	Morkketi meri mernaas dhayda; istta katamatakka mulera dhoqalla dhayssadasa; istti mulera dogetti attida.
019	PSA	009	007	Gido attiin GODAY mernaas kawotidi dees; izi pirdanaas ba araata giigsides.
019	PSA	009	008	Izi ha alameza xilloteththan pirdana; kawoteththata bollaka tumateththan pirdana.
019	PSA	009	009	GODAY un7ettidaytas baqati attizaso; meto wodetankka qotetti attizaso.
019	PSA	009	010	Ne sunththa erizayti nenan ammanetteettes; ays giikko GODAWU! Neni nena koyzayta yegga aggabeekka.
019	PSA	009	011	Xiyoonen kawoti uttida GODAAS galata mazamure yexxite; izi ooththida ooso dere ubbaas qonccen yootite.
019	PSA	009	012	Ays giikko suuth gussizaytas halo kessiza Xoossi naaqettidayta waasoza izi dogenna.
019	PSA	009	013	Abeet GODAWU! ta morkketi tana yedeththizayssa be7a. Neni taas qadhettada hayqoppe tana ashsha.
019	PSA	009	014	Hessika tani Xiyoone asa karen eqqada nena galatanaassinne ne ashshidayssan keeha ufayettanaassa.
019	PSA	009	015	Kawoteththay ba bookkida ollan kundides. Istti qotti woththida woximadey istta toho oykkides.
019	PSA	009	016	GODAY ba xillo pirdan erettides; iita asi ba kushen ooththida ooso woximaden oykettides.
019	PSA	009	017	Iitati si7oolen gelana; Xoossa dogiza kawoteththay ubbayka istta mala hanana.
019	PSA	009	018	Hiyeesati aydekka dogetti attettenna; woykko manqota hidotay coo mernaas dhayenna.
019	PSA	009	019	Abeet GODAWU! Kawoteththati ba wolqqan dendidi ne bolla ceeqettontta mala neni istta bolla pirda.
019	PSA	009	020	Abeet GODAWU! Ne istta daganththa; istti as gididayssa neni istta erisa.
019	PSA	010	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ne ays haakkada eqqay? Meto wodenkka ays geemmay?
019	PSA	010	002	Iita asati otoretteettes; hiyeesatakka yedeththeettes; istti haras woththida woximaden zaari oykettetto.
019	PSA	010	003	Iita asi ba wozina amon ceeqettees; Yoray GODAA cayeessinne kaddees.
019	PSA	010	004	Iita asi otoreteththan Xoossa koyenna; iza qofa ubbaan Xoossi deenna.
019	PSA	010	005	Ubbaa miishshi izas kumees; ne wogay izas gelenna; otoranchchay ne wogappe haakkees; hessa gishshas ba morkketa bollan izi qilccees.
019	PSA	010	006	Ba wozinan izi, «Tana aykkoyka qaaththenna; tana mulekka metoy gakkenna» giidi qoppees.
019	PSA	010	007	Iza doonan qanggeththi, wordoynne mandey kumides; iza inxarsan geneynne baleththoy dees.
019	PSA	010	008	Dere giddon geemason zuggi uttees; maadoy bayndayta dhayssanaas naagettees; xillo asata geeman wodhees.
019	PSA	010	009	Ba qotettizason geemmidi, hiyeesa oykkanawu gaammo mala zuggees; maadoy bayndayta ba woximaden oykkidi goochchi efees.
019	PSA	010	010	Maadoy bayndaynne hiyeesay iza kushen kundees; izikka istta nippi histti menththereththees.
019	PSA	010	011	Iita asi ba wozinan, «Xoossi tana dogides; ba sinththaa taappe genththides; mulekka izi tana be7enna» gees.
019	PSA	010	012	Abeet GODAWU! Denda. Xoossoo! Ne kusheza dhoqqu histta denththa; maadoy baynda metotanchchata dogoppa.
019	PSA	010	013	Iita asi Xoossa ays kadhizee? Ba wozinankka, «Xoossi tana qaxxayenna» ays gizee?
019	PSA	010	014	Gido attiin Xoossoo! Neni metozanne waayezakka beyaasa; neni ubba wode maaddanaas giiga uttadasa; neni yi7ota maaddaasa; maadoy bayndaytikka bana nees sheedhdheettes.
019	PSA	010	015	Gene asata wolqqa menththa; iita asata wolqqaka liiqisa; istti nam7anththo iita ooththontta mala istta ooso mala istta qaxxaya.
019	PSA	010	016	GODAY merippe mernaas kawotidi dees; hara kawoteththati iza biittafe dhayana.
019	PSA	010	017	Abeet GODAWU! Neni hiyeesata amo eraasa; istta woosaakka siyada minththeththaasa.
019	PSA	010	018	Oonikka istta yashisontta mala maadoy bayndaytassinne yi7otas ne pirda.
019	PSA	011	001	GODAY tani baqata attizaso; histtiin intte tana ays, «Neni kafo mala pude zuma bolla baqata» geetii?
019	PSA	011	002	Nagaranchchati wozina geeshshata dhuman caddanaas bantta wondafe dafi oykkida.
019	PSA	011	003	Yochcha shuchchi woddiza wode, xilloy ay ooththanawu dandayzee?
019	PSA	011	004	GODAY ba geeshsha Keeththan dees; salon ba araatan uttidi asaa be7ees; iza ayfeti asaa pilggi xeelleettes.
019	PSA	011	005	GODAY xillotanne nagaranchchata pilggi xeellees. Gido attiin geellateththinne makkallateth siiqizayta izi keehippe ixxees.
019	PSA	011	006	GODAY iitata bolla eexxiza tama bonqonne diine tama bukisana. Dhayssiza gote carkon istta qaxxayana.
019	PSA	011	007	GODAY xillo gidida gishshas xilloteththa ooso dosees. Suure asati iza sinth beyana.
019	PSA	012	001	GODAWU! Lo7o asi biitta bollafe wurida gishshas ne tana maaddarkki; deraa giddon ammanettiza asi deenna.
019	PSA	012	002	Issoy issaas wordo haasayees; issoy issaa doonan cimmeettes;
019	PSA	012	003	Abeet GODAWU! baleththiza doona gorda; otoron haasayza inxarsata qanxxa;
019	PSA	012	004	Istti, «Nuni nu inxarsan xoonana; nu doonay nuussa; nuus goday oonee?» geettes.
019	PSA	012	005	GODAY, «Hiyeesati un7ettida gishshassinne, metotanchchata waaso gishshas ha7i tani dendana; tani istti amottiza saroteththan istta woththana» gees.
019	PSA	012	006	GODAA qaalay izan walakay baynda muuruta; cooce taman laappunto paacetti geeyida bira mala.
019	PSA	012	007	Abeet GODAWU! Neni nuna saroteththan naaga; ha woden diza iita yeletappe mernaas ne nuna ashsha.
019	PSA	012	008	Asaa giddon iitay bonchchettida wode geellati ubba wode otoreteththan simeretteettes.
019	PSA	013	001	Abeet GODAWU! Awude gakkanaas neni tana doganee? Ne tana mernaas balanee? Awude gakkanaas neni taappe geemmanee?
019	PSA	013	002	Awude gakkanaas tani ta qofara baaxetanee? Awude gakkanaas ta wozinay ceecishe daanee? Ta morkketi ta bolla awude gakkanaas goobanee?
019	PSA	013	003	Ta GODAWU! Haa taakko xeellada taas zaaro imma; ta ayfe poo7isada, hayqoppe tana ashsha.
019	PSA	013	004	«Nuni iza xoonidos» giidi, ta morkketi ceeqettontta mala ne istta teqqa. Ta kundeththaan istti ufayettontta mala ne istta digga.
019	PSA	013	005	Gido attiin ne maaroteththa daron tani ammanettays; neni tana ashshiza gishshas tani ufayettays.
019	PSA	013	006	GODAWU! Ne kiyateththi taas darida gishshas tani nees yexxana.
019	PSA	014	001	Eeyati bantta wozinan, «Xoossi baawa» geettes; istta de7oy moorettides; istti harassiza miish ooththeettes; istta giddon lo7o ooththiza issi asikka deenna.
019	PSA	014	002	Xoossa koyzaynne akeekizay de7izakko be7anaas, GODAY saloppe duge asaa xeellees.
019	PSA	014	003	Gido attiin ubbayka ogeppe kare ke7ida; ubbayka mulera go7onttaaz gidida; lo7o ooththizay ooninne deenna; haray atto issaadeyka deenna.
019	PSA	014	004	GODAY, «Ta asaa bonqqi miza iita asati aykkoka erettennee?» gees.
019	PSA	014	005	Gido attiin Xoossi xillo asatara de7iza gishshas iita asati hessan dagammana.
019	PSA	014	006	Intte hiyeesata halchcho laalleeta; gido attiin GODAY hiyeesati baqati attizaso gidees.
019	PSA	014	007	Isra7eeles atoteththi Xiyooneppe yidaakko! GODAY istta duussa zaariza wode Yaaqoobe zereththati ufayettana; Isra7eele asay ufayssan galatana.
019	PSA	015	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ne Dunkaanezan gam7anay oonee? Ne geeshsha zumaa bolla nenara de7anay oonee?
019	PSA	015	002	Suure de7o de7izay, xillo ooththizay, ba wozinappe tuma haasayzay,
019	PSA	015	003	as cimmonttay, ba lagge bolla iita ooththonttay, ba shooro zigironttay,
019	PSA	015	004	Iita asata kadhizay, gido attiin GODAAS yayyizayta bonchchizay, ay deexxikkoka ba caaqqida qaala polizay,
019	PSA	015	005	ba miishsha dichchas tal7onttay, xillo as qohanaas matta7e ekkonttay, Ha yo7ota polizaadey mernaaskka hirgenna.
019	PSA	016	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ta baqata attizasoy nena; ne ki7on tana qotta.
019	PSA	016	002	Tani GODAAS, «Neni ta Godaa; neeppe attiin hara lo7oy taas deenna» gadis.
019	PSA	016	003	Sa7an de7iza geeshshati ay mala bonchchettidaytee! Tani isttan ufayettays.
019	PSA	016	004	Wordo xoossata kaallizayti bantta bolla meto darseettes. Gido attiin tani eeqa xoossatas shukkike; isttas sunththaaka xeygikke.
019	PSA	016	005	GODAWU! Taas laata xinxxoynne qaaday nena;
019	PSA	016	006	Ne taas wadhdhida zaway lo7o gidides; keehippe lo7o xinxxoy tana gakkides.
019	PSA	016	007	Tana zoriza GODAA galatays; omars ta wozinay tana tamaarssees.
019	PSA	016	008	Tani ubbato GODAA sinththasays; izi ta ushachchan diza gishshas tani kokkorikke.
019	PSA	016	009	Hessa gishshas ta wozinay ufayettees; ta shemppoyka woppu gees; ta asateththayka hirgay baynda shempi dees.
019	PSA	016	010	Ne tana Si7oolen aggaka; ne geeshshaza wooqqana mala aggaka.
019	PSA	016	011	Neni tana de7o oge bessaasa; ne matan kumeththa ufayssi, nees ushachchan mernaa ufayssi dees.
019	PSA	017	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ta xilloteththan maganniza magana siya; ta waasoza ezga; cimoy baynda woossiza woosaas zaaro imma.
019	PSA	017	002	Taas xilloteththi neeppe yo; tumaa ne ayfey xeello.
019	PSA	017	003	Neni qamman tana xomosadasa; ta wozina paaccadasa; ne paaccidaa gidikkoka ta bolla aykkoka demmabeekka. Ta inxarsay iita haasaybeenna.
019	PSA	017	004	Tani hara asa mala iita qaala haasaykke; tani ne azazo naagiza gishshas gene oge kaallabeekke.
019	PSA	017	005	Ta tohoti ne ogeppe handarshontta mala ta tanggoy ne ogeppe kare kezibeenna.
019	PSA	017	006	Abeet Xoossawu! Tani woossiin neni siyiza gishshas tani nena woossays; ne hayththa taakko zaarada, tani nees yootizayssa siya.
019	PSA	017	007	Bantta morkketappe baqatizayta ne ushachcha kushezan qottada ashshizayssoo! Ne kiyateththa malalisiza ogera qonccisa.
019	PSA	017	008	Ne ayfe ciro mala tana naaga; ne qefeta giddon tana qotta.
019	PSA	017	009	Un7eththiza iitatappenne dooddi uttida wolqqama morkketa kusheppe ne tana ashsha.
019	PSA	017	010	Isttas qadhettiza wozinay baawa; otoro haasaya haasayeettes.
019	PSA	017	011	Tani bizaso ubbaan istti tana dooddeettes; tana duge biittan kundis yegganaas dereqeettes.
019	PSA	017	012	Istti banttas miza miish koyza gaammo mala; woykko geeman zamadi naagiza wodalla gaammo mala.
019	PSA	017	013	Abeet GODAWU! Denda. Ta morkketara eqettada istta shoca; ne mashshan iitatappe tana ashsha.
019	PSA	017	014	Abeet GODAWU! Hessa mala asatappe tana qotta; Istta qaaday ha sa7a de7o xalla gidiza asaappe ne kushen tana ashsha; ne mazgaban minjjida qixaateppe istta kalssa; istta naytas daridi tirpo; istta nayta naytaska gidi palaho.
019	PSA	017	015	Gido attiin tani xilloteththan ne sinththa beyana; tani beeggiza wode ne bonchcho be7ada alana.
019	PSA	018	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ne taas wolqqa immida gishshas ta nena siiqays.
019	PSA	018	002	GODAY taas zaalla; tani olappe naagettiza miixa; izi tana ashshizayssa; ta Xoossay tani izan geemetta attiza wogga zaalla. Izi taas gondalle; izi tana ashshiza kace; taas izi mino zemppo.
019	PSA	018	003	Galatay bessiza GODAA tani xeygays; izi ta morkketappe tana ashshees.
019	PSA	018	004	Hayqo wodoroy tana cuullides; dhayssiza di7oy tana mittides.
019	PSA	018	005	Duufo wodoroy tana qachchides; hayqo woximadey ta sinththan waaxettides.
019	PSA	018	006	Tana metoy un7iin GODAA xeygadis; «Tana maadda» gaada ta Xoossas waassadis; izi ba Keeththan dishe ta cenggurssaa siyides; tani waassida waasoy iza hayththan wodhdhides.
019	PSA	018	007	Xoossi hanqettida gishshas biittay qaaxxides; zumata xaphoy kokkorides.
019	PSA	018	008	Iza sidheppe hanqo cuway cuwattides; iza doonappe miza tama lacoy kezides; iza doonappe xuuggiza bonqoy pulttides.
019	PSA	018	009	Salo phalqidi wodhdhides; he wode iza toho garsara dhippi gida shaaray dees.
019	PSA	018	010	Kiruben uttidi paallides; carko qefe ekkidi pude dendi bides.
019	PSA	018	011	Bana dhuman kammides; iza Dunkaaneza dhippi gida irara shaaray dooddides.
019	PSA	018	012	Iza sinththan de7iza gita poo7ozappe shachchinne wolqqanththi ke7ides; dhippi gida shaarakka kanththi ke7ides.
019	PSA	018	013	GODAY dada mala saloppe guummides; Ubbaafe Dhoqqa Xoossay ba cenggurssa sissides; wolqqanththaninne tama lacon qonccides.
019	PSA	018	014	Ba wondafeza yiishshaa yeddides; ba morkketakka laallides; wolqqanththa poo7o kiittidi istta yedeththides.
019	PSA	018	015	Abeet GODAWU! Neni seerida wodenne ne hanqoy eexxida wode, gita abbati ichchida biittay beettides; qasse sa7a yochchay qonccides.
019	PSA	018	016	GODAY bollafe ba kusheza duge yeddidi tana oykkides; ciimma haaththafe tana kessides.
019	PSA	018	017	Izi ta bolla wolqqatiza ta morkketappe, tana ixxizaytappe ashshides.
019	PSA	018	018	Tana metoy un7ida gallas istti ta bolla dendida; gido attiin GODAY taas zemppo gidides.
019	PSA	018	019	Izi tana aaho demban kessides; tanan ufayettida gishshas tana ashshides.
019	PSA	018	020	Ta xilloteththa mala GODAY taas qanxxides; ta kushe geeshshateththa mala izi taas zaarides.
019	PSA	018	021	Tani GODAA oge kaalladis; tani ta Xoossa aggada iita ooththabeekke.
019	PSA	018	022	Tani iza woga ubbaa naagadis; iza azazoza polanaappe guye gabeekke.
019	PSA	018	023	Tani iza sinththan suure de7adis; tanateththaa nagarappe naagadis.
019	PSA	018	024	Hessa gishshas GODAY taas ta xilloteththa mala immides; ta kushey iza sinththan geesh gidida mala zaarides.
019	PSA	018	025	Abeet GODAWU! Ammanettizaytas neni ammanettaasa; suuretas neni suure.
019	PSA	018	026	Geeshshataskka neni geeshsha; gido attiin geellatas neni geella.
019	PSA	018	027	Ashketa ne ashshaasa; gido attiin otoranchchata kawushshaasa.
019	PSA	018	028	Abeet GODAWU! Ne taas xomppaasa; Xoossay neni taas dhuma poo7isaasa.
019	PSA	018	029	Ne maaddiin tani ta morkketa olays; ta Xoossa wolqqan tani istta gimbe bollara guppa aadhdhays.
019	PSA	018	030	Xoossa ogey suure; GODAA qaalay ammanettizayssa; Izakko baqatiza ubbatas izi gondalle.
019	PSA	018	031	Xoossafe attiin hara xoossi oonee? nu GODAAPPE attiin hara zaallay oonee?
019	PSA	018	032	Taas wolqqa immizaynne ta oge saro ooththizay Xoossa.
019	PSA	018	033	Izi ta tohota genessa toho mala minththees; tana dhoqqasohotan saroteththan woththees.
019	PSA	018	034	Izi ta kusheta ola tamaarssees; hessa gishshas tani ta qesen xarqimala birata wondafeza dafada dukkays.
019	PSA	018	035	Ashshiza ne gondalle taas immadasa. Ne ushachcha kushen tana zemppisadasa; taakko ziqqi gaada tana gitasadasa.
019	PSA	018	036	Ta oge aassadasa; hessa gishshas ta tohoy handarashibeenna.
019	PSA	018	037	Ta morkketa tani yedeththa oykkadis; tani istta dhayssana gakkanaas guye simmabeekke.
019	PSA	018	038	Istti nam7anththo dendontta mala shocadis; ta toho garsankka kundida.
019	PSA	018	039	Olas tana wolqqa gixissadasa; ta morkketa ta sinththan gulbatissadasa.
019	PSA	018	040	Ta morkketa ta sinththafe guye zaara baqatissadasa; tana ixxizayta tani dhayssadis.
019	PSA	018	041	Banttana maaddana mala waassida; gido attiin ooninne istta ashshibeenna. GODAA istti xeygida; gido attiin izi isttas koyibeenna.
019	PSA	018	042	Carkoy pittidi efiza gudulla mala tani istta ooththadis; ogen de7iza urqqa malakka istta yedhettadis.
019	PSA	018	043	Makkalla asappe tana ashshadasa; ne tana kawoteththata ayssizaade histta shuumadasa; ta erontta derey taas haarettides.
019	PSA	018	044	Tana erontta allaga derey taas azazettees; istti ta goobateththaa siyidi taas ziggeettes.
019	PSA	018	045	Istti yashshan kaha dhayeettes; bantti naagiza miixappe kezidi kokkorishe taakko yeettes.
019	PSA	018	046	GODAY de7o Xoossa! Ta zemppiza wogga zaallay galatetto! Tana ashshida Xoossay dhoqqu dhoqqu go!
019	PSA	018	047	Izi ta halo kessiza Xoossa; kawoteththata taas haarisiza Xoossa.
019	PSA	018	048	Ta morkketappe tana ashshaasa; Abeet GODAWU! Neni ta morkketa bolla tana dhoqqu dhoqqu histtaasa; makkallanchcha asatappe neni tana ashshaasa.
019	PSA	018	049	Hessa gishshas tani nena kawoteththata sinththan galatana; tani ne sunththa yeththan sabbana.
019	PSA	018	050	Xoossi ba kawoththida kawos xoono bolla xoono immees. Ba tiydayssas kiyateththa bessees; Dawitesinne iza zereththatas mernaas hessaththo ooththees.
019	PSA	019	001	Saloti Xoossa bonchcho yooteettes; salo gufanththoy iza kushe ooso awajjees.
019	PSA	019	002	Issi gallassay hara gallassas hessa yootees; issi qammayka kaalliza qammas erateth qonccisees.
019	PSA	019	003	Isttas haasayay woykko qaalay baawa; istta cenggurssikka siyettenna.
019	PSA	019	004	Gido attiin istta haasaya cenggurssi sa7a ubbaan laalettana; istta qaalaykka biitta gaxa gakkana. Xoossi arshes salon soho giigsides.
019	PSA	019	005	Arshey mishiray ba keeththafe keziza mala poo7i ke7ees; gaadde woxxiza pilata asa mala ufayettees.
019	PSA	019	006	Arshey kessasoppe wuloso gakkanaas bees; iza seelappe geemmi attana miishshi deenna.
019	PSA	019	007	GODAA wogay suure; shemppo zaari cil7isees; GODAA azazoy ammanettizayssa; akeekay paccidaytas aadho erateth immees.
019	PSA	019	008	GODAA wogay likke; wozina ufayssees. GODAA azazoy geeshsha; ayfe poo7isees.
019	PSA	019	009	GODAAS yashshi geeshshateththa; izi mernaas eqqidi de7ana. GODAA pirday mulera tumanne xillo.
019	PSA	019	010	Worqqafenne muuruta worqqafe aadhdhi dosettees; eessafenne eessa ililoppe aadhdhi mal7ees.
019	PSA	019	011	Qasse tana ne aylleza naagettana mala zorees; ne woga naagoy daro go7ees.
019	PSA	019	012	Ba bala demmizay oonee? Abeet GODAWU! Geemmida nagarappe tana geeshsha.
019	PSA	019	013	Tani ne aylley, xalateththan nagara ooththontta mala neni tana naaga. Nagaray tana haaroppo; he wode tani suure gidana; gita mooroppeka geeyana.
019	PSA	019	014	Abeet GODAWU! Ta zemppiza wogga zaallawu! Tana wozzida ta Godawu! Ta doonappe ke7iza qaalaynne ta wozina qofay nena ufayssizayssa gido.
019	PSA	020	001	Neni metotida wode GODAY ne woosa siyo; Yaaqoobe Xoossa sunththi nena minththi esso.
019	PSA	020	002	Ba Keeththafe nees maado kiitto; Xiyooneppe maadoy yo.
019	PSA	020	003	Ne yarsho ubbaa izi akeeko; ne xuuggiza yarshon izi ufayetto.
019	PSA	020	004	Ne wozina amo nees immo; ne halchcho ubbaa polo.
019	PSA	020	005	Ne xoonida gishshas nuni ufayssan hombocana; nu Xoossa sunththan nu bandira dhoqqu ooththana; ne woosa ubbaa GODAY nees immo.
019	PSA	020	006	GODAY ba doorida kawozas xoono immizayssa tani ha7i eradis; ba ushachcha kushezan izi gita xoonon kunththana; ba geeshsha saloppeka izas zaaro immana.
019	PSA	020	007	Issoti issoti bantta ola para-gaaren ammanetteettes; harati bantta paran ceeqetteettes; nuni gidikko nu GODAA wolqqan ceeqettoos.
019	PSA	020	008	Istti dhuphettidi kundana; nuni gidikko dendidi minni eqqana.
019	PSA	020	009	Abeet GODAWU! Kawozas xoono imma; nunikka nena xeygiza wode siya.
019	PSA	021	001	Abeet GODAWU! Kawoy ne immida wolqqa gishshas ufayettees; neni immida xoonon izi keehi hombocees.
019	PSA	021	002	Neni iza wozina amo izas immadasa; qasse izi nena ba doonan oychchidayssa neni diggabeekka.
019	PSA	021	003	Neni lo7o anjjora iza mokkaasa; geeshsha worqqa kallachcha iza hu7aan goxxisadasa.
019	PSA	021	004	Neni de7o izas immana mala nena woossides; nekka izas de7onne adussa layth immadasa.
019	PSA	021	005	Neni xoono immida gishshas izas bonchchoy darides; gitateththinne teema izas immadasa.
019	PSA	021	006	Neni izas mernaa anjjo immadasa; ne izara duussan iza ufayssadasa.
019	PSA	021	007	Kawozi GODAAN ammaneettes. Ubbaafe Dhoqqa Xoossa kiyateththi izara diza gishshas izi yayyenna.
019	PSA	021	008	Ne kushey ne morkketa ubbaa demmana; ne ushachchay nena ixxizayta oykkana.
019	PSA	021	009	Neni qoncciza wode coocen eexxiza tama mala ne istta xuuggana; GODAY ba hanqoza suulen istta xuuggana; iza tamaykka istta mi dhayssana.
019	PSA	021	010	Neni istta nayta biittafe diggana; istta zereththaaka dereppe denththa dhayssana.
019	PSA	021	011	Ne morkketi ne bolla genen duulateettes; iita miishshika maqetteettes; gido attiin isttas hanenna.
019	PSA	021	012	Nekka istta ne wondafeza yiishshan gooddaasa; istti guye simmidi baqatana mala ooththaasa.
019	PSA	021	013	Abeet GODAWU! Ne minoteththay dhoqqu dhoqqu go; ne gita wolqqaa gishshas galata mazamure yexxoos.
019	PSA	022	001	Ta Xoossawu! Ta Xoossawu! Tana ays aggadii? Tana maadda gaada tani waassishin ays siyontta ixxadii? Taappeka ays haakkadii?
019	PSA	022	002	Abeet ta Xoossawu! Gallas kumeth ta neekko waassishin ne siyabeekka; qamma ubbaankka neekko waasoppe shempabeekke.
019	PSA	022	003	Ne gidikko geeshsha kawo; Isra7eele galatay ne yuushon dees.
019	PSA	022	004	Kase nu aawati nenan ammanettida; nenan ammanettiin ne istta ashshadasa.
019	PSA	022	005	Istti neekko waassiin ashshadasa; nenan ammanettiin istta yeellasabeekka.
019	PSA	022	006	Tani guxune attiin as gidikke; tani asan kadhettidaadenne ixettidaade.
019	PSA	022	007	Tana be7ida ubbati qidheettes; zaaridikka inxars kessi qidheettes; ba qoodhekka ta bolla qaaththeettes.
019	PSA	022	008	Histtidi, «Izi GODAAN ammanettides; ane Xoossi iza ashsho; izi ufayettidaa gidikko ane iza maaddo» geettes.
019	PSA	022	009	Gido attiin ta wogara yelettana mala maaddiday nena; tani ta aayi dhanth dhammishinkka ne taas ammanettaasa.
019	PSA	022	010	Tani yelettoosofe doommada nenan diccadis; ta aayey uloppe doommadakka neni ta Xoossa.
019	PSA	022	011	Metoy taakko mati mati yiza gishshas, tana maaddizaykka baynda gishshas neni taappe haakkofa.
019	PSA	022	012	Daro morkketi korma boorata mala tana giddoththida; qayciza Baasaane biitta boorata mala tana dooddida.
019	PSA	022	013	Menththereththi yeggidi xaaggiza gaammo mala ba doona ta bolla doyda.
019	PSA	022	014	Tani haaththa mala goggadis; ta meqeththati someppe someppe kolettida. Ta wozinay muqaadda mala ta giddon seerides.
019	PSA	022	015	Taas qoodhey kon7a mala melides; ta inxarsay gonggiraththara oykettides; neni tana hayqqida asa mala gudullan baanan yeggadasa.
019	PSA	022	016	Kanati tana giddoththida; Iita asati tana dooddi oykkida; Ta kushetanne ta tohota shiishshi dhishkida.
019	PSA	022	017	Tani meqeththata qoodana dandayays; ta morkketikka tana phirxi histti xeelleettes.
019	PSA	022	018	Ta may7oza gishetti ekkida; ta adussa may7ozan saama yeggida.
019	PSA	022	019	Abeet GODAWU! Neni ha7i taappe haakkofa. Abeet ta wolqqawu! Tana maaddanaas eesota.
019	PSA	022	020	Tana mashshafe ashsha; ta shemppoyo wolqqama kanatappe ashsha.
019	PSA	022	021	Tana gaammota doonappe ashsha; qayciza menththa kacezappe tana naaga.
019	PSA	022	022	Tani ne sunththa ta ishatas yootana; istti shiiqidasonkka ta nena galatana.
019	PSA	022	023	Intteno GODAAS yayyizaytoo, iza galatite! intteno Yaaqoobe zereththatoo! Ubbayka iza bonchchite! intteno Isra7eele zereththatoo! Ubbatikka bonchchon izas yayyite!
019	PSA	022	024	Izi naaqettidayssa kadhibeenna; metotishin yeggi aadhdhibeenna; ba sinththa izappe genththibeenna; izi maaddarkki gi waassiin iza waaso siyides.
019	PSA	022	025	Neni ooththida lo7o ooso gishshas, derey shiiqidason galatana; ta adinidayssa nena yayyiza asaa sinththan gaththana.
019	PSA	022	026	Hiyeesati miidi kallana. GODAA koyzayti iza galatana. Istti mernaas ufayettana.
019	PSA	022	027	Sa7a gaxa gakkanaas diza asay iza gishshas yuushshi qoppana; GODAAKKO simmana. Asa zere ubbay izas goynnana.
019	PSA	022	028	Ays giikko maatay izassa; kawoteththay ubbay izas haarettana.
019	PSA	022	029	Sa7a bolla diza dureti izas goynnana. Bana hayqoppe ashshanawu dandayontta biittan baana asi ubbay iza sinththan gulbatana.
019	PSA	022	030	Buro yaana yeletay izas ooththana; he yeletay kaalli yiza yeletas Godaa ooso yootana.
019	PSA	022	031	Istti iza xilloteththa gishshas buro yaana yeletas yootana.
019	PSA	023	001	GODAY ta heenththanchcha; taas aykkoyka paccenna.
019	PSA	023	002	Tana aaca qooron shempisees; xillo haaththi dizaso tana kaaleththees.
019	PSA	023	003	Ta de7o ooraxissees. Ba sunththa gishshas tana xilloteththa ogen kaaleththees.
019	PSA	023	004	Neni ta GODAY tanara diza gishshas tani girdi gida dhuma shoobba giddora biikkoka iita miishshas babbike. Ne guufeynne gatumay tana minththeththees.
019	PSA	023	005	Ta morkketa sinththan taas maadda giigsadasa; ta hu7e zayten tiyadasa; ta ushshi kunththa palahissadasa.
019	PSA	023	006	Ne kiyateththinne ne maaroteththay ta de7o layththa ubbaan tana kaallana; tani GODAA keeththan mernaas daana.
019	PSA	024	001	Sa7aynne sa7an kumida ubbay GODAASSA; salo gufanththon diza ubbay Xoossassa.
019	PSA	024	002	Sa7aa gita abbata bolla miccides; haaththa bollaka minththidi essides.
019	PSA	024	003	GODAA zuma bolla kezanay oonee? Iza geeshshasohon eqqanay oonee?
019	PSA	024	004	Iza kushey nagarappe geeyiday, iza wozinay geeshsha gididay, eeqa xoossatas goynnonttay, wordo caaqqonttay,
019	PSA	024	005	izi GODAAPPE anjjo ekkana; bana ashshiza Xoossafe xillo pirda demmana.
019	PSA	024	006	Xoossako xeelliza asaynne Yaaqoobe Xoossaa sinth koyza asay heytantta mala.
019	PSA	024	007	Kareti doyettetto; Bonchcho Kawoy gelo; beni pengeti iza ufayssan mokkite!
019	PSA	024	008	He Bonchcho Kawoy oonee? Minonne wolqqama GODAA! Olaska izi wolqqama GODAA!
019	PSA	024	009	Kareti doyettetto; Bonchcho Kawoy gelo; beni pengeti iza ufayssan mokkite!
019	PSA	024	010	Ha Bonchcho Kawoy oonee? He Bonchcho Kawoy salo medheteththa GODAA!
019	PSA	025	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ta nena wozinappe woossays.
019	PSA	025	002	Abeet ta Xoossawu! Tani nenan ammanettays; tana yeellasoppa; ta morkketikka ta bolla ceeqettofetto.
019	PSA	025	003	Nena hidota ooththizayti yeellatettenna; gido attiin gene ooththizayti yeellatana.
019	PSA	025	004	Abeet GODAWU! Tana ne oge bessa; ne geedo kaalo tana tamaarsa.
019	PSA	025	005	Neni tana ashshiza Xoossa; ne tumateththan tana kaaleththanne tamaarsa; ubba wode ta hidotay nena.
019	PSA	025	006	Abeet GODAWU! Beniisofe diza ne qadheteththaanne ne kiyateththa hassa7a.
019	PSA	025	007	Ta yelagateththa nagaranne mooro hassa7oppa; Abeet GODAWU! Ne gita kiyateththa malanne ne lo7eteththa keena tana qoppa;
019	PSA	025	008	GODAY kiyanne suure; hessa gishshas nagaranchchata ba oge tamaarssees.
019	PSA	025	009	Ashketa suure ogera kaaleththees; isttaka ba oge tamaarssees.
019	PSA	025	010	GODAA caaqo qaalanne maara naagizaytas iza ogey ubbay kiyanne tuma.
019	PSA	025	011	Abeet GODAWU! Ta nagaray keehi daro; gidikkoka ne sunththa gishshas atto ga.
019	PSA	025	012	GODAAS yayyiza asi oonee? Ne doorada baana ogeza izi nena tamaarsana.
019	PSA	025	013	Izi ubbaa wodekka lo7o duus daana; iza zereththati biitta laattana.
019	PSA	025	014	GODAY bana yayyizaytappe ba xuura qottenna; izi isttas ba gelida caaqo qaalakka erisees.
019	PSA	025	015	GODAY ta toho narxafe kessi ekkiza gishshas, ta ayfey maado demmanaas ubba wode izakko xeellees.
019	PSA	025	016	GODAWU! Tani bizza dizaadenne qohettida as gidida gishshas, ne haa taakko simma; ne maaroteththaka bessa.
019	PSA	025	017	Taas metoy darides; ta metozappe tana neni kessa.
019	PSA	025	018	Ta metozanne ta tuggaa neni be7a; Ta nagara ubbaa atto ga.
019	PSA	025	019	Ta morkketi ay keena daridaakko ne be7a; istti tana ay mala ixxizaakko ne xeella.
019	PSA	025	020	Neni tana naaganne ashsha; ta nenan zemppadis; ne tana yeellasoppa.
019	PSA	025	021	Ne taas hidota gidida gishshas suureteththaynne tumateththay tana naago.
019	PSA	025	022	Abeet Xoossawu! Isra7eele asa meto ubbaafe neni wozza.
019	PSA	026	001	Abeet GODAWU! Tani suureteththaninne sidhey baynda nenan ammanetta de7ida gishshas ne taas pirda.
019	PSA	026	002	Abeet GODAWU! Tana paacca; ta qanth pilgga; ta wozina xeella;
019	PSA	026	003	Ays giikko ne siiqoy ta sinththan dees; tani ne tumateththa ogen hemettays.
019	PSA	026	004	Tani baleththiza asatara issife uttike; lo7o misatiza iitata maabaran gelikke.
019	PSA	026	005	Iita ooththiza asata issifeteththa tani ixxays; kofa asatara issife uttike.
019	PSA	026	006	Abeet GODAWU! Tanan qohoy bayndayssa bessanaas ta kusheza meeccays; histtada yarsho yarshizasoza yuuyays.
019	PSA	026	007	Galata mazamure yexxays; neni ooththida miish ubbaaka yootays.
019	PSA	026	008	Abeet GODAWU! Neni de7iza keeththanne ne bonchchoy aqizasoho tani dosays.
019	PSA	026	009	Tana nagaranchchatara issife pirdofa; as wodhizaytarakka issife ta shemppo dhayssofa.
019	PSA	026	010	Istta kushen iita halchchoy dees; qasse istta ushachcha kushey matta7en kumides.
019	PSA	026	011	Tani gidikko borey baynda duus days; tana wozza; taas qadhetta.
019	PSA	026	012	Ta tohoy dembason eqqides; tani derey shiiqidason GODAA galatana.
019	PSA	027	001	GODAY taas poo7onne tana ashshizayssa; histtiin tani oonas yayyanee? GODAY ta shemppoys attiza miixa; histtiin tani oonas babbanee?
019	PSA	027	002	Iita asati, ta morkketinne ta balgaarati tana wodhanawu taakko hordofi yiza wode, istti baas dhuphettidi kundana.
019	PSA	027	003	Morkke tooray tana dooddizaakkoka ta wozinay yayyenna; olay ta bolla worajjidaakkoka, tani GODAAN ammanettays.
019	PSA	027	004	Tani GODAA issi miish oychchays; hessika tani ta de7o layth ubbaan GODAA keeththan de7anaassa; tani GODAA bonchcho lo7oteththa be7anaassa; iza Keeththankka iza koyashe de7anaassa.
019	PSA	027	005	Hessa gishshas meto gallas izi tana ba dizason genththana; ba dunkaanen tana qotti ashshana; dhoqqa zaalla bollaka izi tana essana.
019	PSA	027	006	He wode tana dooddida ta morkketappe bollara dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana; tani iza Dunkaaneza sinththan ufayssa yarsho yarshana; tani GODAAS diixxananne yexxana.
019	PSA	027	007	Abeet GODAWU! Tani nena xeygiza wode neni taas koya; taas qadhetta; tana siya.
019	PSA	027	008	Neni, «Ta sinththa koyite» gida wode, ta wozinay, «Abeet GODAWU! Eeno; tani ne sinththa koyana» gides.
019	PSA	027	009	Abeet tana ashshiza ta Xoossawu! Neni tana maaddizaade; Ne sinththa taappe genththofa; tana ne aylle hanqettada neeppe haassofa. Tana oloppanne aggofa.
019	PSA	027	010	Ta aawaynne ta aaya tana aggikokka GODAY tana shiishshi ekkana.
019	PSA	027	011	Abeet GODAWU! Ne oge tana tamaarsa; ta morkketa gishshas tana suure ogera kaaleththa.
019	PSA	027	012	Wordo markkati ta bolla makkallateththan dendida; hessa gishshas ne tana istta iita amos aaththa immofa.
019	PSA	027	013	Tani shemppora paxa dashe GODAA kiyateth beyanayssa hidota ooththays.
019	PSA	027	014	GODAAN ammanetta; minna, hidota qanxxofa, GODAAN ammanetta.
019	PSA	028	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ta Zaallawu! Tani nena xeygishin taas sissi ixxofa; ta waassishin ne co7u giikko tani duufon geliza asata mala gidana.
019	PSA	028	002	Ta kusheza ne Geeshsha aqoso miccada woossishinne tana maaddarkki gaada ta waassishin ne siya.
019	PSA	028	003	Ba wozinan iita qoppishe ba laggetara saroteth haasayza iita ooththizaytara tana isttara gaththa efoppa.
019	PSA	028	004	Ne isttas istta iitateththaa malanne istta ooso mala imma; isttas istta kushe ooso mala zaara; istti ooththida iita oosozas halo kessa.
019	PSA	028	005	Istti GODAA oosos wudu gontta ixxida gishshas, iza kushe oosotas soho immontta aggida gishshas, izi istta laallana; zaaridikka keexxenna.
019	PSA	028	006	Ta woosa siyida gishshas, GODAY galatetto.
019	PSA	028	007	GODAY taas wolqqanne gondalle; ta wozinay izan ammaneettes; hessan tani maadettadis; hessa gishshas ta wozinay izan ufayettees; tani iza yeththan sabbana.
019	PSA	028	008	GODAY ba deraas wolqqa; izi ba tiyda kawoza ashshiza miixa.
019	PSA	028	009	GODAWU! Ne deraa ashsha; nees gidizayta anjja; istta heenththanchchay nena gida; neni istta mernaaskka tookka.
019	PSA	029	001	Intteno salon diza medhetatoo! «Bonchchoynne wolqqay GODAASSA» giidi yootite.
019	PSA	029	002	GODAA bonchcho sunththaa galatite; Iza geeshshateththa teemas GODAA goynnite.
019	PSA	029	003	GODAA cenggurssay haaththata bollan siyettees. Bonchcho Xoossay dada mala guummees; GODAY gita haaththata bollan guummees.
019	PSA	029	004	GODAA cenggurssay wolqqama; GODAA gunththay, «Nees hoola!» giissizaaza.
019	PSA	029	005	GODAA cenggurssay ziga miththa menththereththees; Libaanoose zigatakka GODAY menththereththees.
019	PSA	029	006	Libaanoose zumaa galo mara mala buraqissees; Siriyoone zumaakka menththa mala xikisees.
019	PSA	029	007	GODAA cenggurssay wolqqanth popol7u gees.
019	PSA	029	008	GODAA cenggurssay bazzo qaaththees; GODAY Qaadeese Bazzo qaaththees.
019	PSA	029	009	GODAA cenggurssay wolata qaaththees; miththa hayththika qoqofees. Iza Keeththan de7izayti, «Bonchchoy GODAAS gido» geettes.
019	PSA	029	010	GODAY di7o haaththa bolla ba araata woththidi uttides; GODAY ba kawoteththa algan uttidi mernaas haarees.
019	PSA	029	011	GODAY ba deraas wolqqa immees. Ba asaakka saroteththan anjjees.
019	PSA	030	001	Abeet GODAWU! Neni tana ciimmafe kessadasa; ta morkketi ta bolla ufayettontta mala ooththadasa; hessas ta nena dhoqqu dhoqqu histtays.
019	PSA	030	002	Abeet ta GODAWU! Neni tana maaddana mala ta neekko waassadis; nekka tana paththadasa.
019	PSA	030	003	Abeet GODAWU! Tana duufon bontta mala naagadasa; duge ciimma ollan gelontta mala neni tana ashshadasa.
019	PSA	030	004	Intteno Xoossa asatoo! GODAAS yexxite; iza geeshsha sunththaaka sabbite.
019	PSA	030	005	Iza hanqoy guuththa wodessa, gido attiin iza kiyateththi de7o layth ubbaassa; omars yeekkishe aqikkoka maalado zaway baynda ufays gidees.
019	PSA	030	006	Tani woppan diza wode, «Tani mulekka kokkorikke» gadis.
019	PSA	030	007	Abeet GODAWU! Neni taas kiyida wode, tana gita zuma mala minththa essadasa; gido attiin neni ne sinththaa taappe haraso zaarida wode tani dagammadis.
019	PSA	030	008	Abeet GODAWU! Tani nena xeygadis; tani Godaappe maaroteth woossadis;
019	PSA	030	009	«Ta hayqqiko woykko duufon gelikko ne taappe ay demmanee? Biittan gelida asi nena galati erizee? Ne ammaneteththa haasayi erizee?
019	PSA	030	010	Abeet GODAWU! Ta woosa ne siya; taas qadhetta. Abeet GODAWU! Ne taas maado gida» gadis.
019	PSA	030	011	Ta yeeho yeththan laammadasa. Kayo may7oza taappe qaarada ufayssa may7o tana mayzadasa.
019	PSA	030	012	Hessa gishshas tani nena sabbanaappe attiin co7u giikke. Abeet ta GODAWU! Tani nena mernaas galatana.
019	PSA	031	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ne taas kuwa gidana mala ta neekko yadis; aydekka tana yeellasoppa; ne xilloteththan tana ashsha.
019	PSA	031	002	Ne hayththa taakko zaara; eeson tana ashsha; neni tana genththiza zaalla gida; tana ashshiza mino miixa taas gida.
019	PSA	031	003	Ee, neni taas zaalla; ta izan gela attiza miixa; ne sunththa gishshas tani baana oge bessanne kaaleththa.
019	PSA	031	004	Neni taas zemppo gidiza gishshas, istti taas waaxi woththida narxafe tana ne naaga.
019	PSA	031	005	Abeet GODAWU tumu Xoossawu! tani ta shemppo ne kushen hadara immays; neni tana wozza.
019	PSA	031	006	Paththontta eeqatas goynnizayta tani ixxays; tani gidikko GODAAN ammanettays.
019	PSA	031	007	Ta meto neni be7ida gishshassinne ta tuggaa neni erida gishshas tani ne siiqon ufayettays.
019	PSA	031	008	Neni tana ta morkketas aaththa aaththa immabeekka; ta tohotakka aaho sohon essadasa.
019	PSA	031	009	Abeet GODAWU! Tani meton geladis; taas qadhetta. Tani daro mishettadis; ta ayfey, ta ashoynne ta shemppoy daaburdes.
019	PSA	031	010	Ta shemppoya waayen daaburadus; ta layththayka ceecen wurides. Meto daron ta wolqqay cingides; ta meqeththatikka giddon seerida.
019	PSA	031	011	Ta morkketa ubbaas tani qidhe miish gidadis; ta shoorotas miires attadis; tana erizaytas kadhes gidadis; ogen tana be7idaytikka taappe baqateettes.
019	PSA	031	012	Tani hayqqida asa mala dogettadis; mooho oto mala gidadis.
019	PSA	031	013	Tani daroti saasukettishin siyadis; dagamay Ubbasora dees; istti ta bolla genen duulateettes; tana wodhanawukka maqetteettes.
019	PSA	031	014	Gido attiin GODAWU! Tani nenan ammanettada, «Neni ta Xoossa» gays.
019	PSA	031	015	Ta de7o layththay ne kushenna; tana gooddiza ta morkketa kusheppe ne tana ashsha.
019	PSA	031	016	Ne aylleza bolla ne sinththa poo7isa; ne maaroteththan tana ashsha.
019	PSA	031	017	Abeet GODAWU! Tani nena xeygays; tana yeellasoppa; iitati gidikko yeellatetto; duge duufon gelidi sirphi getto.
019	PSA	031	018	Xilloza bolla otoron, kadheninne xalateththan haasayza gishshas wordanchchata doona duudisa.
019	PSA	031	019	Nenan zemppanaas neekko shiiqidaytassinne nees yayyizaytas neni asaa sinththan isttas immana gaada minjja woththida kiyateththi ay mala daroo!
019	PSA	031	020	Neni istta ne keeththan genththada asaa maqqofe ashshaasa; neni istta ne dizason qottada iita inxarsafe naagaasa.
019	PSA	031	021	Tani morkkey dooddi oykkida katamaa giddon diza wode izi malalisiza ba maaroteth tana bessida gishshas GODAY galatetto.
019	PSA	031	022	Tani dagammada, «Ne sinththafe kichchadis» gadis. Gido attiin tana maaddana mala nena ta xeygida wode ta waasoza neni siyadasa.
019	PSA	031	023	Intteno Xoossa asatoo! GODAA siiqite. GODAY izan ammanettizayta naagees; gido attiin otoranchchatas isttas bessiza qixaate immees.
019	PSA	031	024	Intte hidota GODAAN ooththidaytoo! Beeggitenne minnite.
019	PSA	032	001	Iza mooroy atto geetettidayssinne iza nagaray kamettiday anjjettidayssa.
019	PSA	032	002	GODAY iza nagara qoodonttaadeynne iza qofan baleththoy baynday anjjettidayssa.
019	PSA	032	003	Tani ta nagara paaxontta dashe gallas kumeth ceeciin ta asateththay daaburdes.
019	PSA	032	004	Gallassinne qamma ne kushey ta bolla deexxides; haaththi bone awan micciza mala ta wolqqay cingi wurides.
019	PSA	032	005	Tani ta nagara nees paaxadis; ta qohidayssa neeppe genththabeekke; «Ta mooroza GODAAS paaxana» gadis. Histtiin ne ta nagara ubbaa atto gadasa.
019	PSA	032	006	Hessa gishshas xillo asi neni beettiza wode nena woosso; di7oy izi diza heera meecci efikkoka iza bochchenna.
019	PSA	032	007	Neni taas qotettizaso; neni tana metoppe naagaasa; tana xoono yeththan kunththadasa.
019	PSA	032	008	GODAY, «Tani nena tamaarsana; neni baanaas bessiza ogekka nena erisana; tani nena zorananne naagana.
019	PSA	032	009	Bixalaninne puulon haarettiza akeekay baynda baqulo mala woykko para mala intte hanopite» gees.
