019	PSA	063	005	Asi lo7o kath mi kallidi ufayettiza mala ta shemppoya nenan ufayettana; tani ta inxarsan ufayssa yeththan nena galatana.
019	PSA	063	006	Tani ta hiixan dashe nena hassa7ays; omarsa kumeth ne ooso yuushsha qoppays;
019	PSA	063	007	Neni tana maaddiza gishshas tani ne qefe kuwan uttada ufayssan yexxays.
019	PSA	063	008	Ta shemppoya shiphphi ga kaalladus; ne ushachcha kusheykka tana minththi oykkides.
019	PSA	063	009	Gido attiin tana wodhana koyzayti biitta garsan ciimma ollan moogettana.
019	PSA	063	010	Istti mashshas aadhdhi imettana; istti godare kawo gidana.
019	PSA	063	011	Gido attiin kawoy Xoossan ufayettana; Xoossa sunththan caaqqiza ubbay iza galatana; wordo haasayzayta doonay gidikko gordettana.
019	PSA	064	001	Abeet Xoossawu! Ta magana neni siya; ta shemppoyo wodhanaas mandiza ta morkketappe tana ashsha.
019	PSA	064	002	Pala asata maqqofenne makkallanchchata duulatappe tana genththa.
019	PSA	064	003	Istti bantta inxarsaa mashsha mala leefida; qasse marze qaalata wondafe yiishsha mala dukkanaas giigsida.
019	PSA	064	004	Istti qotettidi bantta wondafen xillo as dukkeettes; asi akeekontta dishin dukkanaas guye geettenna.
019	PSA	064	005	Istti iita ooththanaas issoy issaara maqetteettes; geemara woximade woththanaas zoretteettes; istti, «Nuna ooni be7anee?» geettes.
019	PSA	064	006	Istti gene maqettishe, «Nuni lo7o maqqo maqettidos» geettes; hessika asa wozinaynne kahay iitan kumidayssa bessees.
019	PSA	064	007	Gido attiin Xoossay istta ba yiishshan dukkana; istti akeekontta madunththana.
019	PSA	064	008	Izi istti haasayda qaala istta bolla zaarana; isttaka bashshan gaththana; istta be7ida ubbay aamusidi hu7e qaaththana.
019	PSA	064	009	He wode asay ubbay Xoossas yayyana; Xoossa ooso qonccen yootana; izi ooththidayssaka yuushshi qoppana.
019	PSA	064	010	Xilloti GODAAN ufayetetto; izakka baas baqati attizaso ooththetto; wozina suureti ubbay iza galatetto.
019	PSA	065	001	Abeet Xoossawu! Xiyoonen nees galatay bessees; nuni nees adinettidayssa gaththana.
019	PSA	065	002	Abeet woosa siyizayssoo! Asay ubbay neekko yaana.
019	PSA	065	003	Nu nagaray nuna mittides; neni gidikko nu balaa atto ga wursadasa.
019	PSA	065	004	Neni dooridaadeynne nenara daana mala ne dubbushaakko shiishsha ekkidaadey anjjettidaade; ne geeshshasozappenne ne dunkaane anjjozappe nu kallana.
019	PSA	065	005	Abeet nuna ashshiza Xoossawu ne xillo ooson malalisiza miish nuus ooththa; Sa7aa gaxappe gaxa gakkanaas, haaho abbatappeka he pinththan diza asa ubbaas hidotay nena.
019	PSA	065	006	Neni ne wolqqa gixettadasa; zumatakka ne minththa essadasa.
019	PSA	065	007	Neni abba giirissanne dambala gunththa sirphi ooththaasa; qasse derey dendiza denththa irxxisaasa.
019	PSA	065	008	Hessaththo neni ooththida malaata gishshas, sa7a gaxa gakkanaas de7iza asay ubbay nees, «Hoola!» gees. Arshey mokkizasoppe wullizaso gakkanaas diza asa ubbaa ufayssan ilili giissadasa.
019	PSA	065	009	Neni biitta naagada haath ushshaasa; histtada daro duresaasa; Asas kaththay mokkana mala Xoossa shaafay haaththan kumides; hessaththo ooththada neni giigsadasa.
019	PSA	065	010	Goshsha gadetas gidiza ira immaasa; Phasheta liiqisaasa; biittaaka puuse iran shugisaasa; caarechchati doli diccana mala anjjaasa.
019	PSA	065	011	Layththaa kalo layth ooththaasa; neni aadhdhidaso ubbay kath xalla gidees.
019	PSA	065	012	Mehe heemmizasohon cilila maatay kumides; zumbullati ufayssan kumida.
019	PSA	065	013	Dembatan wude mehey kumides; shoobbatan kaththi kumides; ubbatikka ufayssan ililishe yexxeettes.
019	PSA	066	001	Sa7an diza as ubbay intte qaala dhoqqisidi ililisan Xoossa galatite.
019	PSA	066	002	«Xoossa sunththi bonchchetto!» giidi yexxite; bonchcho galata izas immite.
019	PSA	066	003	Xoossas, «Ne oosoti ay keena malalisizoo! Ne wolqqay daro gidida gishshas ne morkketi yashshan ne sinththan kokkoreettes.
019	PSA	066	004	Sa7an diza ubbay nees goynnees; nena sabbees; ne sunththas galata mazamure yexxees» giite.
019	PSA	066	005	Haa yiite; Xoossi ooththidaaz be7ite; izi asa giddon malalisiza ooso ooththides.
019	PSA	066	006	Izi abba haaththa shaakkides; qasse beni nu aawati shaafara mela biittara tohon pinnida; nunikka izi ooththida ooson ufayettidos.
019	PSA	066	007	Izi ba wolqqan mernaas haarees. Kawoteththata ubbaaka ba ayfen xeellees; hessa gishshas makkallizayti iza bolla dhoqqu dhoqqu gooppetto.
019	PSA	066	008	Asawu! Nu Xoossa galatite; intte galata cenggurssay siyetto.
019	PSA	066	009	Izi nuna shemppora paxa woththides; nuni kundontta malakka naagides.
019	PSA	066	010	Abeet Xoossawu! Neni nuna paacca xeelladasa; bira seerisi geeshshiza mala nuna geeshshadasa.
019	PSA	066	011	Neni nuna woximaden gelththadasa; Nu zokkonkka deexo ba7o ba7isadasa.
019	PSA	066	012	Nu morkketi nuna hu7era duge yedhdhana mala ooththadasa; nuni haaththa giddoranne tama giddora kanththidos; gido attiin ha7i nuna ishalo soho ehadasa.
019	PSA	066	013	Tani xuugettiza yarshora ne geeshshasoho gelada ta adina nees gaththana.
019	PSA	066	014	Tani metotida wode ta doonappe ta kessidayssa ta inxarsan ta adinettida adina ta gaththana.
019	PSA	066	015	Tani nees xuugettiza yarshos modhdhota shiishshana; sawo yarshos dharshota, kormatanne korbeta shiishshana.
019	PSA	066	016	Intteno Xoossas yayyizaytoo! Ubbati haa yiidi siyite; Xoossi taas ooththidayssa tani inttes yootana.
019	PSA	066	017	Ta qaala dhoqqu histtada tani izakko waassadis; ta inxarsankka izas galata shiishshadis.
019	PSA	066	018	Tani ta wozinan nagara genththidaakko, Goday ta woosa siyenna.
019	PSA	066	019	Gido attiin Xoossi tumappe taas siyides; ta woosaakka ezgides.
019	PSA	066	020	Ta woosa kadhontta, ba mernaa siiqo taappe haassontta Xoossay galatetto.
019	PSA	067	001	Xoossi nuus qadhettonne nuna anjjo; ba ayfeso nu bolla poo7iso.
019	PSA	067	002	Ne ogeti sa7a bollan, ashshiza ne wolqqayka kawoteththata ubbaa giddon erettetto.
019	PSA	067	003	Abeet Xoossawu! Asay nena galato; kawoteth ubbay nees galata shiishsho.
019	PSA	067	004	Neni asas suureteththan pirdiza gishshas sa7a bollaka ne deraa kaaleththiza gishshas kawoteththati ufayetetto; ililishekka nees yexxetto.
019	PSA	067	005	Abeet Xoossawu! Asay nena galato; kawoteth ubbay nees galata shiishsho.
019	PSA	067	006	Biittay kath immana; Xoossi, nu Xoossay nuna anjjana.
019	PSA	067	007	Xoossi nuna anjjana; Sa7a gaxa gakkanaas diza asay ubbay izas yayyana.
019	PSA	068	001	Xoossi dendo; iza morkketi laalettetto; iza ixxizayti iza sinththafe baqatetto.
019	PSA	068	002	Cuway carkon laalettiza mala neni istta laalla; muqaadday taman seeriza mala, iitati Xoossa sinththafe seeri dhayetto.
019	PSA	068	003	Xilloti gidikko ufayetetto; Xoossa sinththan ufayssan hombocetto; qasseka maguletto.
019	PSA	068	004	Xoossas yexxite; iza sunththas galata mazamure yexxite. Shaara bollara hemettizayssa dhoqqu dhoqqu histtite; izas sunththay GODAA; intteka iza sinththan keehi ufayettite.
019	PSA	068	005	Xoossi ba geeshshasohon dishe aaway bayndaytas aawa; qasse am7etaska pirdiza daanna.
019	PSA	068	006	Xoossi barkka diza bizzatas soo as immees; qasho keeththan dizayta birshidi istta ishalon woththees. Makkallanchchati gidikko suulliza bazzon de7ana.
019	PSA	068	007	Abeet Xoossawu! Neni ne asa kaaleththida wode, neni isttara bazzo kanththida wode,
019	PSA	068	008	Siina Xoossa sinththan, Isra7eele Xoossa sinththan biittay qaaxxides; saloti ira duge tigida.
019	PSA	068	009	Abeet Xoossawu! Neni koshshiza keena ira immadasa; ladda biittaaka araddisadasa.
019	PSA	068	010	Ne derezikka izo baas duussaso histtida; abeet Xoossawu! Manqotas koshshizaaz neni kiyateththan immadasa.
019	PSA	068	011	Goday qaala yeddides; he kiitaa daro maccassati deraas awajjida.
019	PSA	068	012	Istti, «Kawoti ba olanchchatara di7o gishetti ekkida.
019	PSA	068	013	Dorsata naaganaas guyen attidayti birappe oosettida qefeti bollara xolqiza worqqan tiyettida haraphphe misle demmida» gida.
019	PSA	068	014	Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay kawota laallida wode, Xalmoone Zuma bolla shach bukisides.
019	PSA	068	015	Baasaane zumati wogga gita zumata; Baasaane zumata bolla daro poggonoti deettes.
019	PSA	068	016	Daro poggonoti de7iza zumatoo! Xoossi daanaas doorida zumaza intte ays miqqaynen xeelleetii? GODAY izan mernaas de7ana.
019	PSA	068	017	Xoossa para-gaareti daro shiyan qoodettizayta; Goday Siina zumaappe ba geeshshasoho yides.
019	PSA	068	018	GODAWU! Di7o ekkada pude ne duussas kezadasa; asa ubbaafe imota ekkadasa; haray attoshin makkallanchchatappeka ekkadasa;
019	PSA	068	019	Hach hach nu tooho tookkiza Goday, nuna ashshiza nu Xoossay galatetto.
019	PSA	068	020	Be7ite! Nu Xoossi ashshiza Xoossa! Hayqoppe attana dandayettizay GODAY ashshiina.
019	PSA	068	021	Xoossi tumappe ba morkketa hu7e kinchchana; nagara ogen hemettiza goofaranchchata hu7e qoo7ereththana.
019	PSA	068	022	Goday, «Tani intte morkketa Baasaaneppe zaarada ehana; tani istta ciimma abba giddofe kessada guye zaarana.
019	PSA	068	023	Neni ne morkketa suuth yedhdha aadhdhana; ne kanatikka morkketa suuththafe bantta gisha laaccana» gides.
019	PSA	068	024	Abeet Xoossawu! Ne xoono cifray ubbaan beettees; ta Xoossanne ta kawoy azhaban ba geeshsha soo gelththishe qonccees.
019	PSA	068	025	Yexxizayti sinththan, qasse karabe baqqiza geela7oti giddon, diixxizayti guyen azhabi beetteettes.
019	PSA	068	026	Istti, «Xoossaa kumeththa shiiqon galatite; intteno Isra7eele zereththato GODAA galatite» geettes.
019	PSA	068	027	He cifran ubbaafe kaalotiza Biniyaame zareti kaaleththeettes. Kaallidi Yuhuda daannati bantta butten butten beettes; wurseththan Zaabiloone daannatinne Niftaaleme daannati kaalleettes.
019	PSA	068	028	Abeet Xoossawu! Ne wolqqa qonccisa. Hayssafe kase ne nuus ooththidayssaththo ha7ikka ne minoteth nuna bessa.
019	PSA	068	029	Yerusalaamen diza ne Keeththa gishshas kawoti imota nees ekki yaana.
019	PSA	068	030	Maqqa giddon diza do7ata neni seera. Booratanne marata wude misatiza kawota neni laalla; istti gulbatidi bantta bira nees giirana mala ooththa; olettanaas yeemottiza asata laalla.
019	PSA	068	031	Gita asati Gibxeppe yaana; Tophphiyay ba kushe Xoossako miccana.
019	PSA	068	032	Intteno sa7a kawoteththatoo! Xoossas yexxite; Godaas galata mazamure shiishshite.
