019	PSA	068	035	Abeet Xoossawu! Neni ne keeththafe qonccashe malalisaasa; Isra7eele Xoossay ba deraas minoteththinne wolqqa immees. Xoossi galatetto.
019	PSA	069	001	Abeet Xoossawu! Haaththa kixay taas qoodhe gakkida gishshas ne tana ashsha.
019	PSA	069	002	Tohoy eqqizasoy baynda caren mitettadis; ciimma haaththa giddo geladis; haaththa dambalay tana mittana hanees.
019	PSA	069	003	Tani maado demmanaas waassashe daaburadis; taas qoodhe poorandeyka melides. Ta Xoossa naagon dishin ta ayfey baljumides.
019	PSA	069	004	Tana mela coo ixxizayti ta hu7e binanappe daro. Wordora tana morkkizaytinne tana dhayssanawu koyzayti darida. Ta kaysa ekkontta miish tana qanxxa gida.
019	PSA	069	005	Abeet Xoossawu! Ta eeyateththa neni eraasa; ta ooththida nagaray neeppe qotettibeenna.
019	PSA	069	006	Abeet Godawu, Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAWU! Nena hidota ooththidayti yeellatopetto; Abeet Isra7eele Xoossawu! Nena minththi koyzayti ta gaason kawuyofetto.
019	PSA	069	007	Tani cash ne gishshas gaada dandayadis; ta ayfesoy yeellatides.
019	PSA	069	008	Tani ta ishanttas imath, qasse ta aayey naytas allaga gidadis.
019	PSA	069	009	Tani ne keeththas mishettiza mishoy tana tama mala xuuggees; Asay nena cayida cashshay tana gakkides.
019	PSA	069	010	Ta xoomashe yeekkadis; hessankka ta qidhettadis.
019	PSA	069	011	Tani kayo may7o may7adis; isttaskka tani tosses attadis.
019	PSA	069	012	Tani katama geliza pengen uttizaytas zigirsas attadis; maththottizaytas yeththas gidadis.
019	PSA	069	013	Abeet GODAWU! Tani gidikko nena woossays. Abeet Xoossawu! Ne doorida wode ta woosa siya; ne mernaa siiqon ne ashshiza ashoza tana bessa.
019	PSA	069	014	Caren mitettontta mala tana ashsha. Tana ixxizaytappe tana naaga; ciimma haaththafekka tana ashsha.
019	PSA	069	015	Di7o haaththi tana efoppo; ciimma abbay tana mittofo; ciimma ollay ta bolla woddofo.
019	PSA	069	016	Abeet GODAWU! Ne mernaa siiqo kiyateththa mala taas zaaro imma; Ne qadheta daron taakko simma.
019	PSA	069	017	Taappe ne ayllezappe ne sinththa genththofa; tani waayettiza gishshas taas eeson zaaro imma.
019	PSA	069	018	Neni taakko shiiqada tana wozza; ta morkketappekka tana kessa la7a yedda.
019	PSA	069	019	Ta bolla gakkida cashsha, yeellateththaanne kawushshateththaa ne eraasa; ta morkketakka hu7en hu7en ne demmaasa.
019	PSA	069	020	Cashshi ta wozina madunththiin ta hidota qanxxadis. Taas qadhettiza as koyadis; gido attiin issi asikka deenna. Tana minththeththiza as koyadis; gido attiin issaadeka demmabeekke.
019	PSA	069	021	Tani gafida wode taas cammiza kath immida. Tani saamettida wode taas caala phanqida ushshu immida.
019	PSA	069	022	Istti miza maadday isttas woximade gido. Istti yarsho yarshidi miza maadday isttas gite gido.
019	PSA	069	023	Xeellontta mala istta ayfey goozetto; istta zokkoy quunni atto.
