019	PSA	069	028	Istti de7o maxaafappe qucettetto; xillotara issife mazgabettofetto.
019	PSA	069	029	Gido attiin tani sakettashenne waayettashe de7ays. Abeet Xoossawu! Ne tana ashshadanne naaga.
019	PSA	069	030	Tani Xoossa sunththa yeththan galatana; galata yeththan iza gitateththaa qonccisana.
019	PSA	069	031	Hayssi sangettontta boorappenne korma yarshofe aadhdhidi GODAA ufayssana.
019	PSA	069	032	Qohettidayti tana Xoossay ashshidayssa be7idi ufayetetto. Intteno Xoossako shiiqizayto intte wozinay minetto.
019	PSA	069	033	Ays giikko GODAY hiyeesata siyees; qasho keeththan de7iza ba asaakka kadhenna.
019	PSA	069	034	Saloynne sa7ay, abbaynne iza giddon woxxi qaaxxiza ubbati Xoossaa galatetto.
