019	PSA	099	003	Gitanne keehippe yashissiza ne sunththa istti ubbay sabbetto! izi dumma!
019	PSA	099	004	Tuma pirda dosiza wolqqama kawo! neni suureteththas yoch yeggadasa; neni Yaaqoobes tumu pirdanne xilloteth essadasa.
019	PSA	099	005	Izi dumma gidida gishshas GODAA nu Xoossaa dhoqqu dhoqqu histtite; iza toho garsankka gufannidi izas goynnite.
019	PSA	099	006	Iza qeeseta giddofe Museynne Aarooney deettes; Sameelikka iza sunththan woossidaytappe issaa; istti GODAAS waassida; izikka istta waaso allides.
019	PSA	099	007	Izi shaara tuussa giddora isttas haasaydes; istti izi immida maaraanne woga naagida.
019	PSA	099	008	Abeet GODAWU, nu Xoossawu! neni istta woosa siyadasa; neni istta iitateththaa gishshas qaxxaydaa gidikkoka isttas atto gida Xoossa.
019	PSA	099	009	GODAA nu Xoossaa dhoqqu dhoqqu histtite; iza geeshsha zuma bollan izas goynnite; ays giikko GODAA nu Xoossay geeshsha Xoossa.
019	PSA	100	001	Sa7an de7iza as ubbay GODAAS ufayssan ililite.
019	PSA	100	002	GODAAS ufayssan haggazite; ufayssa yeththara iza sinth shiiqite.
019	PSA	100	003	GODAY Xoossa gididayssa erite; nuna medhdhiday iza; nuni izayta; nuni iza asati izi heemmiza dorsa wudeta.
019	PSA	100	004	Iza penge galatara, iza zago sabara gelite; iza galatite; iza sunththaaka anjjite.
019	PSA	100	005	Ays giikko GODAY kiya; iza siiqoy mernaassa; iza ammaneteththay yeletappe yeleta gakkanaassa.
019	PSA	101	001	Tani ne siiqo gishshassinne tuma pirda gishshas yexxana; abeet GODAWU! Tani nees galata mazamure yexxana.
019	PSA	101	002	Tani suure oge kaallana; neni taakko awude yaanee? Tani ta keeththan suureteththan daana.
019	PSA	101	003	Tani ta ayfera iita miish xeellike; Xoossafe kare kezida asata ooso ixxays; tani isttara mulekka zuppetikke.
019	PSA	101	004	Wozina geellati taappe haakketto; iitateththara taas gaytoteththi deenna.
019	PSA	101	005	Geeman ba lagge zigirzayssa tani sirphi ooththana; otorettizayssinne ceeqettiza as tani co7u ga aggike.
019	PSA	101	006	Istti tanara daana mala biitta bolla de7iza ammanettizayta tani lo7o ayfen xeellays. Suureteththan hemettiza asi taas haggazana.
019	PSA	101	007	Cimo ooththizay oonikka ta keeththan deenna; wordo haasayzay ta sinththan eqqenna.
019	PSA	101	008	Biittan de7iza iita as ubbaa tani hach hach dhayssana; iita ooththizayta ubbaa tani GODAA katamappe dhoqalla dhayssana.
019	PSA	102	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ta woosa siya; ta waasoy neekko gakko.
019	PSA	102	002	Ta metotida gallas ne sinththa taappe genththofa; ne hayththa taakko zaara; tani neekko waassiza wode taas eeson alla.
019	PSA	102	003	Ays giikko ta layththay cuwa mala dhayees; ta meqeththaykka tama bonqo mala eexxees.
019	PSA	102	004	Ta wozinay away labida maata mala handes; taas qoodhey kath ixxides.
019	PSA	102	005	Taas oole daroppe dendoyssan meqeththi xalla attides.
019	PSA	102	006	Tani bazzon diza biya kafo woykko laalettida keeththan de7iza gutto mala.
019	PSA	102	007	Tani ichchiin dhiskoy yeenna; tani keeththa hu7en barkka uttida kafo mala gidadis.
019	PSA	102	008	Ta morkketi ubbaa gallas tana cayeettes; tana iiseththizayti ta sunth qanggettida mala qoodida.
019	PSA	102	009	Tani bidinth dhiille mala qam7adis; ta afunththaaka ushshara walakka uyadis.
019	PSA	102	010	Ne hanqo gaasoninne ne bosha gaason ne tana pude denththoosoppe duge oladasa.
019	PSA	102	011	Ta de7o layththay omarsa wode kuwa mala; tani maata mala meladis.
019	PSA	102	012	Gido attiin abeet GODAWU! Neni kawoteththa araatan mernaas uttadasa; ne sunththayka yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas hassa7ettana.
019	PSA	102	013	Neni Xiyoonis kiyateth ooththiza wodey gakkida gishshassinne wodezikka ha7i gidida gishshas neni dendada izis qadhettana.
019	PSA	102	014	Ne oosanchchati izan diza shuchchata doseettes; budhettida biittaska qadhetteettes.
019	PSA	102	015	Kawoteththati GODAA sunththaas yayyana; sa7a kawoti ubbay iza bonchchana.
019	PSA	102	016	GODAY Xiyoono zaari essiza wode izi ba gitateththa bessana.
019	PSA	102	017	Izi hiyeesata woosaa siyana; istta shoobbeka kadhenna.
019	PSA	102	018	Buron yelettanay GODAA galatana mala hayssi yiza yeletas xaafetto.
019	PSA	102	019	GODAY dhoqqan diza ba geeshsha sohoppe duge xeellides; izi saloppe duge sa7a be7ides.
019	PSA	102	020	Hessika qashettida asata waaso siyanaassinne hayqos pirdettida asata qashoppe birshanaassa.
019	PSA	102	021	Hessa gishshas GODAA sunththi Xiyoonin yootettana; iza galatay Yerusalaamen awajjettana.
019	PSA	102	022	Deretinne kawoti issife shiiqidi GODAAS he wode goynnana.
019	PSA	102	023	Izi tani naateteththan dishin, izi ta minoteththaa ogen ashshides; ta daana layththaaka qaanththides.
019	PSA	102	024	Histtiin tani, «Abeet ta Xoossawu! tani daana layththaa buro baggasishin ne tana ekkofa. Abeet GODAWU! Neni yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas daasa» gays.
019	PSA	102	025	Neni beni sa7a medhdhadasa; salotikka ne kushe ooso.
019	PSA	102	026	Heyti ubbay dhayana; gido attiin neni minna daana; istti ubbayka afala mala wurana; neni istta carqqa mala laammana; isttika aadhdhana.
019	PSA	102	027	Gido attiin awudekka neni nena; ne layththay mulekka wurenna.
019	PSA	102	028	Nees ooththizayta nayti saroteththan daana; istta zereththayka ne sinththan minni eqqana.
019	PSA	103	001	Ta shemppoyee! GODAA galata! Ta kumeththa asateththay iza geeshsha sunththa galato.
019	PSA	103	002	Ta shemppoyee! GODAA galata! Izi nees ooththida kiyateththa ubbaa dogoppa.
019	PSA	103	003	Izi ne nagara ubbaa atto gees; izi ne harge ubbaafe nena paththees.
019	PSA	103	004	Izi nena duufon gelontta mala ashshees; mernaa siiqoninne maarotan nena anjjees.
019	PSA	103	005	Golle kafoththo neni ooraxana mala izi ne amo ubbaa lo7o miishshan kunththana.
019	PSA	103	006	GODAY naaqettidaytas xillo ooththeessinne suure pirda pirdees.
019	PSA	103	007	Izi ba oge Muse bessides; ba oosokka Isra7eele asaa erisides.
019	PSA	103	008	GODAY qadhettizaadenne maarizaade; izi hanqettanaas eesotonttaade; iza siiqoy keehippe daro.
019	PSA	103	009	Izi ubba wode nu mooros mootenna; mernaaskka hanqettenna.
019	PSA	103	010	Izi nu nagara mala nuus ooththibeenna; nu iitateththaa mala nuus zaaribeenna.
019	PSA	103	011	Saloy sa7appe dhoqqiza mala GODAAS yayyizaytas iza siiqoy gita.
019	PSA	103	012	Arshey mokkizasoppe wullizasoy haakkiza mala GODAY nu mooroza nuuppe haassides.
019	PSA	103	013	Aaway ba naytas qadhettiza mala GODAY baas yayyizaytas qadhettees.
019	PSA	103	014	Nuni aazappe medhettidaakko izi erees; nuni biitta gididayssaka izi akeekees.
019	PSA	103	015	Asa de7oy gidikko maata mala; izi bazzo ciishsha mala ciiyees.
019	PSA	103	016	Carkoy carkiza wode qoqofetti dhayees; izi kase dizasoy mulekka erettenna.
019	PSA	103	017	Gido attiin GODAAS yayyizaytas iza siiqoy mernaappe mernaa gakkanaassa; iza xilloteththayka yeletappe yeleta gakkanaassa.
019	PSA	103	018	Hessi hananay iza caaqo qaala naagizaytassinne iza azazo polanaas minettizaytassa.
019	PSA	103	019	GODAY ba araataa salon essides; iza kawoteththay ubbaa haarees.
019	PSA	103	020	Intteno iza kiitanchchatoo! Iza azazo poliza wolqqamatoo! Izi gizayssa ezgizaytoo! GODAA galatite.
019	PSA	103	021	Intteno salon de7iza minotoo! Iza shene ooththiza aylletoo! GODAA galatite.
019	PSA	103	022	Intteno izi haariza soho ubbaan de7iza medhetatoo! ubbayka GODAA galatite. Ta shemppoyee! GODAA galata.
019	PSA	104	001	Ta shemppoyee! GODAA ta Xoossa galata! Abeet GODAA ta Xoossawu! Neni ay keena gitaa! Neni bonchchonne teema may7adasa.
019	PSA	104	002	Neni afala mala poo7o quma7adasa; salotakka dunkaane mala toladasa.
019	PSA	104	003	Ne keeththaa salo gufanththo bollan keexxadasa; shaara nees para-gaare kessadasa; carko qefe toggada baasa.
019	PSA	104	004	Neni carkota ne kiitanchcha, tama lacokka ne aylle kessaasa.
019	PSA	104	005	Neni sa7a yochcha bolla essadasa; izi meri mernaaskka qaaxxenna.
019	PSA	104	006	Wogga gita abba biitta bollan afala mala miccadasa; haaththika gita zumata kammides.
019	PSA	104	007	Gido attiin ne seeriin haaththati kichchida; ne azazo siyidi eeson baqatida.
019	PSA	104	008	Istti gita zumatappe duge shoobbata wodhdhida; neni isttas giigsidaso goggida.
019	PSA	104	009	Haaththati simmidi biitta kammontta mala, istti aadhdhontta mala zawa essadasa.
019	PSA	104	010	Neni pulttota shoobban pulttisaasa; haath zumata giddora duge gogissaasa.
019	PSA	104	011	Bazzo do7ati ubbay izappe uyeettes; harididatikka saamos izappe uyi aleettes.
019	PSA	104	012	Salo kafoti haaththaa matan bantta keeththa keexxeettes; miththa haggata giddonkka yexxeettes.
019	PSA	104	013	Neni gita zumata bollan saloppe ira bukisaasa; biittaaka ne kushe ooso ayfen kunththadasa.
019	PSA	104	014	Neni mehes maata, asas kath mokisaasa; hessan asay biitta ooththidi kath shiishshees.
019	PSA	104	015	Asa wozina ufayssiza woyne, sinth shicissiza zaytenne wolqqa immiza kath demmees.
019	PSA	104	016	GODAA miththati, izi tokkida Libaanoose zigati daro ira uyi kalleettes.
019	PSA	104	017	Isttan kafoti bantta keeth keexxeettes; zigiletikka ziga bolla keexxidi de7eettes.
019	PSA	104	018	Dhoqqa zumata bollan Wushati de7eettes; qasse guppaleti shuchcha gongolon qotetteettes.
019	PSA	104	019	Wodaa qooda erisanaas neni agina medhdhadasa; arshey ba wulliza wode erees.
019	PSA	104	020	Neni dhuma ehiza wode sa7ay qammees; wora do7atikka kezidi woxeretteettes.
019	PSA	104	021	Wodalla gaammoti maana miishshas waasseettes; istti banttas miza miish Xoossafe koyeettes.
019	PSA	104	022	Arshey mokkiza wode guye simmidi bantta aqoson ichcheettes.
019	PSA	104	023	He wode asi ba oosos kezees; sa7ay qammana gakkanaas ooththees.
019	PSA	104	024	Abeet GODAWU! Ne oosoy ay keena daroo! Ne aadho erateththan neni istta ubbaa medhdhadasa; ne medhdhida medhetati biitta kumida.
019	PSA	104	025	Hanna abbaya gitanne aaho; qooday baynda qaaxxiza medheteththati, guuththatinne gitati izin kumida.
019	PSA	104	026	Izi bollan markabeti simeretteettes; qasse neni medhdhida Lewataane geetettiza miiminttey izin kaa7ees.
019	PSA	104	027	Koshshiza wode ne isttas mizaaz immana mala istti ubbay neekko xeelleettes.
019	PSA	104	028	Neni isttas immida wode istti shiishsheettes; neni ne kusheppe yeggiin istti lo7o miish kalleettes.
019	PSA	104	029	Neni ne sinththa genththiza wode dagammeettes; ne istta shemppo ekkiza wode hayqqeettes; duge biittankka simmi geleettes.
019	PSA	104	030	Gido attiin neni isttas ne ayana kiittida wode harati medhetteettes; biittaaka ooraxissaasa.
019	PSA	104	031	GODAA bonchchoy mernaas de7o; GODAY ba ooson ufayetto.
019	PSA	104	032	Izi biitta xeelliin biittay qaaxxees; qasse izi zumata bochchiin zumati cuwatteettes.
019	PSA	104	033	Tani de7iza layth ubbaan GODAAS yexxana; tani shemppora paxa de7ida wode ubbaan ta Xoossas yexxana.
019	PSA	104	034	Tani GODAAN ufayettiza gishshas ta wozina qofay iza ufaysso.
019	PSA	104	035	Nagaranchchati biittafe dhayetto; hayssafe sinththas iitati dooppetto. Ta shemppoyee! GODAA galata! GODAA galata!
019	PSA	105	001	GODAA galatite; iza sunththa xeygite; izi ooththida oosota kawoteththata erisite.
019	PSA	105	002	Izas ginxo giigsite; galata yeththika yexxite; malalisiza iza ooso ubbaa yootite.
019	PSA	105	003	Geeshsha sunththan izayssan ceeqettite; GODAA koyzayta wozinay ufayetto.
019	PSA	105	004	GODAANNE iza wolqqa xomosite; ubbato iza sinththa koyite.
019	PSA	105	005	Intteno iza aylle Abrahaame zereththatoo! Doorettida Yaaqoobe naytoo! Izi ooththida malalisiza oosota, iza malaatanne izi pirdida pirda akeekite.
019	PSA	105	007	Izi GODAA nu Xoossaa; iza suure pirdayka sa7a ubbaa bolla dees.
019	PSA	105	008	Izi ba caaqo qaala mernaas ba azazida qaala shii yeleta gakkanaas naagees.
019	PSA	105	009	Izi Abrahaames caaqqida caaqo qaala, Yisaaqas immida qaala balenna.
019	PSA	105	010	Hessa Yaaqoobes woga, Isra7eelesikka mernaa caaqo qaala histtidi minththi essides.
019	PSA	105	011	Qasseka, «Nees Kanaane biittaa immana; izikka ne zereththatas laata gidana» gides.
019	PSA	105	012	Istti qoodan qii guuththatanne Kanaane biittan bete gididi diza wode,
019	PSA	105	013	issi dereppe hara dere, issi kawoteththafe hara kawoteth yuuyida.
019	PSA	105	014	Xoossi istta oonikka qohanaas immibeenna; istta gishshas kawota seerishe,
019	PSA	105	015	«Tani tiydayta bochchofte; nabeta qohopite» gides.
019	PSA	105	016	GODAY biittaa bolla kosha yeddides. Istta kath ubbaa dhayssides.
019	PSA	105	017	Gido attiin izi ba asaa ashshanaas isttafe sinththan aylleteththas bayzettida Yooseefe kiittides.
019	PSA	105	018	Iza tohoti kaatenan waaxettida; izi sansalatan qashettides.
019	PSA	105	019	Izi kase yootidayssi polettana gakkanaas GODAA qaalay iza paaccides.
019	PSA	105	020	Kawoy as kiittidi iza birshisides; deraa haarizayssi qasho keeththafe kessides.
019	PSA	105	021	Kawozi iza ba keeththas goda ooththides; baas diza ubbaa aqota bolla shuumides.
019	PSA	105	022	Hessika shuumeta maarara kaaleththana malanne gita asata aadho erateth tamaarsana mala sunththides.
019	PSA	105	023	Hessafe guye Isra7eeley Gibxe gelides; Yaaqoobey Kaame biittan bete as gididi de7ides.
019	PSA	105	024	GODAY ba asaa keehi corasides; istta morkketappe istta aaththi minththides.
019	PSA	105	025	Izi Gibxe asay ba asaa ixxana malanne ba aylleta bolla dendana mala ooththides.
019	PSA	105	026	Hessafe guye ba aylle Musenne ba doorida Aaroone isttako kiittides.
019	PSA	105	027	Istti Gibxe asata sinththan Xoossa malaata, Kaame biittan malalisiza miish ooththida.
019	PSA	105	028	GODAY dhuma kiittidi he biitta dhumisides; gido attiin Gibxe asati iza azazo ixxis gida.
019	PSA	105	029	Istta haaththa suuththan laammidi moleta wodhides.
019	PSA	105	030	Istta biitta ubbaa kawoza keeththaaka shodhdhey kumides.
019	PSA	105	031	Izi azaziin boxeynne uu7ey istta biitta ubbaa bolla shom7ushom7ides.
019	PSA	105	032	Istta biitta bollan ira gishshas shach wolqqanththara bukisides.
019	PSA	105	033	Izi istta woyne turanne balase mith ubbaa dippi histtides; istta biittan de7iza miththatakka menththereththides.
019	PSA	105	034	Izi azaziin booleynne qooday baynda gumbaroy kezides.
019	PSA	105	035	Histtidi istta gaden mokkida kath ubbaa mides; istta biittan diza cilila miish ubbaaka dippi histtides.
019	PSA	105	036	GODAY Gibxe deren bayrata ubbaa wodhides; koyro yelettida nayta ubbaaka dhayssides.
019	PSA	105	037	Hessafe guye izi Isra7eele asaa worqqanne bira alleqora kessides; istta giddofe kundidi attiday ooninne baawa.
019	PSA	105	038	Gibxe asati isttas daro yayyida gishshas istti kezi bishin ufayettida.
019	PSA	105	039	Xoossay istta kammanaas shaara miccides; omars isttas poo7isanawu tama giigsides.
019	PSA	105	040	Istti miza miish oychchiin kuracho misatiza kafota isttas yeddides; istta salo quma kalisides.
019	PSA	105	041	Izi zaalla phalqiin haaththi pulttides; shaafa malakka duge bazzo goggides.
019	PSA	105	042	Izi ba aylle Abrahaames caaqqida geeshsha qaala hassa7ides.
019	PSA	105	043	Izi ba asaa ufayssan, ba dooridayta ililisan kessides.
019	PSA	105	044	Izi isttas hara kawoteththata biitta immides; histtiin istti harati daaburi kessida kaththa ayfe laattida.
019	PSA	105	045	Hessa izi ooththiday istti izi woththida maara naaganaassa; iza wogaakka polanaassa. GODAA galatite!
019	PSA	106	001	GODAA galatite! Izi kiya gidida gishshas, iza siiqoykka mernaas gidida gishshas GODAA galatite.
019	PSA	106	002	GODAY ooththida wolqqama ooso yootanaas, woykko iza galata ubbaa qonccisanaas dandayzay oonee?
019	PSA	106	003	Pirday geellattontta mala naagizaytinne ubba wode xillo ooththizayti anjjettidayta.
019	PSA	106	004	Abeet GODAWU! Neni ne asaa maaddiza wode tana qoppa; istta neni ashshiza wode tanakka alla.
019	PSA	106	005	Hessika ne doorida asaas sa7ay kiyiin tani beyana mala, ne asaa ufayssa tani ufayettana mala, ne nayti bonchchettida gaason tanikka ufayssan magulana malassa.
019	PSA	106	006	Nuni nu aawata mala nagara ooththidos; mooronne iita ooththidos.
019	PSA	106	007	Nu aawati Gibxen de7iza wode, ne malalisiza ooso qoppibeettenna. Ne siiqo daroteththaa istti akeekibeettenna; Zo7o abba lanqen makkallida.
019	PSA	106	008	Gidikkoka izi ba sunththaa gishshas, ba gita wolqqa erisanaas istta ashshides.
019	PSA	106	009	Izi Zo7o abba seerides; abbayka melides; bazzon kaaleththizayssa mala ciimma giddora istta kaaleththidi pinththides.
019	PSA	106	010	Izi istta ixxizayta kusheppe ashshides; morkketa kusheppe istta wozzides.
019	PSA	106	011	Istta morkketa haaththi mittides; isttafe issoyka attibeenna.
019	PSA	106	012	He wode Isra7eeleti iza qaala ammanida; iza yeththan sabbida.
019	PSA	106	013	Gidikkoka istti izi ooththoyssa heerakka dogida. Iza zore naagontta bantti koyidayssa ooththida.
019	PSA	106	014	Istti bazzo biittan keehi amottida; qasse mela biittankka Xoossa paaccida.
019	PSA	106	015	Hessa gishshas izi istti woossidayssa immides; gido attiin istta shemppos gilqateth kiittides.
019	PSA	106	016	Asati bazzon dunkaani dishe Musenne GODAAS dummatida aylle Aaroone qanaatida wode,
019	PSA	106	017	biittay doyettidi Daataane mittides; Abraame iza keeththa asatara moogides.
019	PSA	106	018	Qasse istta maabaraa giddon tamay eexxiin, lacoy he iita asata xuuggides.
019	PSA	106	019	Korebe Zuman de7ishe worqqa seerisidi mara misle medhdhida; histtidi he mislaas goynnida.
019	PSA	106	020	Istti bantta bonchcho Xoossaa maata miza miiza mislen laammida.
019	PSA	106	021	Istti banttana ashshida Xoossa dogida; izi Gibxen gita ooso,
019	PSA	106	022	Kaame biittankka malalisizayssanne Zo7o abban, «Hoola!» giissizayssa ooththidayssa dogida.
019	PSA	106	023	Hessa gishshas Xoossi istta dhayssana gides; gido attiin dhayssontta mala iza hanqoza zaaranaas Xoossi doorida Musey giddon eqqides.
019	PSA	106	024	He lo7o biittayo kadhida; Hessafe guye iza qaalan ammanettibeettenna.
019	PSA	106	025	Istti bantta Dunkaaneza giddon zuuzumidanne GODAA qaalas azazettontta ixxida.
019	PSA	106	026	Hessa gishshas istti bazzon kundi dhayana mala, izi ba kushe denththidi caaqqides.
019	PSA	106	027	Istta zereththati kawoteththata giddon olettanayssanne istti biitta gaxa gakkanaas laalettanayssa yootides.
019	PSA	106	028	Hessafe guye istti Ba7aali-Pe7ooren diza eeqas goynnizaytara issife gayttida; shemppoy baynda eeqatas yarshettida yarshoza mida.
019	PSA	106	029	Istti bantta ooson GODAA hanqeththida; histtiin istta giddon iita hargey wodhdhides.
019	PSA	106	030	Gido attiin Finihaasi dendidi istta mooroza pirdiin iita hargey istta bollafe kichchides.
019	PSA	106	031	Hessika yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas mernaas izas xilloteth gididi qoodettides.
019	PSA	106	032	Mariiba pultto matan GODAA hanqeththida; istta gaason Muse bolla metoy gakkides.
019	PSA	106	033	Ays giikko istti Muse yiillosida; histtiin iza doonappe bessontta qaalay ke7ides.
019	PSA	106	034	GODAY dhayssite giin istti Kanaane asata dhayssibeettenna.
019	PSA	106	035	He palaappe istti he kawoteththatara geletti ekettidi walakettidanne istta de7o woga kaallida.
019	PSA	106	036	Xoossa asati istta eeqas goynnida; hessika isttas woximade gidides.
019	PSA	106	037	Istti bantta attumanne macca nayta daydanththatas yarshida.
019	PSA	106	038	Istti xillo suuth Kanaane eeqatas yarshida; bantta attumanne macca nayta suuth gussida; he suuththan biittay tunides.
019	PSA	106	039	Hessaththo istti bantta ooson tunidanne layma maccassa mala bantta Xoossas ammanettontta ixxida.
019	PSA	106	040	Hessa gishshas GODAA hanqoy iza asaa bolla eexxi ke7ides; izi bayta harassettides.
019	PSA	106	041	Izi istta hara kawoteththata kushen aaththi immides; istta morkketi istta haarida.
019	PSA	106	042	Istta morkketi istta naaqqidanne bantta shenen ayssida.
019	PSA	106	043	Izi istta daroto ashshides; gido attiin istta makkallas gixxi kezida; bantta nagara gaason dhayda.
019	PSA	106	044	Gidikkoka istti waassida waasoza siyidi istta waayeza qoppides.
019	PSA	106	045	Istta gishshas ba caaqo qaala hassa7ides; aggontta ba siiqo daron istta maarides.
019	PSA	106	046	Istta di7ida ubbay isttas qadhettana mala ooththides.
019	PSA	106	047	Abeet GODAWU Nu Xoossawu! Nuna ashsha. Nuni ne geeshsha sunththa galatana mala kawoteththata giddofe nuna shiishsha.
019	PSA	106	048	GODAY, Isra7eele Xoossi mernaappe mernaa gakkanaas galatetto! Asay ubbay, «Amiin» go. GODAA galatite!
019	PSA	107	001	Izi kiyanne iza siiqoy mernaas gidida gishshas GODAA galatite.
019	PSA	107	002	GODAY istta wozzidayti, istta morkketa kusheppe izi ashshidayti hizgetto;
019	PSA	107	003	arshey mokkizasoppenne wullizasoppe, pudehappenne dugehappe dere ubbaafe izi shiishshidayti hizgi haasayetto.
019	PSA	107	004	Isttafe issoti issoti bazzo biittan toylattida; ba de7iza katama efiza oge demmanaas dandaybeettenna.
019	PSA	107	005	Istti gafidanne saamettida; keehippe daaburda.
019	PSA	107	006	Istti metotida wode GODAAKKO waassida; izikka istta waayezappe ashshides.
019	PSA	107	007	Istti de7ana katama gakkanaas, izi istta sitta ogera kaaleththides.
019	PSA	107	008	Mernaa iza siiqozassinne izi asas ooththida malalisiza miishshatas istti GODAA galatetto!
019	PSA	107	009	Ays giikko izi saamettidayta ushshi alisees; gafidaytakka lo7o miishshan kalssees.
019	PSA	107	010	Isttafe issoti issoti birata sansalatan qashettidi waayettizayta; sakkanna dhuma giddonkka uttidayta;
019	PSA	107	011	Gaasoykka istti Xoossa qaala bolla makkallidanne Ubbaafe Dhoqqa Xoossa zore kadhida.
019	PSA	107	012	Hessa gishshas wolqqa ooson istta ixeththides; istti daaburiin istta maaddizay dhaydes.
019	PSA	107	013	Istti metotida wode GODAAKKO waassida; izikka istta waayezappe ashshides.
019	PSA	107	014	Sakkanna dhumappe istta kessides; istti qashettida sansalatakka duusereththides.
019	PSA	107	015	Mernaa iza siiqozassinne izi asas ooththida malalisiza miishshatas istti GODAA galatetto.
019	PSA	107	016	Ays giikko izi xarqimalappe oosettida penge menththides; birata kolatatakka qanxxereththides.
019	PSA	107	017	Isttafe issoti issoti ba makkallateththa gaason eeya gidida; ba nagara gaasonkka meton gelida.
019	PSA	107	018	Istta qoodhey kath ixxiin hayqqana matida.
019	PSA	107	019	Istti metotida wode GODAAKKO waassida; izikka istta waayezappe ashshides.
019	PSA	107	020	Izi ba qaala kiittidi istta paththides; duufo doonappeka istta ashshides.
019	PSA	107	021	Mernaa iza siiqozassinne izi asaas ooththida malalisiza miishshatas istti GODAA galatetto.
019	PSA	107	022	Istti izas galata yarsho yarshetto; qasseka ufayssa yeththan izi ooththida ooso qonccisetto.
019	PSA	107	023	Isttafe issoti issoti markaben gita abba giddora bida; he gita abba bolla bantta ooso ooththida.
019	PSA	107	024	Istti GODAA ooso be7ida; izi ciimma garsan ooththida malalisiza oosota xeellida.
019	PSA	107	025	Izi azaziin gote carkoy dendides; histtiin abba dambalay qaaxxides.
019	PSA	107	026	Istti pude salo kezida; simmidikka duge ciimman gelida; istta gakkida metoppe dendoyssan istta wozinay taahides.
019	PSA	107	027	Istti maththottida asa mala yiicotidi gandigarda; isttas akeekiza wozinaykka dammides.
019	PSA	107	028	Istti metotida wode GODAAKKO waassida; izikka istta waayezappe ashshides.
019	PSA	107	029	Izi gote carkoza co7u histtides; abba dambalakka sirphi histtides.
019	PSA	107	030	Co7u gida gishshas istti ufayettida; istti amottiza wodeben gaththides.
019	PSA	107	031	Mernaa iza siiqozassinne izi asas ooththida malalisiza miishshatas istti GODAA galatetto.
019	PSA	107	032	Istti iza dere duulatan dhoqqu dhoqqu histtetto; qasse cimata shiiqon iza galatetto.
019	PSA	107	033	Shaafata mulera melissides; pulttoti pulttontta mala teqqides.
019	PSA	107	034	Heen de7iza asaa iitateththaa gaason aradda biittayo aykko dolisontta maxine biitta ooththides.
019	PSA	107	035	Izi bazzon haath eelissides mela biittan pulttoy dhuuqqana mala ooththides.
019	PSA	107	036	Gafidayta heen woththides; isttika banttas de7ana katama keexxida.
019	PSA	107	037	Istti bantta goshshan zerida; woyne tokkida; daro kath shiishshida.
019	PSA	107	038	Izi istta anjjiin istti keehi corattida; istta mehetakka guuththibeenna.
019	PSA	107	039	Meton, waayeninne ceecen xoonettiin istta qooday guuxxides.
019	PSA	107	040	GODAY halaqata kawushshides; ogey baynda bazzon toylattana mala istta ooththees.
019	PSA	107	041	Gido attiin izi metotanchchata istta waayeppe kessides; dorsa wude mala cora naytakka isttas immides.
019	PSA	107	042	Suure asati hessa be7idi ufayetteettes; gido attiin geellata doonay gordettana.
019	PSA	107	043	Era asi ha yo7oza ba wozinan woththo; izikka GODAA maaroteth akeeko.
019	PSA	108	001	Abeet Xoossawu! Ta wozinay mino; tani nees kumeththa wozinappe yexxananne nena sabbana.
019	PSA	108	002	Ta diiththinne maasinqoy dendite! tanikka maalado wonttara dendana.
019	PSA	108	003	Abeet GODAWU! Tani deraa giddon nena galatana; qasse kawoteththata giddon nees saban yexxana.
019	PSA	108	004	Ne siiqoy gita; salotappeka aadhdhees. Ne ammaneteththayka pude salo gakkees.
019	PSA	108	005	Abeet Xoossawu! Salotappe bollara dhoqqu dhoqqu ga! Ne bonchchoy biitta ubbaa gakko.
019	PSA	108	006	Neni siiqizayti attana mala ne ushachcha qesen nuna ashsha; ta woosa siya.
019	PSA	108	007	Xoossi ba geeshshasohon dishe, «Tani xoonada Seekeeme biitta shaakkana; qasse Sukoote Zullaa gishana.
019	PSA	108	008	Gala7aadey tayssa; Minaaseykka tayssa; Efreemey ta hu7en woththiza birata qoobe; Yuhuday ta kawoteththa guufe.
019	PSA	108	009	Mo7aabey taas meechchaso; Eedoomey tayssa gididayssa erisanaas tani ta caamma iza bolla woththays; tani Filisxeeme xoonada gererays» gides.
019	PSA	108	010	Gimbettida katamaakko tana oonee efanay? Eedoome gakkanaas tana oonee kaaleththanay?
019	PSA	108	011	Abeet Xoossawu! Nuna aggiday nena gidikkii? Neni nu olanchchatara kezikke gadasa.
019	PSA	108	012	Asa maadoy hada; hessa gishshas nu morkketa bolla nuus xoono imma.
019	PSA	108	013	Xoossi nunara gidikko nuni morkketa xoonana; izi nu morkketa ba tohon yedhdhana.
019	PSA	109	001	Abeet tani galatiza Xoossawu! Neni taas co7u gooppa.
019	PSA	109	002	Iitatinne wordanchchati ba doona ta bolla doyda; ta bollaka wordo haasayda.
019	PSA	109	003	Istti ixo qaalara tana giddoththida; gaasoykka baynda tana keehi qohida.
019	PSA	109	004	Tani istta siiqishin istti tana mootida; gido attiin ta woossays.
019	PSA	109	005	Tani lo7o ooththiin taas iita zaarida; ta istta siiqiin tana ixxida.
019	PSA	109	006	Iza bolla iita daanna shuuma; iza mootizaykka iza ushachchan eqqo.
019	PSA	109	007	Pirdason izi mooranchcha gidi beetto; iza woosaykka izas simmidi gometo!
019	PSA	109	008	Iza layththi qaammo; iza shuumeteththaaka haray ekko!
019	PSA	109	009	Iza nayti aawa dhaydi yi7otetto; iza machcheyakka am7o gidu!
019	PSA	109	010	Iza nayti yuuyi yuuyidi woossetto; ha7i ba diza laalettida keeththafekka goodettetto!
019	PSA	109	011	Iza aqota ubbaa aco aaway laatto; izi daaburdi kessida ubbaa allagay bonqqo!
019	PSA	109	012	Oonikka iza maaroppo; woykko yi7o gidida naytas qadhettizay dooppo!
019	PSA	109	013	Iza nayti ubbay dhayetto; kaalliza yeletan iza sunththi dogetto.
019	PSA	109	014	Iza aawata nagaray GODAA sinththan qofetto; iza aayey nagaray mulekka qucettofo!
019	PSA	109	015	Istta nagaray GODAA sinththan ubbato beetto; istta akeekissiza miishshi biitta bolla dooppo.
019	PSA	109	016	Gaasoykka izi manqidaade, metotizaadenne wozinay madunxidaade hayqqana gakkanaas gooddides attiin iza maaranaas qoppibeenna.
019	PSA	109	017	Izi qangganaas dosiza gishshas izi qanggetto! Izi anjjanaas dosontta gishshas izappe haakkides!
019	PSA	109	018	Qanggeth may7o mala may7ides; haaththa mala izas bollan gelides; zayte malakka meqeththa giddo gelides.
019	PSA	109	019	Afala mala iza kammo; saqqe mala ubba wode iza xeessan de7o!
019	PSA	109	020	Hayssi tana mootizaytassinne ta bolla iita haasayzaytas GODAY immiza woyto gido!
019	PSA	109	021	Gido attiin abeet Ubbaafe Dhoqqa GODAWU! ne sunththa gishshas tana lo7o ayfen xeella; ne siiqoy lo7o gidida gishshas tana ashsha.
019	PSA	109	022	Tani hiyeesanne metotanchcha asa; ta wozinay madunxides.
019	PSA	109	023	Tani omarsa wode kuwa mala dhayana hanays; boole malakka qoqofettadis.
019	PSA	109	024	Xoomishin ta gulbatey daaburdes; ta ashoy gilqidi meqeth attides.
019	PSA	109	025	Ta morkketas tani qilcciza miish gidadis; istti tana be7idi ba qoodhe qaaththeettes.
019	PSA	109	026	Abeet GODAWU ta Xoossawu! Tana maadda; ne mernaa siiqo mala tana ashsha.
019	PSA	109	027	Abeet GODAWU! Hayssa ne kushey ooththidayssanne neni polidayssa ta morkketi eretto.
019	PSA	109	028	Istti tana qanggeettes; neni gidikko tana anjjaasa; ta bolla dendizayti yeellatana; gido attiin tani ne aylley ufayettana.
019	PSA	109	029	Tana mootizayti kawushshateth may7etto; bantta yeellaaka kuta mala quma7etto.
019	PSA	109	030	Tani ta inxarsan GODAA keeha galatana; daro derey shiiqida duulatan iza sabbana.
019	PSA	109	031	Gaasoykka istta bolla hayqo pirda pirdizaytappe ashshanaas manqotappe ushachcha baggara izi eqqees.
019	PSA	110	001	GODAY ta Godaas, «Tani ne morkketa ne toho garsan yedhisana gakkanaas, ta ushachchan utta» gides.
019	PSA	110	002	GODAY nees maata guufe Xiyooneppe kiittana; nenikka morkketa haarana.
019	PSA	110	003	Neni ne morkketara olettiza gallas ne olanchchati ba shenen ne millen eqqana; wontta maalado awa mala geeshshateththan phoollashe ne naateteththa asay neekko yaana.
019	PSA	110	004	GODAY, «Malkexeedeqe qeeseteththa mala nenikka mernaas qeese gidana» giidi caaqqides; izi ba qofa laammenna.
019	PSA	110	005	GODAY ne ushachchan dees; izi ba hanqo gallas kawota tinchchereththana.
019	PSA	110	006	Kawoteththata bolla izi pirdana; ola wosanatakka aha xalla histtana; sa7an ubbaan diza kawota izi menththereththana.
019	PSA	110	007	Kawozi oge lanqen diza haaththa pulttofe uyidi, izi ba hu7e dhoqqu dhoqqu histtana.
019	PSA	111	001	GODAA galatite! Suureta shiiqoninne dere duulatan tani kumeththa wozinappe GODAA galatana.
019	PSA	111	002	GODAA oosoti ay keena gitaa! Isttan ufayettizayti ubbay istti yuushshi qoppanaas bessees.
019	PSA	111	003	Iza oosoti bonchchoninne teeman kumidayta; iza xilloteththika mernaas dees.
019	PSA	111	004	Izi ba malalisiza oosota hassa7ettana mala ooththides. Izi kiyanne maariza GODAA.
019	PSA	111	005	Baas yayyizaytas kath immees; ba caaqo qaalaakka mernaas qoppees.
019	PSA	111	006	Allagata biitta ba deraas immidi ba mino oosoza ba kawoteththaa bessides.
019	PSA	111	007	Iza oosoti tumanne suure; iza wogatikka ubbay ammanettizayta.
019	PSA	111	008	Istti mernaas eqqi de7izayta; tumateththaninne suureteththan imettida.
019	PSA	111	009	Izi ba asaas atoteth immides; ba caaqo qaalakka isttas mernaas azazides; iza sunththi geeshshinne yashissizaaza.
019	PSA	111	010	Aadho erateththas koyroy GODAAS yashshateththa; iza azazo ooththizaytas lo7o akeekay dees. GODAY mernaas galatetto!
019	PSA	112	001	GODAY galatetto! GODAAS yayyiza asi, iza azazotakka polanaas ufayettiza asi anjjettidayssa.
019	PSA	112	002	Iza nayti biittan wolqqama gidana; suure asata yeletay anjjettana.
019	PSA	112	003	Aqotaynne dureteththi iza keeththan dees; iza xilloteththayka mernaas de7ana.
019	PSA	112	004	Kiya, qadhettizanne xillo ooththiza suure asas dhuma giddon poo7oy poo7ees.
019	PSA	112	005	Kiyateththan coo tal7iza asas, ba ooso suureteththan ooththiza asas de7oy injjetana.
019	PSA	112	006	Xillo asi awudenne kundenna; mernaas izi hassa7ettishe de7ana.
019	PSA	112	007	Iita miishshi iza daganththenna; ays giikko iza wozinay hirgenna; GODAAN ammaneettes.
019	PSA	112	008	Iza wozinay mino; mulekka yayyenna; wurseththan ba morkketa kundeth izi be7ana.
019	PSA	112	009	Izi hiyeesatas kiyateththan immees; qasse iza xilloteththay mernaas dees; iza kacey bonchchon dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana.
019	PSA	112	010	Iita asi hessa be7idi yiillotees; ba achchaa garccishe coo gilqi dhayees; iitata amoy hada gidana.
019	PSA	113	001	GODAY galatetto! Intteno GODAA oosanchchatoo! GODAA galatite! Iza sunththaaka sabbite!
019	PSA	113	002	GODAA sunththi hachchife mernaa gakkanaas galatetto!
019	PSA	113	003	Arshey mokkizasoppe biidi wullizaso gakkanaaska GODAA sunththi galatetto!
019	PSA	113	004	GODAY kawoteththata ubbaafe gita; iza bonchchoyka salotappe dhoqqa.
019	PSA	113	005	GODAA nu Xoossa malay oonee? Izi bolla dhoqqan kawoteththa araatan uttides.
019	PSA	113	006	Izi salotaninne sa7an dizayta duge xeellees.
019	PSA	113	007	Izi hiyeesa gudullafe dhoqqu dhoqqu histtees; metotanchchaka bidinththafe denththees.
019	PSA	113	008	Histtidi istta gita asataranne dere shuumetara issife utisees;
019	PSA	113	009	Mayneyo nayta aayo ooththees; bonchchidikka izison izo ufayssan woththees; GODAY galatetto!
019	PSA	114	001	Isra7eele asay Gibxe biittafe kezida wode, Yaaqoobe zereththay allaga qaala haasayza biittafe yeggidi bida wode,
019	PSA	114	002	Yuhuda asay Xoossas geeshsha as gidides; Isra7eele asaykka izas haarettides.
019	PSA	114	003	Zo7o abbay hessa be7idi baqatides; Yordaanoose shaafaykka guye simmides.
019	PSA	114	004	Zumati dharsho mala guferettida; zumbullatikka dorsa laaqqa mala xikkida.
019	PSA	114	005	Abbazoo! Ne ays baqatadii? Yordaanoose shaafazoo! Ays guye simmadii?
019	PSA	114	006	Intteno zumatoo! Dharsho mala ays guppidetii? Intteno zumbullatoo! Dorsa laaqqa mala ays xikkidetii?
019	PSA	114	007	Hanne biittayee! Godaa sinththan Yaaqoobe Xoossa sinththan kokkora.
019	PSA	114	008	Izi zaalla eele haath kessides; wolqqama zaalla pultto haath kessides.
019	PSA	115	001	Abeet GODAWU! Nu gishshas gidontta ne siiqo gishshassinne ne ammaneteththa gishshas ne sunththaa bonchcha.
019	PSA	115	002	Kawoteththati ays, «Istta Xoossi awan dizee?» gizoo?
019	PSA	115	003	Nu Xoossay salon dees; izi ba dosidayssa ubbaa ooththees.
019	PSA	115	004	Gido attiin istta eeqa xoossati birappenne worqqafe asa kushen oosettidayta.
019	PSA	115	005	Isttas doonay dees shin haasayettenna; ayfeykka dees shin demmettenna.
019	PSA	115	006	Isttas hayththi dees shin siyettenna; siidheykka dees shin singettenna.
019	PSA	115	007	Isttas kushey dees shin bochchettenna; tohoykka dees shin hemettettenna; istta poorandey cenggurs kessenna.
019	PSA	115	008	Istta medhdhizaytinne isttan ammanettizayti ubbay istta mala gidetto.
019	PSA	115	009	Intteno Isra7eele asatoo! GODAAN ammanettite! Izi inttes gondallenne inttena maaddizaade.
019	PSA	115	010	Intteno Aaroone zereththatoo! GODAAN ammanettite! Izi inttes gondallenne inttena maaddizaade.
019	PSA	115	011	Intteno GODAAS yayyizaytoo! GODAAN ammanettite! Izi inttes gondallenne inttena maaddizaade.
019	PSA	115	012	GODAY nuus qoppees; izi nuna anjjana; izi Isra7eele asatanne Aaroone zereththatakka anjjana.
019	PSA	115	013	GODAAS yayyizayta ubbaa guuth gidiin gita izi anjjana.
019	PSA	115	014	GODAY inttenakka intte naytakka darso!
019	PSA	115	015	Salonne sa7a medhdhida GODAY inttena anjjo!
019	PSA	115	016	Saloti Xoossassa; gido attiin sa7a asa naytas immides.
019	PSA	115	017	Hayqqidi duge duufon gelidayti GODAA galatanaas dandayettenna.
019	PSA	115	018	Gido attiin nuni shemppora paxa dizayti hachchife doommidi mernaa gakkanaas GODAA galatana. GODAY galatetto!
019	PSA	116	001	Izi ta shoobba woossiza woosa siyida gishshas tani GODAA dosays.
019	PSA	116	002	Izi ba hayth taakko yeggida gishshas tani de7iza wode ubbaan iza xeygana.
019	PSA	116	003	Hayqoy woximade mala tana dooddi oykkides; duufon geloy tana hirgisides. Ceeceynne un7oy tana toli oykkides.
019	PSA	116	004	He wode tani, «Abeet GODAWU! Hadara! Tana ashsha» gaada GODAA sunth xeygadis.
019	PSA	116	005	GODAY kiyanne xillo; nu Xoossay maarizayssa.
019	PSA	116	006	GODAY ashketa naagees; tani metotida wode izi tana ashshides.
019	PSA	116	007	Ta shemppoyee ane woppu ga; GODAY nees lo7o miish ooththides.
019	PSA	116	008	GODAY tana hayqoppe, ta ayfe afunththafe, ta tohokka dhupheppe ashshides.
019	PSA	116	009	Hessa gishshas tani GODAA sinththan shemppora paxa dizayta giddon hemettays.
019	PSA	116	010	Ta, «Tani keeha un7ettadis» giza wodekka ammano aggabeekke.
019	PSA	116	011	Taas gizaazi dhayiin, «Asi ubbay wordo» gadis.
019	PSA	116	012	Izi taas kiyida kiyateththaa gishshas tani GODAAS ay qanxxanaas dandayazinaa?
019	PSA	116	013	GODAY tana ashshida gishshas woyne ushshu galatas shiishshada iza sunththu xeygana.
019	PSA	116	014	Iza deraa ubbaa sinththan tani adinida adina GODAAS gaththana.
019	PSA	116	015	Geeshshata hayqoy GODAA sinththan bonchcho.
019	PSA	116	016	Abeet GODAWU! Tani ne aylle; tani ne aylley naa; tana qashoppe birshadasa.
019	PSA	116	017	Abeet GODAWU! Tani galata yarsho nees yarshana; histtada ne sunththaa xeygana.
019	PSA	116	018	Iza deraa ubbaa sinththan tani adinettida adina GODAAS gaththana.
019	PSA	116	019	Hessaka tani gaththanay, Yerusalaamen diza GODAA keeththa dabaabanna. GODAY galatetto!
019	PSA	117	001	Kawoteththati ubbay GODAA galatite! Ubba asay iza galatan sabbite!
019	PSA	117	002	Ays giikko izi ba gita siiqo nuna bessides; iza ammaneteththayka mernaassa; GODAY galatetto!
019	PSA	118	001	Izi kiyanne iza siiqoy mernaas gidida gishshas GODAA galatite!
019	PSA	118	002	Isra7eele asay, «Iza siiqoy mernaassa» go.
019	PSA	118	003	Aaroone zereththati, «Iza siiqoy mernaassa» getto.
019	PSA	118	004	GODAAS yayyizayti ubbay, «Iza siiqoy mernaassa» getto.
019	PSA	118	005	Tani un7ettida wode GODAAKKO waassadis; histtiin izi ta waasoza allidi tana un7ofe kessides.
019	PSA	118	006	GODAY tanara diza gishshas tani yayyike. Asi tana ay ooththanee?
019	PSA	118	007	GODAY tana maaddanaas tanara dees; ta morkketa xooneteththaa tani ayfen be7ana.
019	PSA	118	008	Asan ammaneteththafe GODAAN ammaneteththay lo7o.
019	PSA	118	009	Daannatan ammaneteththafe GODAAN ammaneteththay lo7o.
019	PSA	118	010	Kawoteththati ubbay tana dooddida; gido attiin GODAA sunththan tani istta xoonadis.
019	PSA	118	011	Istti tana ubbasora dooddi oykkida; gido attiin GODAA sunththan tani istta xoonadis.
019	PSA	118	012	Istti tana maththi dooddiza mala dooddida; gido attiin agunththi eexxiza mala eexxi dhayda; GODAA sunththan tani istta xoonadis.
019	PSA	118	013	Tana sugiin kundanaas gandigaradis; gido attiin GODAY tana maaddides.
019	PSA	118	014	GODAY taas minoteththinne yeththa; tana ashshizay iza.
019	PSA	118	015	Xillota dunkaane giddon xoono ililisinne ufayssa yeththi, «GODAA ushachcha kushey wolqqama miish ooththides!» gishe seetettees.
019	PSA	118	016	GODAA ushachcha kushey dhoqqu dhoqqu gides! GODAA ushachcha kushey wolqqama miish ooththides.
019	PSA	118	017	Tani hayqqike shemppora paxa de7ana; GODAY ooththida ooso buroppeka awajjana.
019	PSA	118	018	GODAY tana keehi qaxxaydes; gido attiin hayqos aaththi immibeenna.
019	PSA	118	019	Tani giddo gelada GODAA galatana mala xilloteththa pengeta ane taas doyte!
019	PSA	118	020	Hayssi GODAA penge; izara xilloti xalla gelana.
019	PSA	118	021	Neni taas siyida gishshassinne xoono immida gishshas tani nena galatays.
019	PSA	118	022	Gimbizayti kadhidi ixxida shuchchay gulas hu7en woththiza shuch gidides.
019	PSA	118	023	Hayssika GODAA ooso; qasse nu ayfesikka malalisiza miishsha.
019	PSA	118	024	Hayssi gallassay GODAY ooththida gallassa; ane nuni izan ufayettoossinne ililoos.
019	PSA	118	025	Abeet GODAWU! Ha7i nuna ashsharkkii! Abeet GODAWU! Ha7i nuus injjesarkkii!
019	PSA	118	026	GODAA sunththan yiza asi anjjettidayssa gido! Nuni GODAA Keeththan inttena anjjoos.
019	PSA	118	027	GODAY Xoossa; izi nuus poo7isides; cilila miththa haggata oykkite; yarsho yarshizasoza bolla diza kacetakko gakkanaas kezite; ba7aale bonchchite.
019	PSA	118	028	Neni ta Xoossa; tani nena galatana; Neni ta Xoossa; tani nena gitasana.
019	PSA	118	029	Izi kiya gidida gishshas GODAA galatite! Iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	119	001	Bantta ogen borey bayndaytinne GODAA wogga mala hemettizayti anjjettidayta.
019	PSA	119	002	Izi yootidayssa ooththizaytinne ba kumeththa wozinappe iza koyzayti anjjettidayta.
019	PSA	119	003	Istti makkalla miish ooththettenna; GODAA ogen hemetteettes.
019	PSA	119	004	Ne woga ammanettidi naagana mala neni nuna azazadasa.
019	PSA	119	005	Ne woththida woga naaganaas ta ogey minnana mala ta amottays.
019	PSA	119	006	Ne azazota ubbaa ta lo7eththa akeekikko mulekka yeellatikke.
019	PSA	119	007	Ne xillo pirda tani tamaarda keena suure wozinappe nena galatana.
019	PSA	119	008	Tani ne woththida maarata naagana; tana mulekka yeggofa.
019	PSA	119	009	Naateththi ba oge geeshshateththan wostti naaganaas dandayzee? Ne qaalay giza mala de7ikko dandayees.
019	PSA	119	010	Tani ta kumeththa wozinappe nena koyays; ne azazotappe kare kezontta mala tana naaga.
019	PSA	119	011	Tani ne bolla nagara ooththontta mala ne qaala ta wozinan qottadis.
019	PSA	119	012	Abeet GODAWU! Neni galatetta! Ne maara tana tamaarsa.
019	PSA	119	013	Ne doonappe keziza maara ubbaa tani ta inxarsan yootays.
019	PSA	119	014	Asi ba dureteththan ufayettiza mala tani neni immida maara kaallashe ufayettays.
019	PSA	119	015	Ne woththida wogata yuushsha qoppays; ta wozinakka ne ogetan woththadis.
019	PSA	119	016	Ne awajjay tana ufayssees; ne qaalaakka tani dogikke.
019	PSA	119	017	Tani shemppora paxa de7ana malanne ne qaalas azazettana mala, taas ne aylles lo7o miish ooththa.
019	PSA	119	018	Ne woga giddon diza malalisiza tumateththa tani be7ana mala ta ayfe doya.
019	PSA	119	019	Tani ha sa7an imaththa; ne azazota taappe genththofa.
019	PSA	119	020	Ta shemppoya ubba wode ne maara demmanaas keeha laamotadus.
019	PSA	119	021	Ne azazozappe kare kezizayta, otorettizaytanne qanggettizayta neni seeraasa.
019	PSA	119	022	Ta neni yootidayssa naagida gishshas istta cashshanne kadheza ta bollafe digga.
019	PSA	119	023	Dere kaaleththizayti ubbati ta bolla maqettikokka tani ne aylley ne awajjata yuushsha qoppana.
019	PSA	119	024	Ne markkateththati tana ufaysseettes; isttika tana zoreettes.
019	PSA	119	025	Ta shemppoy kezana hanees; neni gida qaala mala tana ashsha.
019	PSA	119	026	Tani ta oge ubbaa nees qonccisadis; neni taas siyadasa; ne awajjata tana tamaarsa.
019	PSA	119	027	Ne maara tana akeekissa; malalisiza ne ooso ta yuushsha qoppana.
019	PSA	119	028	Ta shemppoya ceecey darida gishshas daaburadus; neni gida qaala mala tana minththa.
019	PSA	119	029	Baleththiza oge taappe haassa; ne kiyateththan ne woga tana tamaarsa.
019	PSA	119	030	Tani tumaa oge dooradis; ne wogaakka ta wozinan woththadis.
019	PSA	119	031	Abeet GODAWU! Tani ne yootidayssa minththa oykkadis; ne tana yeellas aaththa immofa.
019	PSA	119	032	Neni ta wozina aassida gishshas tani ne azazo ogen woxxays.
019	PSA	119	033	Abeet GODAWU! Ne awajjata tana tamaarsa; tani wurseththi gakkanaas iza naagana.
019	PSA	119	034	Tani ne woga naagana malanne kumeththa wozinappe izas azazettana mala neni taas akeeka imma.
019	PSA	119	035	Ne azazoy tana ufayssees; hessa gishshas ne ogen tana kaaleththa.
019	PSA	119	036	Ta wozina bessontta go7as gidontta ne maara polana mala zaara.
019	PSA	119	037	Paththontta miish xeellontta mala ta ayfeta naaga; ne qaala mala ta de7o ooraxissa.
019	PSA	119	038	Nees yayyana mala ne gelida qaala taas ne ayllezas pola.
019	PSA	119	039	Ne pirday suure gidida gishshas tani yayyiza kawushshateththafe tana naaga.
019	PSA	119	040	Tani ne woga naaganawu amottays; neni xilloteththan ta de7o ooraxissa.
019	PSA	119	041	Abeet GODAWU! Ne mernaa siiqoy taakko haa yo; neni gida qaala mala tana ashsha.
019	PSA	119	042	Tani ne qaalan ammanettays; tana cayizaytaska tani zaaro immana.
019	PSA	119	043	Tani ne wogan hidota ooththadis; tuma qaala ta doonappe dhayssofa.
019	PSA	119	044	Tani meri mernaaskka ne wogaas ubba wode azazettana.
019	PSA	119	045	Tani ne woga siiqiza gishshas la7an simerettana.
019	PSA	119	046	Tani kawota sinththan eqqada neni yootidayssa yootashe yeellatikke.
019	PSA	119	047	Tani ne azazota dosays; isttankka ufayettays.
019	PSA	119	048	Tani siiqiza ne azazota bonchchays; ne awajjata yuushsha qoppana.
019	PSA	119	049	Neni taas ne ayllezas immida qaala qoppa; hessa gishshas tani he qaalan hidota ooththays.
019	PSA	119	050	Ne qaalay taas de7o immides; hessi meto wode tana minththeththees.
019	PSA	119	051	Otoranchchati tana keehi kadhida; gido attiin tani ne wogappe sher7i giikke.
019	PSA	119	052	Abeet GODAWU! beniisofe diza ne woga tani qoppadis; hessan tani minettays.
019	PSA	119	053	Iitati ne wogas azazettonttayssa be7ada keeha hanqettadis.
019	PSA	119	054	Tani imaththateththan de7iza biittan ne wogay taas mazamure gidides.
019	PSA	119	055	Abeet GODAWU! Tani giddoth ne sunththaa qoppays; ne wogaakka naagays.
019	PSA	119	056	Ta ne wogaas azazettana; hessi taas ooso gidides.
019	PSA	119	057	Abeet GODAWU! Ta qaaday nena; tani ne qaalas azazettanaas qachchadis.
019	PSA	119	058	Tani kumeththa wozinappe nena koyays; neni gida qaala mala taas qadhetta.
019	PSA	119	059	Tani ta oge xomosa xeelladis; ne maara kaallanaas simmadis.
019	PSA	119	060	Tani ne azazo naaganaas eesotanaappe attiin takkike.
019	PSA	119	061	Iitati tana oykkana gite yeggida; tani gidikko ne woga dogabeekke.
019	PSA	119	062	Ne xillo woga gishshas ta nena galatanaas giddoth dendays.
019	PSA	119	063	Tani nees yayyizayta ubbaassinne ne woga naagizaytas lagge.
019	PSA	119	064	Abeet GODAWU! Sa7ay ne mernaa siiqon kumides; ne awajjata tana tamaarsa.
019	PSA	119	065	Abeet GODAWU! Ne gida qaala mala taas ne ayllezas lo7o ooththadasa.
019	PSA	119	066	Tani ne azazota ammanays; lo7o pirdanne erateth tana tamaarsa.
019	PSA	119	067	Ta qaxxayettanaappe kase ne wogappe kare kezadis; ha7i tani ne qaalas azazettana.
019	PSA	119	068	Neni lo7o; ne oosoykka lo7o; hessa gishshas ne awajjata tana tamaarsa.
019	PSA	119	069	Otoranchchati ta sunththaa wordora moorida; gido attiin tani ne woga ta kumeththa wozinappe naagays.
019	PSA	119	070	Istta wozinay mulekka dammides; gido attiin tani ne wogan ufayettays.
019	PSA	119	071	Tani qaxxayettidayssi taas lo7o gidides; ne woga taamarana mala tana maaddides.
019	PSA	119	072	Daro shii birappenne worqqafe ne doonappe ke7ida wogay taas aadhdhees.
019	PSA	119	073	Tana ne kushey medhdhidessinne giigsides; ne azazo tani taamarana mala taas akeeka imma.
019	PSA	119	074	Tani ne qaala hidota ooththadis; hessa gishshas nees yayyizayti tana be7idi ufayetetto.
019	PSA	119	075	Abeet GODAWU! Ne pirday xillo gididayssanne neni tana qaxxayday ammaneteththan gididayssa tani erays.
019	PSA	119	076	Neni taas ne ayllezas gelida qaala mala ne mernaa siiqoy tana minththeththo.
019	PSA	119	077	Ne wogay tana ufayssiza gishshas tani shemppora paxa de7ana mala taas qadhetta.
019	PSA	119	078	Otoranchchati tana wordon mootiza gishshas yeellatetto. Tani gidikko ne wogata yuushsha qoppays.
019	PSA	119	079	Nees yayyizaytinne ne azazo erizayti ubbay haa taakko simmetto.
019	PSA	119	080	Tani yeellatontta mala ne maaran ta wozinay borey bayndaaz gido.
019	PSA	119	081	Ne tana ashshana mala ta shemppoya keeha laamotadus; tanikka ne qaala hidota ooththadis.
019	PSA	119	082	«Ayde tana minththeththandeesha?» guussan ne immida hidota qaala ta naagishin ta ayfey doljumides.
019	PSA	119	083	Cuwan kaqqida lukkamo mala gidadis; gidikkoka ne awajjata balabeekke.
019	PSA	119	084	Tani ne aylley awude gakkanaas daanee? Tana yedeththizayta bolla neni awude pirdanee?
019	PSA	119	085	Ne woga naagontta otoranchchati tana dhayssanaas olla bookkeettes.
019	PSA	119	086	Ne azazoti ubbay ammanettizayta; asay gaasoy baynda yedeththiza gishshas tana maadda!
019	PSA	119	087	Istti tana biittafe dhayssana gakkida; gido attiin tani ne woga aggabeekke.
019	PSA	119	088	Ne mernaa siiqon ta de7o ooraxissa; tanikka ne azazota naagana.
019	PSA	119	089	Abeet GODAWU! Ne qaalay mernaasa; izikka salon minni dees.
019	PSA	119	090	Ne ammaneteththay yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas dees; neni sa7as yochcha yeggadasa; izikka minnidi dees.
019	PSA	119	091	Neni gida mala ubbayka hach gakkanaas minnidi dees; ays giikko ubbatikka ne aylleta.
019	PSA	119	092	Ta metotida wode dhayaychchana shin ne wogay taas ufays gidides.
019	PSA	119	093	Ne azazoti tana shemppora paxa woththida gishshas tani mulekka istta dogikke.
019	PSA	119	094	Tani neessa; tana ashsharkkii! tani woga naaganawu koyays.
019	PSA	119	095	Iitati tana dhayssanawu zamadidi naageettes; gido attiin neni yootidayssa tani yuushsha qoppays.
019	PSA	119	096	Polo gidida miish ubbaas zaway dizayssa tani be7adis; gido attiin polo gidida ne azazotas zaway deenna.
