019	PSA	119	154	Ne ta gishshas mootettada tana wozza; ne gida qaala mala tana shemppora paxa woththa.
019	PSA	119	155	Iitati ne woga koyontta gishshas isttas atoteththi deenna.
019	PSA	119	156	Abeet GODAWU! Ne qadhetay daro; ne qaala mala tana shemppora paxa woththa.
019	PSA	119	157	Ta morkketinne tana yedeththizayti daro; gido attiin tani ne yootida qaalaappe sher7i gabeekke.
019	PSA	119	158	Ne azazota naagontta gishshas ta ammanettonttayta beyada shaatettadis.
019	PSA	119	159	Abeet GODAWU! Tani ne woga dosizaakko be7a; ne siiqo mala tana shemppora paxa woththa.
019	PSA	119	160	Ne qaala ubbay tuma; ne xilloteththa wogay mernaassa.
019	PSA	119	161	Dere haarizayti tana coo yedeththida; gido attiin ta wozinay ne qaalas yayyees.
019	PSA	119	162	Daro miish di7ida asi ufayettiza mala neni gida qaalan tani ufayettays.
019	PSA	119	163	Tani wordo ixxayssinne shaatettays; gido attiin ne woga siiqays.
019	PSA	119	164	Ne xillo pirda gishshas tani nena gallassan laappunto galatays.
019	PSA	119	165	Ne woga siiqizaytas daro saroteththi dees; istta dhuphiza miishshi deenna.
019	PSA	119	166	Abeet GODAWU! Tani ne atoteththaa ufayssan naagays; ne azazotakka polays.
019	PSA	119	167	Tani ne yootida qaala naagays; ta iza daro siiqays.
019	PSA	119	168	Tani ne wogassinne ne yootida qaalas azazettana; ta oge ubbay ne sinththan qoncce.
019	PSA	119	169	Abeet GODAWU! Ta waasoy neekko gakko; neni gida qaala mala taas akeeka imma.
019	PSA	119	170	Ta shoobeththi pude ne sinth gakko; neni gida qaala mala tana ashsha.
019	PSA	119	171	Ne awajjata tana tamaarsadasa; hessa gishshas ta metershatappe galatay pulttees.
019	PSA	119	172	Ne azazoti ubbay xillo; hessa gishshas ta doonay ne qaala yexxo.
019	PSA	119	173	Tani ne azazota dooradis; hessa gishshas ne kushey tana maaddanaas giigi utto.
019	PSA	119	174	Abeet GODAWU! Ne atoteththa ta laamotays; ne wogay tana ufayssees.
019	PSA	119	175	Tani nena galatana mala tana shemppora paxa woththa; ne wogay taas maado gido.
019	PSA	119	176	Dhayda dorsa mala tani toylattadis; gido attiin tani ne woga balabeekke; hessa gishshas tana ne aylleza koya.
019	PSA	120	001	Tani metotida wode GODAA xeygadis; izikka taas koyides.
019	PSA	120	002	Abeet GODAWU! Wordotiza metershatappenne cimmiza inxarsatappe tana ashsha.
019	PSA	120	003	Intteno wordanchchatoo! Izi inttena wosttanee? hessafe hara intte bolla ay ooththanee?
019	PSA	120	004	Izi inttena hoxe tooran caddana; izi inttena bonqo taman xuuggana.
019	PSA	120	005	Ta Mesheeke deraa giddon days; Qeedaare dunkaanenkka uttida gishshas taas aayye ana!
019	PSA	120	006	Saroteth ixxiza asatara tani daro wode de7adis.
019	PSA	120	007	Tani saro koyays; gido attiin tani saro haasayza wode istti oosh koyeettes.
019	PSA	121	001	Tani, «Maadoy taas awappe yaandeeshaa?» gaada ta ayfeta pude zumatakko denththadis.
019	PSA	121	002	Taas maadoy salonne sa7a medhdhida GODAAPPE yees.
019	PSA	121	003	Izi ne toho hallixissenna; nena naagizayssi dhiskenna.
019	PSA	121	004	Isra7eele naagizayssi mulekka ichchennanne dhiskenna.
019	PSA	121	005	GODAY nena naagizayssa; GODAY nees ushachcha baggara kuwa gidana.
019	PSA	121	006	Gallassa away nena xuuggenna; omarsa aginaykka nena qohenna.
019	PSA	121	007	GODAY iita ubbaafe nena naagana; ne shemppo heemmana.
019	PSA	121	008	GODAY ne buussaanne yuussaa hachchife mernaa gakkanaas naagana.
019	PSA	122	001	Istti tana, «Ane GODAA Keeth boos» giin tani ufayettadis.
019	PSA	122	002	Hanne Yerusalaame katamayee! Nuni ne pengetara gelidi eqqidos.
019	PSA	122	003	Yerusalaame katamaya danxxetta keexettida mino katama.
019	PSA	122	004	Isra7eeles imettida woga mala Isra7eele qommoti GODAA sunth galatanaas hee baana.
019	PSA	122	005	Dawite zereththafe kawotidayti pirdanaas heen uttida.
019	PSA	122	006	Yerusalaame saroteththas, «Nena dosizayti ubbay ishalon detto;
019	PSA	122	007	Ne gimbeta giddon saroy de7o! Ne kawoteththa keeththan woppay kumo» gi woossite;
019	PSA	122	008	Ta dabbota gishshassinne laggeta gishshas «Ne giddon saroy do!» gays.
019	PSA	122	009	GODAA nu Xoossa Keeththa gishshas gaada tani nees lo7o amo amottana.
019	PSA	123	001	Nenoo salo araatan uttidayssoo! Tani neekko pude xeellays.
019	PSA	123	002	Ashkaray ba godaa kushe xeelliza mala, ashkarayakka ba godattey kushe xeelliza mala, nunikka izi nuna maarana gakkanaas nu GODAAKKO pude xeelloos.
019	PSA	123	003	Abeet GODAWU! Nu bolla kadhey darida gishshas maararkkii! Nuna maara.
019	PSA	123	004	Ceeqettizaytappe daro cashshi otoranchchatappe daro kadhey nuna gakkides.
019	PSA	124	001	Isra7eeley, «GODAY nunara donttaakko nu waananee?
019	PSA	124	002	Nu morkketi nu bolla dendida wode GODAY nunara bayndaako,
019	PSA	124	003	istta hanqoy nu bolla tama mala eexxida wode istti nuna paxa mittanashin.
019	PSA	124	004	Haaththi nuna ekki baanashin; di7oy nuna mittanashin.
019	PSA	124	005	Kixa haaththi nuna maanashin» getto.
019	PSA	124	006	Nuna nu morkketa achchan puuzisontta ashshida GODAY galatetto.
019	PSA	124	007	Nuni shankkanchchata narxafe kafoy kessi ekkiza mala kessi ekkidos; Yardey duuxxides nunikka kessi ekkidi attidos.
019	PSA	124	008	Salonne sa7a medhdhida GODAA sunththan nuus maadoy yees.
019	PSA	125	001	GODAAN ammanettizayti mernaas qaaxxontta diza Xiyoone Zuma mala.
019	PSA	125	002	Zumati Yerusalaame katama yuushon diza mala hachchife mernaa gakkanaas GODAY ba deraa yuushon dees.
019	PSA	125	003	Xilloti iitateth tamaarontta mala iitati haarishe xillota biittan gam7ettenna.
019	PSA	125	004	Abeet GODAWU! Lo7o asatassinne wozina suure asatas ne lo7o ooththa.
019	PSA	125	005	Gido attiin kase ba geella oge simmizayta neni iita ooththizaytara issife gaththa qaxxaya; Isra7eeles saroy gido!
019	PSA	126	001	GODAY nuna di7ettidayta zaaridi Xiyoone ehida wode nuus agumo misatides.
019	PSA	126	002	He wode nu doonay miichchan kumides; nu inxarsika ufayssa mazamure yexxides; histtiin kawoteththati bantta giddon, «GODAY isttas gita miish ooththides» gida.
019	PSA	126	003	Tumukka GODAY nuus gita miish ooththides; nunikka keehi ufayettidos.
019	PSA	126	004	Abeet GODAWU! Negebe Bazzon ira bukisada shaafa haaththan kunththiza mala nu duussa ooraththa.
019	PSA	126	005	Yeekkishe zeridayti ufayssan yexxishe shiishshana.
019	PSA	126	006	Zereth tookkidi yeekkishe bidayti mirqqeta tookkidi ufayssan yexxishe simmana.
019	PSA	127	001	GODAY keeth keexxontta aggiko keexxizayti coo mela daabureettes; GODAY katama naagontta aggiko naagizayti coo mela dafetteettes.
019	PSA	127	002	Neni aqota demmanaas maalado wonttara denda woxxikonne giddoth gakkanaas ne daaburkko hessi wurikka hada; GODAY ba siiqizaytas shemppo immees.
019	PSA	127	003	Nayti GODAAPPE imettiza imotata; naytikka tumappe iza woyto.
019	PSA	127	004	Asi naateththan dishe yeliza attuma nayti olanchcha kushen diza yiishsha mala.
019	PSA	127	005	Iza kohoti he yiishshatan kumiday anjjettidaade. Izi katama pengen ba morkketara marshettiza wode shatumettenna.
019	PSA	128	001	GODAAS yayyizaytinne iza ogen hemettizayti ubbay anjjettidayta.
019	PSA	128	002	Neni ne daabura ayfe maana; ne anjjettananne nees injjetana.
019	PSA	128	003	Ne machchiya neson ayfiza woyne mala gidana; ne naytikka ne maadda yuushon wogara puute mala gidana.
019	PSA	128	004	GODAAS yayyiza asi hessaththo anjjettana.
019	PSA	128	005	GODAY nena Xiyooneppe anjjo! Neni de7ida layth ubbaan Izi nena Yerusalaame lo7eteth besso!
019	PSA	128	006	Izi nena nayta nayta gaththi besso! Isra7eeles saroy gido!
019	PSA	129	001	Isra7eele asay, «Morkketi tana yelagateththafe doommidi daro wode un7eththida.
019	PSA	129	002	Tumappe istti tana yelagateththafe doommidi daro wode un7eththida; gido attiin istti tana xoonibeettenna.
019	PSA	129	003	Ta zokko xurqafen shoci shocidi worxafettida gade misatissida» go.
019	PSA	129	004	Gido attiin GODAY xillo; iitata wodoro duusereththidi tana birshi yeddides.
019	PSA	129	005	Xiyoone ixxiza ubbay yeellatidi guye simmo!
019	PSA	129	006	Keeththa kaara bolla mokkidi heerakka meliza maata mala gido!
019	PSA	129	007	Hessi buucizaytas kushe kumontta maata mala woykko mirqqizaytaskka danke kumontta kaththa mala.
019	PSA	129	008	He ogera aadhdhizayti, «Xoossi wolqqa immo» buucizaytikka, «Xoossi anjjo» gooppetto.
019	PSA	130	001	Abeet GODAWU! Tani ciimma meto giddon dashe neekko waassays.
019	PSA	130	002	Abeet Godawu! Ta cenggurssa siya; tani shoobbizayssa ne hayththati ezgetto.
019	PSA	130	003	Abeet GODAWU! Neni nu nagara kaaletta kaaletta mazgabidaakko abeet Godawu oonee ne sinththan eqqi dandayanee?
019	PSA	130	004	Gido attiin nuni nena bonchchana mala neni nu nagara atto gaasa.
019	PSA	130	005	Tani GODAA laamotan naagays; ta shemppoya dandayan naagawus; iza qaalaakka hidota ooththawus.
019	PSA	130	006	Zabeti sa7ay awude wonttaneesha giidi naagizayssafekka bolla tani Goda laamotan naagays.
019	PSA	130	007	GODAA achchan siiqoynne maaroteththi diza gishshas Isra7eele asawu! GODAAN hidota ooththite.
019	PSA	130	008	Izi Isra7eele asaa istta nagara ubbaafe ashshana.
019	PSA	131	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ta wozinay otorettibeenna; tani otoron xeella erikke; ta qofan bessontta gitateththas amottabeekke; ta wolqqafe bollara zaradhdhabeekke.
019	PSA	131	002	Dhanth duuxxida nay ba aayi ki7on co7u gi uttiza mala, ta shemppoya ta giddon co7unne woppu gadus.
019	PSA	131	003	Isra7eele asawu! Hachchife doommidi mernaa gakkanaas GODAAN hidota ooththite.
019	PSA	132	001	Abeet GODAWU! Dawitenne izi dandayda metoza ubbaa ne qoppa.
019	PSA	132	002	GODAWU! Izi nees caaqqida qaala, wolqqama Yaaqoobe Xoossaska adinettida adinaa qoppa.
019	PSA	132	003	Izikka, «Hayssafe sinththan tani taso gelikke; ta hiixankka kezikke;
019	PSA	132	004	dhiskoka dhiskike; ta ayfetakka liiphikke.
019	PSA	132	005	Hessika tani GODAAS duussaso, wolqqama Yaaqoobe Xoossas aqoso giigsana gakkanaassa» gides.
019	PSA	132	006	Hekko nuni Taabotaza gishshas Efraatan dishe siyidos; Qiriyaate-Yi7aarime biittan iza demmidos.
019	PSA	132	007	Nuni, «Ane izi dizaso boos; iza tohoy yedhdhizason gufannidi izas goynnoos.
019	PSA	132	008	«Abeet GODAWU! Denda! Ne minoteththas malata gidida Taabotaara ne Keeth gelada shempa.
019	PSA	132	009	Ne qeeseti xilloteth may7etto; geesh gidida ne asati ililetto» gidos.
019	PSA	132	010	Ne aylle Dawite gishshas gaada neni tiydayssa yeggofa.
019	PSA	132	011	GODAY Dawites qanththafe caaqqides; laamettontta qaalan, «Ne naytappe issaa tani ne araatan utissana.
019	PSA	132	012	Ne nayti ta caaqo qaalanne tani tamaarsida qaala istti naagikko istta naytikka ne kawoteththa araatan mernaas uttana» gi caaqqides.
019	PSA	132	013	GODAY Xiyoono doorides; baas de7izaso ooththanaas amottidi,
019	PSA	132	014	«Hanna taas mernaas shempposo gidana; tani izo dosida gishshas izin de7ana.
019	PSA	132	015	Tani izo keeha anjjana; izin de7iza manqotakka kath kalssana.
019	PSA	132	016	Tani izin diza qeeseta atoteth mayzana; izin de7iza Xoossa asatikka ufayssan yexxana.
019	PSA	132	017	«Ha sohon Dawite zereththafe kawo kessana; tani tiydayssas poo7o giigsana.
019	PSA	132	018	Tani iza morkketa yeellachchana; gido attiin iza hu7aan de7iza kawoteththa kallachchay phoollana» gides.
019	PSA	133	001	Ishantti issifeteththan de7izayssi ay mala lo7onne ay mala ufayssizaazee!
