019	PSA	134	002	Xoossa Keeththan intte kushe denththidi GODAA galatite.
019	PSA	134	003	Salonne sa7a medhdhida GODAY inttena Xiyooneppe anjjo.
019	PSA	135	001	Intteno GODAA aylletoo! Iza galatite! GODAA sunththa sabbite!
019	PSA	135	002	Intteno GODAA Keeththan ooththizaytoo! Intteno nu Xoossa Keeththa zagon eqqidayto galatite!
019	PSA	135	003	Izi kiya gidida gishshas GODAA galatite! Izi lo7o gidida gishshas iza sunththaas yexxite!
019	PSA	135	004	GODAY Yaaqoobe baas buzo ooththides; Isra7eelekka baas al7o miish histti doorides.
019	PSA	135	005	GODAY gita gididayssanne nu GODAY xoossata ubbaafe dhoqqizayssa tani erays.
019	PSA	135	006	Saloninne sa7an, abbataninne ciimmata ubbaa giddonkka GODAY ba dosidayssa ubbaa ooththees.
019	PSA	135	007	Kareththa shaara sa7a gaxappe izi denththees; izi irara wolqqanth kiittees; ba minjji woththidasoppe carko kessi yeddees.
019	PSA	135	008	Gibxe biittan asappe biidi mehe gakkanaas bayra yelettida ubbaa wodhides.
019	PSA	135	009	Nenoo Gibxe! Paaroone bollanne iza oosanchchata bolla ooraththinne malalisiza miish yeddides.
019	PSA	135	010	Izi daro kawoteththata dhayssides; wolqqama kawotakka wodhides.
019	PSA	135	011	Amooreta kawo Sihoone, Baasaane kawo Aagenne Kanaane kawota ubbaa wodhides.
019	PSA	135	012	Istta biittaaka ba deraa Isra7eele laatissides.
019	PSA	135	013	Abeet GODAWU! Ne sunththi mernaas daana; yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas neni hassa7ettana.
019	PSA	135	014	GODAY ba asaas pirdana; izi ba aylletaskka qadhettana.
019	PSA	135	015	Kawoteththati goynniza eeqa xoossati birappenne worqqafe asa kushen oosettidayta.
019	PSA	135	016	Isttas doonay dees shin haasayettenna; ayfey dees shin xeellettenna.
019	PSA	135	017	Hayththi dees shin siyettenna; istta siidhen peenoykka deenna.
019	PSA	135	018	Istta medhdhidaytinne isttan ammanettizayti ubbay istta mala gidetto.
019	PSA	135	019	Isra7eele derezoo! GODAA galatite; Aaroone keeththa asatoo! GODAA sabbite;
019	PSA	135	020	Lewe keeththa asatoo! GODAA galatite; GODAAS yayyizaytoo! Ubbay GODAA galatite.
019	PSA	135	021	Yerusalaamen de7iza GODAY Xiyoonen galatetto! GODAY galatetto!
019	PSA	136	001	GODAA galatite! Izi kiya; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	002	Xoossata Xoossa galatite! iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	003	GODAA galatite! iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	004	Izi xalla gita malalisiza miish ooththees; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	005	Ba hiillateththan salota medhdhides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	006	Biittaa haaththa bollan miccides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	007	Gita poo7ota medhdhides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	008	Arshey gallas poo7ana mala ooththides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	009	Aginaynne xoolintteti omars poo7isana mala ooththides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	010	Izi Gibxe biittan bayrata wodhides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	011	Isra7eele asaa Gibxeppe kaaleththi kessides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	012	Ba mino kusheninne ba wolqqama qesen hayssa ooththides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	013	Zo7o abba shaakki yeggides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	014	Isra7eele asaa he abba giddora pinththides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	015	Gibxe kawonne iza olanchchata Zo7o abban mitissides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	016	Izi ba asaa bazzora kaaleththides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	017	Gita kawota shocides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	018	Wolqqama kawota wodhides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	019	Amooreta kawoza Sihoone wodhides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	020	Qasse Baasaane kawoza Aage wodhides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	021	Histtidi istta biitta ba asaa laatissides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	022	Ba aylle Isra7eele laatissides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	023	Nuni kawuyida wode izi nuna qoppides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	024	Nuna nu morkketappe ashshides; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	025	Medheta ubbaas mizaaz immees; iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	136	026	Salo Xoossa galatite! iza siiqoy mernaassa.
019	PSA	137	001	Baabiloone shaafata lanqen uttidi nuni Xiyoone qoppida wode yeekkidos.
019	PSA	137	002	Heen nuni nu diiththata haaththa matan dicciza miththata bolla kaqqidos.
019	PSA	137	003	Nuna di7ida asati nuni yexxidi istta ufayssana mala, «Xiyoone yeththafe issaa ane nuus yexxite» gida.
019	PSA	137	004	GODAA mazamure nuni allaga biittan wostti yexxonii?
019	PSA	137	005	Yerusalaame katamayee! Tani nena balikko ta ushachcha kushey ba ooso balo.
019	PSA	137	006	Tani nena hassa7ontta aggiko ta ufayssa ubbaafe aaththada Yerusalaame dosontta aggiko ta inxarsay gonggiraththara oyketto.
019	PSA	137	007	Abeet GODAWU! Yerusalaamey kundiza gallas Eedoome asati ooththidayssa qoppa; istti, «Laallite! Laallite! Yochchaafe dhoqalli dhayssite!» gidayssa baloppa.
019	PSA	137	008	Hanne Baabiloone biittayee ne dhayana! Neni nu bolla polida iita ooso ne bolla zaari ooththizay anjjettidayssa.
019	PSA	137	009	Ne guuththa nayta oykkidi zaalla bolla dincereththizay anjjettidayssa.
019	PSA	138	001	Abeet GODAWU! Tani ta kumeththa wozinappe nena galatays; xoossata sinththan nena sabbays.
019	PSA	138	002	Ne geeshsha Keeththakko simmada nena goynnays; ne siiqo gishshassinne ne ammaneteththa gishshas tani ne sunththa sabbays; neni ne sunththaanne ne qaala ubbaafe aaththada dhoqqu histtadasa.
019	PSA	138	003	Tani xeygida gallas taas koyadasa; ne minoteththan tana minththeththa.
019	PSA	138	004	Abeet GODAWU! Sa7an diza kawoti ubbay ne doonappe ke7ida qaala siyidi nena galatetto!
019	PSA	138	005	GODAA bonchchoy gita gidida gishshas istti izi ooththida ooso gishshas yexetto.
019	PSA	138	006	GODAY bolla dhoqqan diikkoka hiyeesata lo7o ayfen xeellees; gido attiin otoranchchata izi haahoppe erees.
019	PSA	138	007	Tani meto giddon diikkoka neni tana naagaasa; ta morkketa hanqo bolla ne qese denththaasa; ne ushachcha kushen tana ashshaasa.
019	PSA	138	008	GODAY taas qoppidayssa polana; abeet GODAWU! Ne siiqoy mernaassa; ne kushe ooso yegga aggofa.
019	PSA	139	001	Abeet GODAWU! Neni tana pilgga eradasa.
019	PSA	139	002	Tani awude uttizaakkonne awude eqqizakko neni eraasa; neni ta qofa ubbaa haakoppe akeekaasa.
019	PSA	139	003	Tani bizaasonne shempizaso xomosaasa; ta ogeta ubbaa neni eraasa.
019	PSA	139	004	Abeet GODAWU! Tani ta doonappe issi qaalakka haasayanaappe kasetada neni ta qofa ubbaa eraasa.
019	PSA	139	005	Neni ta yuusho ubbaan daasa; ne kushezan tana naagaasa.
019	PSA	139	006	Ne erateththay tana keehippe malalisees; tani akeekanaas dandayzayssafekka dhoqqees.
019	PSA	139	007	Tani ne Ayanappe awa baanaas dandayazinaa? Woykko ne sinththafe awa baqatanaas dandayazinaa?
019	PSA	139	008	Pude salo ke7ikko neni heen daasa! Duge si7oole wodhdhikokka neni heen daasa.
019	PSA	139	009	Arshey mokkizaso bagga paalla biikko, woykko arshey wullizaso bagga haakka biikko,
019	PSA	139	010	Tana heen ne kushey kaaleththees; ne ushachcha kusheykka tana minththi oykkees.
019	PSA	139	011	Tani, «Dhumazoo! Tana genththa; poo7ozoo! Ta yuushon dhuma» giikko,
019	PSA	139	012	dhumay nena xeelo diggenna; omarsi nees gallassa mala poo7ees; dhumaynne poo7oy nees issi mala.
019	PSA	139	013	Neni ta asateththa ubbaa medhdhadasa; ta aayey ulonkka tana tila medhdhadasa.
019	PSA	139	014	Neni tana keehi yegalththinne malalisizaaz histta medhdhida gishshas ta nena galatays; ne oosoti malalisizayta! Ta shemppoya hessa ubbaa erawus.
019	PSA	139	015	Tani geemason medhettida wode ta meqeththati neeppe geemmibeettenna; tani ta aayey ulon ciimma giddon hiillan oosettiza wode,
019	PSA	139	016	ta aayi ulon buro suuth gida ta dishin ne ayfeti be7ida; ta layththatappe issoynne doomettontta dishin taas neni barida gallassati ubbay ne mazgaban xaafettida.
019	PSA	139	017	Abeet Xoossawu! Ne taas qoppiza qofay ay mala lo7oo! Izikka ay keena coraa!
019	PSA	139	018	Tani iza qoodikko aceppeka daro; ta ichcha beeggiza wode ha7ikka nenara de7ays.
019	PSA	139	019	Abeet Xoossawu! Neni iitata siifidaakko aazee dizay! Suuth gussana saamettiza asati taappe haakkite!
019	PSA	139	020	Istti ne bolla iita miish haasayeettes; ne morkketi ne sunththaa mooreettes.
019	PSA	139	021	Abeet GODAWU! Nena ixxizayta tani ixxikinaa? Ne bolla dendizayta tani harassettikinaa?
019	PSA	139	022	Ta istta mulera ixxays; istta tani ta morkketa mala qoodays.
019	PSA	139	023	Abeet Xoossawu! Ta wozina pilggada era; tana paaccada ta ceece qofaakka shaakka era.
019	PSA	139	024	Ane tanan iitay de7ikko xeella; histtada mernaa ogera tana kaaleththa.
019	PSA	140	001	Abeet GODAWU! Iita asatappe tana ashsha; makkallanchchatappeka tana naaga.
019	PSA	140	002	Istti ubba wode iita ooththanaas maqetteettes; ubba gallassika oosh denththanaas yo7o piqqeettes.
019	PSA	140	003	Istti haso shooshsha mala inxars qaraseettes; istta doonappe goppe marze mala qaalay kezees.
019	PSA	140	004	Abeet GODAWU! iita asata kusheppe tana ashsha; ta toho qaxxanaas qoppiza makkallanchchatappeka tana naaga.
019	PSA	140	005	Otoranchchati taas woximade woththida; gite giigsida; ta ogenkka diiza woththida.
019	PSA	140	006	Tani GODAA, «Neni ta Xoossa» gays. Abeet GODAWU! Tani shoobbizayssa siya.
019	PSA	140	007	Abeet Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAWU! tana ashshiza minozoo! ola gallas taas gondalle gidadasa!
019	PSA	140	008	Abeet GODAWU! Iitata amoy polettofo; istta qofay polettana mala ooththofa!
019	PSA	140	009	Ta morkketan tana xoonisoppa; istti qoppida iita qofay istta hu7en xaaxetto.
019	PSA	140	010	Istta bolla tama bonqoy qoletto; istti taman olettetto; simmi kezanaas dandayontta ollan kundetto.
019	PSA	140	011	Iita haasayzayta biittay tookkofo; makkallanchchata iita miishshi oykko.
019	PSA	140	012	GODAY hiyeesatas pirdizayssanne metotanchchatas mootettizayssa ta erays.
019	PSA	140	013	Xilloti tumuppe ne sunththaa galatana; suuretikka ne sinththan de7ana.
019	PSA	141	001	Abeet GODAWU! Tani nena xeygays; tana maaddanaas elela. Tani neekko waassiza wode ta waaso siya!
019	PSA	141	002	Ta woosay exaane cuwa mala ne sinth shiiqo; tani ta kusheza miccizayssi nees omarsa wode yarsho mala gido.
019	PSA	141	003	Abeet GODAWU! Ta doona naaganaas zabe woththa; ta mettershata pengen naagizayssa essa.
019	PSA	141	004	Mooro ooththiza asatara iita ooso ooththontta mala ta wozina iitakko zaaroppa; istta gibiraakka tana mizoppa.
019	PSA	141	005	Xillo asi tana qaxxayo; hessika taas lo7o; izi tana seerikko hessi ta hu7en zayte tiyiza mala; hessaka ta ixxike; gido attiin tani ubbatokka iita asata ooso bolla woossays.
019	PSA	141	006	Istta daannati aafora duge olettiza wode ta qaalay tuma gididayssa istti erana.
019	PSA	141	007	Gadey goyettiza malanne phashey liiqiza mala istta meqeththika duufo doonan laalettana.
019	PSA	141	008	Abeet GODAWU, Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossawu! Ta ayfey nena xeellees; ta zemppoy nena; tana hayqos aaththada immofa.
019	PSA	141	009	Istti taas woththida woximadeppenne iita ooththizayta giteppe tana naaga.
019	PSA	141	010	Ta saro aadhdhishin istti bantti woththida gitezan oyketetto.
019	PSA	142	001	Ta qaala dhoqqu histtada tani GODAAKKO waassays. GODAAPPE maaroteth woossays.
019	PSA	142	002	Ta qohoza ubbaa izas magannays; ta meto ubbaa izas yootays.
019	PSA	142	003	Tani daaburda wode neni ta oge eraasa; ta hemettiza ogen tana oykkanaas woximade woththida.
019	PSA	142	004	Tani ta yuusho simma xeelliza wode tana maaddanay oonikka deenna; ta baqata attanaasoyka deenna; ta shemppoys wudettiza asikka deenna.
019	PSA	142	005	Abeet GODAWU! Ne tana maaddana mala ta neekko waassays; ta zemppoy nena; ta shemppora paxa dishin ta qaaday nena.
019	PSA	142	006	Tani keehippe hidota qanxxida gishshas ne ta waaso siya! Tana gooddizayti taappe wolqqatida gishshas tana ashsha.
019	PSA	142	007	Tani ne sunththaa galatana mala tana qashoppe birsha. Neni taas lo7o gidida gishshas xilloti ta yuushon shiiqana.
019	PSA	143	001	Abeet GODAWU! Ta woosa siya; ta shoobbizayssa ezga; neni xillonne ammanettizayssa gidida gishshas taas zaaro imma.
019	PSA	143	002	Ne sinththan xillo gidana asi oonikka deenna; tana ne aylleza pirdas shiishshofa.
019	PSA	143	003	Ta hayqqana gakkanaas ta morkketi tana yedeththida; tana dirxxidi biitta gars gelththida; kase hayqqida asata malakka tana dhuman woththida.
019	PSA	143	004	Hessa gishshas tani daaburadis; ta wozinaykka hidota qanxxides.
019	PSA	143	005	Tani beni wodeta hassa7ays; neni ooththida ooso ubbaa yuushsha qoppays; ne kushe oosotakka akeekays.
019	PSA	143	006	Tani ta kusheza neekko miccays; mela biittay haath koyza mala ta shemppoya nena saamettadus.
019	PSA	143	007	Abeet GODAWU! Tani daaburadis; ne taas zaaro immanaas elela! Tani hayqqida asataththo duge duufon gelontta mala ne sinththa taappe genththofa.
019	PSA	143	008	Tani nena ammanettiza gishshas maalado maalado ne siiqo tana bessa; tani ta shemppo nees hadaradis; hessa gishshas ta baana oge tana tamaarsa.
019	PSA	143	009	Abeet GODAWU! Ta ne garsan qotettadis; tana ta morkketappe ashsha.
019	PSA	143	010	Neni ta Xoossa; tani ne shene polana mala tana tamaarsa; ne lo7o Ayanay tana suure oge kaaleththo.
019	PSA	143	011	Abeet GODAWU! Ne sunththa gishshas tana ashsha; ne xilloteththan tana metoppe kessa.
019	PSA	143	012	Ne tana siiqiza gishshas ta morkketa suppu histta wodha; tana ne aylleza un7eththizayta dippi histta dhayssa.
019	PSA	144	001	Ta kusheta olas, ta biradhdhetakka xongeththas loohissida GODAY ta zaallay galatetto!
019	PSA	144	002	Izi tana siiqizanne genththiza Xoossa; izi taas miixanne tana ashshizayssa; izi ta gondallenne tani baqatada attizaso; kawoteththatakka izi taas haarisizayssa.
019	PSA	144	003	Abeet GODAWU! Ne hayssa sire bonchchanaas asi aazee? Ne hayssaththo asas qoppanawu asa nay aazee?
019	PSA	144	004	Asi issito carki aadhdhiza carko mala; iza layththatikka eeson dhayza kuwa mala.
019	PSA	144	005	Abeet GODAWU! neni salaa daakkada duge wodhdha! zumata bochchada cuwasa!
019	PSA	144	006	Wolqqanth yeddada ne morkketa laalla! Ne wondafe yiishshan dukkada yedeththa!
019	PSA	144	007	Bollafe ne kushe yeddada, tana wolqqama haaththafe goochcha kessa; allaga asata kusheppe ne tana ashsha.
019	PSA	144	008	Istta doonay wordo haasayees; istti ushachcha kushe denththidi wordo caaqqeettes.
019	PSA	144	009	Abeet Xoossawu! Tani nees ooraththa mazamure yexxana; tammu shayan waaxettida diiththan nees yexxana.
019	PSA	144	010	Kawotas xoono immaasa; ne aylle Dawite giththa mashshafe ashshaasa.
019	PSA	144	011	Wordo haasayzaytappenne ba ushachcha kushe denththidi wordo caaqqizaytappenne allagatappe tana ashshanne naaga.
019	PSA	144	012	Nu attuma nayti ba naateteththan dalqidalqidi dicciza miththa mala gidetto! Nu macca naytikka kawo keeththa gulan alleqos essida tuuqe mala gidetto.
019	PSA	144	013	Nu gootaratan dumma dumma qommo kaththi kumo; nu dorsati shii laaqqa gakkanaas yeletto; heemettizason tammu shii gakkanawu daretto.
019	PSA	144	014	Nu miizati yelizayta gidetto; istti awucayontta yelettidi corattetto. Nuna asi di7oppo; nu zagon waasoy siyettofo.
019	PSA	144	015	Ha anjjoy iza gakkiza derey anjjettida dere; Xoossi izas GODAA gidida derey anjjettida dere.
019	PSA	145	001	Abeet ta kawo Xoossawu! Tani nena dhoqqu dhoqqu histtana; ne sunththa mernaaskka galatana.
019	PSA	145	002	Tani nena ubba gallas sabbana; ne sunththaaka mernaas galatana.
019	PSA	145	003	GODAY gita; gita galatay izas bessees; iza gitateththay asa qofappe bolla.
019	PSA	145	004	Issi yeletay kaalliza yeletas ne ooththida ooso yootees; malalisiza ne oosotakka qonccisana.
019	PSA	145	005	Istti ne bonchchonne ne gita teema haasayana; tanikka malalisiza ne oosoza zaara zaara qoppana.
019	PSA	145	006	Asay malalisiza ne oosoza gitateththa gishshas haasayettana; tanikka ne gitateththa awajjana.
019	PSA	145	007	Istti ne kiyateththa daroza yootana; ne xilloteththaa ufayssan yexxana.
019	PSA	145	008	GODAY qadhettizayssanne maarizayssa; izi hanqettanaas eesotonttayssanne siiqoy kumidayssa.
019	PSA	145	009	GODAY ubbaas kiya; izi ba medhdhida ubbaas qadhettizayssa.
019	PSA	145	010	Abeet GODAWU! medheta ubbay nena galatana; ne derey ubbayka nena sabbana.
019	PSA	145	011	Istti ne kawoteththa bonchcho gishshas haasayana; ne wolqqa gishshas yootana.
019	PSA	145	012	Hessan ne wolqqama oosotanne ne kawoteththa teema bonchchoza istti erisana.
019	PSA	145	013	Yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas ne haarana; ne kawoteththay mernaassa. GODAY ba gida qaalan ammanettizayssa; izi ba ooso ubbaan kiya.
019	PSA	145	014	GODAY gandigarzayta kaafees; kundidaytakka denththees.
019	PSA	145	015	Ubbaa ayfey neekko xeellees; isttas koshshiza woden neni isttas quma immaasa.
019	PSA	145	016	Neni ne kushe miccada shemppora paxa diza ubbaa amo kunththaasa.
019	PSA	145	017	GODAY ba oge ubbaan xillo; izi ba ooso ubbaan kiya.
019	PSA	145	018	GODAY bana xeygizaytas ubbaas mata; wozinappe xeygiza ubbaas matan dees.
019	PSA	145	019	Izi baas yayyiza ubbaas amo kunththees. Qasse izi istta waasoza siyidi istta ashshees.
019	PSA	145	020	GODAY bana siiqizayta ubbaa naagees; gido attiin iitata ubbaa dhayssana.
019	PSA	145	021	Tani ta doonan GODAA galatana. Medheta ubbay iza geeshsha sunththa meri mernaas galato!
019	PSA	146	001	GODAY galatetto! Ta shemppoyee, GODAA galata!
019	PSA	146	002	Ta de7o layththa ubbaan tani GODAA galatana; tani shemppora paxa diza wode ubbaan ta Xoossa sabbana.
019	PSA	146	003	Dere ayssizaytan ammanettofte; As ashshanawu dandayontta asho may7ida medhetatan ceeqettofte.
019	PSA	146	004	Istta shemppoy keziza wode istti biittan simmana; istta halchchoy ubbay he gallas attana.
019	PSA	146	005	Yaaqoobe Xoossay maaddiza asi ba hidotakka ba GODAA bolla woththida asi anjjettidaade.
019	PSA	146	006	GODAY salonne sa7a, gita abbanne istta giddon diza ubbaa medhdhidayssa; izi ba ammaneteththaa mernaas naagizayssa.
019	PSA	146	007	Izi qohettidaytas pirdizayssa; gafidayta mizi kalssizayssa. GODAY qashettidayta birshi yeddizayssa;
019	PSA	146	008	GODAY qooqeta xeelisees. GODAY kundidayta denththees; GODAY xillotakka siiqees.
019	PSA	146	009	GODAY bete asata naagees. Am7etanne yi7o nayta maaddees; gido attiin iitata oge dhayssees.
019	PSA	146	010	GODAY mernaas kawo; Xiyoone! Ne Xoossi yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas kawotana. GODAY galatetto!
019	PSA	147	001	GODAY galatetto! Nu Xoossa mazamuren saboy ay mala lo7o! iza galatizayssi ufayssees; hessika izas bessees.
019	PSA	147	002	GODAY Yerusalaame ooraxissana; Isra7eeleppe betidaytakka shiishshana.
019	PSA	147	003	Wozinay meqqidayta izi koolees; istta madunththaaka izi paththees.
019	PSA	147	004	Izi salo xoolintteta qooda erees; issaa issaa iza sunththan sunththan xeygees.
019	PSA	147	005	Nu GODAY gita; izi keehippe wolqqama; iza erateththaas zaway deenna.
019	PSA	147	006	GODAY kadhettidayta bonchchees; gido attiin iitata kawushshees.
019	PSA	147	007	GODAAS galata mazamure yexxite; nu Xoossas maasinqo shocishe galatite.
019	PSA	147	008	Izi salo shaara mayzees; sa7as ira bukisees; zumata bollaka maata mokisees.
019	PSA	147	009	Medosassinne quuro yelotas miza miish izi immees.
019	PSA	147	010	Izi ufayettizay parata wolqqaninne tooranchchata minoteththan gidenna.
019	PSA	147	011	GODAY baas yayyizaytaninne iza siiqon ammanettizaytan ufayettees.
019	PSA	147	012	Yerusalaame katamayee! GODAA galata! Hanne Xiyoonee! Ne Xoossa sabba!
019	PSA	147	013	Izi ne penge kolata minththees; ne giddon diza ne nayta anjjees.
019	PSA	147	014	Izi ne zawa saroteththan naagees; nena keehippe lo7iza gistte kalssees.
019	PSA	147	015	Izi ba kiita sa7as kiittees; iza qaalaykka eeson gakkees.
019	PSA	147	016	Izi shach afala mala miccees; kenchchoka bidinththa mala laallees.
019	PSA	147	017	Izi shach shuchcha mala duge yeddana; he moocezan eqqanaas ooninne dandayenna.
019	PSA	147	018	Izi ba qaala kiittidi shachchaa mayisees. Izi carko carkissiin haaththi goggees.
019	PSA	147	019	Izi ba qaala Yaaqoobe zereththas ba maaraanne wogaa Isra7eele asaas qonccisees.
019	PSA	147	020	Izi hessa mala hara kawoteththatas ooththibeenna; istti iza woga erettenna. GODAY galatetto!
019	PSA	148	001	GODAY galatetto! Salon de7izaytoo! GODAA galatite; bolla dhoqqan de7izaytoo! Iza sabbite.
019	PSA	148	002	Intteno iza kiitanchchatoo! Ubbay iza galatite; salon de7iza iza olanchchatoo! Ubbay iza galatite.
019	PSA	148	003	Arsheynne aginay iza galatite; poo7isiza xoolinttetoo! Ubbay iza galatite.
019	PSA	148	004	Intteno ubbaafe bolla dhoqqan diza salotoo! Iza galatite; Salo gufanththofe bollara diza haaththatoo! Iza sabbite.
019	PSA	148	005	Izi azaziin istti ubbayka medhettida gishshas ubbati GODAA sunththaa galatetto!
019	PSA	148	006	Izi istta istti dizason meri mernaas minththi woththides; Izi isttas laamettontta woga immides.
019	PSA	148	007	Sa7an de7izaytoo! GODAA galatite! Abba giddon diza gita medheteththatinne wogga gita abba ciimmati ubbayka iza sabbite.
019	PSA	148	008	Wolqqanththinne shachchi, kenchchoynne gubbanay, iza azazo poliza gote carkoti ubbatikka iza galatite.
019	PSA	148	009	Zumatoo, zumbullatoo, ayfe ayfiza miththatoo, zigatoo ubbatikka iza galatite.
019	PSA	148	010	Mehetoo, do7atoo, sa7ara gooshettiza medhetatoo! Paalliza kafotoo ubbatikka iza galatite.
019	PSA	148	011	Sa7aa kawotoo, kawoteththatoo! Daannatoo, dere haarizaytoo! Ubbatikka iza galatite.
019	PSA	148	012	Panththatoo, geela7otoo, cimatoo, naytoo! Ubbatikka iza galatite.
019	PSA	148	013	Iza sunththi ubbaa bolla dhoqqa; iza bonchchoy sa7appenne saloppe bolla; hessa gishshas hayti ubbay iza sunth galatetto.
019	PSA	148	014	Iza bagga gidida Isra7eele asati iza galatana mala izi istta kace kessides. GODAY galatetto!
019	PSA	149	001	GODAY galatetto! GODAAS ooraththa mazamure yexxite! Geeshshata shiiqoson izas galata mazamure yexxite!
019	PSA	149	002	Isra7eele asati bana medhdhidayssan ufayettetto; Xiyoone asati ba kawozan keehippe ufayettetto.
019	PSA	149	003	Durishe karabe baqqishenne diith diixxishe iza sunth sabbetto.
019	PSA	149	004	GODAY ba asan ufayettees; ashketa ashshidi bonchchon puulasees.
019	PSA	149	005	He puulateththaan Xoossa asati ufayssan yexxetto; gadey wonttana gakkanaas ililishe yexxetto.
019	PSA	149	006	Istta doonan Xoossa galatay, istta kushenkka qara giththa mashshay de7o.
019	PSA	149	007	Istti hessan kawoteththata bolla halo kessana; asaakka qaxxayana.
019	PSA	149	008	Istta kawota sansalatan, istta ola qaratakka biratan qachchana.
019	PSA	149	009	Hessan istta bolla xaafettida pirda polidi Xoossa asati xoonana. GODAY galatetto!
019	PSA	150	001	GODAY galatetto! Xoossa iza keeththan galatite; iza wolqqay diza salo gufanththon iza galatite.
019	PSA	150	002	Izi ooththida wolqqama oosota gishshas iza galatite; izi keehi gita gidida gishshas iza galatite!
019	PSA	150	003	Zayen iza galatite; bagananinne maasinqon iza galatite.
019	PSA	150	004	Karabe baqqishenne durishe iza galatite; tammu shayan waaxettida diiththaninne susul7en iza sabbite.
019	PSA	150	005	Daala qaaththishe iza galatite; daalaa shocishe iza galatite.
019	PSA	150	006	Shemppora paxa diza ubbay GODAA galatite! GODAY galatetto!
#
# BOOK	020	PRO	Proverbs	Leemiso Maxaafa
020	PRO	001	001	Hayti Isra7eele Kawo Dawite naa Solomoone leemisota.
020	PRO	001	002	Leemisoti asay aadho erateththa, seeranne erateththa haasaya akeekanaas maaddeettes.
020	PRO	001	003	Isttika de7ana de7on aadho erateth, xilloteth, suure pirdanne suure hano tamaarsizayta.
020	PRO	001	004	Erateththi paccidaytas akeeka, naateththatas erateththinne wozinamateth immizayta.
020	PRO	001	005	Aadho eranchchati ha leemisota siyidi erateth gujjeettes; akeekanchcha asatikka lo7o zoreta ekkeettes.
020	PRO	001	006	Hessa malan leemisotanne istta birsheththata, aadho eranchchata haasayanne istta maaleththo akeekanaas dandayeettes.
020	PRO	001	007	Aadho erateththas koyroy GODAAS yashshateththa; eeyati gidikko aadho erateththinne seera kadheettes.
020	PRO	001	008	Ta naazoo! Ne aawa zore ezga; ne aaya tamaarsizayssaka aggofa.
020	PRO	001	009	Hessi ne hu7es bonchcho kallachcha; nees qoodhen aaththiza alleqo mala gidana.
020	PRO	001	010	Ta naazoo! Nena nagaranchchati baleththiko eeno gooppa.
020	PRO	001	011	Istti nena, «Ane haa ya; issife biidi suuth gussanaas zuggoos; xillotakka wodhanaas qotetti uttoos.
020	PRO	001	012	Duufoy mittiza mala nunikka ane istta paxa dishin mittoos; nuni istta ciimma ollan olettiza asa mala ane ooththoos.
020	PRO	001	013	Nuni al7o miish ubbaa demmana; histtidi nu keeththa bonqqi ekkida miishshan kunththana.
020	PRO	001	014	Nunara zuppeta; demmidaaz issife go7ettana» gaana.
020	PRO	001	015	Ta naazoo! Isttara issife oge hemettofa; istti biza oge baana gaada ne toho denththofa.
020	PRO	001	016	Gaasoykka istti iita miish ooththanaas woxxeettes; asaa suuth gussanaaskka jaameettes.
020	PRO	001	017	Kafoy xeellishin iza oykkanaas yarde woththiko aykkoka maaddenna.
020	PRO	001	018	Hayti ha asati bantta suuth gussanaas zuggeettes; bantta shemppo wodhanaas qotetti utteettes.
020	PRO	001	019	Bessontta ogera go7a demmanaas woxxiza ubbata wurseththay hayssa mala; istti shiishshida aqotay istta shemppo ekki baana.
020	PRO	001	020	Aadho erateththaya oge bolla de7ashe xeygawus; dubbushan ba qaala dhoqqu histtada waassawus.
020	PRO	001	021	Aadho erateththaya cora asi shiiqizason waassawus; katama geliza pengen eqqada,
020	PRO	001	022	«Intteno wozina pacetoo! Intte awude gakkanaas eeyateththa oge kaallanee? Qilccizaytoo! Intte qilccizayssan awude gakkanaas ufayetteetii? Eeyatoo! Erateththa awude gakkanaas ixxanee?
020	PRO	001	023	Ta seeran intte simmidaakko, tani ta qofa inttes qonccisanakkoshin; ta qaalakka inttena tamaarsanakkoshin.
020	PRO	001	024	Tani xeygida wode intte koyontta ixxideta; tani ta kusheza micciin oonikka wudu gibeenna.
020	PRO	001	025	Ta zore ubbaa kadhideta; ta seerakka ekkibeekketa.
020	PRO	001	026	Hessa gishshas inttena metoy gakkiza wode tani intte bolla miiccana; bashshi intte bolla gakkiza wode tani intte bolla qilccana.
020	PRO	001	027	Bashshi abba dambala mala inttena qaaththiza wode, metoy gote carko mala inttena denththiza wode, tuggaynne waayey inttena mittiza wode tani inttena qilccana.
020	PRO	001	028	«He wode istti tana xeygana; ta gidikko isttas koykke; istti tana minththi koyana; gido attiin tana demmettenna.
020	PRO	001	029	Istti erateth ixxida; GODAAS yashshateth dooribeettenna.
020	PRO	001	030	Ta zore ekkanaas koyibeettenna; ta seera ubbaa kadhida.
020	PRO	001	031	Hessa gishshas istti bantti ooththida ooso ayfeza maana; bantti qoppida qofa ayfekka kallana.
020	PRO	001	032	Wozinay paccidayta aadho erateththafe haakoy istta wodhana; balata wuda dhayoy istta dhayssana.
020	PRO	001	033	Gido attiin tana siyizayti ubbay saron daana; aykko hirgay baynda woppan daana» gawus.
020	PRO	002	001	Ta naazoo! Neni ta qaala siyikko, ta azazokka neni ne wozinan woththiko,
020	PRO	002	002	ne hayth aadho erateththaako zaarikko, ne wozina akeekakko ne zaarikko,
020	PRO	002	003	shaakki erisiza erateth ne koykko, ne qaala dhoqqu histtada akeeka xeygikko,
020	PRO	002	004	izokka bira koyza mala ne koykko, qotan diza aqota mala ne izo minththa koykko,
020	PRO	002	005	he wode neni GODAAS yashshateth akeekana; Xoossaaka lo7eththada erana.
020	PRO	002	006	GODAY aadho erateth immiza gishshas izappe erateththinne akeekay beettes.
020	PRO	002	007	Izi suuretas xoono minjjees; istta bolla wosoy bayndaytas gondalle gidees.
020	PRO	002	008	Suure pirda oge naagees; baas ammanettizayta hemeth minththees.
020	PRO	002	009	He wode neni xilloteth, suure pirda, geellay baynda pirdanne lo7o oge ubbaa shaakka erana.
020	PRO	002	010	Gaasoykka aadho erateththi ne wozinan gelana; erateththayka ne shemppo ufayssana.
020	PRO	002	011	Shaakki eroy nees gondalle gidana; akeekaykka nena naagana.
020	PRO	002	012	Aadho erateththi nena iita asata ogeppe ashshana; geella haasayzaytappeka nena naagana.
020	PRO	002	013	Istti dhuma ogen baanaas suure oge aggizayta;
020	PRO	002	014	Istti iita ooson ufayettizayta; geella ogen hombocizayta.
020	PRO	002	015	Istta ogey geella; istta hemetay mirqqeththa.
020	PRO	002	016	Aadho erateththi layma maccassafe naagana; ba inxarsan cimmizaarippe nena ashshana.
020	PRO	002	017	Iza ba yelagateththa azina aggidaaro; Xoossa sinththan gelida caaqo qaala kadhidaaro.
020	PRO	002	018	Izi soo beeththi hayqos gaththees; izi ogetikka moytilleta duulatan gaththeettes.
020	PRO	002	019	Izikko gelida oonikka guye simmenna; de7o ogekka demmenna.
020	PRO	002	020	Hessa gishshas neni lo7o asata leemiso kaalla; xillota ogen hemetta.
020	PRO	002	021	Suure asati biitta bolla gam7ana; wosoy baynda asatikka izi bolla minni daana.
020	PRO	002	022	Gido attiin iitati biittafe dhayana; ammanettonttaytikka dhoqallettana.
020	PRO	003	001	Ta naazoo! Tani nena tamaarsizayssa dogoppa; ta azazotakka ne wozinan woththa.
020	PRO	003	002	Istti ne layth adussana; ishalo de7onne saroteth nees gujjana.
020	PRO	003	003	Siiqoynne tumateththi neeppe haakkofetto; istta ne qoodhen qachcha; ne wozinankka xaafa.
020	PRO	003	004	Histtiko neni Xoossa sinththaninne asaa sinththan sabettananne lo7o sunth demmana.
020	PRO	003	005	Neni polo wozinan GODAAN ammanetta; neni ne akeekan zemppofa.
020	PRO	003	006	Neni biza oge ubbaan iza sinththasa; izikka ne biza oge suurisana.
020	PRO	003	007	Nerkka nena aadho eranchcha gooppa; GODAAS yayya; iitappeka haakka.
020	PRO	003	008	Hessi ne bollaa payya woththana; ne meqeththatakka xalisana.
020	PRO	003	009	GODAA ne aqotan bonchcha; biittay nees immiza ayfe ubbaafe xeeraa izas imon bonchcha.
020	PRO	003	010	Ne hessaththo ooththiko ne gootarati kumi palahana; neni woyne ushshu agizasoti cippi gi kumana.
020	PRO	003	011	Ta naazoo! GODAA seera kadhoppa; izi nena hanqiza wodekka lanccofa.
020	PRO	003	012	Aaway ba siiqiza naa seerizayssaththo GODAYKKA ba dosiza naa seerees.
020	PRO	003	013	Aadho erateth demmanaas woxxiza asi, akeekakka baas miishshe ooththiza asi anjjettidaade.
020	PRO	003	014	Gaasoykka izippe demmiza go7ay birappe demmiza go7appe aadhdhees; izippe beettiza go7ay worqqafe beettiza go7appe aadhdhees.
020	PRO	003	015	Aadho erateththi zo7o inqqufe keehi al7o; neni demmanaas amottiza ubbay izira ginattenna.
020	PRO	003	016	Iza ushachcha kushen adussa layth, hadirsa kushen aqotanne bonchcho oykkadus.
020	PRO	003	017	Izi ogeti ufayssiza ogeta; iza hemettiza oge ubbayka saro.
020	PRO	003	018	Iza bana idimmizaytas de7o miththa; izo oykkizaytikka anjjettana.
020	PRO	003	019	GODAY ba aadho erateththan sa7a medhdhides; ba akeekankka salota istti dizason minththides.
020	PRO	003	020	Shaafati iza erateththan goggeettes; shaarati ira immeettes.
020	PRO	003	021	Ta naazoo! Suure pirdanne shaakki ero naaga; istti ne sinththafe haakkofetto.
020	PRO	003	022	Istti nees de7o gidana; ne qoodheskka aleqo gidana.
020	PRO	003	023	He wode neni ogen hirgay baynda hemettana; ne tohoykka dhuphettenna.
020	PRO	003	024	Neni ichchida wode babbaka; ichchadakka mal7o dhisko dhiskana.
020	PRO	003	025	Akeekontta gakkiza metonne iitata bolla gakkiza dhayssas babbaka.
020	PRO	003	026	Ays giikko GODAY nees ammanettizaade gidana; ne tohoy woximaden oykettontta mala izi nena naagana.
020	PRO	003	027	Nees maaddana wolqqay dishin maado bessizaytas lo7o ooso aggofa.
020	PRO	003	028	Ha7i nees dishin ne shoorozas, «Simmada ya; tani nees wonto immana» gooppa.
020	PRO	003	029	Nenan ammanettidi ne matan dishin ne shooroza bolla iita miish ooththanaas halchchofa.
020	PRO	003	030	Nena qohontta as gaasoy baynda coo mootoppa.
020	PRO	003	031	Gene ooththiza asata qullofa; istta iita ogekka kaallofa.
020	PRO	003	032	Gaasoykka GODAY iita ooththizayta ixxees; gido attiin suuretas izi ba wozina qofa qonccisees.
020	PRO	003	033	GODAA qanggeththi iita ooththizayta keeththanna; gido attiin iza anjjoy xillotasonna.
020	PRO	003	034	Otoreteththan qilccizayta bolla GODAYKKA qilccees; gido attiin banttana kawushshizayta bonchchees.
020	PRO	003	035	Aadho eranchchati bonchcho laattana; eeyati gidikko kawushshateththas aadhdhi imettana.
020	PRO	004	001	Ta naytoo! Intte aawa zore siyite; wozinan woththi ezgite; akeekakka inttes miish histtite.
020	PRO	004	002	Tani inttes lo7o timirte immiza gishshas ta timirte aggofte.
020	PRO	004	003	Tani ta hu7enkka ta aawaas yelaga naa; ta aayeyska mexi issi naa.
020	PRO	004	004	Ta aaway tana tamaarsishe, «Ta qaala kumeththa wozinan oykka; ta azazotakka naaga; ne histtiko paxa de7ana.
020	PRO	004	005	Aadho erateththinne akeeka oykka; ta qaala dogoppa; izippeka kare kezoppa.
020	PRO	004	006	Aadho erateth aggofa; iza nees gondalle gidana; izo siiqa; izakka nena naagana.
020	PRO	004	007	Aadho erateththi bayra; hessa gishshas izo demma. Akeekay ne aqoza ubbaa ekkizaa gidikkoka iza demma.
020	PRO	004	008	Neni aadho erateth bonchcha; iza nena dhoqqu dhoqqu ooththana; neni izo idimma; iza nena bonchchana.
020	PRO	004	009	Iza ne hu7en saba akilile woththana; bonchcho kallachchaka immana» gees.
020	PRO	004	010	Ta naazoo! Ta gizayssa ezga; ta qaalaakka ne wozinan woththa; ne layththi aduqqana.
020	PRO	004	011	Tani nena aadho erateththa oge kaaleththana; suure ogekka bessana.
020	PRO	004	012	Ne hemettashe dhuphettaka; woxxikokka kundaka.
020	PRO	004	013	Ta timirte lo7eththa oykka; izo yeddofa; iza nees de7o gidida gishshas izo naaga.
020	PRO	004	014	Nagaranchchata oge yedhdhofa; iita asata ogenkka hemettofa.
020	PRO	004	015	Izippe haakka; izin hemettofa; izippe guye simma; histtada ne ogeyra ba.
020	PRO	004	016	Istti iita ooththontta dishe dhiski erettenna; as dhupheththontta dishin dhiskoy istta ayfen yeenna.
020	PRO	004	017	Istti iitateth kaththa mala meettes; genekka ushsha mala uyeettes.
020	PRO	004	018	Xillota ogey seeta gallas gakkanaas poo7i poo7i biza mallado xalqqe mala.
020	PRO	004	019	Gido attiin nagaranchchata ogey sakkanna dhuma mala; istti aazan dhuphettanaakkoka erettenna.
020	PRO	004	020	Ta naazoo! Ta gizayssa akeeka; ta qaalaakka lo7eththa ezga.
020	PRO	004	021	Ne ayfe sinththafe haassofa; ne wozinan woththa.
020	PRO	004	022	Gaasoykka istti demmiza asas de7o immeettes; istti asateththaska payyateth immeettes.
020	PRO	004	023	Ubbaafekka bollara neni ne wozina minththada naaga; ays giikko de7oy izappe pulttees.
020	PRO	004	024	Ne doonappe gene haasaya digga; iita haasaya ne metershafe haassa.
020	PRO	004	025	Ne ayfeti sitti giidi sinth xeelletto; tishshi histtada ne sinththan dizayssa xeella.
020	PRO	004	026	Ne tohos oge giigsa; suure oge xalla hemetta.
020	PRO	004	027	Ushach hadirsi gooppa; ne toho iitappe naaga.
020	PRO	005	001	Ta naazoo! Ta aadho erateththaa ne wozinan woththa; tani akeekan yootiza qaala lo7eththa ezga.
020	PRO	005	002	Hessika wozinamateththi nees miish gidana malanne ne metershati erateth naagana malassa.
020	PRO	005	003	Layma maccassa inxarsafe eessa ililoy xokkees; izi haasayay oyssafekka aadhdhi shuggees.
020	PRO	005	004	Gido attiin iza wurseththan godare uuththa mala cammawus; nam7u baggara qanxxiza qara mashsha mala.
020	PRO	005	005	Izi tohoti duge hayqoso beettes; izi tanggoy sitti histti duge duufon kaaleththees.
020	PRO	005	006	Iza de7o oges wudu guukku; izi ogeti geella; gido attiin geella gididayssaka iza erukku.
020	PRO	005	007	Ta naytoo! Tana ezgite; ta yootiza qaalaappe ke7opite.
020	PRO	005	008	Intte oge izippe haassite; izi pengerakka aadhdhofte.
020	PRO	005	009	Hessika intte intte goobateththa haratas, intte layththaaka menxe iitatas intte immontta malassa.
020	PRO	005	010	Allagati intte aqotan kaa7ontta malanne intte daaburankka hara asasoy duretontta malassa.
020	PRO	005	011	Intte ashoy wuriin, intte meqeththi gilqiin wurseththa layththan intte goottarana.
020	PRO	005	012	Qasseka neni, «Tani ays seera ixxadinaa! Ta wozinaykka zore ays kadhidee!
020	PRO	005	013	Tana tamaarsizayti yootidayssa ekkabeekke; tana zorizayta zorezakka ezgabeekke.
020	PRO	005	014	Hessa gishshas tani shiiqida duulata sinththafe dhayana matadis» gaana.
020	PRO	005	015	Neni eelissida ne pultto haaththafe uyada aliza mala ne machcheys ammanettada izi siiqon ala.
020	PRO	005	016	Beetta beetta maccassi uyiza pultto haath gidoppa.
020	PRO	005	017	Nenateththaa ne machcheys naaga; hara maccassara zin7ofa.
020	PRO	005	018	Ne machcheya nees anjjettida pultto gidu; yelagateththan neni ekkida ne machcheyra ufayetta.
020	PRO	005	019	Lo7iza gaara malanne ufayssiza genessa mala, izi dhanththati ubba wode nena aletto; izi siiqoy nena ubbato oykko.
020	PRO	005	020	Ta naazoo! Layma maccassay siiqon ays maththottay? Hara asa machchira ays qoomettay?
020	PRO	005	021	Gaasoykka asi ooththiza ubbaa GODAY beyees; izi hemettiza hemetaa ubbaa pilggi xeellees.
020	PRO	005	022	Nagaranchcha izi ooththida nagaray zaari oykkees. Iza nagara gitey iza qachchees.
020	PRO	005	023	Izi ba eeyateththa daron oge balana; bana haarana dandayontta aggida gishshas izi hayqqana.
020	PRO	006	001	Ta naazoo! Neni ne shoorozas waase gelidaa gidikko, hara asa gishshas neni kushe baqqa caaqqidaa gidikko,
020	PRO	006	002	neni gelida qaalan oykettidaa gidikko, ne doonappe ke7ida qaalan ne oykettidaa gidikko,
020	PRO	006	003	ta naazoo! Neni ne shooroza kushen kundida gishshas nena ashshanaas baada iza sinththan kunda; ne shoorozakko baada shoobba.
020	PRO	006	004	Hessaththo ooththontta dashe dhiskofa; ne siphinththati liphopetto.
020	PRO	006	005	Shankkanchchatappe genessi kessi ekki attiza mala, yarden oykettontta attida kafo mala nena ashsha.
020	PRO	006	006	Nenoo azallazoo! Cunccalletaakko ba; histtada isttafe tamaarada aadho eranchcha gida.
020	PRO	006	007	Cunccalletas azazizay deenna; istta haarizay deenna.
020	PRO	006	008	Gido attiin banttas maana miish bone shiishsheettes; kath shiishshiza wode banttas kath shiishsheettes.
020	PRO	006	009	Nenoo azallazoo! Neni awude gakkanaas dhiskanee? Dhiskofekka ne awude beegganee?
020	PRO	006	010	«Tani guuththara dhiska ekkana; guuththara liipha dendana; ta kushe borkotada guuththara shempa ekkana» ne gishin,
020	PRO	006	011	he wode manqoteththi panga mala, pacey ola miishsha oykkida asa mala ne bolla puttu gaana.
020	PRO	006	012	Womaleynne menxe iita asi yuuyi yuuyidi iita qaala haasayzay,
020	PRO	006	013	ba ayfera qim7otizay, ba tohon bessizay, ba biradhdhetankka malatizay,
020	PRO	006	014	ba wozinan iita miish woththi denththi qoppizay ay wodekka oosh denththees.
020	PRO	006	015	Hessa gaason bashshi akeekontta iza bolla yaana; izi hassa7ay baynda meqqana; meqqidikka paxenna.
020	PRO	006	016	GODAY ixxiza usuppun yo7oti deettes; laappunththaza keehi harasettees.
020	PRO	006	017	Otoreteththan xeelliza ayfe, wordotiza inxars, xillo asata wodhiza kushe,
020	PRO	006	018	iita miish qoppiza wozina, iitaso eesotiza tohota,
020	PRO	006	019	wordo bolla wordo gujji gujjidi yootiza wordo markka, ishantta giddon oosh medhdhiza asa.
020	PRO	006	020	Ta naazoo! Ne aawa azazo pola; ne aaya tamaarsidayssaka aggofa.
020	PRO	006	021	Istta ubbato ne wozinan oykka; ne qoodhenkka qachcha.
020	PRO	006	022	Neni hemettiza wode istti nena kaaleththana; neni ichchiza wode istti nena naagana; neni beegottiza wodekka istti nena zorana.
020	PRO	006	023	Ays giikko ha azazoti nees xomppe; timirtetikka poo7o; qasse seeraykka de7okko efiza oge.
020	PRO	006	024	Ha azazoti iita maccassafe nena naagana; doonan cimmiza hawusha maccassafekka naagana.
020	PRO	006	025	Izi lo7eteththa ne wozinan amottofa; izi qim7oteththan oykettofa.
020	PRO	006	026	Issi addey bana bayza diza maccassayo guuththa miishshan demmanaas dandayees; asa machchi geedo kaaloy nees shemppo dhayssana.
020	PRO	006	027	Issi asi tama idimmiin iza may7oy meetettontta attanaas dandayzee?
020	PRO	006	028	Issi asi bonqo tama yedhdhi bishin iza tohoy xuugettontta attana dandayzee?
020	PRO	006	029	Asa machcho laggeththiza asi hessa mala; izo bochchiza ubbay qaxxayettontta attenna.
020	PRO	006	030	Kaysoy gafa attanaas kaysikko asay iza kadhenna.
020	PRO	006	031	Gido attiin izas diza aqota ubbaa oychchikokka izi oykettidaa gidikko laappun kushe qanxxana bessees.
020	PRO	006	032	Layma laymatiza asas wozinay pace; hessaadey barkka ba shemppo dhayssees.
020	PRO	006	033	Bukaynne kawushshateththi izas qaada; yeellateththi izappe mulekka qucettenna.
020	PRO	006	034	Qanaatey azina hanqettana mala denththeththees; izi halo kessiza wode izas qadhettenna.
020	PRO	006	035	Izi ay edakka ekkenna; ay keena imotaykka iza hanqo doshisenna.
020	PRO	007	001	Ta naazoo! Ta qaala naaga; ta azazokka ne wozinan qum7a oykka.
020	PRO	007	002	Ne paxa de7ana mala ta azazota naaga; ta timirtezakka ne ayfe ciro mala naaga.
020	PRO	007	003	Hayta ne biradhdhetan qachcha; ne wozinankka xaafa.
020	PRO	007	004	Aadho erateth ne taas michcho ga; akeekakka ne taas dabbo ga.
020	PRO	007	005	Istti nena layma maccassafenne ba qaalan baleththiza hawusha maccassafe naagana.
020	PRO	007	006	Issi gallas tani ta keeththa maskootezara kare xeelladis.
020	PRO	007	007	Akeekay paccida yelagata be7adis. Istta giddofe issoy keehi eeya.
020	PRO	007	008	He wodallay izi soo efiza oge baggara oykki bishe izi keeththa achchara aadhdhi bishin,
020	PRO	007	009	he wode sa7ay qammanaas lankilankishin, dhumay ayfe oykkishin,
020	PRO	007	010	issi maccassaya iza demmanaas kezadus; layma maccassa may7o may7ada baleththanaas murtta kezadus.
020	PRO	007	011	Iza xalanne yeellay baynda maccassa; sohon woppu gaada uttuku.
020	PRO	007	012	Iza issito ogen, issito gulan, issito dubbushan eqqada naagawus.
020	PRO	007	013	Iza he naaza shiishsha oykkada yeerawus; yeellay baynda iza ayfe tishshi histta xeellashe,
020	PRO	007	014	«Tani tason issifeteththa yarsho yarshanaas bessees; tani ta adina hach poladis.
020	PRO	007	015	Histtada nena xeellanawu ke7adis; nena keeha koyadis; ha7i beya nena demmadis.
