021	ECC	004	001	Tani qasseka salo gufanththon diza qoho ubbaa be7adissinne akeekadis; qohettidayta afunth be7adis; istta minththeththiza asikka deenna; wolqqay istta qohiza asata kushen dees; istta minththeththiza asikka deenna.
021	ECC	004	002	Hessa gishshas tani, «Ha7i shemppora paxa dizaytappe kase hayqqidayti kiya» gadis.
