021	ECC	004	016	Iza sinththan qooday baynda derey dees; kawoteththafe izi kichchiza wode izi ooththidayssas oonikka iza galatenna. Hessika hada; carko oykkanaas yedeththiza mala.
021	ECC	005	001	Xoossa Keeth gelashe ne toho shiishsha ekka; siyanaas shiiqoy eeyata yarshofe aadhdhees; ays giikko istti bantta oosoy iita gididayssa erettenna.
021	ECC	005	002	Haasayanawu eesotoppa; qasse issi miish Xoossas immana gaada eeson geppofa; ays giikko Xoossi salon dees; neni gidikko sa7an daasa; hessa gishshas ne haasayana qaalay ginara gido.
021	ECC	005	003	Ooso daron agumoy beettiza mala haasaya daron eeyateththa qaalay qonccees.
021	ECC	005	004	Xoossas neni adinida adina gam7ontta gaththa; eeson polontta attiko izi ufayettenna; hessa gishshas neni adinettidayssa ubbaa pola.
