021	ECC	006	007	Asi daaburdi ooththiza ubbay ulossa; gido attiin iza amoy mulekka kalli erenna.
021	ECC	006	008	Histtiin aadho eranchchay eeyappe aazan aadhdhizee? Manqoy harata sinththan waani simerettanaakko eroy iza ay maaddizee?
021	ECC	006	009	Amon toylattanaappe ayfen be7oy kiya; hessika hadanne carko oykkanaas yedeththiza mala
021	ECC	006	010	Ha7i diza ubbaas kaseti sunththi imetti uttides; asi hananaazi eretti uttides; asi baappe minnizayssara baaxettenna.
