#
# BOOK	022	SOL	Song of Solomon	Siiqo Saba
022	SOL	001	001	Yeth ubbaafe aadhdhiza Solomoone mazamure.
022	SOL	001	002	«Ne siiqoy woyne ushshafe aadhdhi ufayssees; ne mettershan zaara zaaradakka tana yeera.
022	SOL	001	003	Ne tiyettiza shittoy ay mala sawizee! Ne sunththay xeygettiza wodekka ay mala ufayssizee! Geela7oti nena hessa gishshas siiqeettes.
022	SOL	001	004	Tana nenara ekkada ba; haa ya, ane nam7ay issife woxxoos! Ta kawoo, tana ne quruxo giddo gelththa» gadus. Laggeti «Izan nuni ay keena ufayettidonii! Nuni iza siiqo woyne ushshafekka aaththidi nashshoos. Tumukka maccassay ubbay nena siiqanaas bessees» gida.
022	SOL	001	005	«Intteno Yerusalaame maccassatoo, siyite! Tani kareth gidikkoka mala lo7o. Ta kareththateththay Qeedaare dunkaane mala; gido attiin ta medhay kawo Solomoone keeththa magalashata mala.
022	SOL	001	006	Ta medha kareththiday awa seela; tani kareth gidida gishshas tana kadhopite. Ta aayi naa ishati tanara ooyettidi tana woyne atakilte naaganaas woththida; hessa gishshas tani tayssa naagabeekke.
022	SOL	001	007	Ta siiqozoo! Ane taas yoota; ne dorsa wude heemmizay awanee? Gallas awappe ne istta guurissizay awanee? Nena demmanaas ne laggeta wude kaallashe ays coo toylattiza maccassa mala gidoo?» gadus.
022	SOL	001	008	«Haa macca ubbaafe aadhdha lo7iza malanchchayee! Ta dizaso erontta aggiko dorsati bida geedo kaallada ya; ne deysha laaqqatakka heenththanchchata dunkaane matan heemma.»
022	SOL	001	009	«Ta godee! Gibxe kawos para-gaare goochchiza parata giddon diza macca paray mala lo7aasa.
022	SOL	001	010	Ne shagalasoy lozhzhu gides; ne qoodhey inqqu geetettiza seelon alleqettides.
022	SOL	001	011	Nuni nees biran alleqettida worqqa geexe oosisana» gides.
022	SOL	001	012	«Kawoy maaddan utti dishin ta shitto sawoy keeththa giddo ubbaan tunnu gides.
022	SOL	001	013	Ta siiqozi ta dhanththata giddon diza sawiza karbbe xuntte mala.
022	SOL	001	014	Ta siiqozi En-Gaade geetettiza woyne tokkiza gaden mokkida bazzo ciishsha mala» gadus.
022	SOL	001	015	«Ta godee! Neni ay mala lo7ay! Neni ay mala lo7ay! Ne ayfeti haraphphe mala lo7eettes» gides.
022	SOL	001	016	«Ta siiqozoo, nenikka ay mala lo7ay! Ne keeha lo7aasa; nu hiiththay cilila maata mala ufayssees» gadus.
022	SOL	001	017	«Nu keeththa tuussi Libaanoose ziga; kaaraykka xiiddan oosettides» gides.
022	SOL	002	001	«Tani Lasharoonen mokkiza ciishsha malanne gadhan mokkiza suufe ciishsha mala» gadus.
022	SOL	002	002	«Ta siiqoya maccassata garsan agunththa giddon diza lo7o ciish misatawus» gides.
022	SOL	002	003	«Ta siiqoza tani naateththatara gaththa xeelliza wode, wora giddon diza appile misatees; tanikka keeha ufayettadis; tani iza kuwa garsan shempadis; mal7iza iza ayfezapeka ma kalladis.
022	SOL	002	004	Izi tana gibiras aaho keeththan gelththides; ba siiqo ta bolla bandira mala dhoqqu dhoqqu ooththides.
022	SOL	002	005	Tani iza siiqon oykettada hargadis; hessa gishshas tana zabibe ayfe mizidi gazidissite; appile mizidi tana beegoththite.
022	SOL	002	006	Ba hadirsa kushe bolla tana borkotissides; ba ushachcha kushen tana idimmides.
022	SOL	002	007	Intteno Yerusalaame yelaga maccassatoo! siiqoy baas dosidi dendana gakkanaas iza intte beegoththontta mala, tani inttena genessataninne bazzo wushan amatays.
022	SOL	002	008	Be7ite! Ta siiqoza cenggurssi zumata bollara pirishe, zumbullata bollara xongettishe yizayssi siyettees.
022	SOL	002	009	Ta siiqozi Wusha laaqqa woykko genessa laaqqa misatees. Be7ite! Izi nu keeththa daaranchchan eqqides; maskootera soo xeellees; magalasha xoo7era xuulungi xeellees.
022	SOL	002	010	Ta siiqozi tana, ‹Ta godee, denda! Ta lo7oyee! Haa ya! Ane issife boos.
022	SOL	002	011	Beya, balgoy aadhdhides; iraykka aggides.
