023	ISA	007	001	Ooziya naa Iyo7aatamey yelida Akaazey Yuhuda biittan kawotida wode Aaraame biitta kawo Eraasooninne Isra7eele biitta Kawo Eromeliyo naa Faaquhey Yerusalaame olanaas kezida; gido attiin xoonanaas dandaybeettenna.
023	ISA	007	002	Aaraame dereynne Efreeme derey issi bolla gididi olas ke7idayssa Dawite zareppe kawotida kawoy siyida wode wora mith carkoy qaaththiza mala Akaaze wozinaynne deraa wozinay qaaxxides.
023	ISA	007	003	Histtiin GODAY Isayaasas, «Neni ne naa Sha7aari-Yaashube ekkada Akaazera gayttanaas baada may7o meeccizayta goshshaakko efiza oge matan ganna baggara de7iza eele haaththa zaraa xeeran neni iza demmana.
023	ISA	007	004	Histtada izas, ‹Naagetta; woppu ga; babbofa; hayta tamay mishin attidi cuwattiza duruma nam7atappe Aaraames, Eraasoonessinne, Eromeliyo naa hanqos shabarettofa› ga yoota.
023	ISA	007	005	Aaraame biitta asay Efreeme asaaranne Eromeliyo naara ne bolla iita miish ooththanaas,
