023	ISA	007	009	Qasse Samaariyay Efreeme biittaas hu7e; Eromeliyo nay Samaariyas hu7e; intte intte ammanon minnidi eqqontta ixxiko mulekka eqqanaas dandayekketa» gees.
023	ISA	007	010	Qasseka GODAY Akaazes,
