023	ISA	062	006	Hanne Yerusalaamee! Naagizayta ne dirsata bolla essadis; istti gallassika omars guye geettenna; Intteno GODAAKKO waassizaytoo, mulekka shempofte;
023	ISA	062	007	Izi Yerusalaame minththana gakkanaassinne biitta ubbaa bolla erettida katama ooththana gakkanaas izas shemppo immofte.
023	ISA	062	008	GODAY ba ushachcha kusheninne ba wolqqama qesen, «Hayssafe guye ta intte kath intte morkketas quma gidana mala immike; qasse intte daaburi kessida ooraththa ushshaa allagati uyettenna.
023	ISA	062	009	Gido attiin kaththaa shiishshidayti maana; GODAAKKA galatana; woyne teera maxi shiishshidayti ta keeththa pengen uyana» gi caaqqides.
023	ISA	062	010	Aadhdhite! Iza pengeta baggara kanththi biite; deraas oge baasite; giigsite; shuchchata diggite; kawoteththatas malaata essite.
023	ISA	062	011	Be7ite, GODAY sa7a gaxa gakkanaas, «Xiyoone macca nays, ‹Hekko nena Ashshizaadey yees; ne waagay iza kushen dees; ne qaaday izakkon dees› giite» giidi awajjides.
023	ISA	062	012	Istti, «GODAY Wozzida Geeshsha dereta; nekka Yegetta Attonttaaro koyettiza Katamayo» geetettana.
023	ISA	063	001	Eedoome biittan diza Booxira katamappe zo7o seelo may7o may7idi yizay hessi izi oonee? hayssi bonchcho may7idi ba wolqqa gitateththan hemettishe yizay izi oonee? «Xillo haasayzaynne ashshanaas wolqqay dizay tana gidikkinaa!» gees GODAY.
023	ISA	063	002	Ne seelo may7oy woyne gum7iza asata may7o mala ays zo7idee?
023	ISA	063	003	«Gum7izasohozan woyne tani tarkka yedhdhadis; kawoteththatappe oonikka tanara deenna; tani istta ta hanqon yedhdhadis; ta bashshankka istta dirxxereththadis; istta suuththi ta seelo may7o bolla dhacettides; ta may7oy ubbay moorettides.
023	ISA	063	004	Tani halo kessana gallassay ta wozinan dees; ta wozzana gallassayka gakkides.
023	ISA	063	005	Tani xeelladis shin maaddizay beettibeenna; maaddizaadey baynda gishshas tani malalettadis. Hessa gishshas ta qesey taas atoteth ehides; ta hanqoyka tana minththides.
023	ISA	063	006	Ta hanqon kawoteththata yedhdhadis; ta bashshan istta maththosadis; istta suuththaaka biittan gussadis» gaana.
023	ISA	063	007	GODAA kiyateththi, GODAY nuus ooththida ooso ubbaa gishshas, izi galatettiza oosoza gishshas, iza siiqozanne iza kiyateththa keena, Isra7eele keeththas izi ooththidayssa, ee izi ooththida lo7o oosota gishshas ta yootana.
023	ISA	063	008	GODAYKKA, «Tumukka; istti ta dereta; istti taas wordotontta attuma nayta» gides. Hessa gishshas izi istta Ashshizaade gidides.
023	ISA	063	009	Istta meto ubbaan ceecides; Iza duussaa erisiza kiitanchchay istta ashshides; izi ba siiqoninne ba maaroteththan istta wozzides. Kase aadhdhida wode ubbaan istta denththidesinne tookkides.
023	ISA	063	010	Istti gidikko makkallida; iza Geeshsha Ayanaakka mishisida hessa gishshas izi simmidi isttas morkke gidides; istta olides.
023	ISA	063	011	Hessafe guye asay beni wodezanne Muse wode yuushshi qoppides; Ba dorsata heenththanchchatara ubbaafe kessidayssi izi awan dizee? Ba Geeshsha Ayana istta giddon woththidayssi ha7i awan dizee?
023	ISA	063	012	Bonchchettida wolqqama qese, Muses ushachcha kushe bolla woththides; baas mernaas sunth kessanaas, haaththata istta sinththan shaakkides.
023	ISA	063	013	Paray aykkoy baynda bazzo biittara kanththi biza mala, isttaka ciimma giddora kaaleththi pinththides; hessa gishshas istti dhuphettibeettenna.
023	ISA	063	014	Duge zulle wodhdhiza mehe wude mala, GODAA Ayanay isttas shemppo immides; izi deraa hessaththo kaaleththiday, ne sunththaa bonchchisanaassa.
023	ISA	063	015	Abeet GODAWU, dummatida, bonchchettidanne dhoqqu gida ne araataappe saloppe duge xeella; ne wolqqaynne ne mishettiza mishoy awanee? ne ashketeththaynne ne qadheteththi nuuppe haakkides.
023	ISA	063	016	Abrahaamey nuna erontta aggiko, Isra7eeleykka nuna akeekontta aggikokka neni nuus aawa. Abeet GODAWU, neni nuus aawa; Beniisofekka doommidi ne sunththay nuna wozzizayssa.
023	ISA	063	017	Abeet GODAWU, nuni ne ogeppe kezana mala, nu wozina tullisada nees yayyontta mala ays ooththay? Ne aylleta gishshas gaada, nees xinxxo gidida qommota gishshas gaada nuukko simma.
023	ISA	063	018	Guuththa wodes ne derey geeshshasohoza laattides; ha7i gidikko nu morkketi ne Keeththaa yedhdhida.
023	ISA	063	019	Hekko beniisofe nuni neyta; gido attiin istta neni haarabeekka; istti ne sunththankka xeygettibeettenna.
023	ISA	064	001	Abeet GODAWU, neni salota daakkada duge wodhdharkkii! Zumati ne sinththan kokkoretto.
023	ISA	064	002	Qayxare tamay haath penttisiza mala, ne morkketa matan ne sunththi erettana mala wodhdha; kawoteththatakka ne sinththan kokkorssa.
023	ISA	064	003	Kasekka neni nu qoppontta yashissiza miish ne ooththida wode ne wodhdhiin zumati kokkorida.
023	ISA	064	004	Beniisofe doommidi hidota ooththi naagizaytas gakkiza malaata ooththiday neeppe attiin hara Xoos be7ida ayfeynne siyida hayththi mulekka deenna.
023	ISA	064	005	Suure miish ufayssan ooththizaytanne ne oge qoppizayta neni maaddaasa; gido attiin nuni istta bolla pacey baynda nagara ooththida gishshas hekko neni nu bolla hanqettadasa; histtiin nuni waani attana dandayzonii?
023	ISA	064	006	Nuni ubbayka tuna asa mala gididos; nu xilloteththa ooso ubbay tunida carqqa mala. Nuni ubbayka boncco mala qokkidos; nu nagaray nuna carko mala pitti efides.
023	ISA	064	007	Oonikka woosan ne sunth xeygenna; nena oykkana paaccizaykka deenna; neni ne ayfeso nuuppe genththadasa; nu nagaray nuna dhayssana mala aggadasa.
023	ISA	064	008	Gidikkoka abeet GODAWU, neni nuus aawa; nuni urqqata; neni nuna medhdhidayssa; nuni ubbayka ne kushen medhettidayta.
023	ISA	064	009	Abeet GODAWU, keeha hanqettofa; nu nagaraakka mernaas qoppofa; nuus woosetta; nu ubbay ne dere gidida gishshas ne ayfeso nuukko haa zaara.
023	ISA	064	010	Ne geeshsha katamati aykkoy baynda bazzo gidida; Xiyoonakka aykkoy baynda bazzo biitta gidadus; Yerusalaameykka yegetta attadus.
023	ISA	064	011	Nu aawati kase nena izan galatiza Xoossa Keeththay taman xuugettides; kase lo7osoti ubbatikka dhayda.
023	ISA	064	012	Abeet GODAWU, hayssi ubbay haniinkka ne simmikii? Neni co7u gaada nuna zaway baynda qixaate qaxxayay?
023	ISA	065	001	GODAY, «Tana woossonttaytas ta qonccadis; tana koyonttaytas beettadis. Ta sunththaa xeygontta kawoteththas, ‹Yee! Yee!› ga koyadis.
023	ISA	065	002	Makkallanchcha deretas, iita ogera bizaytas, bantta wozina amo kaallizaytas, ta kushe gallas kumeth miccadis.
023	ISA	065	003	Atakiltesohon yarsho yarshizayti, urqqafe medhettida yarshosohota bolla exaane cuwasizayti, ubba wode tana hanqeththiza dereta.
023	ISA	065	004	Duufo giddon uttizayti, geemasohon aqizayti, guddunththa asho mizayti, istti bantta otota tunida asho camba kunththizayta.
023	ISA	065	005	Istti, ‹Ta geesh gidida gishshas kichcha; ta mata yooppa; taakko shiiqoppa› gizayta. Hayssa mala derey ta siidhen cuwa malanne gallas kumeth eexxiza tama mala.
023	ISA	065	006	«Be7ite, ta sinththan xaafetti uttides; ta co7u giikke; gido attiin iza ooso ooso mala ta izas immana; istta hano mala ta isttas ciggana.
023	ISA	065	007	Intte nagara halonne intte aawata nagara halo ta kessana. Istti zumata bolla xuugettiza yarsho shiishshida gishshas, zumbullata bolla tana cayida gishshas, istti makkida miishshan isttas zaari makettana; istti kase ooththida ooso kushe zaari ekkana» gees.
023	ISA	065	008	GODAY, «Woyne wurco giddon ililoy diza mala asaykka, ‹Iza giddon lo7o miishshi diza gishshas iza qanxxofte› giza mala, tanikka ta aylleta gishshas gaada hessaththo ooththana; mulera tani istta dhayssike.
023	ISA	065	009	Tani Yaaqoobe zereththatappenne Yuhuda zereththafe ta zumata laattanayta ta ehana; doorettida ta derey istta laattana; ta ashkaratikka heen daana.
023	ISA	065	010	Tana minththi koyza ta derezas, Lasharooney dorsa wudey heemettizaso, Akoore zulley wude mehey pe7izaso gidana.
023	ISA	065	011	Gido attiin GODAA aggida inttes, ta geeshsha zumaa dogida inttes, ‹Ta baso› geetettiza eeqa xoossas soho giigsida inttes, ‹Gaade› geetettiza eeqa xoossas walakettida woyne ushshu wancan kunththida inttes,
023	ISA	065	012	ta xeygiin zaarontta ixxida gishshas, ta yootiin siyontta ixxida gishshas, ta sinththankka iita ooththida gishshas, tana hanqeththiza miish intte doorida gishshas, ta inttena mashshas aaththa immana; intte ubbayka shukettanaas qoodhe immana» gees.
023	ISA	065	013	Hessa gishshas, Ubbaa Haariza GODAY, «Be7ite, ta ashkarati maana; intte gidikko gafana; ta ashkarati uyana; intte gidikko saamettana; Ta ashkarati ufayettana; intte gidikko yeellatana.
023	ISA	065	014	Ta ashkarati wozinappe ufayssan yexxana; intte gidikko wozinay meqqiin intte waassana; intte ayanay meqqida gishshas intte woo woo giidi waassana.
023	ISA	065	015	Intte intte sunththaa doorettida ta derey qanggana mala aaththi immana; Ubbaa Haariza GODAY inttena wodhana; baas haggazizaytas gidikko izi hara sunth immana.
023	ISA	065	016	Hessa gishshas biittay bolla anjjo koyzaadey tuma Xoossa sunththan anjjettana; biittayn caaqqiza asi tuma Xoossa sunththan caaqqana; kase aadhdhida metoti dogettida; ta ayfeppekka geemmida» gees.
023	ISA	065	017	GODAY, «Hekko, tani ooraththa salotanne ooraththa sa7a medhdhana; kase aadhdhida miishshati qofettettennanne hassa7ettettenna.
023	ISA	065	018	Gido attiin tani medhdhizayssan ufayettite; mernaas hombocite; tani Yerusalaame ufayssas, izi deraakka homboceththas medhdhana.
023	ISA	065	019	Tani Yerusalaamen ufayettana; tani ta derezan hombocana; hayssafe guyen yeehoynne waasoy heen seetettenna.
023	ISA	065	020	Hayssafe guyen heen guuththa wodes shemppora paxa daana yidhay woykko wode kallontta cimay deenna; xeetu layth kumida asi hayqqiko wodey gakkontta mulqqetti hayqqida asa mala qoodettana; asi xeetu layth kumontta hayqqiko boshan hayqqida mala qoodeettes.
023	ISA	065	021	He wode asay keeth keexxana; izankka daana; woyne mith tokkidi iza ayfe maana.
023	ISA	065	022	Hayssafe guye hara asi izan daana keeth keexxettenna; woykko haray maana miishshi tokettenna; ta deraa layththi miththa layththa mala aduqqana; tani dooridayti bantta kushe ooson adussa layth ufayettana.
023	ISA	065	023	Istta daaburay hada attenna; qaada iita naakka yelettenna; isttinne istta zereththi GODAY anjjida dere gidana.
023	ISA	065	024	Istti buro tana xeyganaappe kaseta tani koyana; istti taas yooti wursontta ta siyana.
023	ISA	065	025	Kana suyteynne dorsa laaqqay issife maana; gaammoy boora mala maata maana; shooshshi gudulla laaccana; ta geeshsha zumaa bolla istti qohettettenna; bashshika istta bolla yeenna» gees.
023	ISA	066	001	GODAY, «Saloy taas araata; sa7aykka taas yedhdhizaso; histtiin intte taas keexxana keeththinne ta shemppana soy awayssee?
023	ISA	066	002	Hayta ubbaa ta kushey ooththibeennee? Hayti beettana mala ooththiday tana gidikkinaa? Tani ashke; wozinay meqqidaadenne ta qaalaska kokkorizaadeko ta xeellays.
023	ISA	066	003	«Gido attiin taas boora yarshizaadey as wodhizaade mala, dorsa laaqqa yarshizaadey kana cuulli wodhiza asa mala; kaththa yarsho shiishshizaadey, guddunththa suuth shiishshizaade mala; qofsos exaane taas cu7asizaadey, eeqa xoos goynniza asa mala; istti bantta oge doorida; istta shemppoyakka istta tunateththan ufayettawus.
023	ISA	066	004	Hessa gishshas meto ta istta bolla gaththana; istti yayyida miishshika ta istta bolla ehana; gaasoykka ta xeygiza wode istti koyibeettenna; ta yootishin istti ezgibeettenna; ta sinththan iita miish ooththida; tana iitiza miish doorida» gees.
023	ISA	066	005	Intteno qaalaas kokkorizaytoo, hayssa GODAA qaala siyite; «Intte ishantti inttena ixxidaytoo, ta sunththa gishshas inttena kessi yeggidaytoo! Inttena, ‹Ane GODAY bonchchettoo! Ane intte ufayssaaka be7oos› gida; gidikkoka istti yeellatanayssi attenna.
023	ISA	066	006	Hessa kataman diza waasoza siyite; Xoossa keeththan diza caabba siyite; hessika GODAA cenggurssa; izi ba morkketas bessiza waaga qanxxana.
023	ISA	066	007	Miixattanaappe kaseta yelawus; miixa waaye be7ontta dashe attuma naa yelawus.
023	ISA	066	008	Hessa mala yo7o siyi erizay oonee? Hessa mala yo7o be7i erizay oonee? Derey issi gallas medhetti erizee? Woykko kawoteththati qiphida ayfey xeellanaashe gakkanaas beetti erizoo? Xiyoono buro miixay oykkishin heerakka ba nayta yelawus.
023	ISA	066	009	Yelettana matidayssa yelettontta mala tani diggazinaa?» gees GODAY. «Yelishin yeliza ulo ta gorda erazinaa?» gees ne GODAY.
023	ISA	066	010	«Intteno Yerusalaamo siiqiza ubbatoo, izira ufayettite; intte izira hombocite; izis yeekkida ubbati izira keehi ufayettite.
023	ISA	066	011	Minththeththiza izi dhanththaa intte dhammidi kallana; inttes gidanaashe gakkanaas intte uyana; keehippe daro gidida izi dureteththan intte ufayettana» gees GODAY.
023	ISA	066	012	GODAY, «Be7ite, tani izis saroteth gita shaafa mala gogisana; kawoteththata aqota shaafa haaththa mala gogisana intte izi ki7on idimetti dhammana; izi ki7on uttidi intte guppana.
023	ISA	066	013	Aaya ba naa al7isiza mala takka inttena al7isana; intte Yerusalaamen minettana» gees.
023	ISA	066	014	Intte hessa be7iza wode intte wozinay ufayettana; intte meqeththaykka maata mala cililana; qasse GODAA kushey iza aylleta bolla dizayssi erettana; iza hanqoy gidikko iza morkketa bolla qonccana.
023	ISA	066	015	Hekko GODAY tama lacon yaana; iza para-gaareti gote carko mala; izi ba yiillo hanqon, ba seera tama lacon qonccisana.
023	ISA	066	016	Tamaninne mashshan GODAY ba pirdaa asa ubbaa bolla ehana; daroti GODAA mashshan shukettana.
023	ISA	066	017	GODAY, «Atakiltey dizasoho biidi isttafe issaas goynnanaas bana geeshshizaytinne dummasizayti, guddunththa ashonne ecere asho, tunida miishshata miza ubbati ba pirda wurseththan issife ekkana» gees.
023	ISA	066	018	«Tani istta oosonne istta qofa eriza gishshas, kawoteththata ubbaanne dumma dumma qaalan haasayza ubbata issife shiishshanaas yaana; isttika yiidi ta bonchcho be7ana.
023	ISA	066	019	Tani istta giddon malata ooththana; isttafe attida issi issineta gede kawoteththatakko, Tarseese, Puuxe, wondafen olettiza erettida Luudetakko, Tubaalenne Yaawaane hessaththoka ta goobateththaa siyonttaytakkonne ta bonchcho beyonttaytakko haakon diza abba giddon diza harurotakko ta yeddana; ta bonchcho kawoteththata giddon yootana.
023	ISA	066	020	GODAAS yarsho gidana mala intte ishata ubbata kawoteththatappe bonchchettida ta zumaa Yerusalaame paran, para-gaareninne gaaren, baquloninne gaamellan istta ehana. Isra7eele asay kaththa yarsho wogan diza mala geeshsha miishshan woththidi GODAA Keeth shiishshiza mala haytakka shiishshana.
023	ISA	066	021	Tanikka isttafe baggayta qeesetanne Leweta gidana mala ta doorana» gees.
023	ISA	066	022	GODAY, «Tani medhdhana ooraththa salotinne ooraththa sa7ay ta sinththan minni daanayssaththo intte sunththinne intte zereththa sunththi hessaththo minni daana.
023	ISA	066	023	Agina xeeroppe biidi hara aginay xeerana gakkanaas, issi Sambatappe biidi hara Sambata gakkanaas, as gidida ubbay taas goynnana yaana.
023	ISA	066	024	Istti kezidi ta bolla makkallida asata aha be7ana. Istta miza guxuneykka hayqqenna; istta miza tamaykka to7enna. Istti asa zereth ubbaas harassizaaz gidana» gees.
#
# BOOK	024	JER	Jeremiah	Ermaasa Tinbite
024	JER	001	001	Biniyaame biittan Anatoote kataman diza qeesetappe issaa Kilqiyaasa naa Ermaasi yootida qaalay hayssafe kaallizayssa.
024	JER	001	002	Amoone naa Yuhuda kawo Iyosiyaasi kawotida tammanne heedzdzanththo layththan GODAA qaalay Ermaasakko yides.
024	JER	001	003	Qasse Iyosiyaasa naa Yuhuda Kawo Iyo7aaqemey kawotida layththatan GODAA qaalay Ermaasakko yides. Hessafe guye Iyosiyaasa naa Sedeqiyaasi kawotiin tammanne issinththa layththan he wode ichchashanththa aginan Yerusalaame asay di7ettidi baana gakkanaas GODAA qaalay Ermaasa baggara izas yootettides.
024	JER	001	004	GODAA qaalay taakko hizgishe yides.
024	JER	001	005	«Ermaasa! Tani nena ne aayey ulon medhdhanaappe kase erays. Neni yelettanaappe sinththan ta nena dummasa woththadis. Qasseka kawoteththatas nabe gidana mala shuumadis.»
024	JER	001	006	Histtiin tani, «Ubbaa Haariza GODAWU! Tani buro naa gidida gishshas ay ga haasayanaakko ta erikke» gadis.
024	JER	001	007	Gido attiin GODAY tana, «‹Tani naa› gooppa. Tani nena kiittiza asa ubbaakko ba. Tani azaziyssa ubbaaka yoota.
024	JER	001	008	Tani nena ashshanaas nenara diza gishshas ne isttas yayyofa; tani GODAY hayssa nees yootays» gides.
024	JER	001	009	GODAY ba kushe yeddidi ta metershata bochchidi, «Hekko ne yootana ta qaala ne doonan woththadis.
024	JER	001	010	Neni shoddanaassinne laallanaas, dhayssanaassinne shira yegganaas, keexxanaassinne tokkanaas dereta bollanne kawoteththata bolla tani hach nena shuumadis» gides.
024	JER	001	011	GODAA qaalay taakko yiidi, «Ermaasaa! Ne ay be7ay?» gi oychchides. Tanikka, «Ochcholoone hagga be7ays» gadis.
024	JER	001	012	GODAY tana, «Neni likke be7adasa. Tanikka ta qaalay polettanayssa tishshi histta be7ays» gides.
024	JER	001	013	GODAA qaalay qasseka taakko yiidi, «Haray aazi nees beettizee?» gi oychchides. Tanikka zaarada, «Issi penttiza otoy pudeha baggafe haa geddi gi uttidayssi beettees» gadis.
024	JER	001	014	GODAY taas, «Pudeha baggafe bashshi dhuuqqidi ha biittan diza asaa ubbaa bolla gukkana.
024	JER	001	015	Tani pudeha baggan diza kawoteththata haa yaana mala xeygana; Yerusalaameninne izi yuushon diza Yuhuda katamata bolla meto gaththidi istta oykkana; hessafe guye Yerusalaame geliza pengeta bolla bantta araata miccana.
024	JER	001	016	«Yuhuda asay tana aggidi, hara eeqa xoossatas exaane cuwasida gishshas, ba kushen ooththi kessidayta goynnida gishshas ta deraa bolla pirdaa awajjadis.
024	JER	001	017	«Neni gidikko giigetta! Denda eqqada tani nena azazizayssa ubbaa isttas yoota; isttas yayyofa. Neni isttas yayyiko tani nena istta sinththan gujja yashissana.
024	JER	001	018	«Hach tani nena ha biitta ubbaa bolla, Yuhuda kawota bolla, halaqata bolla, qeeseta bollanne ha biitta asaa bolla ne eqetta dandayana mala gimbettida katama, birata tuussinne xarqimalappe oosettida birata dirsa mala ooththadis.
024	JER	001	019	Istti nenara olettana; gido attiin tani ashshanaas nenara issife diza gishshas nena xoonettenna. Tani GODAY hayssa nees yootays» gides.
024	JER	002	001	GODAA qaalay yiidi taas,
024	JER	002	002	«Ba! Baada waassa; Yerusalaame asaa hayththan sissa; GODAY, ‹Neni naateteththan ay keena ammanettidaakko, qasse neni buro mishiran dashe tana ay keena siiqidaakko, zereththi zerettontta bazzo biittan ne wostta kaallidaakko ta akeekays.
024	JER	002	003	He wode Isra7eeley GODAAS geeshsha, koyro shiishshiza xeera kaththa mala; izo mittidayti mooranchcha gidida; istta bolla bashshi yides›» gees.
024	JER	002	004	Intteno Yaaqoobe keeththa asatoo! Isra7eele zare ubbatoo! GODAA qaala siyite!
