024	JER	052	021	Issi issi tuussa geesay 18 wadha, gomppay yuuyi aadhdhanaas 12 wadha; izas giddoy doya gidida gishshas issaa issaa doona ordeteththay oyddu biradhdhey wodhdhiza keena.
024	JER	052	022	Issi tuussa hu7e bolla wadhdhiza xarqimalappe oosettida qusttey dees; issi issi xarqimalappe oosettida qustte adussateththay 5 wadha gidishin yuuyi aadhdhanaas oroomaane miththa ayfe misatiza geexen geexettides; hankko tuussayka he oroomaane ayfe misatiza geexen geexetti kaseyssara issino misatides.
024	JER	052	023	Uddufun tammanne usuppun oroomaane miththa ayfeti mille baggara waayey baynda beettizayta gidishin yuushozan diza oroomaane miththa ayfeta qooday xeeta.
024	JER	052	024	Kawoza bonchcho naagiza wottadarata halaqay kase qeeseta halaqa Saraya, izappe garsara diza qeese Sofonaasanne penge naagiza heedzdzu zabeta qachchi efides.
024	JER	052	025	Katamaa giddon attida asaappe olanchchatas alaafe gidida ola gadawa, kawo zoriza laappunata, dereza giddofe olanchchata dooriza ola gadawa, xaafezanne katama giddon beettida hara 60 asata ekki bides.
024	JER	052	026	Kawoza bonchcho naagiza wottadarata halaqa Nabuzaradaaney heytantta ubbaa ekkidi Baabiloone kawoy dizaso Erebila gaththides.
024	JER	052	027	Kawozikka istta heen Erebilan dippi histti wodhides; Yuhudaykka hessa malan ba biittafe di7etta badus.
024	JER	052	028	Nabukadanaxoorey di7i efida dereza qooday hayssafe kaalli dizayssa; izi ba kawotida laappunththa layththan 3,023 ayhudata,
024	JER	052	029	ba kawotida tammanne osppunththa layththan Nabukadanaxoorey 832 as,
024	JER	052	030	Ba kawotida nam7u tammanne heedzdzanththo layththan Nabuzaradaaney 745 ayhudata di7i efides; izi di7i efida asaa qooday issi bolla 4,600.
024	JER	052	031	Yuhuda kawo Iyo7aakiney di7ettida heedzdzu tammanne laappunththa layththan Yori-Marodeeqey Baabiloonen kawotides; he layththankka tammanne nam7anththa aginan nam7u tammanne ichchashanththo gallassan Yuhuda kawo Iyo7aakine qoppides; qasho keeththafekka iza kessides.
024	JER	052	032	Iza lo7o qaalan haasayssides; Baabiloonen izara qashoson diza kawota ubbatappe bollara aaththidi iza bonchchoson woththides.
024	JER	052	033	Iyo7aakiney qashoson dishe may7ida may7oza izappe qaari yeggides; hessafe biidi hayqqana gakkanaas ba diza wode ubbaan kawoza maaddafe mishe gam7ides.
024	JER	052	034	Baabiloone kawo Iyo7aakiney biidi hayqqana gakkanaas pacey baynda ubba wode izas maana qallaba immides.
#
# BOOK	025	LAM	Lamentations	Ermaasa zilas
025	LAM	001	001	Kase izin daro kawoteththay diza katamaya waanada oletta attadee! Dereta giddon kase gita gididaara waanada am7i mala gidadee! Awuraajjata garsan godatto gididaara ha7i waanada aylle gidadee!
025	LAM	001	002	Iza giddoththi camo yeeho yeekkawus; izis afunththayka shagalara goggees; izi laggetappe izo minththeththizay oonikka deenna; ubbatikka izo kaddida; zaaridikka izis morkke gidida.
025	LAM	001	003	Yuhuday daro waayettidaappenne tooshettidaappe guye di7ettadus; iza kawoteththata giddon uttadus; izis shempizasoykka dhaydes; iza meto garsan dishin gooddizayti ubbay izo demmida.
025	LAM	001	004	Oonikka izi ba7aaleta bonchchanaas yontta gishshas Xiyoone ogeti yeekkeettes; izi pengetara gelizaynne kezizay deenna; izi qeeseti ceeceettes; geela7otikka muuzotteettes; izakka gita meto garsan tuggatawus.
025	LAM	001	005	Izi nagaray daro gidida gaason GODAY izi bolla meto yeggides; izi morkketi izo haarida; izi naytikka morkketan di7ettida; izi morkketas duussi lo7ides.
025	LAM	001	006	Xiyoone macca nayppe izi puulateththinne teemay shaaketti kichchides; izi daannati maata mizasoy dhayda genessa mala gidida; istti bana gooddizaytappe wolqqay wuriin baqatida.
025	LAM	001	007	Yerusalaamey metotida wodeninne waayettida gallassatan kase izis diza aqota yuushsha qoppawus; iza morkke kushen kundida wode izo maaddizay oonikka baynda wode, izi morkketi izi kundeththaa be7idi izi bolla miiccida.
025	LAM	001	008	Yerusalaamey daro deexo nagara ooththadus; kadheska attadus; iza kallo dishin be7ida gishshas kase izo bonchchidayti ubbay izo kadhida; izakka ba baggara yeellatada biitta xeellashe guye simmadus.
025	LAM	001	009	Izi tunateththi izi may7o bolla beettides; sinththafe izi bolla hananayssa iza qoppabeekku; izi kundeththi daganththizaaz gidides; iza, «Ta Godaa Xoossoo! Ta metotiza metoza be7a; ta morkketi tana xoonida» ga woossiinkka izo minththeththizay oonikka beettibeenna.
025	LAM	001	010	Izi aqota ubbaa bolla morkkey ba kushe yeddides; Xoossa asaa shiiqon gelontta mala neni diggidayti eeqa xoossatas goynniza ayzaabeti gede izi Xoossa Keeththan gelishin be7adus.
025	LAM	001	011	Izi asay miza kath demmanaas koshshan daaburees; shemppora paxa daanaas baas diza aqota maana kaththara laammeettes; Yerusalaame asay, «Abeet GODAWU! Nuni kawuyidos; nuna xeellada nuus qoppa.
025	LAM	001	012	«Godaa Xoossi ba wolqqama hanqoza nu bolla yeddida wode nu bolla gakkida meto mala metoy gakkida asi dizaa gidikko intteno ogera aadhdhi biza ubbato ane be7ite! Ha metoy inttes kawushsha misatizee?
025	LAM	001	013	«Izi bolla dhoqqasohoppe tama yeddides; he tamazikka nuus meqeththan gelides; nu tohota qachchanaas gite yeggides; histtidi nuna guye zaari kundisides; kumeththa gallas nuna daaburssides; coo melakka toylasides.
025	LAM	001	014	«Ta nagara shiishshi qachchidi ta morgen woththides; ta wolqqaka wursides; tani eqettanaas dandayontta morkketas GODAY tana aaththi immides.
025	LAM	001	015	«Nu garsan diza olanchchata ubbatara Xoossi eqettides; nu giddofe yelagata dhayssanaas olanchchata nu bolla yeddides. Woyne miththa ayfe ushshu kessanaas yedhdhiza mala GODAY boshettontta geela7o misatiza Yuhuda asaa yedhides.
025	LAM	001	016	«Morkkey nu bolla goobides; nu naytikka barkka attida; nuna zori minththeththizayti nuuppe haakkida; hessa gishshas ta yeekkayssinne afunththa gussays.
025	LAM	001	017	Xiyoona ba kushe miccadus; izo minththeththizaadey deenna; Yaaqoobe zaretas shooroti izas morkke gidana mala Xoossi azazo kessides; Yerusalaameykka istta giddon tuna miishsha mala qoodettadus.
025	LAM	001	018	«Xoossi xillo; tani gidikko iza azazo bolla makkalladis; intte wurikka siyite; ta metozakka xeellite; macca naytinne naateththa attuma nayti taappe di7etti bida.
025	LAM	001	019	Tani ta dosizayta xeygadis; istti gidikko tana kaddida; ta qeesetinne cimati ba shemppo ashshanaas kath koyishe katamay giddon wurida.
025	LAM	001	020	«Abeet GODAWU! Ta waayeza be7a! ta giddo asateththay metotides; ta keeha makkalladis; ta wozinaykka meqqides; Karen gidiin soon deraa hayqoy wursees.
025	LAM	001	021	«Derey ta zilalizayssa siyides; gido attiin oonikka tana minththeththizaadey beettibeenna; ta morkketi ubbayka ta metotoyssa siyida; neni ooththoyssaka eridi istti ufayettida; ne istta bolla ehana ga qachchida gallassaya yu; isttika ta mala zilaletto.
025	LAM	001	022	«Istta iitateththi ne sinththan beetto; ta nagara gaason ne ta bolla ooththoyssaththo istta bollaka ooththa; ta ceecada zilaliza zilasay darides; ta wozinaykka daaburdes» gishe waasseettes.
025	LAM	002	001	GODAY Xiyoone macca nayo ba hanqon wostti kawushshidee! Isra7eele bonchcho saloppe duge sa7an yeggides; izi ba hanqo gallas ba toho shempisizaso gididaaro zaari qoppanaas koyibeenna.
025	LAM	002	002	Yaaqoobe duussaso ubbaa Xoossi qadhetay baynda dhayssides; Yuhuda dere miixata izi ba hanqon laallides; izi kawoteththanne dere ayssizayta kawushshidi duge biittan yeggides.
025	LAM	002	003	Izi ba gita hanqon Isra7eele wolqqa liiqisides; morkkey iza olanaas yiza wode ba maado kushe isttafe denththides; ba yuushon diza ubbaa miza tama laco mala iza hanqoy Yaaqoobe bolla eexxi kezides.
025	LAM	002	004	Izi morkke mala wondafe dafi oykkides; iza ushachcha kushey yiishshaa yeddanaas giigsides; bana lo7izayta ubbaa morkke mala shukkides; Xiyoone dunkaaneta bollaka ba hanqo tama mala qolides.
025	LAM	002	005	Xoossi morkke mala gididi Isra7eele dippi histtides; kawoteththa keeththaaka dhayssides; izi miixaakka laallides; Yuhuda asaa bolla kayonne zilas darssides.
025	LAM	002	006	Izi ba keeththa kaththa giddon diza gaabba shoddiza mala shoddi olides; Xoossi Xiyoono iza layththan layththan bonchchiza ba7aaletanne sambatata diggides; izi ba mino hanqon kawozanne qeeseza kawushshides.
025	LAM	002	007	GODAY yarsho yarshizasohoza kadhides; ba keeththaaka aggides; ba kawoteththa keeththa gimbeta morkkes aaththi immides; ba7aale gallassatan ooththizayssaththo istti GODAA Keeththan keehi waassida.
025	LAM	002	008	GODAY Xiyoone katama gimbe laallanaas qanxxi dendides; mixe wodoroza piddisides; izi istta dhayssontta aggenna; miixatinne gimbetti laalettida; isttika issife dhayda.
025	LAM	002	009	Izi pengeti duge biittan gelida; kare gordiza birata kolatati meqeretti wodhdhida; izi kawozinne daannati ayzaabetan di7etti bida; hayssafe guye kase isttas diza wogay ooththenna; izi nabetaska hayssafe guye GODAAPPE ajjuutay qonccenna.
025	LAM	002	010	Xiyoone dere cimati biitta bolla co7u gi uttida; istti ba hu7en gudulla laallida; maaqaka may7ida; Yerusalaame geela7oti duge biitta xeellida.
025	LAM	002	011	Ta derey wurides; naateththa naytinne qeeri nayti katama giddon labbani kundida. Hessa gishshas ta ayfey afunththan baljumides; taas maracey kokkorides; ta wozinaykka seerides;
025	LAM	002	012	Olason madunxi kundida asata mala katamay giddon istti daaburda; istti bantta aayeta, «Kaththinne haaththi nuus awan dizee?» gi oychchishe istti qese bolla borkotidi shemppo kezida.
025	LAM	002	013	«Hanne Yerusalaame! Ta ne gishshas ay gaanaas dandayazinaa? Ta nena aazara ginasa xeelloo? Hanne dosettida Xiyoone geela7oyee! Ta nena wostta minththeththanaas dandayazinaa? ne madunththay abbafeka cimmatees; nena paththanaas dandayzay oonee?
025	LAM	002	014	Ne nabeta ajjuutay wordonne coo hada; ne nagara qonccisidi nena di7eteththafe ashshettenna; istti nees yootiza tinbitey baleththizaazinne ogeppe kare kessizaaza.
025	LAM	002	015	Ne achchara aadhdhi biza ubbay ne bolla ba kushe baqqi kaa7ana; biitta ubbaan aadho lo7o geetettiza katamayanne dere ubbay ufayettiza katamaya hanii?» gaana; qidhishekka ba hu7e qaaththana.
025	LAM	002	016	Ne morkketi ubbay issife bantta doona keehi doyda; bantta ach saxxishe qidhida; «Nuni izo mittidos! nuni amottidaara hanno; shemppora paxa diidi gakki ayfen be7idos» gida.
025	LAM	002	017	Xoossi ba qoppidayssa ooththides; daro wodeppe kase yootida qaala polides; izi nena qadhetay baynda laallides; ne waayettishin morkkey ufayettana mala ne morkketa dhoqqu dhoqqu histtides.
025	LAM	002	018	Yerusalaame gimbe giddon diza asawu! Xoossaako waassite; intte afunththi omarsinne gallas di7o mala goggo; intteka shempofte; intte ayfesikka shemppo immofte.
025	LAM	002	019	Qammaa kumeth dendidi waassite; Godaa sinththan intte wozina haaththa mala gussite; oge doonan koshatti kundida ne nayta shemppo gishshas ne kushe pude izakko denththada woossa.
025	LAM	002	020	Abeet GODAWU! Hayssa ne be7a! Neni hayssaththo kase oona bolla ooththa erizaakko ane akeeka; aaya yela dichchida naa zaara maanaas bessizee? Qeeseynne nabey Xoossa Keeththan hayqqanaas bessizee?
025	LAM	002	021	Yelagatinne cimati hayqqidi ogen kundi attida; yelaga maccassatinne attumati mashshan hayqqida; ne hanqettida gallas istta wodhadasa; qadhetay bayndaka shukkadasa.
025	LAM	002	022	Ba7aale gallas diggisas xeygiza mala ta morkketa ta bolla xeygadasa; ne hanqo gallas oonikka kessi ekkibeenna; woykko shemppora paxa attiday deenna; ta yela dichchidayta morkkey taappe dhayssides.
025	LAM	003	001	Godaa hanqo guufen waaye be7ida asi tana.
025	LAM	003	002	Izi tana ba sinththafe kessi yeddides; poo7oy baynda gede dhuman tana gelththides.
025	LAM	003	003	Izi kumeththa gallas zaari zaaridi tana shocides.
025	LAM	003	004	Izi ta asateththaaka ceegissides; ta meqeththatakka menththereththides.
025	LAM	003	005	Izi tana metoninne iita tugga giddo yeggides.
025	LAM	003	006	Hayqqidi gam7ida asa mala tani dhuman daana mala ooththides.
025	LAM	003	007	Ta kezontta mala ta yuushoza dirdes; mino sansalatan tana qachchides.
025	LAM	003	008	Tani maado koyada waassa xeygiinkka izi ta waasaa siyanaas koyibeenna.
025	LAM	003	009	Ta ogeza masettida shuchchan gordides; ta aadhdha biza ogezakka geellasides.
025	LAM	003	010	Izi taas zamadi uttida zardo mala gidides; qasseka qotetti naagiza gaammo mala gidides.
025	LAM	003	011	Tana ta biza ogeppe goochchi kessidi duusereththi yeggides; tana asi bayndason olaagides.
025	LAM	003	012	Izi ba wondafe dafi oykkides; tana caddanaas ba yiish giigsi woththides.
025	LAM	003	013	Izi yiishshaa yeddidi taas wozina ayfen caddides.
025	LAM	003	014	Tani ta dere asaas qidhe miish gidadis; gallas kumeth ta bolla qidhe mazamure yexxeettes.
025	LAM	003	015	Izi ta de7oza camon kunththides; izi tana ciye ushshu kalssides.
025	LAM	003	016	Izi ta ach shuchchan menththides; izi tana gudullan yedhettides.
025	LAM	003	017	Ta shemppoys saroteththi dhaydes; ufayssi izi aazakkonne ta baladis.
025	LAM	003	018	Hessa gishshas, «Ta bonchchoy taappe shaakettides; tani Xoossafe naagiza hidota ubbay dhaydes» gadis.
025	LAM	003	019	Ta waayenne ta toylateththaa ta qoppishin ta de7oy tana cammides.
025	LAM	003	020	Ubbaa wodekka ta hayssa qoppishin ta wozinay ceecees.
025	LAM	003	021	Gidikkoka tani hayssa qoppiza wode taas sinththafe hidotay dees.
025	LAM	003	022	Hessika nuni dhayontta aggiday GODAA siiqoy daro gidida gaasonna; iza qadhetaykka mernaas wurontta gishshassa.
025	LAM	003	023	Istti maalado maalado ooraththa; Ne ammaneteththayka daro.
025	LAM	003	024	Taas qaaday GODAA; hessa gishshas ta izan xalla hidota ooththays.
025	LAM	003	025	GODAY bana hidota ooththizaytassinne iza koyzaytas lo7o.
025	LAM	003	026	GODAY as ashshiza ashoza izaadey co7u gi naagikko lo7o.
025	LAM	003	027	Asi yelagateththa woden qambara tookkiko lo7o.
025	LAM	003	028	GODAY iza toossida gishshas izi barkka co7u gi utto.
025	LAM	003	029	Sinththafe izas hidotay daana dandayza gishshas bana ziqqi histti haariso.
025	LAM	003	030	Baqqana koyidaades izi ba shagala besso; kawushshateththika ekko.
025	LAM	003	031	GODAY ase mernaaskka yeggi aggenna.
025	LAM	003	032	Izi asa bolla meto ehikkoka ba mernaa siiqon simmi qadhettees;
025	LAM	003	033	Izi odidi asa bolla meto woykko waaye ehi erenna.
025	LAM	003	034	Deraan diza qasho asay ubbay genen yedhettishin,
025	LAM	003	035	Ubbaafe Dhoqqa Xoossay beyishin asas asateththa maatay digettiza wode,
025	LAM	003	036	qasseka tuma pirday geellattiza wode GODAY hessa mala hanota demmennee?
025	LAM	003	037	Xoossi azazontta dishin ba gidaaz polanaas dandayzay oonee?
025	LAM	003	038	Iita gidiin woykko lo7o gidiin ba gidaaz polizay Ubbaafe Dhoqqa Xoossaa gidennee?
025	LAM	003	039	Histtiin shemppora paxa diza asi ba nagaran qaxxayettishe aazas zuuzumizee?
025	LAM	003	040	Hessa aggidi nuni nu oge ane pilggi xeelloos; GODAAKKOKA simmoos.
025	LAM	003	041	Ane nuni nu wozinanne nu kushe salon diza Xoossako pude denththidi,
025	LAM	003	042	«Nu GODAWU! Nuni makkallidos; nagarakka ooththidos; hessa gishshas neni nuna maarabeekka.
025	LAM	003	043	Neni hanqon kumada nuna gooddadasa; ne nuna qadhetay baynda wodhadasa.
025	LAM	003	044	Woosay neekko aadhdhi bontta mala nena shaaran kammadasa.
025	LAM	003	045	Ne nuna ayzaabeta giddon orcconne buura kessadasa.
025	LAM	003	046	Nu morkketi ubbay ba doona nu bolla doyda.
025	LAM	003	047	Nuni bashshaninne laaleteththan metoninne shiron kumdos» goos.
025	LAM	003	048	Ta derey wurida gishshas ta ayfeppe afunththi di7o mala goggides.
025	LAM	003	049	Shempontta ubba wode ta ayfeppe afunththi gukkees.
025	LAM	003	050	Hessi hananay Xoossi saloppe duge xeellana gakkanaassa.
025	LAM	003	051	Tani diza kataman diza ubbaa maccassata bolla gakkida metoza tani ta ayfen be7ida gishshas ta wozinay ceecides.
025	LAM	003	052	Gaasoykka baynda taas morkke gididayti kafo mala tana shankkatida.
025	LAM	003	053	Istti tani shemppora paxa dishin duge ollan yeggida; shuchchika ta bolla olida.
025	LAM	003	054	Haaththi kumidi taas hu7e bollara goggides; tani dhayadis gaada qoppadis.
025	LAM	003	055	Ta GODAWU! Tani ciimma olla giddon dashe ne sunththa xeygadis.
025	LAM	003	056	Ta waaso ne siyana mala ta nena woossiin siyadasa.
025	LAM	003	057	Ta nena xeygida wode ne taakko shiiqada, «Yayyofa» gadasa.
025	LAM	003	058	Godoo! Ne taas mootettada tana ashshadasa.
025	LAM	003	059	GODAWU! Ne ta bolla gakkida qohoza beyadasa; ne taas pirda.
025	LAM	003	060	Ta morkketi ta bolla halo kessanaas qoppidayssanne istti ta bolla zuppetidayssa ne beyadasa.
025	LAM	003	061	Ta GODAWU! Istti tana cayida cashshanne ta bolla maqettida maqqoza ne siyadasa.
025	LAM	003	062	Gallas kumeth ta morkketi ta bolla saasuketteettessinne zuuzumeettes.
025	LAM	003	063	Ne istta xeella! Istti eqqidi gidiin uttidi ba yeththan tana caddeettes.
025	LAM	003	064	Ta GODAWU! Ne isttas istta ooso mala imma.
025	LAM	003	065	Istta wozina dammisa; Ne qanggeththi istta gakko.
025	LAM	003	066	Abeet GODAWU! Ne istta ne hanqon goodda; salo garsafe dhayssa.
025	LAM	004	001	Worqqay waani tasides; Walakay baynda muuruta worqqay waani laamettidee! Xoossa keeththi keexettida bonchcho shuchchati oge doonan laalettida.
025	LAM	004	002	Kase bonchchettida worqqa misatiza Xiyoone nayti ha7i waanidi kushen urqqafe tilidi medhdhida mana miishsha mala gididoo!
025	LAM	004	003	Worakanati ba marata dichchanaas ba dhanth dhanththeettes; ta derey gidikko bazzon diza yanchcha kafota mala menxe iitides.
025	LAM	004	004	Daro saamettida gishshas guuththa nayta inxarsi pude gonggiraththara oykettides; nayti kath woossida shin oonikka isttas immibeenna.
025	LAM	004	005	Kase lo7o kath mizayti ha7i metotidi oge bolla toylattida; kase lo7o may7o may7idi ishalon diccidayti ha7i bidinththan ichchida.
025	LAM	004	006	Ta dereza bolla gakkida qixaatey oona kusheykka bochchontta dishin eeson aadhdha wodhdhida Sodoome katama asaa gakkida qixaatezappeka keehi iita.
025	LAM	004	007	Istta kaaleththizayti shachchafe aadhdhida geeshsha; maaththafe aadhdhi booththa; istta bollay zo7o inqqufe aadhdhida aarissa; qasse isttas medhaykka simpere geetettiza shuchcha mala.
025	LAM	004	008	Ha7i gidikko istta medhay shaalapeka aadhdhi karettides; oonikka istta ogen be7idi erenna; istti meqeth xalla attida; mela miththa mala gidida.
025	LAM	004	009	Koshan hayqqidaytappe mashshan hayqqidayti lo7o;
025	LAM	004	010	Ta asaa bolla gakkida hanqo gaason naytas mishettiza aayeti ba yelida nayta ba kushera doysi mida.
025	LAM	004	011	Xoossi ba wolqqama hanqoza qonccisides; Xiyoono dippi histti dhayssiza tama oyseththides.
025	LAM	004	012	Biitta bolla diza kawotappe woykko alame bolla diza asaappe oonikka istta morkketi woykko worajjizayti Yerusalaame pengeta menththi gelana giidi oonikka qoppibeenna.
025	LAM	004	013	Hayssi haniday nabetinne qeeseti ooththida nagara gaasonna; qasse istti xillota suuth gussida gishshassa.
025	LAM	004	014	Qooqe asa mala istti oge bolla gadigadana; istti suuththan tunida gishshas istta may7o bochchanaas xalizaadey deenna.
025	LAM	004	015	Hessa gishshas asay istta bolla, «Kichchite! Intte tuna! Haakkite! Nuna bochchofte!» gi waassana. Hessa gaason istti baqatidi kawoteththaa giddon toylattishe asay isttas, «Intte nunara hayssan daanaas dandayekketa» gida.
025	LAM	004	016	Istta laalliday Xoossa; hayssafe guye izi isttas qoppenna; istta qeesetas bonchchoy imettenna; cimataska puulay deenna.
025	LAM	004	017	Nu ayfey maado demmanaas xeellishe coo mela daaburdes; nuna ashshanaas dandayontta deretappe maado demmanaas laamotan naagidos.
025	LAM	004	018	Asay nu geedon eqqiza gishshas nu ogera hemettanaas dandaybeekko; nuus wurseththi matides; nu layththi wurides; nu dhayza wodey gakkides.
025	LAM	004	019	Nuna gooddizayti salora paalliza gollefe aadhdhi eesoteettes; istti nuna zuma bollara gooddida; bazzon nuna zuggi naagida.
025	LAM	004	020	Nuni iza kuwa garsan utti de7ana gi qoppidayssa, Xoossi tiydayssa, nuus de7o shemppoka gididayssa bantta woximaden oykkida.
025	LAM	004	021	Intteno Uuxe biittan diza Eedoome asatoo! Ufays nococu giite! Gido attiin qaaday inttenakka gakkana; intte maththottananne kallo attana.
025	LAM	004	022	Intteno Xiyoone asatoo! Intte mooro gaason qaxxayettoyssi inttes gidana; hayssafe guye inttena di7ettida biittan gam7isenna; gido attiin Eedoome asatoo! Izi inttena intte nagara gishshas qaxxayana; izi intte moorozakka qoncce kessana.
025	LAM	005	001	Abeet GODAWU! Nu bolla gakkidayssa ne qoppa; nu kawushshateththaka xeella.
025	LAM	005	002	Nu biitta allagati laattida; nu keeththaaka baas duussaso ooththida.
025	LAM	005	003	Nuni yi7o gididos; nu aayeti am7eta gidida.
025	LAM	005	004	Nuni nu haaththa miishshan shammi uyidos; nuni nu miththaaka shammi ekkidos.
025	LAM	005	005	Nuna gooddizayti nuus geedon eqqida; keehippe daaburdos; shempoka digettidos.
025	LAM	005	006	Nuni kath kallanaas giidi Asoore asatassinne Gibxes kushe immidos.
025	LAM	005	007	Nu aawati nagara ooththida; nuni istta qixaate ekkidos.
025	LAM	005	008	Aylleti nuna haarida; istta kusheppe nuna kessi ekkanay oonikka deenna.
025	LAM	005	009	Bazzon diza ola gaason nuni nu shemppo aaththi immidi kath demmidos.
025	LAM	005	010	Kosha daroppe dendidayssan hargidos; nu medhaykka shaala mala gidides.
025	LAM	005	011	Maccassata Xiyoonen tunisida; geela7otakka Yuhuda katamatan wolqqan oykki kawushshida.
025	LAM	005	012	Daannata istti kaqqida; cimatakka bonchchibeettenna.
025	LAM	005	013	Yelaga attuma nayti woxan gaaccana mala wolqqaththida; panththati deexo mith tookkidi gadigadida.
025	LAM	005	014	Cimati pirdanaas uttiza dubbusha aggida; panththatikka bantta mazamure aggida.
025	LAM	005	015	Ufayssi nu wozinappe dhaydes; nu durissika yeehon laamettides.
025	LAM	005	016	Kallachchay nu hu7eppe kundides; nu nagara ooththida gishshas aayye ana!
025	LAM	005	017	Hessa gaason nu wozinay daaburdes; nu ayfeykka baljumides.
025	LAM	005	018	Xiyoone biittay bula gidida gishshas worakanati guppizasoho gidides.
025	LAM	005	019	Abeet GODAWU! Neni mernaas haaraasa; ne kawoteththay yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas daana.
025	LAM	005	020	Ne nuna ays ubba wode co7u gay? qasse ays hayssa gakkanaas aggaagadii?
025	LAM	005	021	GODAWU! Neni nuna neekko zaara; nunikka neekko simmana! beni nu bonchchoza zaarada nuna ooraththa!
025	LAM	005	022	Ne hessaththo ooththontta aggiko nuna mulera aggadii? ne hanqozaska zaway baawee?
