# BOOK	026	EZE	Ezekiel	Hiziqeela Tinbite
026	EZE	001	001	Heedzdzu tammanththa layththan, oydanththo aginan, ichchashanththo gallassan, tani Koboore shaafan di7ettidi bidayta giddon dashe saloti doyettiin Xoossa ajjuuta be7adis.
026	EZE	001	002	Kawo Iyo7aakiney di7ettida ichchashanththa layththan, he aginan ichchashanththo gallassan,
026	EZE	001	003	Baabiloonen Koboore shaafa matan diza Buuze naa qeese Hiziqeelakko GODAA qaalay yides; GODAA wolqqay tana oykkides.
026	EZE	001	004	Tani dhoqqu ga xeellishin pudeha baggafe gote carkoy yizayssa be7adis; izappe wolqqanththi wawaci giza dhippi gida shaaraa gita poo7oy giddoththi woththides; tamazas giddo adday birata bonqqo misatees.
026	EZE	001	005	Tamaza giddon shemppora paxa diza oyddu medheteththata misley dees; istta medhaykka asa medha misatees.
026	EZE	001	006	Isttas issaas issaas oyddu ayfesoynne oyddu qefey dees.
026	EZE	001	007	Isttas sitti gida luule tohoy dees; istta tohoy mara qinccifille malanne qucettidi xolqiza xarqimala misatees.
026	EZE	001	008	Isttas oyddu baggara qefeta garsan asa kushey dees; he oyddatasikka ayfesotinne qefeti deettes.
026	EZE	001	009	Istta qefeti issoy issaara diishetteettes; istti ubbayka guye simmi xeellontta sitti giidi sinth beettes.
026	EZE	001	010	Istta ayfesoy hayssafe kaalli dizayssa mala; istta oyddatasikka issaas issaas sinththa baggara asa ayfeso malay dees; ushachcha baggara gaammo ayfeso malay, hadirsa baggara boora ayfeso malay, qasseka istta issaas issaas guye baggara golle ayfeso malay dees.
026	EZE	001	011	Istta ayfesoy hessa misatees; istta qefey pude yangetti uttides; isttas issaas issaas nam7u nam7u qefey dees; issaa issaa qefey hankkoyssa qefera diishetti uttides.
026	EZE	001	012	Istti ubbayka sitti giidi sinth beettes; guye simmontta Xoossa Ayanay bizaso awakka beettes.
026	EZE	001	013	Ha shemppora paxa diza medheteththata medhay eexxiza tama bonqonne xomppe misatees; he shemppora paxa diza medheteththata giddon tamay yaanne haa qaaxxees; tamazi phoollees; iza giddofekka wolqqanththi kezees.
026	EZE	001	014	Ha shemppora paxa diza medheteththati wolqqanththi eeson wawaci giza mala yaanne haa simeretteettes.
026	EZE	001	015	Ta ha oyddu shemppora paxa diza medheteththata xeellashe, oyddu ayfesoti shemppora paxa diza medheteththata matan issi issi irzo biitta bolla beyadis.
026	EZE	001	016	He irzota medhaynne hanotay hayssafe kaallizayssa mala; al7o shuchcha mala xolqeettes; oyddata medhaykka issi mala; issi issi irzoy hara irzora qaxetti uttidaa misatees.
026	EZE	001	017	Istti biza wode medheteththati oyddu bagga yuuyana dandayeettes; medheteththati biza wode irzoti yaanne haa geettenna.
026	EZE	001	018	He oyddu irzotas odzdzodzdzoy dees; ha oyddu irzoti gitanne babisizaaza; yuuyi aadhdhanaaska isttan ayfeti kumida.
026	EZE	001	019	Ha shemppora paxa diza medheteththati biza wode istta millen diza irzotikka beettes; he shemppora paxa diza medheteththati biittafe pude dendiza wode irzotikka isttara issife dendeettes.
026	EZE	001	020	Xoossa Ayanay bizaso awakka istti beettes; ayanay istta giddon diza gishshas irzoti isttara issife pude dendeettes.
026	EZE	001	021	De7oy diza medheteththati biza wode irzotikka beettes; istti eqqiza wode irzotikka eqqeettes; qasse irzoti isttara issife pude dendeettes.
026	EZE	001	022	Ha shemppora paxa diza medheteththata hu7eppe bollara babisizanne mastoote mala xolqidi ayfe caddiza salo gufanththo misatizay micetti dees.
026	EZE	001	023	He salo gufanththozappe garsa baggara istta qefey sitti giidi, issoy issaakko micetti uttides; qasse istta ubbaasikka istta bolla kammiza nam7u nam7u qefey dees.
026	EZE	001	024	Ha shemppora paxa diza medheteththati piradhdhiza wode istta qefeta giirissa siyadis; he giirissay di7o haaththa gunththa mala, Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossa cenggurssa malanne cora olanchchata wocama mala hanizayssa siyadis. Istti piradho aggiza wode bantta qefeza shiphphi histteettes.
026	EZE	001	025	Istti piradhdhizayssa aggidi bantta qefeza shiishshida mala istta hu7eppe bollara diza salo gufanththofe bollara giirissi seetettides.
026	EZE	001	026	Isttafe bollara diza salo gufanththofe dhoqqu giidi simpere araata misatizay dees; he araataa bolla as misatizaazi uttides.
026	EZE	001	027	Izas xees misatizasoppe pude baggay taman bonqqida birata misatizayssa; xees misatizasoppe duge baggay tama misatizayssa be7adis; iza yuushon phoolliza poo7oy dees.
026	EZE	001	028	Iza yuushon diza phoolliza poo7oy ira gallas shaara bolla eqqida zuulla misatees. Hessika GODAA bonchcho qoncceth misatees. Tani hessa be7ida wode, biittan duge gufannada issaade haasaya cenggurs siyadis.
026	EZE	002	001	Izi tana, «Haysso asa nawu! Denda ne tohon eqqa; tani nees yootana» gides.
