026	EZE	002	007	Istti makkallanchcha zare gidida gishshas istti siyikkoka siyontta ixxikokka ta qaala isttas yoota.
026	EZE	002	008	Neni gidikko haysso asa nawu! Ta nees yootizayssa siya! He makkallanchcha zareta mala makkallofa; ne doona doyada tani nees immizayssa ma» gides.
026	EZE	002	009	Hessafe guye tani xeellishin issi kushey taakko micettidayssa heerakka be7adis; he kushezan xaaththa maxaafay dees.
