027	DAN	002	040	Qasseka beettida miish ubbaa menththereththi yeggiza birata mala mino gidida oydanththo kawoy kawotana; biratay ubbaa menththereththi liiqisiza mala izi baappe kase kawotida kawota menththereththi yeggana.
