027	DAN	002	048	Hessafe guye Kawozi Daaneela gita bonchchoson woththides; keehi daro imotata izas immides; Baabiloone kawoteththa ubbaa ayssizaade histtides; Baabiloone eranchchata ubbaa bolla halaqa histti shuumides.
