027	DAN	011	044	Hessafe guye arshey mokkiza baggaranne pudeha baggara yiza worey iza daganththana; izi keehi hanqettidi daro asata wodhanaassinne dhayssanaas dendana.
027	DAN	011	045	Izi ba kawoteththa dunkaaneza abbaafenne geeshsha zumaappe giddon tokkana; gido attiin hessi wuri haniinkka izas wurseth gidana; iza maaddanaykka beettenna» gides.
027	DAN	012	001	Kase taas ajjuutaza birshiza kiitanchchazi taas, «Ne dereza naagiza gita kiitanchchas halaqa Mika7eeley izi he wode qonccana; asa zereththi medhettoosofe he wode gakkanaas hani erontta wolqqama metoy hanana; istta sunththay maxaafan xaafettida ubba asay attana.
027	DAN	012	002	Istti hayqqiin biittay midayti wurikka dendana; istta garsafe baggayti mernaa de7os, baggayti mernaa kawushshassinne waayes dendana.
027	DAN	012	003	He wode aadho eranchchati salo poo7o mala phoollana; darota xilloteththa oge kaaleththidayti wuri merippe mernaa gakkanaas salo xoolintteta mala xolqana.
027	DAN	012	004	«Daaneela! Neni alame wurseththi gakkanaas hayssa maxaafaza gordada maatamen shoca; he wode asay erateth darsanaas yaanne haa woxerettana» gides.
027	DAN	012	005	Hessafe guye ta sinththan haaththa shaafa doonan hara nam7ata he pinththaninne ha pinththan eqqidayta be7adis.
027	DAN	012	006	Istta giddofe issay lee7e haare may7idi he shaafazappe pude baggara eqqida kiitanchchaza, «Hayti malalisiza hanoti polettanaas ay keena wodey attidee?» giidi oychchides.
027	DAN	012	007	Lee7e haare may7idi shaafappe ganna baggara eqqida kiitanchchazi ba kusheta pude salo denththidi, «Hessi heedzdzu layththinne bagga gam7ana; geeshsha asata wolqqay wurshin hayti wurikka polettana» giidi mernaaas de7izayssan caaqqishin siyadis.
027	DAN	012	008	Izi gizayssa siyadis shin taas gelibeenna; histtiin tani, «Ta Godoo! Hayssa ubbaa wurseththi ay gidanee?» ga oychchadis.
027	DAN	012	009	Izikka taas, «Daaneela! Hayssa alameza wurseththi gakkanaas hayssi tinbite qaalazi gordettidi maatamen shocettida gishshas neni ba.
027	DAN	012	010	Daroti qorettana, gacetti geeyananne istta bolla wosoy bayndayta gidana; iitati gidikko bantta iitateth gujji gujji baana; iitatappe issoyka akeekenna; gido attiin aadho eranchchati akeekana.
027	DAN	012	011	«Gallas gallas shiiqiza yarshoy digettoosafenne bashsha tunateththi doomettoosafe ha simmiin 1,290 gallas gidana.
027	DAN	012	012	Genccidi 1,335 gallassati aadhdhana gakkanaas ba ammano naagizay anjjettida asa.
027	DAN	012	013	«Daaneela! Neni wurseth gakkanaas ba; hessafe guye ne shempana; wurseththa gallas nees giigida xinxxo ne laattana» gides.
