# BOOK	028	HOS	Hosea	Hose7e Tinbite
028	HOS	001	001	Ooziyay, Iyo7aatamey, Akaazeynne Hizqiyaasi issoy issaafe kaalli kaallidi Yuhudan kawotida wode hessaththoka Iyo7aasa naa Iyorba7aamey Isra7eelen kawotida wode Bi7eere naa Hose7ekko yida GODAA qaalay hayssafe kaallizayssa.
028	HOS	001	002	GODAY Hose7e baggara Isra7eele naytas qaala buro yootishe Hose7es, «Ta derey taappe shaakettidi iita layma laymatiza gishshas neni baada issi laymatiza maccas nees machcho ekka; izippe nees nayta yela» gides.
028	HOS	001	003	Hessa gishshas Hose7ey biidi Dibilayeme nayo Goomero machcho ekkides; izakka qanththatada izas attuma naa yeladus.
028	HOS	001	004	Hessafe guye GODAY Hose7es, «Iyunne iza zereththati Izra7eelen wodhida asata geedon Iyu zereththata ta qaxxayana wodey haaho gidenna; Isra7eele kawoteththi hayssafe guye kundana mala ta ooththana.
028	HOS	001	005	He wode Izra7eele shoobban Isra7eele ola asa ubbaa ta menththereththana; hessa gishshas ne naaza sunththaa, ‹Izra7eele› gaada sunththa» gides.
028	HOS	001	006	Goomera qasseka qanththatada macca naa yeladus. GODAYKKA Hose7es, «Tani hayssafe guye Isra7eele asaas qadhettike; ta istta maarikke; hessa gishshas neni izi sunththaa, ‹Loruhama› ga sunththaa.
028	HOS	001	007	Yuhuda asaas gidikko tani ta siiqo bessana. Tani GODAY istta Xoossay ashshana; ta istta ashshanayssi ola wolqqan gidenna; mashshan, tooran woykko paraninne paran olizaytan gidenna» gides.
028	HOS	001	008	Goomera ba nayo dhanththi duuththidaappe guye qasseka qanththatada attuma naa yeladus.
028	HOS	001	009	GODAYKKA Hose7e, «Hayssafe guye Isra7eele asay ta dere gidenna; tanikka istta Xoos gidikke. Hessa gishshas neni ne naaza sunththaa, ‹Lo7aami› ga xeyga» gides.
028	HOS	001	010	Gidikkoka Isra7eele asay qooday baynda abban shaamintta mala darana. Ha7i Xoossi, «Intte ta dere deekketa» geetettidasohon, «Intte de7o Xoossa nayta» geetetti xeygettana wodey yaana.
028	HOS	001	011	He wode Yuhuda asaynne Isra7eele asay simmidi issino gidana. Nam7ati banttana ayssanaade issi as doorana. Qasseka istti bantta deren dichchaninne dureteththan de7ana. Izra7eele gallassay gita gidana.
028	HOS	002	001	Hessa gishshas intte intte ishata Isra7eele nayta, «Aami» intte michchetakka «Uruhaama» gi sunththite.
028	HOS	002	002	«Ta naytoo! Intte aayo zorite; hayssafe guye iza taas machcho gidukku; tanikka izis azina gidikke; ba sinththafe layma suuke hano, ba wodira giddofe laymateth diggu.
028	HOS	002	003	Iza simmontta ixxiko iza ba aayey uloppe kallo yelettida mala ta izo xiire kallo ashshana. Bazzo malanne mela biitta mala ta izo ooththana. Ta izo haaththa saamon wodhana.
028	HOS	002	004	Layma maccassafe yelettida gishshas izi naytas ta mishettike.
028	HOS	002	005	Istta aaya layma; kawushsha hanon shaaradus. Iza ba doonara, ‹Tani ta laggeththotaakko bays; istti taas kaththinne haaththe, suufeppenne lee7e haareppe dadettida may7o, wogara zaytenne woyne ushshu immana› gadus.
028	HOS	002	006	Hessa gishshas tani izi oge agunththara gordana; iza kezana penge demmontta mala tani gimbe yuushsha aaththa gordana.
028	HOS	002	007	Iza ba laggeththota demmanaas woxxana shin isttako gakkanaas dandayukku. Iza istta daro koyana shin demmuku; hayssafe guye, ‹Hayssa ha duussafe taas kase duussay lo7o; hessa gishshas beni ta azinaakko ta simma baana› gaana.
028	HOS	002	008	Tani izis kase kath, woyne ushshinne wogara zayte immidayssanne qasseka iza ba7aale geetettiza eeqa xoossas yarsho biranne worqqa izis darssiday tana gididayssa iza shaakka erabeekku.
028	HOS	002	009	Hessa gishshas kaththi kaxxiza wode ha kaxxiza kaththaa, woyne ayfey teeriza wode woyne ushshaa, tani izippe woththa ekkana. Hessaththoka iza ba kalloteththa kammontta mala suufeppenne lee7e haareppe dadettida may7oza ta izippe qaara ekkana.
028	HOS	002	010	Izi laggeththota sinththan ta izo kallo ashshana; izo ta kusheppe ashshanay deenna.
028	HOS	002	011	Iza ba ufayssa ba7aaleta ubbaa, layththan layththan bonchchiza ba7aaleta, agina xeeron xeeron bonchchiza ba7aaleta, Sambatatanne hara iza dumma dumma doora bonchchiza ba7aaleta nam7anththo ooththontta mala ta diggana.
028	HOS	002	012	Iza ba laggeththotappe baas waaga gaada ekkida woyne miththatanne balase miththata ta dhoqallana. Isttaka wora do7ati maana.
028	HOS	002	013	Ba7aale geetettiza eeqa xoossas exaane cuwasanaassinne lo7o geexe woththada iza ba laggeththota kaallada tana aggida gishshas ta izo qaxxayana.
028	HOS	002	014	«Hessa gishshas ta izo maqqada bazzo efana; heen ta izira siiqo qaalan haasayssana.
028	HOS	002	015	Kase izi woyne atakilteza ta izis zaarana; meto shoobba ta izis hidota penge histtana; heen iza Gibxeppe kezida gallas naateththan dashe yexxida mala yexxana.
028	HOS	002	016	Iza he gallassi tana, ‹Ta azinazoo› ga xeygana attiin hayssafe guye, ‹Ba7aale› geetettiza eeqa xoossa sunththan tana xeygukku.
028	HOS	002	017	Ba7aale geetettiza eeqa xoossata sunththaa ta izi doonappe diggana; hayssafe guye istta sunththi dendenna.
028	HOS	002	018	He wode do7atara, kafotaranne biitta bolla gooshettiza medheteth ubbatara ta intte gishshas caaqettana. Ubbayka saron daana mala ola, tooranne, Mashsha biitta bollafe ta diggana.
028	HOS	002	019	Hanne Isra7eele! Ta nena mernaas taas giigsana; Ta nees xilloteththaninne suureteththan pirdana; aggontta siiqoninne qadhetan ta nena taas oychcha giigsana.
028	HOS	002	020	Tani ammanettada nena taas machcho giigsana. Nenikka tani GODA gididayssa erana.
028	HOS	002	021	«He gallas tani zaaro immana; tani salo azazana; saloykka sa7as zaaro immana.
028	HOS	002	022	Biittay kath, woyne ushshunne zayte immana; isttika Izra7eeles zaaro gidana.
028	HOS	002	023	Tani ta dereyo biitta bolla tokkana. ‹Maaroteththi bayndaaro› geetettidaaro ta zaarada maarana; ‹Ta maarikke› gidayssaka zaara maarana; ‹Intte ta dere deekketa› geetettideta. ‹Ta dereta› gaada ta xeygana gaana; isttika tana, ‹Neni nu Xoossa› gaana» gees.
028	HOS	003	001	GODAY tana, «Isra7eele asay hara xoossatakko simmidi zabibe ukeththi shiishshana koyides; hessarakka GODAY istta siiqizayssa mala nekka baada ba laggeththota siiqada laymatashe diza kase ne machcheyo zaarada siiqa» gides.
028	HOS	003	002	Hessa gishshas ta izo tammanne ichchashu saqile biraninne 150 kilo banggan shammadis.
028	HOS	003	003	Ta izo, «Ne laymatizayssanne hara as kaallizayssa aggada tanara daro wode xilloteththan de7a; tanikka nenara ammaneteththan daana» ga zoradis.
028	HOS	003	004	Hessaththoka Isra7eele asay kawoy baynda woykko kaaleththizaadey baynda, yarshoy baynda woykko eeqa xoossata hawultey baynda, qeeseteththa may7oy baynda woykko eeqa xoossata misley baynda daro wode de7ana.
028	HOS	003	005	Hessafe guye Isra7eele derey GODAA ba Xoossaakonne ba kawo Dawitekko simmana. Wurseththa wode istti yashshan kokkorishe GODAAKKONNE iza anjjoko yaana.
028	HOS	004	001	Hanno biittay bolla diza asa ubbaa bolla GODAY shiishshiza mootoy dees. Hessa gishshas Isra7eele asawu! Izi inttena gizayssa siyite; «Hanno biittay bollafe ammaneteththay, siiqoynne Xoos eroy dhaydes.
028	HOS	004	002	Haan dizay qanggeth, wordo, shemppo wodho, laymateththinne caaqqida qaala muusi xalla dees. Geneynne shemppo wodhoy dari dari bees.
028	HOS	004	003	Hessa gaason biittay bolla koshay yees; izi bolla dizay wuri gilqees; meheti, do7ati, kafotinne Abba giddon diza moleti ubbay wureettes.»
028	HOS	004	004	GODAY, «Intteno qeeseto ta inttena mootiza miishshi dees; hessa gishshas oonikka hara asara palamettofo; qasse oonikka hara as mootoppo.
028	HOS	004	005	Intte omarsinne gallas dhuphetteeta; nabetikka inttenara dhuphetteettes. Hessa gishshas tani intte aayo Isra7eele dhayssana.
028	HOS	004	006	Ta derezas erateththi paccida gishshas dhaydes. Intte tana eranaas koyontta gishshas tanikka intte taas qeeseta gidi ooththana mala koykke. Intte ta woga balettida gishshas tanikka intte nayta balana.
028	HOS	004	007	Qeeseta qooday dari dari bishin istti ta bolla ooththida nagaray dari dari bides; bantta bonchchoka kawushshan laammida.
028	HOS	004	008	Ta dereza nagaray isttas muussas kiyides; hessa gishshas derey nagara ooththizayssa keehi dosida.
028	HOS	004	009	Intte qeesetikka deraappe dummatekketa; hessa gishshas ta ubbaaka izaade hano mala iza qaxxayana; iza ooso malakka izas immana.
028	HOS	004	010	Ta derey tana GODAA aggida gishshas istti maanashin kallettenna; laymatanashin corattettenna» gees.
028	HOS	004	011	«Laymateththas, Caalida woyne ushshas, mal7o woyne ushsha suukes banttana aaththi immida; hessantti ta dereza wozina ekkida.
028	HOS	004	012	Hessa gishshas miththafe oosettida eeqa xoossa zore oychcheettes; istti izan maroththiza guufezikka isttas zaaro immiza misatees; laymateththa qofay baleththides; bantta Xoossaas ammanettibeettenna.
028	HOS	004	013	Zumay dizason dizason yarsho yarsheettes; zumbullata bolla, gita daashsha miththata kuwa garsan xuugettiza yarsho yarsheettes. Hessa gaason intte macca nayti layman daana; intte nayta machcheti laymatana.
028	HOS	004	014	Intte macca naytinne intte nayta machcheti laymatishin tani istta qaxxaykke; gaasoykka intte attumasati layma maccassatara suuketeettes; eeqa xoossatas laymateththa yarsho shiishshizaytara intteka izaththo yarsheeta. Hessa gishshas akeekay baynda derey dhayana.
028	HOS	004	015	«Intteno Isra7eele asatoo! Intte laymatikkoka Yuhuda asay laymatana mala ooththofte; hessa gishshas taas goynnanaas Gelgela woykko Beeti-Awene geetettizaso boopite; ‹De7o GODAY beyiin› giidi ta sunththan caaqqofte.
028	HOS	004	016	Isra7eele derey makkallanchcha ussa mala makkallides; histtiin GODAY istta dorsa laaqqata mala lo7oson wostti heemmanee?
028	HOS	004	017	Efreemey eeqa xoossata goynon oykettida gishshas istta gede aggaagite.
