030	AMO	003	001	Isra7eele asawu! Gibxeppe kezida Isra7eele asaas inttes GODAY yootida qaala hayssa siyite.
030	AMO	003	002	Xoossay, «Kumeththa alamen diza dere ubbaafe ta inttena xalla dooradis; intte ooththiza nagara ubbaa gishshas ta inttena qaxxayays» gees.
030	AMO	003	003	Nam7u asati oge issife baana giidi qachchontta aggiko issife baanaas dandayzoo?
030	AMO	003	004	Gaammoy wora giddon aykko miza miish shankkati demmontta dishe coo mela xaaggi erizee? Wodalla gaammoy aykko miza miish demmontta dishe ba dizason coo mela ba qaala sissi erizee?
030	AMO	003	005	Yardey woykko gitey bayndason coo mela gaden kafoy oyketti erizee? Woykko diizay issi miishshi bana bochchontta dishin coo mela piri erizee?
