030	AMO	003	007	GODAY ba xuura ba oosanchcha nabetas koyrotti yootontta dishe aykkoka ooththenna.
030	AMO	003	008	Gaammoy xaaggiin siyidi dagammonttay oonee? GODAY ba xuura izas yootiin tinbite haasayonttay oonee?
030	AMO	003	009	Ashdoodeninne Gibxen diza miixatan diza ubbaas, «Samaariya zumata bolla shiiqite; heen isttan oosettiza gene oosonne bul7aketizayssa xeellite» gi awajjite.
