034	NAH	003	010	Gido attiin iza di7ettadus; goodetta badus; izi nayti ogeta tiixa bolla dinccettida; izi daannata bolla saamay wodhdhides; izi gita asati ubbay sansalatan qashettida.
034	NAH	003	011	Nenikka qasse maththottananne qotettana; morkketappe attizaso ne koyana.
034	NAH	003	012	Ne miixati ubbay muussas gakkida balase miththas koyro ayfe mala; istti qaaxxiza wode istta ayfeti mizaade doonan wodhdheettes.
034	NAH	003	013	Hekko ne ola asay wurikka macca xalla! Ne zawati ne morkketas waggi gi doyettida; istta kolatatakka tamay mides.
034	NAH	003	014	Nena giddoththiza wodes haath duuqqa; nees teqe minththa giigsa; mana urqqa koya; Urqqaa yedhdhada xuube ooththa.
034	NAH	003	015	Nena heen tamay maana; Mashshayka nena qanxxana; gumbaroy miza mala nena garccana; gumbaro mala yeletta; boole mala dara.
034	NAH	003	016	Ne zal7anchchata salo xoolinttepekka darsadasa. Istti gidikko biittayo boole mala pitti miidi piradhdhi bida.
034	NAH	003	017	Nena naagizayti boole mala; ne gita asati meego gallas gimbe garsan uttiza gumbaro mala. Istti arshey kezishin piradhdheettes; istti piradhdhi bizasoy awakko erettenna.
034	NAH	003	018	Asoore kawoo, ne heenththanchchati dhiskida; ne gita asati woppu gi ichchida; ne derey shiishshizay dhayiin zuma bolla laalettides.
034	NAH	003	019	Ne madunth paththana dandayzay deenna; neni hayqos gaththiza meqo meqqadasa; ne gishshas siyida ubbay ne kundeththaan ufayetti kushe baqqana; zaway baynda ne menxe iitateththi bochchonttay oonee?
#
# BOOK	035	HAB	Habakkuk	Imbaaqo Tinbite
035	HAB	001	001	Nabe Imbaaqos ajjuutan qonccida kiitay hayssafe kaallizayssa.
035	HAB	001	002	GODAWU! Ne tana maaddana mala ta nena xeygishin ne ayde gakkanaas siyikkii? «Qohoy darides» gaada ta waassishin ne ayde gakkanaas ashshikii?
035	HAB	001	003	Ne tana aazas qohoy darshin bessay? Hayssa mala gene oosoy oosettishin ne waana co7u gaada xeellay? Mooroynne makkallay ta sinththan dees. Ooshshinne palamay biitta bolla darides.
035	HAB	001	004	Hessa gishshas wogay leppides; tuma pirday deenna; tuma pirday geellattana mala iitati xillota un7eththeettes.
035	HAB	001	005	«Inttes yootettiinkka ammanontta inttena ta intte paxa dishin issi miish ooththana gishshas ane ha7i asaa xeellite; be7idinne daro malalettite.
035	HAB	001	006	Baas gidontta keeththanne dizaso oykkanaas biitta ubbaa worajjiza shemppo iitatanne pilatata Baabiloone dere asaa tani denththana.
035	HAB	001	007	Isttika babisizaytanne daganththizayta; istta pirdaynne bonchchoy isttafe kezana.
035	HAB	001	008	Istta paray maaheppeka pilata; omarsa kana suytetappeka menxe iita; istta toga asaykka too pilatanne haahoppe yizayta. Baqqi ekkidi eleliza golle kafo mala piradhdheettes.
035	HAB	001	009	Wurikka genes gixxi kezida; istta ola asay bazzo biitta carko mala gede sinththe hordofees. Di7ettidayta ace mala shiishshees.
035	HAB	001	010	Kawota leqqees; dere haarizayta qidhi kaa7ees; ola miixa ubbaa leqqees; biitta issiso shiishshi guuppidi katamata baas oykkees.
035	HAB	001	011	Hessafe guye gote carko mala pitti ekki bees; heyti ba wolqqa baas xoossa kessida nagaranchchata» gees.
035	HAB	001	012	Abeet GODAWU! Ne mernaasofe daasa gidikkii? Ta Geeshshawu, ta Xoossawu, neni naagiza gishshas nuni hayqqoko; GODAWU istta pirdana mala ne istta shuumadasa. Zaallazoo! Istti nuna qaxxayana mala ne isttas maata immadasa.
035	HAB	001	013	Ne ayfeti iita xeellontta mala keehi geeshsha; neni qoho co7u ga xeellanaas dandayakka; histtiin as baleththizayta aazas co7u gadii? He asati baappe keehi xilliza asata dhayssishin ne aazas co7u gay?
035	HAB	001	014	Neni asaa abba giddon diza mole malanne GODAY isttas baynda abba giddon diza medheteththa mala ooththadasa.
035	HAB	001	015	Iita morkkey istta wursika manxakora oykki kessana; izi istta gitenkka oykki goochchana; ba woththizason istta shiishshi woththana; hessankka ufayettidi hashshu gaana.
035	HAB	001	016	Hessankka shempidi diza gishshassinne izi miza qumay modhdho gidida gishshas ba oykkida gitezas yarsho yarshees; qasseka ba shiishshizasozas exaane cuwasees.
035	HAB	001	017	Histtiin izi wontiin wontiin pacey baynda ba gite yeggi yeggi mole oykkiza mala derezakka mishay baynda wodhanaas bessizee?
035	HAB	002	001	Tani naage naagizason eqqana; miixa gimbe bolla kezada heen takkana. Ta oyshaas GODAY ay zaaro immanakko ta dizason daada iza naagana.
035	HAB	002	002	Xoossi Imbaaqos, «Waayisontta nababettana mala nees ajjuutan qonccidayssa saleeda bolla lo7eththa wooca xaafa.
035	HAB	002	003	Ne ajjuutazi baas imettida wode naagees; izikka wurseththa gishshas yootees, wordotenna. Gam7ana misatikkoka naaga; izi tumappe yaana; mulekka gam7enna.
035	HAB	002	004	«Hekko izi otorettides; iza amoy suure gidenna; xillo asi gidikko ammanon dees.
035	HAB	002	005	Dureteththi as baleththees; otoranchchas mulekka shemppoy deenna; izi duufo mala yora; wodhiza hayqo malakka kalo erenna; dere ubbaa shiishsheessinne di7i ekki bees.
035	HAB	002	006	Histtiin hessa mala asa bolla qidheninne kadhen asay, ‹Ba kaysi ekkida shaqaceza baas shiishshizaades, genen duretizaades aayye ana! Hessaththo ayde gakkanaas shiishshanee?› gi iza bolla miiccennee?
035	HAB	002	007	Ne acon yeggida asati ne qoppontta ne bolla dendettennee? Istti beeggidi nena daganththettenee? Hessafe guye ne istta kushen kundana.
035	HAB	002	008	Ne daro dere miish bonqqida gishshas hankko bonqqettonttayti nena bonqqana; ne asa suuth gussadasa; deraa, katamanne izan dizayta wursa dhayssadasa.
035	HAB	002	009	«Wordora baleththi ekkida miishshan baas daana keeth keexxizaadessinne ba morkke kusheppe attanaas ba keeth dhoqqasohon keexxizaades aayye ana!
035	HAB	002	010	Daro asa shemppoy dhayana mala qachchadasa; ne keeththa bollanne ne bolla dhayssizaaz ehadasa.
035	HAB	002	011	Gimbe giddon shuchchi waassees; giddon goda eqqida miththatikka izas zaaro immeettes.
035	HAB	002	012	«Suuth gussidinne iita ooththidi katama essizaytas aayye ana!
035	HAB	002	013	Asa oosoy ubbay taman xuugettana mala dereykka mela daaburana mala GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay ubbaa woththibeennee?
035	HAB	002	014	Abbay kumiza mala biittay GODAA gitateth eron kumana.
035	HAB	002	015	«Asa kalloteth beyanaas ba laggeta ushshu ushshizaadessinne istti uyidi maththottana gakkanaas woyne ushshu duuqqizaades aayye ana!
035	HAB	002	016	Neni bonchcho gishshas yeellatana; hessika ha7i taray nees gidida gishshas uyada gandigara; ne kallotta. GODAA ushachcha kushen diza hanqo xuu7ay ne bolla simmana; kase nees diza bonchchoza kawushshateththan laammana.
035	HAB	002	017	Ne Libaanoose bolla ooththida geney nena mittana; neni medosata dhayssidayssi zaari nena daganththana; hessika ne asa suuth gussida gishshassinne dereta, katamatanne isttan dizayta ne ubbaa dhayssida gishshassa.
035	HAB	002	018	«Asa kushey massi giigsida eeqanne wordo haasayza misles ay go7ay dizee? Histtiin iza ooththidaadey barkka ba ooson ammanettiza gishshassinne isttika haasayanaas dandayontta eeqa ooththiza gishshassa.
035	HAB	002	019	Miththaa, ‹Ne beegga!› Shemppoy baynda shuchchaaka, ‹Ne denda!› gizaades aayye ana! Tumukka izi tamaarsana dandayzee? Hekko izi bollara worqqaninne biran tiyettides; izas shemppoyka deenna.
035	HAB	002	020	GODAY gidikko ba Geeshsha keeththan dees. Biitta bolla diza derey wurikka iza sinththan co7u go» gides.
035	HAB	003	001	Nabe Imbaaqoy yeththan shiishshida woossa.
035	HAB	003	002	Abeet GODAWU! Ta ne goobateththa gishshas siyadis. GODAWU ne oosoykka tana yashissides; neni ne ooso nu woden ooraththa; ne oosoti nu wodenkka erettana mala ooththarkkii! Hanqo wodekka maaroteth qopparkkii!
035	HAB	003	003	Xoossi Temaaneppe Geeshshayka Paaraane zuma bollafe yides; Iza bonchchoy salo kammi oykkides; Iza galataykka biitta bolla kumides.
035	HAB	003	004	Iza poo7oy awa arshe poo7o mala; awa xalqqey iza kusheppe kezides; iza wolqqayka heen qotettides.
035	HAB	003	005	Iita hargey izappe sinththara bides; hada hayqoykka iza geedo kaallides.
035	HAB	003	006	Izi eqqiin biittay qaaxxides; izi xeellidi asaa kokkorisides; Mernaas diza zumati laaleteth piski gida; Beniisofe diza zumatikka woddida; Iza ogey mernaassa.
035	HAB	003	007	Tophphiya dunkaaneti metotettishin, Midiyaameta duussasoy bul7akettishin ta beyadis.
035	HAB	003	008	GODAWU! Ne haaththata bolla hanqettadii? Ne hanqoy haaththa pulttota bolla dizee? Neni ne paratanne xooniza para-gaareta toggada kaaleththida wode abba bolla hanqettadii?
035	HAB	003	009	Neni ne wondafe giigsadasa; yiishshay nees yaana mala azazadasa; biitta phalqada haath kessadasa.
035	HAB	003	010	Zumati nena be7idi mannida; Haaththaa dambalay aadhdhi bides; abbay ceeqettides; abbaa dambalakka pude denththides.
035	HAB	003	011	Ne pirisa yeddida ne yiishshatappenne xolqettiza ne toora poo7oppe dendidayssan arsheynne aginay ba dizason eqqi attida.
035	HAB	003	012	Neni biitta bolla hanqon simerettadasa; deretakka hanqon yedhdhadasa.
035	HAB	003	013	Neni ne dere ashshanaasinne ne tiydaade ashshanaas kezadasa, iita dere kaaleththizaade liiqisadasa, hu7eppe toho xugunth gakkanaas kallo ashshadasa.
035	HAB	003	014	Gote carko mala nuna laallanaas yidayssa, aykkoy baynda manqoza geemara mittanaas amottizayssa, olanchchata halaqa gididayssa iza tooran iza zaara caddadasa.
035	HAB	003	015	Neni abba ne paratan yedhisiza woden ciimma abbay qaaxxees.
035	HAB	003	016	Tani siyadis; ta wozinaykka dagammides; Iza giirssafe dendidayssan ta metershay kokkorides. Babon taas maracey qaaxxides. Taas gulbatey kokkorides; gidikkoka nu bolla worajjiza dereza bolla metoy yaana gallas ta gencca naagays.
035	HAB	003	017	Balase geetettiza miththay ayfontta aggikokka woyne miththafe ayfey beettontta aggiko wogara miththika ayfontta aggiko goshsha gadey kath immontta aggiko Dorsi yiren dontta aggikokka Miizi zedhen dontta aggikokka
035	HAB	003	018	Tani ta GODAAN ufayettana; ta izan attida Xoossan ufayettana.
035	HAB	003	019	GODA Ta Xoossay taas wolqqa; ta tohota izi genessa toho mala minththo; izi tana dhoqqasohora hemeththana. Yexxizayta kaaleththizaades yeththa miishshan yexettida mazamure.
#
# BOOK	036	ZEP	Zephaniah	Sofonaasa Tinbite
036	ZEP	001	001	Amoxe naa Iyosiyaasi Yuhudan kawotida wode Hizqiyaasa naa, Amaariya naa, Godoliyaasa naa, Kuushe naa Sofonaasakko yida GODAA qaalay hayssafe kaallizayssa.
036	ZEP	001	002	GODAY, «Tani biitta bolla dizaaz ubbaa dhayssana» gees.
036	ZEP	001	003	GODAY, «Asenne medosata dhayssana; salo kafotanne abba giddon diza moleta ta dhayssana; ta asa zereth biitta bollafe dhayssiza wode iitati laalettida buura doore mala gidana» gees.
036	ZEP	001	004	GODAY, «Tani Yuhudaninne Yerusalaamen diza as ubbaa qaxxayana; qasseka Ba7aale, istta eeqa xoossatanne laymatiza qeeseta hayssafe ta milxi histta dhayssana.
036	ZEP	001	005	Fooqe bolla kezidi salo medheteththatas goynnizayta, GODAAS goynnishenne iza sunththan caaqqishe simmi wodhidi qasse Milkkoome sunththan caaqqizayta,
036	ZEP	001	006	GODAA kaallanaappe guye simmizayta, GODAA koyonttayta, izi istta maaddana mala oychchonttayta ta dhayssana» gees.
036	ZEP	001	007	GODAA gallassay matida gishshas Ubbaa haariza GODAA sinththan co7u giite; GODAY yarsho giigsides; ba xeygidayta baas dummasides.
036	ZEP	001	008	«GODAA yarsho gallas daannatanne kawoza nayta, imaththa may7o may7izayta ubbaa ta qaxxayana.
036	ZEP	001	009	He wode allaga xoossata pengen guppizayta, bantta godata keeththaa makkallateththaninne baleththon kunththizayta ta qaxxayana» gees GODAY.
036	ZEP	001	010	GODAY, «He wode mole penge baggara waasoy, katamaas nam7anththo dubbushan yeehoy, zumbullata bolla gita shiroy siyettana.
036	ZEP	001	011	Intteno Makitesha giyan dizaytoo! Waassite; gaasoykka izan zal7iza zal7anchchati ubbay wurana; biran zal7izaytikka ubbay hayqqana.
036	ZEP	001	012	He wode ta Yerusalaame giddoza xomppera koyana; aykko hirgay baynda badhdhi gi uttidayta, woyne ushshu gacci ekkichchiin orcco bolla attida woyne ushsha mala gididayta, ‹Iita gidiin woykko lo7o gidiin GODAY aykkoka ooththenna› gizayta ta qaxxayana.
036	ZEP	001	013	Istti haarida haaroy bonqqettana; istta keeththay laalettana; istti keeth keexxanashin ba keexxida keeththan deettenna; woyne mith tokkanashin ba tokkida woynezappe oosettida ushshaa uyettenna» gees.
036	ZEP	001	014	«GODAAPPE yaana gita gallassay matides; hessika eeson yaana; GODAA gallassan siyettana yeehoy camo; heen olanchchati camo waaso waassana.
036	ZEP	001	015	He gallassay bashsha gallas, metonne ceece gallas, shironne dhayssa gallas, dhuma gallassinne tulala gallas, Shaaranne girdi gida dhuma gallas gidana.
036	ZEP	001	016	He gallassay gimbettida katamata bollanne adussa gimbeta bolla ola zayeynne ola waasoy siyettiza gallas gidana.
036	ZEP	001	017	Asay qooqeththo hemettana mala asaa bolla tani ceece yeddana; asay GODAA bolla nagara ooththida gishshas istta suuththi di7o mala gukkana; istta ahaykka buura mala olettana.
036	ZEP	001	018	GODAA bashsha gallas istta biraynne worqqay istta ashshanaas dandayenna. Biittay kumeth iza hanqon dhayana; iza zil7eteththa suulen biitta ubbay xuugettana; biitta bolla diza ubbaa bolla qoppontta dishin wurseth ehana» gees GODAY.
036	ZEP	002	001	Intteno yeellay baynda deretoo! Ane issi bolla shiiqite!
036	ZEP	002	002	Bashsha gallassay gakkanaappe kasetidi, he gallassay suulla mala denththi dhayssontta dishin, GODAAPPE mino hanqoy intte bolla yontta dishin GODAAPPE bashsha gallassi intte bolla gakkontta dishin shiiqite.
036	ZEP	002	003	Intteno biitta bolla diza ashketoo; iza azazokka polizaytoo! GODAA koyite; Xilloteththinne ashketeth koyite; GODAA hanqo gallassafe intte attanaakko oonee erizay!
036	ZEP	002	004	Gaazay bula biitta gidana; Asqeloonaykka laaletta attana. Azaxooney seeta gallas kayzana. Aqarooney shodettana.
036	ZEP	002	005	Intteno abba achchan dizaytoo! Kelite dere asatoo, inttes aayye ana! Filisxeeme dere asay diza Kanaane biittayee! ne bolla yootettida GODAA qaalay hayssafe kaallizayssa; «Ta nena mulera dhayssana; nenan diza asappe attana asi deenna.
036	ZEP	002	006	Kaalite asay diza abba achcha biittay heenththanchchata duussasonne dorsa yire gidana.
036	ZEP	002	007	Hessika Yuhudappe casha attidaytas gidana; isttika heen baas aqota demmana; Gadey qammishin Asqeloona kataman diza keeththatan aqana; GODAY istta Xoossay istta naagana; isttafe di7ettidayssaka isttas zaarana.»
036	ZEP	002	008	GODAY, «Mo7aabe asay cayizayssanne Amoone asay qidhizayssa ta siyadis. Ta deraa cayida; istti ta deraa bollaka mandida» gees.
036	ZEP	002	009	Hessa gishshas GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Isra7eele Xoossay, «Tani ta de7o Xoossateththan caaqqays; Mo7aabey Sodoome mala Amooney Gamoora mala, sharafay may7idaso malanne maxine bookki ekkida olla mala mernaas bula gidana. Ta asaappe casha attidayti istta haaro bonqqananne istta biittaa laattana» gees.
036	ZEP	002	010	Bantta otoroteththafe dendidayssan istti Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossa deraa cayida gishshassinne qidhida gishshas hessi istta bolla gakkana.
036	ZEP	002	011	GODAY he biitta eeqa xoossata ubbaa dhayssiza wode izi istta yashissizayssa gidana; Abba achchan diza dereti ubbay issoy issoy ba dizason dishe izas goynnana.
036	ZEP	002	012	«Intteno Tophphiya asatoo! Intte ta mashshan siifettana.»
036	ZEP	002	013	Izi ba kushe pudeha baggan diza dereta bolla denththana; Asoore dhayssana. Nannawekka bulasana; bazzo biitta mala melissana.
036	ZEP	002	014	Dorsa wudeynne mehe wudey, medheteththaafe ubbaa qommoy heen shempana. Guttoynne Quxarsi izi gimbetan aqana. Istta waasoy maskootetara seetettana. Gimbeza laaleththi issaa issaa pengen doorettana; keeththata tookki eqqida ziga godati kallottana.
036	ZEP	002	015	Kase ufayssan diza katamaya hanno; izakka ba wozinan, «Ta xalla days; taappe haray oonikka deenna» gidaara histtiin ha7i waanada wora do7ati guurizaso bazzo biitta gida attadee? Izi achchara aadhdhi biza ubbay izo qidhishe ba kushe wuxxees.
036	ZEP	003	001	Makkallanchchayssinne tunidaaris, as un7eththizayta katamays aayye ana!
036	ZEP	003	002	Iza oonaska azazettuku; ooni zoriinkka ekkuku; GODAANKKA ammanettuku; ba Xoossakokka shiiqukku.
036	ZEP	003	003	Izo kaaleththizayti xaaggiza gaammo mala. Izo ayssizaytikka wontos ashshontta miza kana suyte mala.
036	ZEP	003	004	Izin diza nabeti otoranchchatanne as baleththizayta. Qeeseti Xoossa Keeththa tuniseettes; woga bollaka makkalleettes.
036	ZEP	003	005	Izin diza GODAY izi xillo. Mulekka baletti erenna; maalado maalado suure pirdees; ubbaa gallassika daaburi erenna; gido attiin makkallanchchatas yeellay deenna.
036	ZEP	003	006	GODAY, «Tani dereta dhayssadis; istta miixay mulera dhaydes; oonikka izara aadhdhontta mala istta oge kayzisadis; istta katamati mulera dhayda; issi asikka deenna; isttan de7anaykka deenna.
036	ZEP	003	007	Ta he katamayo, Tumappe neni taas yayyana; ta seerishin ne ekkana gadis shin; hessa gishshas izi duussasoy dhayenna; izi bolla qixaatey gakkenna. Gido attiin ta derey iita ooson, kaseppe gede minni minni bides» gees.
036	ZEP	003	008	GODAY, «Hessa gishshas ta pirdana gallassay gakkanaas diishshite; tani dere asanne kawota shiishshanaas qachchadis. Tani ta mino hanqoza istta bolla gussanaas qachchadis. Ta hanqo taman kumeththa biittay eexxana.
036	ZEP	003	009	He wode asay ubbay GODAA sunth xeygana malanne sigan izas haggazana mala ta istta doona geeshshana.
036	ZEP	003	010	Tophphiya shaafatappe he pinththan laaletti dishe taas goynniza ta derey taas yarsho ehana.
036	ZEP	003	011	Intte ta bolla polida qoho ubbaafe dendidayssan; he gallas yeellatekketa; ba otoreteththan ufayettizayta, hanno ha katamayppe ta diggana. Hessafe guye ta geeshsha zuman, intte ta bolla otoretteketa.
036	ZEP	003	012	GODAA sunththan ammanettiza; ashketanne banttana kawushshizayta; ta intte giddon ashshana.
036	ZEP	003	013	Isra7eeleppe casha attidayti nagara oosettenna. Wordo haasayettenna; Istta doonankka gene haasayay deenna. Hessa gishshas istti miidi saron de7ana; istta babisana miishshika deenna.
036	ZEP	003	014	Hanne Xiyoone nayee ane yexxa! Isra7eele asawu ane ililite! Hanne Yerusalaame nayee! Kumeththa wozinappe ufayetta! Ufayettashe hashshu ga!
036	ZEP	003	015	GODAY ne bolla yiza qixaateza diggides; ne morkketakka neeppe zaarides. GODAY Isra7eele kawoy nenara dees; hayssafe guye ay iitasikka babbaka.
036	ZEP	003	016	He wode asay Yerusalaames, ‹Xiyoone ne babbofa; ne qesey daaburoppo.
036	ZEP	003	017	GODAA ne Xoossay nenara dees; izi ashshiza mino olanchcha. Izi nenan daro ufayettees; izi ba siiqon nena woppisana; ne yeththan izi bonchchettidi ufayettana› gaana.
036	ZEP	003	018	«Bonchcho ba7aale gallassati attida gishshas neni muuzottidayssanne, nees tooho gidida yeellaa ta neeppe diggana.
036	ZEP	003	019	He wode nena un7eththidayta ta qaxxayana. Wobbeta ta ashshana; laalettidaytakka ta shiishshana. Istti kawuyida dere ubbaan ta istta bonchchosinne sabas gaththana.
036	ZEP	003	020	He wode ta inttena shiishshana; intte dere ta inttena zaarana. Intte intte ayfera beyishin, inttefe di7ettida miishshaa ta inttes zaariza wode biitta bolla diza dere ubbaa sinththan ta inttes sabanne bonchcho immana» gees.
#
# BOOK	037	HAG	Haggai	Hagge Tinbite
037	HAG	001	001	Daariyoosi kawotida nam7anththo layththan usuppunththa aginay gelida koyro gallas, GODAA qaalay nabe Hagge baggara Yuhuda dere haariza Salatiyaale naa Zerubaabelekkonne Qeeseta halaqa Iyosaadoqe naa Iyaasokko hizgishe yides.
037	HAG	001	002	GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay, «Hayssi derey, ‹Xoossa keeththi keexettiza wodey buro gakkibeenna› gees.»
037	HAG	001	003	GODAA qaalay nabe Hagge baggara hizgishe yides.
037	HAG	001	004	«Ta keeththay laaletti dishin intte lo7o keeththan daanaas hayssi inttes bessiza wodeyee?»
037	HAG	001	005	Hessa gishshas GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay inttena, «Ane intte ooththoyssa qopite.
037	HAG	001	006	Daro zerideta shin guuth maxi shiishshideta. Mideta shin kallibeekketa; uyideta shin alibeekketa; may7ideta shin may7oy inttena ho7ibeenna; damoza ekkideta shin intte ekkida damozay daakeththa karaxiiten woththidayssa mala» gees.
037	HAG	001	007	GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay, «Ane intte ooththidayssa qopite.
037	HAG	001	008	Pude zuma bolla kezidi mith ekki yiite; keeththaka keexxite; tanikka izan ufayettananne bonchchettana» gees.
037	HAG	001	009	GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay, «Intte daro demmana gidetashin guuth demmideta; hinnoka intteso gelththida wode ta punna dhayssadis. Hessa ta ooththiday inttes ay misatizee? Ta keeththay laaletti uttiin intte wurikka intte keeth keexxanaas woxxiza gishshassa.
037	HAG	001	010	Hessa gishshas intte geedon saloppe puuseykka digettides; biittayka kath diggides.
037	HAG	001	011	Tanikka goshshata bollanne zumata bolla, kaththa bollanne ooraththa woyne ushsha bolla, zayte bolla, biittay immiza ayfe ubbaa bolla, asa bolla, mehe bollanne intte kushe ooso ubbaa bolla kosha ehana» gees.
037	HAG	001	012	Hessafe guye Salatiyaale naa Zerubaabeley qeeseta halaqa Iyosaadoqe naa Iyaasoynne di7eteththafe shemppora paxa simmida asay GODAA bantta Xoossa qaalanne nabe Hagge baggara Xoossi kiittida qaalas azazettida. Asaykka GODAAS yayyides.
037	HAG	001	013	Qasseka GODAY kiittida Haggey hessa GODAA kiita derezas, «GODAY ta inttenara days» gees giidi yootides.
037	HAG	001	014	Hessa gishshas GODAY Yuhuda ayssiza Salatiyaale naa Zerubaabele, qeeseta halaqa Iyosaadoqe naa Iyaasonne di7eteththafe shemppora paxa simmida dereza ubbaa wozina denththeththides. Asaykka yiidi ba GODAA Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossa keeth keexo doommides.
037	HAG	001	015	Hessika Daariyoosi kawotida nam7anththo layththan usuppunththa aginay gelida nam7u tammanne oydanththo gallas hanides.
037	HAG	002	001	Laappunththa aginay gelida nam7u tammanne issinththa gallas GODAA qaalay nabe Hagge baggara hizgishe yides.
037	HAG	002	002	GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay Hagges, «Yuhuda ayssiza Salatiyaale naa Zerubaabeles, qeeseta halaqa Iyosaadoqe naa Iyaasossinne di7oppe shemppora paxa atti simmida asaas,
037	HAG	002	003	‹Intte garsan hayssa keeththa kase izi bonchchora dishin be7idaadey oonee? Ha7i qasse inttes ay misati beettizee? Hayssi intte achchan qoodan gelonttaaz gidennee?
037	HAG	002	004	Ha7i qasse Zerubaabelee minna! Qeeseta halaqa Iyosaadoqe naa Iyaasoo minna! Intteno ha dere asatoo wurikka minnite! Ta inttenara diza gishshas ooththite› ga yootanne oychcha.
037	HAG	002	005	Intte Gibxeppe keziza wode ta inttes, ‹Ta Ayanay inttenara diza gishshas babofte› gida qaalay hayssa.
037	HAG	002	006	«GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay, ‹Mata wode ta nam7anththo salonne sa7a, abbanne biitta issito qaaththana.
037	HAG	002	007	Kawoteththata ubbaa ta qaaseththana. Kawoteththata ubbaa haaroy ha yaana mala ta ooththana. Hayssa ha keeththan ta anjjo kunththana.
037	HAG	002	008	Kumeththa alamen diza biraynne worqqa ubbay taassa.
037	HAG	002	009	Hayssa ha keeththa bonchchoy kase keeththa bonchchofe aadhdhana. Tani hayssan inttes kumeththa saroteth immana›» gees.
037	HAG	002	010	Daariyoosi kawotida nam7anththo layththan uddufunththo aginay gelida nam7u tammanne oydanththo gallas GODAA qaalay nabe Hagge baggara hizgishe yides.
037	HAG	002	011	GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay, «Muse wogay ay gizaakko qeeseta halaqata hizga oychcha.
037	HAG	002	012	Issi asi Xoossas yarshettiza asho ba afala qalam7o giddon ekkiko he may7ozara diza ashoy, woykko ukeththi woykko woxey woykko woyneppe agettida cajjey woykko zaytey woykko hara ay qommo kath izi bochchiko he boshettidayssi geesh gidandee?» giidi oychchiin qeesetikka, «Geesh gidenna» giidi zaarida.
037	HAG	002	013	Haggey qasseka, «Aha bochchidi tunida asi heytappe issaa bochchiko he boshettida kaththay tunandee?» gi oychchiin qeesetikka, «Ee tunana» giidi zaarida.
037	HAG	002	014	Hessafe guye Haggey, «‹Hayssi dereynne hayssa bagga asaykka hessa mala; istta oosoynne istti taas shiishshiza imotay wurikka hessa mala ta sinththan tuna› gees GODAY.
037	HAG	002	015	«GODAY, ‹Hachchife doommidi Xoossa Keeththa gimbeta doommanaappe kase intte bollan gakkidayssa akeekite.
037	HAG	002	016	Intte nam7u konttaale kath ekkana giidi kaththa doorekko bideta shin issi konttaale xalla demmideta. Issi xeetu litiro gidiza woyne ushshu ekkanaas giidi woyne ushshu gum7izasoho bideta shin pexi oyddu tammu litiro xalla demmideta.
037	HAG	002	017	Tani intte kushey ooththidaaz wursa kutul7en, qooshshaninne shachchan dhayssadis; gidikkoka intte qasse ha taakko simmibeekketa.
037	HAG	002	018	Hanno ha uddufunththa aginayppe hach ha nam7u tammanne oydanththo gallassafe haa simmiin Xoossa Keeththas yochchi yegettida gallas gakkanaas diza wodeza wozinan woththitenne yuushshi qopite.
037	HAG	002	019	Ha7i zereththas gidiza kath gootaran dhaykko, qasseka woyneynne balase miththi, oroomaaneynne wogara miththi ubbay hach gakkanaas ayfe ayfontta aggikokka, hachchife doommada tani inttena anjjana› gees» gides.
037	HAG	002	020	He aginan nam7u tammanne oydanththo gallas GODAA qaalay qasseka hizgishe Haggeko yides.
037	HAG	002	021	GODAY Hagges, «Yuhuda haariza Zerubaabeles, ‹Tani salonne sa7a qaaththana› gides gaada yoota.
037	HAG	002	022	Kawota ta istta araataappe diggana; allaga kawotas diza wolqqa ta dhayssana; para-gaaretanne istta toganchchata ta shira yeggana; paratinne para toggizayti issoy issaara bantta giddon hayqettana.
037	HAG	002	023	He gallas tani ta aylle Salatiyaale naa Zerubaabele ta nena ekkana; ta nena taas maatame shociza qalabate histtana; ta nena dooradis» gides.
