# BOOK	038	ZEC	Zechariah	Zakaraasa Tinbite
038	ZEC	001	001	Daariyoosi kawotida nam7anththo layththan osppunththa aginan GODAA qaalay Iddo naa Baraakaye naa Nabe Zakaraasakko yides;
038	ZEC	001	002	«GODAY kase intte aawata bolla keehi hanqettides.
038	ZEC	001	003	Ha7i gidikko asaas, ‹Taakko haa simmite; tanikka intteko simmana› gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY.
038	ZEC	001	004	Kase nabeti intte aawatas, ‹Intte intte iita ogeppenne intte oosoppe simmite› giidi minththi yootida; gido attiin istti qasse siyibeettennanne ta azazokka naagibeettenna; hessa mala intte intte aawata mala hanopite.
038	ZEC	001	005	Kase intte aawati ha7i awan dizoo? Nabetikka mernaas de7andettoo?
038	ZEC	001	006	Gido attiin tani ta nabeta baggara yootida qaalatinne wogati intte aawata bolla gakkibeettennee? ‹Isttika maaroteththan gelththishe Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY ba koyida mala nu ooso malanne nu oge mala nuus bessizaaz nu bolla ooththides›» gida.
038	ZEC	001	007	Daariyoosi kawotida nam7anththo layththan shebaaxe geetettiza tammanne issinththo aginan nam7u tammanne oydanththo gallassan GODAA qaalay Iddo naa Baraakaye naa Nabe Zakaraasakko yides.
038	ZEC	001	008	Omarsa wode ajjuutan zo7o para toggida issaade be7adis; he izikka shoobba giddon barsineete miththata garsan eqqides; qasse iza guyera daama, zo7onne booththa parati deettes.
038	ZEC	001	009	Tanikka, «Ta godo haytanti aazee?» gaada oychchadis; tanara haasayza kiitanchchazi qasse, «Haytanti istti aazakko tani nena bessana» gides.
038	ZEC	001	010	He Barsineete miththa garsan eqqidayssi, «Hayti biitta ubbaa bolla simeretti xomosana mala GODAY kiittidayta» gides.
038	ZEC	001	011	Isttika barsineete miththaa garsan eqqida GODAA kiitanchchaas, «Nu biitta ubbaa bolla simeretti xomosidos; biitta ubbay woppu giidi dees» gida.
038	ZEC	001	012	Hessafe guye GODAA kiitanchchay, «Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAWU! Laappun tammu layththatan ne istta bolla hanqettida Yerusalaamenne Yuhuda katamata ne ayide gakkanaas maarkkii?» gides.
038	ZEC	001	013	GODAYKKA tanara haasayza kiitanchchaas ufayssiza qaalaninne minththeththiza qaalan malthe zaarides.
038	ZEC	001	014	Qasseka tanara haasayza kiitanchchazi, «Hayssa qaalaa yoota; Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY, ‹Tani Xiyoonessinne Yerusalaames keeha qadhettays.
038	ZEC	001	015	Gido attiin saroteth demmidi woppan diza kawoteththata keeha hanqettadis; hessas gaasoykka tani ta dereza bolla guuththara hanqettiin kawoteththati ta qofappe bollara ta deraa qohida› gides.
038	ZEC	001	016	«Hessa gishshas Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY, ‹Tani ta maaroteth Yerusalaames immana; heenkka ta keeththay simmi ooraxidi keexettana; Yerusalaame katamayakka wodoron wadhettana› gees.
038	ZEC	001	017	«Kaaleththidikka kiitanchchazi, ‹Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY ta katamati keehi duretana; GODAY Yerusalaame kase mala maaddananne ba katama histti doorana›» gi awajjite.
038	ZEC	001	018	Hessafe guye ajjuutan oyddu kaceta be7adis.
038	ZEC	001	019	Tanara haasayza kiitanchchaza, «Hayti aazee?» ga oychchadis; izikka, «Hayti Yuhuda asa, Isra7eele asanne Yerusalaame asaa laallida kaceta» gides.
038	ZEC	001	020	Hessafe kaaleththidi GODAY naariqa oykkida oyddu wogaceta tana bessides.
038	ZEC	001	021	Tanikka, «Haytanti ay ooththana yidoo?» ga oychchadis. Izikka, «Hayti oonikka dhoqqu gi xeellontta mala Yuhuda biitta laallida kaceta; ha wogaceti yiday istta daganththanaassinne deraa laallanaas Yuhuda bolla bantta kace denththida kawoteththata kace menththi olanaassa» gides.
038	ZEC	002	001	Qasseka ta ajjuutan wadha wodoro ba kushen oykkidayssa be7adis.
038	ZEC	002	002	Tanikka iza, «Ne awa bay?» ga oychchadis. Izi qasse, «Yerusalaame adussateththaynne aakoteththay aappun wadhakko wadhdha beyana bays» gides.
038	ZEC	002	003	He tanara haasayza kiitanchchay bides. Hara kiitanchchayka izara gaagganaas yides.
038	ZEC	002	004	Histtidi izas, «Woxxa baada hessa naateththa addezas, ‹Yerusalaamey izin diza asa daroteththafenne mehe daroteththafe dendoyssan katamaa yuushon gimbe dirsa koshshenna.
038	ZEC	002	005	Tani tarkka izis tama dirsa gidana; izi giddon tani izis bonchcho gidana› gees gaada yoota» gides.
038	ZEC	002	006	GODAY ba deraa, «Ta kase inttena oyddu bagga laalladis; ha7i gidikko pudeha baggafe baqati kezite; haa yiite.
038	ZEC	002	007	Hanne Xiyoone haa ya; Baabiloone macca naytara de7izaare istta giddofe baqata.
038	ZEC	002	008	Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY: ba bonchcho qonccisana mala ba asaa bonqqidayta kawoteththaako tana kiittides; inttena bochchizay taas ayfe ciro bochchiza mala.
038	ZEC	002	009	Hekko tani ta kushe istta bolla denththana; istta aylleti istta bonqqana; hessafe guye Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY tana kiittidayssa intte erana.
038	ZEC	002	010	«Hanne Xiyoone nayee ane ilila; ufayetta; tani yaada ne giddon daana» gees GODAY.
038	ZEC	002	011	He gallas daro kawoteththati GODAAKKO shiiqidi iza dere gidana; izikka ne giddon de7ana; Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY tana neekko kiittidayssa nekka erana.
038	ZEC	002	012	GODAY geeshsha biittayn Yuhuda baas buzo histti laattana; Yerusalaamekka zaari doorana.
038	ZEC	002	013	GODAY geesh gidida basozappe dendida gishshas asho may7ida ubbay iza sinththan co7u go.
038	ZEC	003	001	Hessafe guye qeeseta halaqa Iyaasoy GODAA kiitanchchaa sinththan eqqidayssanne Xala7eykka iza mootanaas izappe ushachcha baggara eqqidayssa tana ajjuutan bessides.
038	ZEC	003	002	GODAY qasse Xala7e, «Haysso Xala7e GODAY nena seero; Yerusalaame doorida GODAY nena hanqo; hayssi addezi tamappe attida durca gidennee?» gides.
038	ZEC	003	003	Iyaasoykka qita may7o may7idi kiitanchchaza sinththan eqqides.
038	ZEC	003	004	Kiitanchchazi ba sinththan eqqidayta, «Hessa qita may7oza iza bollafe qaari diggite» gides; Iyaasoska, «Hekko ta ne nagara neeppe diggadis; ta nena lo7o may7o mayzana» gides.
038	ZEC	003	005	Qasse tanikka, «Geeshsha goosse iza hu7en goozisite» ga azazadis; GODAA kiitanchchay iza achchan eqqi dishin geeshsha goosse iza hu7en goozisidanne may7oka mayzida.
038	ZEC	003	006	GODAA kiitanchchayka Iyaasoy naagettana mala izas zore immides.
038	ZEC	003	007	Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY, «Ne ta ogen biikko, ne ta azazo naagikko ta keeththa ne ayssana; gibbezasikka ne aawatana. Qasseka hayssan eqqidaytara issife ne gelana malanne kezana mala ta nees maata immana.
038	ZEC	003	008	«Haysso qeeseta halaqa Iyaaso siya! Ne matan nena ooththi maaddizayti buro sinththafe hanana lo7o malata gidida gishshas isttika siyetto; hekko tani buro purcciza ta aylleza ehana.
038	ZEC	003	009	Beya! Tani Iyaaso sinththan laappun ayfey diza shuch woththana; ta he shuchchaa bollan xaafettizaaz wooca wooca xaafana; he biittay nagarakka ta issi gallas diggana» gees.
038	ZEC	003	010	Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY, «He wode issoy issoy ba woyne miththa garsaninne ba balase miththa garsan ba lagge diggisas xeygana» gees.
038	ZEC	004	001	Tana haasayssida kiitanchchazi simmi yiidi issi issi asi dhiskofe beeggiza mala tana beegoththides.
038	ZEC	004	002	Izikka, «Haysso hessi ne be7izayssi aazee?» gides. Tanikka «Hekko iza bolla zayte otoy diza kumeththara worqqa gidida xomppe woththiza balla be7adis; he ballata bolla laappun bombay diza laappun xomppeta be7adis.
038	ZEC	004	003	Qasseka nam7u wogara miththata be7adis; isttafe issoy zaytera diza otozappe ushachcha baggara dizayssa qasse issoy hadirsa baggara dizayssa be7adis» gadis.
038	ZEC	004	004	Tanara haasayza kiitanchchaza, «Ta godoo! Haytanti aazee?» ga oychchadis.
038	ZEC	004	005	Izikka taas, «Hayti aazakko ne erkkii?» gi zaarides. Tanikka izas, «Ta godawu! Ta erikke» gadis.
038	ZEC	004	006	Qasseka, «GODAY Zerubaabeles yootida qaalay hayssa, ‹Ta ayananpe attiin wolqqaninne minoteththan gidenna› gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY.
038	ZEC	004	007	«Haysso gita zumazo ne aazee? Ne Zerubaabele sinththan tidhdhi gida demba gidana; qasse Zerubaabeley Xoossa Keeththa keexxi giigidi qustte shuchcha pude kessiza wode asay, ‹Hashshu hashshu lo7on polettides› gi sabbana» gees.
038	ZEC	004	008	Qasse GODAA qaalay taakko yides;
038	ZEC	004	009	«Zerubaabele kushey hayssa GODAA keeththas yochcha shuch woththides; iza kushey keexxi polana; hessafe guye Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY tana intteko kiittidayssa intte erana.
038	ZEC	004	010	«Guuththa miishshati haniza gallassi kadhiday oonee? Asay Zerubaabele kushen tumbe be7idi ufayettana; heyti laappun xomppeta istta bolla woththiza laappun ballati alame bolla yuuyi xeelliza GODAA ayfeta.»
038	ZEC	004	011	Hessafe guye tani kiitanchchaza, «Xomppezappe istta bolla woththiza ballatappe ushachcha baggaranne hadirsa baggara dizayti hayti wogara miththati istti aazee?» ga oychchadis.
038	ZEC	004	012	Qasseka, «Nam7u worqqa bombata achchan wogara zaytey isttafe gukkiza nam7u bombata matan diza nam7u wogara haggati aazee?» ga oychchadis.
038	ZEC	004	013	Izikka tana, «Heyti aazakko ne erkkii?» gides; tanikka izas, «Ta godoo! Ta erikke» gadis.
038	ZEC	004	014	Izi qasseka, «Hayti nam7ati medheteththa ubbaa Goda sinththan ooththana tiyettida asata» gides.
038	ZEC	005	001	Ta zaarada xeellishin heen ta sinththan issi piradhdhiza xaaththa maxaafa be7adis.
038	ZEC	005	002	Izikka tana, «Ay xeellay?» gi oychchides. Tanikka izas, «Adussateththay nam7u tammu wadha, gomppay tammu wadha gidida issi piradhdhiza xaaththa maxaafa be7adis» gadis.
038	ZEC	005	003	Izikka taas, «Ha xaaththa maxaafa giddon biitta ubbaa bolla yaana qanggeththi xaafeti uttides; he maxaafan issi baggara, ‹Kayso ubbay biitta bollafe dhayana› geetetti xaafettides; qasseka hankko baggara, ‹Wordo caaqqiza ubbay dhayana› geetetti xaafettides.
038	ZEC	005	004	Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY, ‹Tani qanggeth ehana; izikka kaysota keeththinne ta sunththan wordo caaqqizayta keeth gelana; isttas heen diza keeththaa, miththaanne shuchchaa ubbaa dhayssana› gees» gides.
038	ZEC	005	005	Hessafe kaallidi tanara haasayettiza kiitanchchay taakko yiidi, «Hayssi yizay aazakko dhoqqu histta xeella» gides.
038	ZEC	005	006	Tanikka iza, «Hayssi aazee?» ga oychchadis. Izikka «Hayssi maka daachcho» gides; qasseka gujjidi, «Hayssi biitta bolla diza asay ooththida qohoza bessiza malata» gides.
038	ZEC	005	007	Hessafe guye irsaase geetettiza biratappe oosettida kamay qaarettiza wode daachchoza giddon uttida issi maccassayo be7adis.
038	ZEC	005	008	Kiitanchchazikka taas, «Hanna tuna» gi yootidi izo guye zaari daachchoza giddo naaqqi gelththides; he daachcho kamazakka zaari kammides.
038	ZEC	005	009	Hessafe guye tani pude dhoqqu ga xeellishin isttas qefetan carkoy diza nam7u maccassata be7adis; isttas qefeykka kafo wole qefe mala; istti he daachchoza denththi ekkidi pude salo piradhdhida.
038	ZEC	005	010	Tanikka tanara haasayza kiitanchchaza, «Hayti daachchaa awa efizoo?» ga oychchadis.
038	ZEC	005	011	Izikka, «Izas keeth keexxanaas Sana7oore dere efeettes; keexetti giigiza wode daachchoza heen woththana» gides.
038	ZEC	006	001	Qasseka hara ajjuutan oyddu para-gaareti nam7u xarqimala zumata giddora yizayta be7adis.
038	ZEC	006	002	Koyro gaareza goochchiza parazi zo7o, nam7anththozi kareththa,
038	ZEC	006	003	heedzdzanththozi booththa para, oydanththozi qasse masara gidishin parati ubbayka wolqqama.
038	ZEC	006	004	Tanikka tanara haasayza kiitanchchaza, «Ta godawu! Haytanti aazee?» ga oychchadis.
