038	ZEC	014	001	Hekko GODAY pirdiza gallassi gakkides; neeppe bonqqida miishsha ne ayfey be7ishin istti gishetti ekkana.
038	ZEC	014	002	Yerusalaame olana mala kawoteththata ubbaa ta shiishshana; katamayakka oykettana; keeththa giddon diza miishshi bonqqettana; maccassatarakka wolqqan ichchana; katama asaappe baggay di7ettana; attida derey qasse katamayppe kezenna.
038	ZEC	014	003	Hessafe guye GODAY kase ola gallas olettiza mala he kawoteththata olanaas dendana.
038	ZEC	014	004	He wode iza tohoy Yerusalaameppe arshey mokkiza baggara Dabrazayte zumaa bolla eqqana. Dabrazayte zumaykka arshey mokkizasoppe wullizaso gakkanaas nam7u kezi shaaketti wodhana; bagga zumay pudeha bagga, baggay dugeha bagga shaakettidi giddon wolqqama shoobbay medhettana.
038	ZEC	014	005	Inttenikka Azeele gakkanaas zuma tani nam7u kessi shaakkida shoobbara baqatana; kase yuhuda kawo Ooziya wode biittay qaaxxiin beni intte aawati gangida mala intte gangana; hessafe guye GODAA ta Xoossay geeshshatara issife yaana.
038	ZEC	014	006	He wode ta kenchchoy, shachchinne poo7oy mulekka deenna.
038	ZEC	014	007	He gallassay gallassinne qammay baynda GODAY eriza dumma gallas gidana; he gallassi poo7oy poo7oshin de7ana.
038	ZEC	014	008	He wode Yerusalaameppe de7o haaththi pulttana; izappe baggay arshey mokkiza baggan diza hayqo abban gelana; baggay qasse arshey wulliza baggara diza Mediteraane abban gelana; bone gidiin balgo gidiin layth kumeth pacey baynda goggishe de7ana.
038	ZEC	014	009	He wode GODAY biitta ubbaa bolla kawotana; he wode GODAY issaa xalla; iza sunththayka issaa gidana.
038	ZEC	014	010	Pudeha baggara Geebappe doommidi Yerusalaame dugeha baggara diza Armoone katama gakkanaas diza Awurajjay tidhdha demba gidana; Yerusalaame katamaya Biniyaame pengefe beni penge ginaranne gula penge gakkanaas hessaththoka Hanani7eele gimbefe gede kawo keeththaso woyne ushshu gum7izasoho gakkanaas dhoqqu gaada iza minna de7ana.
038	ZEC	014	011	Yerusalaamey daro asi daanaso gidana; hessafe guye iza dhayukku; izin diza derey hirgay baynda woppan daana.
038	ZEC	014	012	Yerusalaame olana dendiza dere bolla GODAY bosha harge ehana; istta shemppora paxa dishin istta ashoy wooqqana; istta ayfeynne inxarsay heen ba dizason wooqqana.
038	ZEC	014	013	He wode GODAY istta bolla hirganne babo yeddana; isttika issoy issoy ba laggeza bolla qoho gaththana.
038	ZEC	014	014	Yuhuda asay Yerusalaame bagga gididi olettana; bana yuuyi aadhdhida kawoteththati haarida aqota ubbaa worqqa, bira, may7onne qooday baynda miish di7i ekkana.
038	ZEC	014	015	Hessa misatiza boshay morkketi dizason dizason, parata, baqulota, gaamellatanne hareta bollanne hara mehe ubbaa bolla yaana.
038	ZEC	014	016	Hessafe guye Yerusalaame olana kezida kawoteththatappe hayqqontta attida ubbay Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAAS goynnanaassinne daase ba7aale bonchchanaas layththan layththan Yerusalaamen shiiqana.
038	ZEC	014	017	Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAAS goynnanaas Yerusalaame shiiqontta biitta kawoteththata ubbaas iray bukkenna.
038	ZEC	014	018	Gibxe asaykka hee bontta iray isttas bukkenna; Yerusalaame kezidi daase ba7aale bonchchontta ixxida kawoteththata bolla GODAY ehana boshaa istta bolla ehana.
038	ZEC	014	019	Gibxe asaakka gidiin hara dere asa kawota gidiin, «Daase ba7aale nu bonchchoko» giikko istta bolla yaana qixaatey hayssafe bollan dizayta;
038	ZEC	014	020	He wode parata qoodhen qashettiza daala ubbaa bolla, «Hayssi Xoossas dummatidayssa» giza qaalay xaafettana; GODAA Keeththa giddon kath kaththiza ototikka yarsho yarshizaso sinththan diza saaneta mala dummatana.
038	ZEC	014	021	Yerusalaameninne Yuhudan diza otoy wurikka medheteththa Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAAS dummatidaaz gidana; Yarsho shiishshiza asay wurikka otota ekkidi yarsho asho isttan doyssana; he wode Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Keeththa giddon ay zal7anchchayka deenna.
#
# BOOK	039	MAL	Malachi	Milkaasa Tinbite
039	MAL	001	001	Milkaasa baggara Isra7eele naytas yida GODAA qaala,
039	MAL	001	002	GODAY, «Ta inttena dosadis» gees; intte gidikko, «Ne nuna aazan dosadii?» geeta. Godaa Xoossi, «Eesawey Yaaqoobe isha gidennee? Ta Yaaqoobe dosadis.
039	MAL	001	003	Gido attiin Eesawe ixxadis; iza deren diza zumata bazzo kessadis; iza gadezakka bazzon diza worakanatas aaththa immadis» gides.
039	MAL	001	004	Eedoomey, «Nu katamati laalettiin istta zaari essana» istti giin Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossa qasse, «Istti zaaridi ooththana shin ta istti ooththoyssa zaara laallana; isttika, ‹Iita derenne GODAY mernaas hanqettida dere geetettana.›
039	MAL	001	005	Hessaka intte intte ayfera beyana; intteka, ‹Isra7eele nayta dere dhassafe harasonkka GODAY gita gaana.
039	MAL	001	006	«Nay ba aawa, aylleyka ba Godaa bonchchees shin ta inttes aawa gidikko aazas tana bonchcheketii? Tani Godaa gidikko aazas taas yayyeketii? gees medheteththa goday; qeesetoo! Ta sunth kawushshizay inttena. ‹Intte qasse: nuni ne sunth wostti kawushshidonii?› geeta.
039	MAL	001	007	Intte taas yarsho shiishshizason tunida kath woththeeta» Histti woththidi, «Nu nena wostti tunisidonii?» geeta. Intte, «GODAA maadday tooshettidaaza» guussanna; intte, «GODAA maadday kadhettidaaza guussanna.
039	MAL	001	008	Intte qooqe mehe yarshos ehizayssi hessi qoho gidennee? Wobbe woykko sakettiza mehe intte yarshos shiishshizayssi hessi qoho gidennee? Heytantta mala inttena ayssiza daannatas intte immizaakko istti inttefe ufayssan ekkanee?» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY.
039	MAL	001	009	«Ha7i qasse izi nuus mishettana mala Xoossa woossite; hessa mala yarsho intte shiishshiin Xoossi inttefe ekkandee?» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	001	010	«Taas Yarsho yarshizason go7ay baynda tama intte eeththontta mala inttefe issaadeyka Xoossa Keeththa penge gordizaakko aazee dizay! Ta inttenan ufayettikenne intte kusheppe ay yarshoka ekkike» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	001	011	Awa arshey kezizasoppe doommidi arshey wullizaso gakkanaas ta sunththay dere ubbaa giddon bonchchettana; beettooson ubbaan ta sunththas exaaneynne geeshsha yarsho asay shiishshana; ta sunththi asa ubbaa achchan bonchchettana.
039	MAL	001	012	«Intte qasse, ‹Godaa maadday tuna yarsho; kaththayka kadhettidayssa› giidi kawushsheeta.
039	MAL	001	013	Qasseka, ‹Hayssi daabura› guussan leqo mixilth iza bolla mixilleeta» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay. «Bonqqi ekkida mehe wobbenne hargiza mehe intte yarsho shiishshiin intte kusheppe ta hessa ekkanaas bessizee?» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	001	014	«Dorsata garsan lo7o dharshoy dizayssa immanaas adinettidi qasse baleththon iza bolla wosoy diza mehe Godaas yarsho shiishshizaadey qanggetto; ta gita kawo; ta sunththika dere kumeththi babbanaas bessiza sunththa» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	002	001	«Ha7ikka qeeseto hayssi ha azazoy inttes imettides.
039	MAL	002	002	Intte ta gizaaz siyontta ixxikonne intte intte wozina ta sunththaa bonchchanaas giigsontta aggiko ta intte bolla qanggeth yeddana; ta inttena anjjana anjjoza qanggeththan laammana; intte tana bonchchanaas intte wozina giigsontta aggida gishshas addafe ta hayssa ubbaa intte bolla ooththana» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY.
039	MAL	002	003	«Intte gaason intte nayta ta hanqana; intte yarshos shiishshiza mehe toce ta gede intte ayfe bolla laallana; intteka izara issife dhayana.
039	MAL	002	004	Ta Lewera caaqqida caaqo qaalay minnana mala hayssa inttena qofsanaas ta yeddoyssa intte erana» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY.
039	MAL	002	005	«Ta izara caaqqida caaqoy de7onne saroteththa caaqo; heytakka ta izas immadis; hessika bonchcho ehides; izikka taas yayyides; ta sunththaaka bonchchides.
039	MAL	002	006	Iza doonan tumu timirtey dees; issi bala miishshika iza doonan beettibeenna; saroteththaninne suureteththan tanara hemettides; daro asaakka nagarappe zaarides.
039	MAL	002	007	Qeesey ubbaa dandayza Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAAS kiitettizaade gidida gishshas iza doonay erateth naaganaas asay iza doonappe timirte koyanaas bessees» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY.
039	MAL	002	008	Gido attiin intte iza ogeppe kare kezideta; daro asaykka intte timirten dhuphettana mala ooththideta; Lewe caaqozaka laallideta.
039	MAL	002	009	Histtiin intte ta ogen bontta gishshassinne intte intte timirteza dumma maado ooththida gishshas intte asa ubbaa sinththan kadhettana malanne intte guuxxana malata ooththadis.
039	MAL	002	010	Nu wurikka issaade naa gidokkonii? Nuna medhdhiday issi Xoossa gidennee? Histtiin nu issoy issaas ammanettontta aggidi kase nu aawata caaqo aazas tunisizonii?
039	MAL	002	011	Yuhuday ammanettibeenna; Isra7eeleninne Yerusalaamen harassiza miishshi hanides; Yuhuday allaganne allaga xoossas goynniza macca nayta machcho ekkidi Godaa Xoossi dosiza iza keeththa tunisides.
039	MAL	002	012	Hessa mala ooththiza ay asikka salo GODAAS yarsho ehizaa gidikkoka GODAY Yaaqoobe dunkaanaappe iza digo.
039	MAL	002	013	Qasse intte ooththana hara miish GODAAS yarsho shiishshizasoza intte ayfunthan meeshana; hessafe guye intte yarshoko xeellontta gishshassinne ufayssan ekkontta gishshas intte yeekkananne waassana.
039	MAL	002	014	Intteka «Izi aazas nu yarshoza ekkontta ixxidee?» giidi oychchana; hessika haniday intte caaqon ekettida naateteththa machchetara caaqettida qaalaa intte ammanettontta laallida gishshassa; Godaa Xoossi intte giddon markka.
039	MAL	002	015	Godaa Xoossi inttessinne machchetas issi asateththinne issi ayanay daana mala ooththibeennee? Xoossi inttena aazas issino ooththidee? Izas waanna qofay Xoossas geeshsha zereth intte yelana mala gidennee? Hessa gishshas inttefe issay issay ba machcheys caaqqida qaala pacinchchontta ammaneteththan naago.
039	MAL	002	016	«Ays giikko tani GODAA Isra7eele Xoossay azinay ba machcho anjji yeddizayssa ixxays; inttefe issaadeyka hessa mala gene ooso ooththiko ta hessa ixxays; hessa gishshas intte intte machchetara caaqettida qaala laammontta mala naagettite» gees GODAA Isra7eele Xoossay.
039	MAL	002	017	Intte coo hada haasayan GODAA saleththideta; «Nu iza aazan saleththidonii?» geeta; intte iza saleththiday, «Iita ooththizayti ubbay Xoossa sinththan lo7o; izikka isttan ufayettees» guussan woykko «Tuma pirdiza Xoossi awan dizee?» guussanna.
039	MAL	003	001	«Hekko tani baana oge baasana as taappe sinththara yeddana; intte koyza GODAY intte qoppontta Xoossa keeth gakki wodhdhana; intte ufayssan naagiza caaqo qaala kiitaa ekki yiza ta kiittidaadey yaana.
039	MAL	003	002	Izi yaana gallassa teqqana dandayzay oonee? Izi qoncciza gallas iza sinththan eqqanaas dandayanay oonee? Izi cooce tama mala woykko may7o meecciza saamuna mala;
039	MAL	003	003	Bira taman seerisidi lo7eththi geeshshiza asa mala uttana; Lewe nayta worqqa malanne bira mala geeshshana; hessafe guye GODAAS yarsho shiishshiza xillo asati daana.
039	MAL	003	004	He wode Yuhudaninne Yerusalaamen shiiqiza yarshoy kase aadhdhida wode mala GODAA ufayssiza yarsho gidana.
039	MAL	003	005	«Hessa gishshas ta intteko pirdana yaana; muurennizayta, laymatizayta, wordo markka markkattizayta, wordo caaqo caaqqizayta, ooso oosisidi miishsha diggizayta, am7etanne yi7o nayta dechchizayta, bete asatas pirda tuccizayta, taas babbonttayta bolla markkattanaas ta ellesays» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	003	006	«Tani laamettontta Xoossa; hessa gishshas intteno Yaaqoobe naytoo! Intte dhaybeekketa» gees GODAY.
039	MAL	003	007	«Intte kase intte aawata wodeppe doommidi ta azazotappe haakkideta; isttaka naagibeekketa; haa taakko simmite tanikka intteko simmana; Intte gidikko, ‹Nuni neekko waani simminoo?› geeta» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	003	008	«Asi Xoossa miish kaysoti erizee? Intte gidikko kaysoteeta; intte qasse, ‹Nu ay kaysotidonii?› giidi oychchite; intte asraatanne maba taappe kaysotideta.
039	MAL	003	009	Intte Isra7eele asay ubbay ta miish kaysotida gishshas intte qanggettidayta.
039	MAL	003	010	Ta keeththan miza kaththi daana mala intteka tana hayssan paaccanaas ane tammaafe issino ubbaa ha ta gootaran gelththite; ta inttes salo maskoote doyontta aggikonne inttes woththizasoy dhayana gakkanaas ta inttes anjja palahisontta aggiko beyandeta» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	003	011	Ta intte gishshas intte biittan mokkiza kaththa qohiza miishshati intte kath montta mala ta hanqana; intte kaththayka meetettenna; intte gade giddon intte tokkida woyne miththay ayfey baynda coo mela deenna;
039	MAL	003	012	«Hessafe kaallidi intte derey kalo biitta gidida gishshas hara derey wurikka inttena intte anjjettida dereta gi xeygana» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	003	013	«Intte ta bolla xalateththa qaala haasaydeta» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay. «Intte gidikko, ‹Ne bolla nu ay haasaydonii?› geeta.
039	MAL	003	014	Qasseka intte, ‹Xoossas oosoy hada; iza azazota naagoynne medheteththa Goda sinththan muuzottiza asa mala de7oy nuna ay maaddidee?
039	MAL	003	015	Ha7i nu otoranchchati anjjetti dishin iita ooththizayti duretishin Xoossa paccizayti kessi ekki attishin beyoos› geeta» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	003	016	He wode GODAAS babbiza asati ba garsan issoy issaara haasayettida Godaa Xoossika istti gizayssa lo7eththi siyides; GODAAS babbizaytas qasseka iza sunththaa bonchchizaytas istti oosoy balettontta mala qofsiza maxaafay iza sinththan xaafettides.
039	MAL	003	017	«Tani ooththiza gallas istti taas buzo miish gidana» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay; «Aaway baas ooththiza naa ashshiza mala tanikka istta ashshana.
039	MAL	003	018	He wode qasseka xillonne nagaranchcha giddon Xoossas ooththizayta giddoninne ooththonttayta giddon diza dummateththa intte beyandeta.
039	MAL	004	001	«Hekko cooce tama mala eexxiza gallassi yaana; otoranchchatinne iita ooththizayti wurikka mela happa mala gidana; he yaana gallassayka istta xuuggana; xeerakka xaphokka ashshenna» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	004	002	«Ta sunththas babbiza inttes qasse xilloteththa arshey ba qefe garsan paththizaaz ekka yaana; intteka birshi yeddida galo mara mala xikettishe kezana.
039	MAL	004	003	Tani ooththiza gallas intte iitata intte toho garsan yedhdhana; istti intte toho caamma garsan bidinth gidana» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	004	004	«Isra7eele nayti ubbay azazettana mala tani ta oosanchcha Muse baggara Korebe zumaa bolla ta immida wogaanne azazota qopite» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossay.
039	MAL	004	005	«Hekko keehi gitanne yashissiza Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA gallassay gakkanaappe kase ta inttes nabe Eelaasa yeddana» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY.
039	MAL	004	006	«Ta yaada biitta qanggeththan dhayssontta mala izi aawata wozina naytakko, qasse nayta wozina aawatakko zaarana» gees Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY.
#
# BOOK	040	MAT	Matthew	Matoosa Mishiraachcho
040	MAT	001	001	Dawite naa, Abrahaame naa gidida Yesus Kirstoosa yeleta zarkkey hayssafe kaallizayssa;
040	MAT	001	002	Abrahaamey Yisaaqa yelides; Yisaaqi Yaaqoobe yelides; Yaaqoobey Yuhudanne iza ishata yelides;
040	MAT	001	003	Yuhuday Timaarippe Faareesenne Zaara yelides; Faareesey Esroome yelides; Esroomey Aaraame yelides;
040	MAT	001	004	Aaraamey Aminadaabe yelides; Aminadaabey Ne7asoone yelides; Ne7asooney Solomoone yelides;
040	MAT	001	005	Solomooneykka Boo7eeze Eraabippe yelides; Boo7eezey Urutippe Iyoobeede yelides; Iyoobeedey Isseye yelides;
040	MAT	001	006	Isseyey kawo Dawite yelides; Dawiti Ooriyo machcheyfe Solomoone yelides.
040	MAT	001	007	Solomooney Erobi7aame yelides; Erobi7aamey Abbiya yelides; Abbiyayka Aasaafe yelides;
040	MAT	001	008	Aasaafey Iyoosaafixe yelides; Iyoosaafixey Iyoraame yelides; Iyoraamey Ooziya yelides;
040	MAT	001	009	Ooziyay Iyo7aatame yelides; Iyo7aatamey Akaaze yelides; Akaazey Hizqiyaasa yelides;
040	MAT	001	010	Hizqiyaasi Minaase yelides; Minaasey Amoxe yelides; Amoxey Iyosiyaasa yelides;
040	MAT	001	011	Iyosiyaasi Baabiloone di7o layth Ikoniyaanenne iza ishata yelides.
040	MAT	001	012	Baabiloone di7oppe guye Ikoniyaaney Salatiyaale yelides; Salatiyaaley Zerubaabele yelides;
040	MAT	001	013	Zerubaabeley Abiyoode yelides; Abiyoodey Elyaaqeeme yelides; Elyaaqeemey Azaare yelides;
040	MAT	001	014	Azaarey Saadooqe yelides; Saadooqey Aakime yelides; Akimey Eliyoode yelides;
040	MAT	001	015	Eliyoodey Alazaare yelides; Alazaarey Maataane yelides; Maataaney Yaaqoobe yelides;
040	MAT	001	016	Yaaqoobeykka Kirstoosa geetettidayssa Yesusa yelida Maaramo ekkana giigsida Yooseefe yelides.
040	MAT	001	017	Hessa gishshas Abrahaameppe yiidi Dawite gakkanaas tammanne oyddu yeleteth; qasse Dawiteppe Baabiloone di7o wode gakkanaas tammanne oyddu yeleteth; Baabiloone di7oppe Kirstoosa yeleta gakkanaas tammanne oyddu yeleta gidees.
040	MAT	001	018	Yesus Kirstoosa yeleta taarikey hayssafe kaalli dizayssa; iza aayo Maarama Yooseefes giigetta dishin izi izira gayttontta Xillo Ayanan qanththatada beettadus.
040	MAT	001	019	Izo giigsida Yooseefey xillo as gidida gishshas Maaramo asa sinththan qoncce kessontta qotara agganaas ba wozinara qachchides.
040	MAT	001	020	Hayssa izi qoppishin Xoossa kiitanchchay agumora izas qonccidi, «Dawite naa Yooseefe! Ne giigsida Maarama qanththatiday Xillo Ayanan gidida gishshas izo neso efanaas babbofa.
040	MAT	001	021	Iza attuma naa yelana; izi as nagarappe ashshanaade gidida gishshas iza sunth ne, ‹Yesusa› ga sunththana» gides.
040	MAT	001	022	Goday nabe Isayaasa doonan, «Hekko! Geela7oy qanththatana; attuma naakka yelana; naaza sunththayka Amanu7eele geetettana; hessa birsheththika, ‹Xoossi nunara dees› geetettidi xaafettidayssi polettana mala hayssi wurikka hanides» gides.
040	MAT	001	024	Yooseefeykka dhiskofe beeggidi Godaa kiitanchchay iza azazida mala Maaramo baso efides.
040	MAT	001	025	Gido attiin baada iza koyro naaza yelana gakkanaas izo ekkibeenna. Yelettida guuththa naaza sunththaa, «Yesusa» gides.
040	MAT	002	001	Kawo Herdoosa wode Yesusi Beeteliheeme Yuhudan yelettidaappe guye arshey mokkiza baggafe eranchchati Yerusalaame yiidi,
040	MAT	002	002	«Yelettida Ayhuda kawoy awan dizee? Awa arshey mokkiza baggara diza xoolintteza be7idi izas goynnana yidos» giidi oychchida.
