041	MAR	003	027	«Hessa gaason issaadey koyrottidi wolqqama as qachchontta dishe wolqqamaza soo gelanaassinne iza miishshe bonqqanaas dandayenna; iza aqo bonqqanaas dandayettizay wolqqamaza qachchiko xalala.
041	MAR	003	028	«Ta inttes tumu gays; asa naytas nagaraynne cashshi wuri maarettana.
041	MAR	003	029	Gido attiin Xillo Ayana bolla cashsha qaala haasayza asa ubbaas mernaas nagara aco gidana attiin maarettenna» gides.
041	MAR	003	030	Hessa izi giday istti iza, «Ne bolla tuna ayanay dees» gida gishshassa.
041	MAR	003	031	Hessafe guye iza aayeyanne iza ishati kare yi eqqidinne ase izakko kiitti xeygisida.
041	MAR	003	032	Iza giddoththi uttida daro asay, «Hekko ne aayeyanne ne ishati karen eqqidi nena koyeettes» gida.
041	MAR	003	033	Izikka zaaridi, «Ta aaya oonee? Ta ishati oonanttee?» gides.
041	MAR	003	034	Iza yuuyi uttida asaakko xeellidi, «Ta aayeyanne ta ishati haytanttako!
041	MAR	003	035	Xoossa shene ooththizay wuri izi ta isha, ta michchonne ta aayo» gides.
041	MAR	004	001	Qasse Yesusi hara wode abbaa achchan tamaarso oykkides. Izakko keehi daro derey shiiqida gishshas abbaa giddon diza wogolo dizaarin gelidi uttides; asaykka wuri abbaa achchan shiiqides.
041	MAR	004	002	Izikka daro yo7ota leemison hizgi tamaarsides.
041	MAR	004	003	«Siyite! Issaadey zereth zeranaas kezides.
041	MAR	004	004	Izi zerishin issi issi zereththi oge bolla wodhdhides. Oge bolla wodhdhida zereththaa kafoti maxi mida.
041	MAR	004	005	Baggay mela biittan wodhdhides. He biittay mela gidida gishshas heerakka caarides.
041	MAR	004	006	Gido attiin arshey kezida mala shullidi xapho yeddontta gishshas melides.
041	MAR	004	007	Qasse issi zereththi agunththa giddon wodhdhides; agunththayka diccidi cuullida gishshas ayfibeenna.
041	MAR	004	008	Hara zereththi qasse lo7o orde biitta bolla wodhdhida gishshas caaridi diccides; ayfekka ayfides; Issoy heedzdzu tammu, issoy qasse usuppun tammu, issoy qasse xeetu ayfides.»
041	MAR	004	009	Yesusi qasseka, «Siyiza hayththi dizaadey siyo!» gides.
041	MAR	004	010	Yesusi barkka dishin tammanne nam7atinne kase izara diza asay izi yootida leemisoza gishshas iza zaari oychchida.
041	MAR	004	011	Izikka isttas, «Inttes Xoossa Kawoteththa xuura eroy gelides shin karen dizaytas gidikko yo7oy wuri leemisora yootettees.
041	MAR	004	012	Hessika kase, ‹Istti be7idi be7idayssa akeekontta malanne simmontta mala, qasseka istta nagaray maarettontta malakko›» gides.
041	MAR	004	013	Qasseka Yesusi, «Hayssi leemisoy inttes gelibeennee? Histtiin hara leemiso intte wostti eranee?
041	MAR	004	014	Zerizaadey qaala zerees.
041	MAR	004	015	Issi issi asati oge bolla wodhdhida zereththaa misateettes; istti qaala siyiza wode Xala7ey yiidi heerakka istti siyida qaalaa istta wozinappe ekkichchees.
041	MAR	004	016	Hessaththoka harati mela biitta bolla wodhdhida zereththaa misateettes. Istti qaala siyidi ufayssan ekkeettes.
041	MAR	004	017	Gido attiin istti xapho yeddontta gishshas guuththa wode gam7ishin qaalaa gaason metoy woykko goodetay asata bolla yiza wode heerakka dhuphetteettes.
041	MAR	004	018	Harati qasse agunththa giddon wodhdhida zereththaa misateettes; istti qaalaa sis siyeettes.
041	MAR	004	019	Gido attiin ha biitta metoy, miishsha siiqoynne hara amoy istti siyida qaala cuullidi ayfe ayfontta mala diggees.
041	MAR	004	020	Hankkoyti lo7o biittan zerettida zereththaa misateettes; heytikka qaalaa siyidi ekkizaadenne heedzdzu tammu ayfe, usuppun tammu ayfenne xeetu ayfe ayfizayta» gides.
041	MAR	004	021	Qasseka Yesusi, «Xomppe oyththidi geemason woykko arsa garsan woththi ereetii? Poo7ana mala qoncceson woththeeta gidennee?
041	MAR	004	022	Hessa gishshas qotettidi qoncce kezonttay, poo7on kezontta geeman attanay baa.
041	MAR	004	023	Hessa gishshas siyiza hayththi dizaadey siyo!» gides.
041	MAR	004	024	Gujjidikka, «Intte siyizayssa wozinan woththite; intte makkiza miishshara inttes makettana; hessafekka daroy gujettana.
041	MAR	004	025	Dizaades gujettana shin bayndaadefe izas dizaarakka ekketaychchana» gides.
041	MAR	004	026	Qasseka Yesusi, «Xoossa kawoteththiya zereth zeriza issi as misatawus.
041	MAR	004	027	Zeridaadey omars dhiskees. Wontishin dendees; gido attiin izi erontta dishin zerettida kaththay mokkidi diccees.
041	MAR	004	028	Gadeyakka koyro caarech, kaaleththada pudhe, qasseka pudheza bolla lo7o ayfe immawus.
041	MAR	004	029	Kaththay kaxxidaappe guye boney gakkiin keeththa aaway heerakka maxa oykkees» gides.
041	MAR	004	030	Yesusi, «Xoossa Kawoteth nu aazara ginisanee? Aazara leemisanee?
041	MAR	004	031	Biitta bolla ubbaafe laafa gidida sanafice ayfe misatawus.
041	MAR	004	032	Zerettada diccidaappe guye qasse atakilteta ubbaafe aadhdhiza gishshas kafoti yiidi he atakiltey haggata kuwa giddon shempeettes» gides.
041	MAR	004	033	Yesusikka asay ekkanaas dandayzayssa keena hayta misatiza hara daro leemisora isttas yootides.
041	MAR	004	034	Ay miish gidikkoka asaas leemisoy baynda yooti erenna. Izinne iza kaallizayti xalla diza wode gidikko wursi birshi yootees.
041	MAR	004	035	He gallas gadey qammishin bana kaallizayta, «Ane gede he pinth pinnoos» gides.
041	MAR	004	036	Istti asaa heen aggaagidi izi utti diza wogolozara Yesusa ekki bida. Hara wogolotikka isttara issife deettes.
041	MAR	004	037	He wode wolqqama dambalay abbaa bolla dendidi wogoloza haaththi kumana gakkanaas shocechchides.
041	MAR	004	038	Gido attiin Yesusi borkoth borkotidi wogolozas guye baggan ichchides. Isttika iza denththidi, «Astamaaree! Nuni dhayshin nena meettennee?» gida.
041	MAR	004	039	Izikka dendidi carkoza, «Co7u ga!» abbaaka, «Woppu ga!» gides; carkoyka co7u gides; mulekka co7u gides.
041	MAR	004	040	Bana kaallizaytakka, «Hayssaththo aazas babbidetii? Hayssa gakkanaas inttes ammanoy baawee?» gides.
041	MAR	004	041	Isttika keehi babbidi ba giddon issoy issaara, «Carkoynne abbay izas azazettizay hayssi oonee?» geetettida.
041	MAR	005	001	Abbaa pinnidi gede Gergesenoone geetettizaso bida.
041	MAR	005	002	Yesusi wogoloyppe wodhdhida mala tuna ayanay iza bolla dizaadey duufoppe kezidi Yesusara gaaggana izakko yides.
041	MAR	005	003	Hayssi addezi duufoson dizaadenne haray attoshin oonikka iza sansalatankka qachchanaas dandaybeenna.
041	MAR	005	004	Daro wode toho birataranne sansalatara qashettees. Gido attiin kushe sansalata duuseththi yeggees; toho biratakka menththereththi yeggees; oonikka iza oykkidi teqqanaas dandaybeenna.
041	MAR	005	005	Gallassinne qamma duufota giddoninne zumata bolla yuuyi yuuyi waassishe ba bolla shuchchara qanxxereththidi madunththees.
041	MAR	005	006	Izikka Yesusa haahon be7ida mala woththan izakko yiidi iza sinththan gulbatidi goynnides.
041	MAR	005	007	Keehi waassidi, «Haysso wogga Xoossa Naa Yesusa, nees tanara aazi dizee? Xoossa sunththan ta nena woossays tana waayisoppa» gides.
041	MAR	005	008	Izi hessa giday Yesusi kase, «Neni tuna ayanay hayssafe keza» gida gishshassa.
041	MAR	005	009	Hessafe qasse Yesusi iza, «Ne sunththi oonee?» giidi oychchides. Izikka, «Nuni darota gidida gishshas ta sunththi Leegoone geetettees» gides.
041	MAR	005	010	He dereppe kessi yeddontta mala Yesusa keehi woossides.
041	MAR	005	011	Heen matan zuma bolla daro guddunththi heemettees.
041	MAR	005	012	Tuna ayanati, «Nu guddunththatan gelana mala nuus ero garkkii?» giidi Yesusa woossida.
041	MAR	005	013	Izikka isttas, «Ero» gides. Tuna ayanatikka addezappe kezidi guddunththatan gelida. Nam7u shii gidiza guddunththati wuri aafozara duguththaa genderetti wodhdhidi abban mitettida.
041	MAR	005	014	Guddunththa heemmizayti baqatidi hanidayssa katamaninne dere giddon yootida. Dereykka hanidayssa beyanaas ba dizasoppe dizasoppe kezides.
041	MAR	005	015	Yesusaakko yiidi daro daydanththi iza bolla diza addeza wozinay izas simmiin may7o may7idinne wogara uttidayssa yida asay be7idi babbides.
041	MAR	005	016	Hayssa be7ida asay daydanththi iza bolla diza addeza gishshassinne guddunththati hanoyssa derezas yootides.
041	MAR	005	017	Hessafe guye he dere asay Yesusi istta dere yeddidi baana mala woossides.
041	MAR	005	018	Yesusi wogolon gelishin daydanththati izappe kezida addezi Yesusara daanaas woossides.
041	MAR	005	019	Yesusi qasse izi oychchidayssa akkay giidi, «Neni gede neso ba; Goday nees ay mala gita miish ooththidaakkonne izi nees ooththida maaroteththaa neso asaas yoota» gides.
041	MAR	005	020	Addezikka baso biidi Yesusi izas ooththida gita miish wursi tammu katama geetettiza deren yootiin siyiday wurikka malalettides.
041	MAR	005	021	Qasseka Yesusi wogolon gelidi gede pinth pinnidi abbaa achchan dishin daro asay iza ach shiiqidinne iza giddoththides.
041	MAR	005	022	Ayhudata Woosa Keeththa halaqatappe issoy Iya7iroosa geetettizayssi izi dizaso biidi Yesusa demmida mala iza toho bolla kundidi
041	MAR	005	023	«Taas guuththa naa dizaara hayqqana gawus. Iza hayqqontta paxa daana mala ne haa yaada ne kushe izi bolla woththarkii?» giidi keehi woossides.
041	MAR	005	024	Yesusikka izara issife bides. Daro asay iza un7eththana gakkanaas kaallides.
041	MAR	005	025	Tammanne nam7u layth kumeth suuththi izi bollafe gukkiza maccas dizaara heen asaara dawus.
041	MAR	005	026	Iza baas diza miish wursana gakkanaas aakimeppe aakime laamon daro daaburadus. Gido attiin sakoy izis gede darides attiin aykkoka lo7ibeenna.
041	MAR	005	027	Iza Yesusa gishshas siyida mala asaa giddora Yesusa guyera kaallada iza may7o bochchadus.
041	MAR	005	028	Gaasoykka, «Ta ay hanadakka iza may7o kushera bocho bochchidaakkoka paxana» gaada qoppida gishshassa.
041	MAR	005	029	Gukkiza suuththay heerakka eqqi aggides; izakka paxidayssa ba asateththan eradus.
041	MAR	005	030	Baappe wolqqay kezidayssa Yesusi eridi gede asaakko simmidi, «Ta may7o oonee bochchiday?» gides.
041	MAR	005	031	Iza kaallizayti qasse, «Hayssi derey un7ettidi sugettishin beyashe waanada, ‹Tana bochchiday oonee?› gay» gida.
041	MAR	005	032	Yesusi hessa ooththiday oonakkonne beyanaas yuushshi xeellides.
041	MAR	005	033	Maccassayakka baas aazi waanidaakko erada babbashenne kokkorashe yaada Yesusa sinththan gufannada tumaa wursa izas yootadus.
041	MAR	005	034	Izikka, «Ta nayee! Ne ammanoy nena ashshides. Saron ba! Ne waayeppe paxa!» gides.
041	MAR	005	035	Yesusi buro haasayan dishin Ayhudata Woosa Keeththa halaqa Iya7iroosa sooppe yiidi Iya7iroosas, «Ne naya hayqqadus; Godaa mela aazas daabursay?» gida.
041	MAR	005	036	Gido attiin Yesusi istta haasayaa leppi histtidi Ayhudata Woosa Keeththaa halaqaza, «Ne ammano xalla ammana attiin babbofa!» gides.
041	MAR	005	037	Phexroosa, Yaaqooberanne Yaaqoobe isha Yohannisappe attiin haray oonikka iza kaallana mala koyibeenna.
041	MAR	005	038	Gede Ayhudata Woosa Keeththa halaqazaso gakkida mala asay waassishe camo yeeho yeekkizayssa be7ides.
041	MAR	005	039	Soo gelidi, «Hayssi wuri aaza waasonne aaza yeehoo? Naya dhiskadus attiin hayqqabeekku» gides.
041	MAR	005	040	Qasse asay wuri iza bolla miiccides; asaa wursika keeththaafe kessidi nayi aawaanne nayi aayiyo qasseka izara issife yidayta iza kaallizayta xalla kaaleththidi naya dizaso gelides.
041	MAR	005	041	Nay kushekka oykkidi, «Xaabita kum!» gides. «Xaabita kum!» guussas birsheththi, «Hanne nayee denda» guussa.
041	MAR	005	042	Nayakka heerakka denda eqqadus; yaanne haa hemettadus. Iziska layththay tammanne nam7a; asaykka he hanozan daro malalettides.
041	MAR	005	043	Yesusi hayssa oonikka erontta mala keehi minththi yootides; «Nays maana quma immite» gides.
041	MAR	006	001	Hessafe guye Yesusi heeppe dendidi gede ba dere bides. Iza kaallizaytikka izara bida.
041	MAR	006	002	Ayhudata Sambatay gakkiin Ayhudata Woosa Keeththe gelidi tamaarsishin siyida asay, «Hayssi addezi hayssa wursi awappe ekkidee? Hayssi izas imettida erateththay aazee? Qasse hayti izi ooththiza malaatati waani iza kushen hanizoo?» gishe malalettida.
041	MAR	006	003	«Hayssi anaaxeza gidennee? Maarami naa Yaaqoobentta Yoosantta, Yuhudanttanne Simoonantta isha gidennee? Iza michcheti nunara haan nu matan dizayta dettenee?» giidi hessafe dendidayssan izan ufayettibeettenna.
041	MAR	006	004	Yesusikka isttas, «Nabey bonchchettonttay ba deren ba dabbota giddoninne baso asaa achchan xalla» gides.
