# BOOK	044	ACT	Acts	Hawaareta Ooso
044	ACT	001	001	Tofiloosaa! Yesusi ooththanaassinne tamaarsanaas oykkidayssa wursa ta nees koyro maxaafaan xaafadis.
044	ACT	001	002	Hessika izi pude denththa gallas gakkanaas ba doori kiittidaytas Xillo Ayana baggara izi isttas immida azazokko.
044	ACT	001	003	Izi daro waaye be7idaappe guye isttako shiiqidi hayqoppe dendanayssa isttas daro markkara qonccisishe oyddu tammu gallas gakkanaas isttas gallas gallas beettishe Xoossa Kawoteththa gishshas yootides.
044	ACT	001	004	Isttara issife maaddan utti dishe istta, «Yerusalaameppe kezopite; gido attiin ta inttes yootishin intte siyidayssa ta Aaway immida ufayssaa naagite.
044	ACT	001	005	Yohannisi haaththan xammaqides; intte gidikko guuththa wodeppe guye Xillo Ayanan xammaqettana» giidi yootides.
044	ACT	001	006	Isttika issi bolla shiiqetti dishe, «Godoo! Ne Isra7eeleta kawoteth zaarada ha7i essanee?» gi oychchida.
044	ACT	001	007	Izikka isttas, «Aaway ba shenen woththida wode eroy inttes imettibeenna.
044	ACT	001	008	Gido attiin Xillo Ayanay intte bolla wodhdhida wode intte wolqqa ekkana. Yerusalaamenkka, Yuhudankka, Samaariyankka ubbason biitta gaxa gakkanaas intte taas markkatta gidana» gides.
044	ACT	001	009	Hessa gi yootidaappe guye istti xeellishin pude salo dendides; shaaraykka istta ayfeppe iza genththides.
044	ACT	001	010	Izi bishin istti iza tishshi histti pude salo xeellishin booththa may7o may7ida nam7u asati qoppontta istta achchan eqqidi,
044	ACT	001	011	«Intteno Galila asatoo! Intte pude salo xeellishe hayssan aazas eqqidetii? Hayssi intte matappe pude salo dendishin intte be7iza Yesusi salo kezishin intte be7ida mala hessaththoka izi haa simmi yaana» gida.
044	ACT	001	012	Hessafe guye Dabrazayte geetettiza zuma bollafe wodhdhidi Yerusalaame simmida. He zumaykka Yerusalaameppe issi kilo metire mala haakkees.
