048	GAL	003	015	Ta ishatoo! Ane ta inttes asi ba duussan haniza miish leemiso immays; haray attoshin asi issito caaqqida qaala issito caaqqidaappe guye oonikka shaaranaas woykko hara iza bolla gujjana dandayonttayssa mala hayssika hessa mala.
048	GAL	003	016	Xoossi Abrahaames yootida qaalay Abrahaamessinne iza zereththassa; Geeshsha Maxaafay daro asas yootiza mala, «Iza zereththatas» geenna; gido attiin issi asas yootettiza mala, «Ne zereththas» gees; hessika Kirstoosa.
048	GAL	003	017	Ta gizaykka hayssa; 430 layththafe guyen imettida wogay kasetidi Xoossi minththida caaqoza laallidi buro hanana hidota qaalaa shaarenna.
