048	GAL	003	022	Qasse Geeshsha Maxaafay hayssi alamey wurikka nagaran qashettidayssa awajjees; hessika asi wurikka Yesus Kirstoosa ammanon beettiza hidotay ammanizaytas ubbaas imettanaassa.
048	GAL	003	023	Hayssi ammanoy yaanaappe kase nuni wogan qashettidi gordan doos.
