# BOOK	049	EPH	Ephesians	Efesoone Asaas
049	EPH	001	001	Xoossa shene mala Yesus Kirstoosa Hawaare gidida Phawuloosappe, Yesus Kirstoosan diza ammanettizaytas Efesoonen ammaniza asaas,
049	EPH	001	002	nu Aawaa Xoossafenne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.
049	EPH	001	003	Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara salon Ayana anjjo ubbaan nuna anjjida Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Aaway Xoossi anjjetto.
049	EPH	001	004	Nu iza sinththan geeshshinne wosoy bayndayta gidana mala buro alamey medhettanaappe kase ba siiqon Kirstoosa baggara nuna doorides.
049	EPH	001	005	Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nu iza naa gidana mala ba lo7o qofaan koyro ubbaa woththides.
049	EPH	001	006	Hessika ba dosizaade baggara coo mela nuus imettida bonchcho kiyateththi galatettana malassa.
049	EPH	001	007	Xoossa aadho kiyateththa dureteththaafe dendoyssan Yesusa suuththan wozzettidi nagarappe nu maarettidos.
049	EPH	001	008	Izi ba kiyateththaa, hiillateththaninne erateth ubbaan nu bolla keehi darssides.
049	EPH	001	009	Xoossi qoppida ba xuura qofaa Kirstoosa baggara ba lo7o qofaa mala nuna erisides.
049	EPH	001	010	Buroppe wode wurseththan hananaas diza iza qofay salo bollanne biitta bolla dizaytas ubbaas hu7e gidida Yesus Kirstoosappe ubbaa gars aaththanaassa.
049	EPH	001	011	Wursika ba shene mala ooththiza iza shenen koyrokka izi qoppi woththidayti nuni izan doorettidos.
049	EPH	001	012	Nuni kasetidi Kirstoosa baggara ekkana giidi ufayssan naagizayti Xoossa bonchcho galatan qonccisanaassa.
049	EPH	001	013	Intteka qasse tumaa qaalaa hessika inttena ashshiza Mishiraachcho qaalaa siyidi Kirstoosan ammanideta; iza ammanidi kase imettana geetettida Xillo Ayana maatamen attamettideta.
049	EPH	001	014	He Ayanazikka iza bonchcho galatan qonccisana mala Xoossi baas gididayta ubbata wozzana gakkanaas nu laatas oyso.
049	EPH	001	015	Hessa gishshas intte Godaa Yesusa ammanida gishshassinne ammaniza asaa intte siiqizayssa ta siyoosoppe haa simmiin inttena qoppa qoppa ekkada tani ta woosan intte gishshas Xoossas galata shiisho aggabeekke.
049	EPH	001	017	Bonchcho Aawaa gidida nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Aawaa Xoossaa intte lo7eththi erana mala qonccisiza Ayanaynne erateththa Ayanay inttes imettana mala ta inttes pacey baynda woossays.
049	EPH	001	018	Hessaththoka intte izan xeygettida ufayssay hessika ammanizayta achchan diza iza dureteththi aazakkonne intte erana mala intte wozina ayfey poo7ana mala woossays.
049	EPH	001	019	Nuus ammanizaytas ubbaafe bolla gidida iza wolqqa dhoqqateth intte erana mala ta woossays; he wolqqayka iza gita minoteththaa ooson bessidayssi hayqoppe Kirstoosa denththidi salon ba ushachchan utissida Kirstoosa baggara.
049	EPH	001	021	Ayssizaytappe, godateththafe, wolqqafenne kawoteththafe qasseka ha7i xalla gidontta buroppe yaana wodekka gidiin sunth ubbaafe izi bolla.
049	EPH	001	022	Xoossi hara wursi iza tohoppe garsan haarisides; Woosa keeththankka ubbaa bolla hu7e ooththides.
049	EPH	001	023	Woosa Keeththiya Kirstoosa asateththa; he izakka ubbason ubba miish kunththiza he iza kumeththa.
