051	COL	002	011	Intte izan qaxxarettideta; hessi he qaxxarazikka nagara gidida asho qofaa digganaas Kirstoosan hanidayssa attiin asa kushen hanibeenna.
051	COL	002	012	Xinqatan izara issife moogettideta; iza hayqoppe denththida Xoossa wolqqan ammanidi qasseka izara issife dendideta.
051	COL	002	013	Intte kase intte mooroninne intte asho nagara hanoteththaa inttefe diggontta aggida gishshas hayqqidaytakko shin Xoossi inttena Kirstoosa baggara paththides; intte nagaraakka ubbaa atto gides.
051	COL	002	014	Kase nuna mootishenne nunara eqettishe diza Muse wogaan aco mootos xaafettidayssa qucci diggides. Masqale bolla torgidi nu bollafe diggides.
051	COL	002	015	Halaqatanne godatizayta godateth isttafe woththi ekkidinne masqale bolla hayqqidi xooni dendidi di7ettidayta qonccen yuushshi bessides.
051	COL	002	016	Hessa gishshas muussan woykko ushshan, issife bonchchon woykko agina xeeroninne Sambata gallas bonchcho gishshas intte bolla oonikka pirdofo.
051	COL	002	017	Heyti wurikka buro yaana hanotas eeshota gidishin waanna asateththay gidikko Kirstoosa.
051	COL	002	018	Bessontta ashketeththinne kiitanchchatas goyno dosiza asi oonikka inttena dhuphidi mela ashshontta mala naagettite; hessa mala asi ba be7ida agumos wogay baynda bana nashshishe hada asho qofaan kumidi otorettees.
051	COL	002	019	Hessa mala asas hu7e gidida Kirstoosara aykko gaytoteththika deenna; kumeththa asateth shayaninne koldzen oyseththi dichchiza hu7ey Kirstoosa; Xoossi Kirstoosa asateth kumeth dichchizay hessa malanna.
051	COL	002	020	Hayssa ha alameza wogaas intte Kirstoosara hayqqidayta gidikko histtiin ha7i aazas he wogaas haaretteetii?
051	COL	002	021	He wogati oykkofa, laacca beyoppa; bochchofa gizayta.
051	COL	002	022	Hayti wuri asa azazoninne asa timirten wodhdhida wogata gidida gishshas oosettidaappe guye coo dhayanaas deettes.
051	COL	002	023	Ha azazoti barkka baappe medhdhi ekkida goyno qofay coo bessontta ashketeththinne ba asateth naaqqi oyththan isttas tumu aadho erateththi dizayta misateettes; gido attiin asho amoteth shiishshi oykkiza wolqqay isttas baa.
051	COL	003	001	Histtiko intte Kirstoosara issife dendidayta gidikko Kirstoosi Xoossa achchan uttidasohon puden diza hanoteththaa koyite.
051	COL	003	002	Intte qofay pude bollan diza miishsha bolla gido attiin ha biittaa yo7o bolla gidoppo.
051	COL	003	003	Gaasoykka intte hayqqidetanne intte de7oykka Kirstoosara Xoossa achchan qotettides.
051	COL	003	004	Inttes de7o gidida Kirstoosi qoncciza gallas intteka he wode izara issife bonchchora qonccana.
051	COL	003	005	Hessa gishshas inttes biitta bolla diza amoteth diggite; heytikka layma, tunateth, asho amo, iita amoteththinne eeqas goyno mala gidida gaphigapho.
051	COL	003	006	Heytantta gaason Xoossa hanqoy Xoossas azazettonttayta bolla yaana.
051	COL	003	007	Intteka kase diza duussaan he miishshata ooththideta.
051	COL	003	008	Ha7i gidikko hanqo, yiillo, cashshe, zigirsinne yeellasiza haasaya heytantta misatizayta ubbaa diggite.
051	COL	003	009	Kase ceega asateth iza oosora gaththi inttefe qaari yeggida gishshas intte intte garsan issoy issaara wordo haasayopite.
051	COL	003	010	Bana medhdhidayssa misatana mala eran ooraxida ooraththa asateth may7ideta.
051	COL	003	011	Heen Girike as gidiin woykko Ayhuda as woykko qaxxarettidayta woykko qaxxarettonttayta woykko tamaardaytanne tamaaronttayta woykko maarettonttayta woykko aylle woykko goqa geetettiza dummateththi deenna; Kirstoosi heytantta ubbaassa; qasse ubbaankka dees.
051	COL	003	012	Hessa gishshas dumma gididi dosettidaytoo! Intte Xoossas doorettidayta gidida mala misheteththinne kiyateth, ashketeth, bonchchonne dandaya may7ite.
051	COL	003	013	Intte issoy issaa dandayte; inttefe issaadey issaade bolla mishettiko yo7oykka iza bolla diikko issoy issaas atto atto geetettite; Godaykka inttes atto gida mala intteka hara asas atto giite.
051	COL	003	014	Hessa ubbaa bolla ubbaa kumeththa issifeteththan shiishshi qachchiza siiqo may7ite.
051	COL	003	015	Intte wurikka issi asho gididi saroteththas xeygettida Kirstoosa saroteththi intte wozinan kawoto; intte galatizayta gidite.
051	COL	003	016	Kirstoosa qaalay inttenan kumeth gido; intte intte garsan aadho erateththan tamaartenne zorettite; mazamureninne saban Ayana yeththan galatara gaththi intte wozinara Xoossas yexxite.
051	COL	003	017	Iza baggara Xoossaa Aawaas galata shiishshishe qaalan gidiin woykko ooson intte ooththizayssa ubbaa Godaa Yesusa sunththan ooththite.
051	COL	003	018	Machchetoo! Godaa achchan inttes bessiza miish gidida gishshas intte azinatas azazettite.
051	COL	003	019	Azinatoo! Intte intte machcheta siiqitenne isttas menxe iitopite.
051	COL	003	020	Naytoo! Intte Godaa ufayssana mala intte inttena yelidaytas ubba miishshan azazettite.
051	COL	003	021	Aawatoo! Nayti hidota qanxxontta mala intte nayta hanqeththofte.
051	COL	003	022	Aylletoo! As ufayssanaassinne coo ayfeson beettanaas gidontta suure wozinappe intte Godaas babbite; hayssa ha biittan haariza godataska hano ubbaan azazettite.
051	COL	003	023	Intte ooththiza miish ubbaa asas gidontta Godaas ooththiza mala taybidi kumeththa wozinappe ooththite.
051	COL	003	024	Intte Godaa achchafe intte ooso mala ekkanaas laatay dizayssa intte ereeta; intte ooththizay Godaa Yesus Kirstoosassa.
051	COL	003	025	Qoho ooththidaadey ba ooththidaari kushe ekkana; iza achchan dumma maadoy deenna.
051	COL	004	001	Godatoo! Inttes salon Goday dizayssa intte eriza gishshas inttes ooththizaytas tumaninne suureteththan ooththite.
051	COL	004	002	Beeggidi galatara gaththi pacey baynda Xoossaa woossite.
051	COL	004	003	Ta iza gishshas qashettida Kirstoosa xuuraa awajjanaas dandayana mala Xoossi nuus qaala yootanaas oge doyana mala nu gishshassika woossite.
051	COL	004	004	Qasseka haasayanaas bessiza qaala qonccen ta haasayana mala taas woossite.
051	COL	004	005	Ammanontta asatara inttes diza hanoteththan aadho erateththan simerettite; inttes beettida lo7o qaadan go7ettite.
051	COL	004	006	Issoy issaas intte zaaro wostti immanaakko intte erana mala intte haasayay maxinera kaxxida kaththa mala mal7o gido.
051	COL	004	007	Tiqiqoosi ta duussaa gishshas wursi inttes yootana; izi daro dosettida ishanne Godaas tanara issife ooththiza ammanettida oosanchcha.
051	COL	004	008	Nu duussaa gishshas intte erana malanne intte wozina minththana mala tani iza intteko kiittadis.
051	COL	004	009	Izi intte bagga gididi ammanettidaadenne dosettidaade gidida nu ishaa Anasmoosara intteko yaana; isttika haan diza hanoza ubbaa inttes yootana.
051	COL	004	010	Barnabaasa aawaa michchey naa Marqoosinne tanara issife qashettida Arxirokoosi inttena saro geettes. Marqoosa gishshas intte ay ooththanaakko kase inttena ta qofsa woththida mala izi intteko gakkishin iza mokki ekkite.
051	COL	004	011	Iyosxoosa geetettiza Iyaasoykka inttena saro gees; Ayhuda asaa giddofe Xoossa Kawoteththas tanara ooththizayti haytantta xalla; istti tana minththeththida.
051	COL	004	012	Intte baggafe gidida Yesus Kirstoosa oosanchcha Ephafiray inttena saro gees; izikka inttena Ayana duussan lo7eththi minnidi mulera woppu giidi Xoossa shenen minni eqqana mala ubba wode intte gishshas woosan baaxetees.
051	COL	004	013	Qasseka intte gishshas hessaththoka Lodoqiyaninne Iyarpolise kataman dizaytas izi pacey baynda ooththizayssa ta iza gishshas markkattays.
051	COL	004	014	Daro dosettida aakime Luqaasinne Deemaasi inttena saro geettes.
051	COL	004	015	Lodoqiyan diza nu ishatas, Nimpusinne izi keeththan shiiqiza ammaniza asatas ta sarokaa yootite.
051	COL	004	016	Hanna ta kiitaya inttes nababettida mala qasseka Lodoqiyan diza Woosa Keeththayn nababettana mala ooththite; intteka qasse Lodoqiyappe inttes kiitettida kiitaa nababite.
051	COL	004	017	Arikiphaases, «Neni Godaappe ekkida oosoza wurseth gaththanaas minna» giite.
051	COL	004	018	Hayssa sarokaa tani Phawuloosi ta kushera xaafadis; ta qashetta dizayssa dogopite; Xoossa kiyateththi inttenara gido.
#
# BOOK	052	1TH	1 Thessalonians	1Tasolonqe Asaas
052	1TH	001	001	Phawuloosappe, Silwaanoosappenne Ximtoosappe; Xoossaa Aawassinne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosayta gidida Tasolonqen diza ammaniza asaas nu Aawaa Xoossaafenne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.
052	1TH	001	002	Nu inttena nu woosan qoppishe ubba wode Xoossaa intte gishshas galatoos.
052	1TH	001	003	Ammanoninne mino siiqoteththan intte ooththida ooso gishshas Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa bolla diza intte mino hidotan beettida intte minoteththaa gishshas nu Godaa Xoossaa, nu Aawaa sinththan ubba gallas intte gishshas qoppoos.
052	1TH	001	004	Xoossan dosettida nu ishatoo! Izi inttena dooridayssa nu eroos.
052	1TH	001	005	Gaasoykka Mishiraachcho qaalay intteko yiday wolqqara Xillo Ayananinne lo7eththi shaakki eriin attiin coo qaala xallan gidenna; qasseka nu intte gishshas giidi waani de7idaakko intte ereeta.
052	1TH	001	006	Ha7i intte nunanne Godaa misatideta; intte bolla ay metoy gakkidaa gidikkoka Xillo Ayana ufayssan qaalaa intte ekkideta.
052	1TH	001	007	Hessafe dendidayssan intte Maqidooniyaninne Akayan ammaniza asa ubbaas lo7o leemisota gidideta.
052	1TH	001	008	Godaa qaalay inttefe kezidi Maqidooniyaninne Akayan siyeteth xalla gidontta inttes Xoossa bolla diza ammanoy ubbason erettides; hessa gishshas nu inttes yootanaas aykkoka koshshenna.
052	1TH	001	009	Intte nuna wostti mokki ekkidaakkonne de7on diza tumu Xoossaas ooththanaas intte eeqatappe Xoossaako waani simmidaakko asay intte gishshas haasayees.
052	1TH	001	010	Qasseka Xoossi hayqoppe denththidayssa buro yaana hanqofe nuna ashshana Saloppe yaana Xoossa Naa Yesusa yuussaa intte wostti naagizaakko asay haasayees.
052	1TH	002	001	Nu ishatoo! Nu inttekon gam7ida gam7oy hada gidonttayssa intteka ereeta.
052	1TH	002	002	Intteka erizayssa mala hayssafe kase Piliphisiyoosen nu waayenne meto be7idossinne cayettidos; gido attiin aynne mino waayey nuna gakkikokka Xoossa Mishiraachcho qaalaa inttes yootanaas nu Godaappe xalateth demmidos.
052	1TH	002	003	Nu inttena zorida zorey iita qofara woykko inttena baleththanaas koyidi gidenna.
052	1TH	002	004	Gido attiin nu Mishiraachcho qaalaa hadara ekkanaas dandayza asata mala Xoossi nuna qoodida gishshas nu haasayoos; hessaka nu ooththizay nu wozina paacci eriza Xoossaa ufayssanaas attiin as ufayssanaas giidi gidenna.
052	1TH	002	005	Nu mulekka baleththo qaala yootibeekko woykko nu uuzeteth kammanaas giidi baleththo hano nu hanonttayssa intte ereeta; hayssaska nu markkay Xoossa.
052	1TH	002	006	Inttefe gidiin woykko haratappe oonappeka asappe imettiza bonchcho nu koyibeekko.
052	1TH	002	007	Nu Kirstoosi kiittidayta gidida gishshas inttes tooho gidanaas dandayoos; gido attiin aaya ba nayta dichchiza mala nunikka intte giddon ashketeththan simerettidos.
052	1TH	002	008	Xoossa qaala xalla gidontta dishin nu shemppoka intte gishshas ufayssan immana gakkanaas inttena siiqidos; gaasoykka nu inttena daro siiqida gishshassa.
052	1TH	002	009	Nu ishatoo! Nu dafeteththaanne nu daaburaa intte ereeta; oonaska tooho gidontta mala qammanne gallas nuus ooththishe Mishiraachcho qaalaa inttes yootidos.
052	1TH	002	010	Nu inttenara ammanizaytara diza wode xilloteththaninne geeshshateththan qasseka wosoy baynda nu waani de7idaakko intteka Xoossika nuus markka.
052	1TH	002	011	Aaway ba naytas haniza mala nunikka inttes issaas issaas ay hanidaakko intte ereeta.
052	1TH	002	012	Intte inttena ba kawoteththassinne ba bonchchos xeygida Xoossaas bessiza mala intte daana mala nu inttena minththidos; lo7eththi zoridossinne hadara gidos.
052	1TH	002	013	Intte nuuppe siyida Xoossa qaalaa ekkida wode ammaniza intte achchan tumu ooththiza Xoossa qaalaa mala ekkideta attiin coo asa qaala mala intte ekkontta aggida gishshas nuni Xoossaa qanxxoy baynda galatoos.
052	1TH	002	014	Nu ishatoo! Yuhuda biittan Yesus Kirstoosa ammaniza Xoossa Woosa Keeththata misatideta; istti Ayhudatappe metonne waaye ekkida mala intteka intte asaappe waaye ekkideta.
052	1TH	002	015	Istti Godaa Yesusanne kase nabetakka wodhida; nunakka gooddida; Xoossaaka ufayssibeettenna; as ubbaara eqettizayta gidida.
052	1TH	002	016	Hessika Ayzaabeti siyidi attana qaala nu isttas yootontta mala digganaassa; hessa mala ooson ba nagara ubba wode ba bolla wurseth gakkanaas gujji gujji beettes; Xoossa hanqoyka istta bolla wodhdhides.
052	1TH	002	017	Gidikkoka nu ishatoo! Nu guuththa wodes inttefe Ayanan gidontta ashon shaakettikokka intte laamotay nuna wodhiza gishshas intte ayfeso beyanaas daro dafeteththan doos.
052	1TH	002	018	Nu intteko baanaas daro laamotidos shin harappeka ta Phawuloosi daro wode dafettadis shin Xala7ey nuna diggides.
052	1TH	002	019	Godaa Yesusi haa yiza wode iza sinththan nu hidotay woykko nu ufayssi woykko nu zawudey nuus inttefe haray oonee?
052	1TH	002	020	Tumappeka nu ufayssinne nu bonchchoy inttena.
052	1TH	003	001	Hessa gishshas nuus dandayettontta ixxiin he wode Ateenan nurkka nu attanayssi nuus lo7o gidi beettides.
052	1TH	003	002	Inttena ammanon minththana mala nunara asas Kirstoosa mishiraachcho qaalaa yootiza Xoossa ashkara gidida Ximtoosa intteko yeddidos.
052	1TH	003	003	Hessika hayssa paacezan oonikka ammanoppe qanxxontta malassa; nunikka hayssas doorettidayssa intteka ereeta.
052	1TH	003	004	Nu qasse inttenara diza wode waayey nu bolla gakkanayssa kasetidi inttes yootidos; intte eriza malakka hanides.
052	1TH	003	005	Hessa gishshas ta aykkoka genceciin taas dandayettontta ixxida gishshas intte ammano gishshas eranaas gaada Ximtoosa kiittadis; ta hessa ooththiday oonee erizay paaccizaadey istta paacciin hanni wode nu daaburay wurikka hada gidontta aggenna gaada babbida gishshassa.
052	1TH	003	006	Ha7i qasse Ximtoosi intte achchafe nuukko yiidi intte ammano gishshassinne intte siiqoteththaa gishshas lo7o wore nuna sissides. Qasseka intte ubba wode nuna lo7eththi qoppizayssanne nunikka inttena beyanaas laamotiza mala intteka nuna beyanaas laamotizayssa nuus yootides.
052	1TH	003	007	Hessa gishshas nu ishatoo! Nu dizay waayeninne meto garsan gidikkoka intte ammano gaason inttenan ha7i nu minettoos.
052	1TH	003	008	Intte Godaan minni eqqida gishshas tumappe ha7i nu paxa daana.
052	1TH	003	009	Intte gaason nu Xoossa sinththan nu demmida ubba ufayssaa gishshas Xoossa ay mala galatanaas dandayzonii?
052	1TH	003	010	Qasseka nu inttena beyanaassinne intte ammanoppe paccidayssa kunththanaas omarsinne gallas keehi woossoos.
052	1TH	003	011	Ha7ikka nu intteko baana mala nu Aaway Xoossi Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi ogeza izi nuus suuriso.
052	1TH	003	012	Nu inttena siiqiza mala inttes intte garsan diza siiqonne intte harata siiqiza siiqoza Goday darsonne keehi gujjo.
052	1TH	003	013	Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi geeshshata ubbatara yiza wode nu Aawaa Godaa Xoossaa sinththan intte wosoy bayndaytanne geeshshata gididi beettana mala intte wozina izi minththo.
052	1TH	004	001	Ha7i wurseththan ta ishatoo! Intte Xoossa ufayssanaas intte waani waani daana bessizaakko nu inttena tamaarsidos; tumappeka nu tamaarsida mala deeta; hessa gishshas Godaa Yesus Kirstoosan nu inttena woossizaynne zorizay hayssafekka aadhdhiza hanora intte sinththe gujjana malassa.
052	1TH	004	002	Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa wolqqan nu inttes ay azazo immidaakko intte ereeta.
052	1TH	004	003	Xoossa sheney intte laymappe haakkidi dummatanaassa.
052	1TH	004	004	Qasse issi issi asay ba machcho geeshshateththaninne bonchchon ayso bessizayssa shaakki ero.
052	1TH	004	005	Hessika Xoos ammanontta Ayzaabeta mala layma qaaqqateththan gidoppo.
052	1TH	004	006	Hessa malan oonikka balettidi ba ishaa baleththofo; gaasoykka hayssafe kase nu inttes yootida malanne naagettanaas akeekissida mala Goday heytantta mala nagara ooththiza ubbata bolla ba hanqo ehana.
052	1TH	004	007	Xoossi nuna geeshshateththas xeygides attiin tunateththas xeygibeenna.
052	1TH	004	008	Hessa gishshas hayssa ha zoreza kadhidi ekkonttaadey Xillo Ayana izas immida Xoossaa kadhees attiin as kadhizaade gidenna.
052	1TH	004	009	Ishata siiqoteththa gishshas inttes oonikka xaafanaas koshshenna; gaasoykka intte intte giddon siiqettana mala intte intte baggara Xoossafe tamaardeta.
052	1TH	004	010	Kumeththa Maqidooniyan diza ammaniza asaa intte ubbaa siiqizayssi erettidayssa; gido attiin nu ishatoo! Sinththa baggan intte hayssafe aaththi siiqettana mala nu inttena zoroos.
052	1TH	004	011	Nu hayssafe kase inttena azazida mala intte intte kushera ooththite; woppu gi diite; inttes gidizayssa lo7eththi xeellite.
052	1TH	004	012	Hessika gallas gallas intte duussay hankko ammanontta asaa achchan inttena bonchchisana malanne intte ay asaska tooho gidontta malassa.
052	1TH	004	013	Ta ishatoo! Intte ashon hayqqidayta gishshas tumaa erana mala nu koyokko; qasseka hidotay baynda hara asata mala intte kayottana mala nu koyokko.
052	1TH	004	014	Yesusi hayqqidi dendidayssa nu ammanizaa gidikko Yesusa ammanidayta Xoossi Yesusara hessaththoka zaari haa yeddana.
052	1TH	004	015	Nu Godaa qaalan inttes gizay hayssa; nuni hayqqontta paxa dizaytinne Goday yaana gakkanaas gam7anayti kase hayqqidaytappe sinththatokko.
052	1TH	004	016	Goday ba hu7era gita azazon kiitanchchata halaqa giirissara Xoossa xurumba giirissan saloppe wodhdhana; kase Kirstoosa ammanidi hayqqidayti istti kaseti dendana.
052	1TH	004	017	Hessafe guye nuni qasse paxa dizayti Godaa carko bolla gaagganaas isttara issife shaarara dendana; hessaththoka nu mernaas Godaara daana.
052	1TH	004	018	Hessa gishshas ha qaalaan issoy issaara minettite.
052	1TH	005	001	Ta ishatoo! Hessi hanana wodeza gishshas nu inttes xaafanaas koshshenna.
052	1TH	005	002	Kaysoy qamman yiza mala Godaa gallassika hessa mala yaanayssa intte intte baggara lo7eththi ereeta.
052	1TH	005	003	Asay, «Gadey saronne lo7okko» gishin miixay qanththara diza maccas oykkiza mala hessaththoka as dhayssizay qoppontta dishin asa bolla gakkana; oonikka kessi ekkenna.
052	1TH	005	004	Intteno ishatoo! He gallassay kayso mala inttena daganththanaas intte dhuman deekketa.
052	1TH	005	005	Intte wurikka poo7o nayta; nuni dhuma woykko qamma baggata gidokko.
052	1TH	005	006	Histtiko ane beeggoos; ane nurkka nuna haaroos attiin hankko dhiskiza asaa mala nunikka ane dhiskokko.
052	1TH	005	007	Dhiskizayti qammara dhiskeettes; maththottizaytikka qammara maththotteettes.
052	1TH	005	008	Nuni gidikko gallassa asata gidida gishshas ammanonne siiqo, tiran may7iza xurure may7o mala may7idi atoteththa hidota hu7en woththiza birata qoobe mala hu7en woththidi ane nunateththaa haaridi de7oos.
052	1TH	005	009	Xoossi nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara atoteth demmana mala attiin nuna hanqos xeygibeenna.
052	1TH	005	010	Nu hayqqikokka woykko paxa diikkoka izara daana mala izi nu gishshas hayqqides.
052	1TH	005	011	Hessa gishshas tumappe intte ha7i ooththizayssa malakka issoy issaara minettitenne minththeththite.
052	1TH	005	012	Histtiko ta ishatoo! Intte giddon minni ooththizayta Godaan inttefe bollara diza halaqatanne inttena zorizayta intte bonchchana mala nu inttena woossoos.
052	1TH	005	013	Istta ooso gishshassika istta siiqora lo7eththi bonchchite; intte intte giddon saron diite.
052	1TH	005	014	Ta ishatoo! Nu inttena, «Ooso ooththontta asata hanqettite; babbizayta minththite; daaburanchchata maaddite; as ubbaa dandayte» gi zoroos.
052	1TH	005	015	Oonaska iita gishshas iita zaarontta mala naagettite; gido attiin intte intte giddon gidiin hara asara gidiin ubba wode lo7o gidizayssa ooththanaas baaxetite.
052	1TH	005	016	Ubba wode ufayettite.
052	1TH	005	017	Qanxxontta woossite.
052	1TH	005	018	Ay hanonkka galatite; Xoossa sheney inttes Yesus Kirstoosa baggara hessa.
052	1TH	005	019	Xillo Ayana tama toyssofte.
052	1TH	005	020	Tinbite qaala kadhopite.
052	1TH	005	021	Wursika paacci xeellite; lo7o gididaaz oykkite.
052	1TH	005	022	Iita gidida ay miishshafekka haakkite.
052	1TH	005	023	Saroteththa Goday izi ubba miishshan inttena dummaso; intte ayanay, intte shemppoynne intte ashoy Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi yiza wode wosoy baynda naagetto.
052	1TH	005	024	Inttena xeygidayssi ammanettidaade gidida gishshas izi hessa ooththana.
052	1TH	005	025	Nu ishatoo! Nu gishshassika woossite.
052	1TH	005	026	Ammanizayta ubbaa geeshsha yeereteththan sarokkite.
052	1TH	005	027	Ha kiitay ammanizaytas ubbaas nababettana mala Godaa sunththan hadara gays.
052	1TH	005	028	Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa aadho kiyateththi inttenara gido.
#
# BOOK	053	2TH	2 Thessalonians	2Tasolonqe Asaas
053	2TH	001	001	Phawuloosappe, Silwaanoosappenne Ximtoosappe; nu Aawaa Xoossaninne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosan gidida Tasolonqen ammaniza asaas,
053	2TH	001	002	Xoossaa Aawappenne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.
053	2TH	001	003	Ta ishatoo! Intte ammanoy wodeppe woden dicci dicci biza gishshassinne intte siiqoykka kaseppe gujetti gujetti biza gishshas nu intte gishshas Xoossa lo7eththi galatanaas bessees.
053	2TH	001	004	Hessa gishshas intte bolla gakkida goodeteththaninne meto ubbaan intte minnida gishshas nuni nu baggara intte dandayaa gishshassinne intte ammano gishshas ammaniza asa ubbaa achchan ceeqettoos.
053	2TH	001	005	Hessi wurikka Xoossa pirday suure gididayssa bessees; hessa gaason waaye be7iza intte Xoossa Kawoteththas bessizayta gidi beettideta.
053	2TH	001	006	Xoossi xillo gidida gishshas inttena waayisizayta izi waayisana.
053	2TH	001	007	Waaye ekkida inttessinne nuus shempo immana; hessika Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi wolqqama salo Xoossa kiitanchchatara salo bolla qoncciza wode hanana.
053	2TH	001	008	He wode Xoos erontta asatanne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Mishiraachcho qaalaas azazettontta asata bolla izi ba halo kessana.
053	2TH	001	009	Isttika Godaa sinththafenne iza bonchcho wolqqaa achchafe kichchidi mernaas dhayon qaxxayettana.
053	2TH	001	010	Istti qaxxayettanay izi geeshshata achchan bonchchettanaassinne ammanizayti wuri izan malalettana mala izi yiza gallassan hanana; intteka he ammaniza asaara daana; gaasoykka nu inttes markkattidayssa intte ammanida gishshassa.
053	2TH	001	011	Nu hessa qoppishe nu Xoossi inttena ba xeyssaas gidizayta histti qoodana mala intte lo7o ooththanaas amottiza amozanne ammanon intte ooththida oosoza ubbaa izi inttes ba wolqqan polana mala nu inttes ubba wode woossoos.
053	2TH	001	012	Qasseka nu Godaa Xoossaanne nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththaa mala Yesus Kirstoosa sunththi intte achchan bonchchettana malanne intteka izan bonchchettana mala nu inttes woossoos.
053	2TH	002	001	Ta ishatoo! Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa yuussaa gishshassinne nu izakko baana buussaa gishshas nu inttena qofsoos.
053	2TH	002	002	Ayanay qonccisides woykko qaalay gees giidi woykko nuuppe inttes kiitettida kiitaa mala, «Godaa yuussaa gallassi gakkides» giidi intte qofan yark yarkoftenne dagammofte.
053	2TH	002	003	Oonikka ay hanonkka inttena baleththofo. Daro asay ammano kaddanaappe sinththe dhayanaas bessiza issi makkalla asi qonccontta dishin he gallassay gakkenna.
053	2TH	002	004	Izikka Xoos geetetti goynnettiza eeqa xoossata ubbaafe bollara bana dhoqqu dhoqqu histtizaadenne Xoossara eqettizaade; izikka Xoossa Keeththan uttidi bana, «Tani Xoossa» giidi awajja awajjisana.
053	2TH	002	005	Ta inttenara diza wode hayta ha yo7ota inttes ta yootidayssi inttes qofettizeesha?
053	2TH	002	006	Izi ba woden qonccana gakkanaas ha7i izi qonccontta mala aazi diggizaakko intte ereeta.
053	2TH	002	007	Makkallanchcha xuuray haray attoshin ha7ikka ooso bolla dees; gido attiin hayssi hananay izi ha7i ooththontta mala iza diggizaadey iza ogeppe kichchana gakkanaas xalla.
053	2TH	002	008	Hessafekka kaallidi Godaa Yesusi ba doona peenoninne ba bonchcho yuussaan dhayssana; makkallanchchay qonccana.
053	2TH	002	009	He makkallanchcha yuussi Xala7e wolqqan hessika as baleththiza malaatataninne malalisiza miishshatan hanana.
053	2TH	002	010	Hessaththoka ekki attontta mala tumaa ixxidi dhayza asata baleththanaas dumma dumma iita oosoy yaana.
053	2TH	002	011	Hessa gaason istti wordo yo7o ammanana mala Xoossi istta bolla bala ooso kiittana.
053	2TH	002	012	Hessi hananay tumaa ammanontta ixxidi wordo yo7on ufayettizayti wuri pirdettanaassa.
053	2TH	002	013	Godaan dosettida ta ishatoo! Nu gidikko ubba wode intte gishshas Xoos galatanaas nuus bessees; gaasoykka Xoossi inttena koyroppe oykkidi intte Xillo Ayanan dummatidaytanne tumu ammanidi intte attana mala inttena doorides.
053	2TH	002	014	Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi bonchcho gishettizayta intte gidana mala nu yootida mishiraachcho qaalaa baggara inttena xeygides.
053	2TH	002	015	Hessa gishshas ta ishatoo! Intte minni eqqite; nuni nu doonan gidiin woykko kiitan woykko nu inttes aaththi yeddida timirteza lo7eththi oykkite.
053	2TH	002	016	Izi nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi qasse nuna siiqidaynne ba kiyateththan mernaa minththeththonne lo7o hidota izi nuus immida nu Aawaa Xoossay,
053	2TH	002	017	izi intte wozina lo7o oosoninne qaalan minththo.
053	2TH	003	001	Wurseththan ta ishatoo! Qasseka Godaa qaalay intte achchan hanoyssaththoka eleli ubbaso gakkana malanne bonchchettana mala nuus woossite.
053	2TH	003	002	Qasseka asi wuri ammanizayssa gidontta gishshas makkallanchchatappenne iita asatappe nu attana mala nuus woossite.
053	2TH	003	003	Goday gidikko ammanettidayssa; izikka inttena minththana; Xala7eppeka inttena naagana.
053	2TH	003	004	Nu inttena azazidayssa intte ha7i ooththideta shin sinththafekka intte ooththanayssa nuni Godaan ammanettoos.
053	2TH	003	005	Goday intte wozina Xoossa siiqookkonne Kirstoosa dandayaakko kaaleththo.
053	2TH	003	006	Ta ishatoo! Ooso ooththontta asaappenne intte nuuppe ekkida timirteza mala dontta ammanizaytappe intte haakkana mala Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa sunththan inttena nu azazoos.
053	2TH	003	007	Intte nu leemiso wostti kaallanaakko intte intte baggara ereeta; nu inttenara diza wode ooso ooththontta coo de7ibeekko.
053	2TH	003	008	Qasseka oona sooppeka kath coo mela mibeekko; qasse inttefe oonaska nu tooho gidontta mala qammanne gallas daaburan ooththi midos.
053	2TH	003	009	Nu hessa ooththiday intte nuna kaallana mala inttes lo7o leemiso gidana giidippe attiin nuus koshshizayssa inttefe ekkanayssa nuna diggiza wogay diin gidenna.
053	2TH	003	010	Nu inttenara diza wode, «Ooso ooththanaas dosontta asi kath mooppo» giza azazo inttes immidos.
053	2TH	003	011	Intte giddon issi issi asati ooso ooththonttayssa nu siyidos; heytantti ooso ooththontta mela asa yo7on geliza asata.
053	2TH	003	012	Heyta mala asati ba ooso co7u gi ooththana malanne ba kath maana mala Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa sunththan nu istta azazoossinne zoroos.
053	2TH	003	013	Intte gidikko ta ishatoo! Lo7o ooso ooththanaappe mulekka azallofte.
053	2TH	003	014	Hayssa nu kiittida qaalaas azazettonttay oonikka diikko hessa misatizaade lo7eththi kaallitenne izi ba ooson yeellatana mala izara gaaggofte.
053	2TH	003	015	Gido attiin iza intte isha mala hanqite attiin morkke mala xeellofte.
053	2TH	003	016	Saroteththaa Goday izi ba baggara yo7o ubbaan inttes saroteth immo; Goday inttenara ubbaara gido.
053	2TH	003	017	Hayssa sarokaa tani ta kushera inttes xaafiday tana Phawuloosa. Ta kiitaas dumma malatay hayssa; izikka hayssa tani ta kushen xaafoyssa.
053	2TH	003	018	Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa aadho kiyateththi inttenara ubbaara gido.
#
# BOOK	054	1TI	1 Timothy	1Ximtoosas
054	1TI	001	001	Nuna ashshida Xoossaan, nuus hidota gidida Yesus Kirstoosa azazon Hawaare gidida Phawuloosappe
054	1TI	001	002	Ammanon taas tumu naa gidida Ximtoosas Xoossaa nu Aawappe nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththi, maaroteththinne saroy nees gido.
054	1TI	001	003	Tani Maqidooniya bashe nena hadara gida mala hayssafe sinththan issi issi asati wordo timirte tamaarsontta mala ne azazanaas Efesoonen daashsha.
054	1TI	001	004	Qasseka asay yootiin wurontta beni wode haysi7en ba wode wursontta mala azaza; heyta mala yo7oy palama denththeththees attiin ammanon oosettiza Xoossa oosos aykkoka go7enna.
054	1TI	001	005	Ha azazozas waanna ayfe yo7oy gidikko geeshsha wozinappe lo7o qofara hessaththoka tumu ammanoppe beettiza siiqo.
054	1TI	001	006	Issi issi asay haytappe pooqqi eqqidi go7ay baynda yo7otakko simmides.
054	1TI	001	007	Wogaa tamaarsizayta gidana mala koyeettes; gidikkoka istti ba yootizayssa woykko keehi mootettiza yo7oza lo7eththi erettenna.
054	1TI	001	008	Gido attiin asi maaran go7ettizaakko wogay lo7o gididayssa nu eroos.
054	1TI	001	009	Qasseka wogay imettiday xillo asas gidontta wogaa yedhdhi aadhdhizaytas, azazettonttaytas, Xoossas babbonttaytas, nagaranchchatas, geeshshateththi bayndaytas, Xoos leqqizaytas, ba aayonne ba aawaa wodhizaytassinne shemppo wodhizaytas gididayssa nu eroos.
054	1TI	001	010	Hessaththoka laymatizaytas, addera aqiza addetas, as bayzizaytassinne shammizaytas, wordanchchatas, asas wordora caaqqizaytas, lo7o timirtera eqettiza ubbatassa.
054	1TI	001	011	He lo7o timirtey anjjettida Xoossi taas hadara immida bonchcho mishiraachcho qaalara gaaggizayssa.
054	1TI	001	012	Tana ba oosos shuumidinne ammanettizaade histti ekkidinne taas minoteth immida nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa ta galatays.
054	1TI	001	013	Hayssafe kase ta ay mala as cayizaadenne goodeththizaade, qasse makkalla as gidikkoka hessa ta eronttanne ammanontta dashe ooththida gishshas Xoossi tana maarides.
054	1TI	001	014	Yesus Kirstoosappe gidida ammanoranne siiqora nu Godaa kiyateththi taas keehi darides.
054	1TI	001	015	Yesus Kirstoosi nagaranchchata ashshanaas duge hayssa ha alame yides giza qaalay tumanne asi wurikka ekkanaas bessizayssa. Nagaranchchatappeka aadhdhiza nagaranchchay tana.
054	1TI	001	016	Gido attiin ta maarettidaykka Yesus Kirstoosi zaway baynda ba dandayaa, ubbaafe aadhdhida nagaranchcha gidida ta bolla bessiday izan ammananaytassinne mernaa de7o demmanaytas leemiso gidana malassa.
054	1TI	001	017	Hessa gishshas mernaas hayqqi erontta, ayfen beetti erontta barkka xalla Xoos gidida kawos mernaappe mernaa gakkanaas izas bonchchoynne galatay gido. Amiin.
054	1TI	001	018	Ta naa Ximtoosaa! Ne gishshas kasetidi yootettida mala hayssa azazoza ta nees immadis; hessika ne he qaalaa kaallashe lo7o baaxe baaxetanaassa.
054	1TI	001	019	Ammanoynne lo7o qofay nees de7o; issi issi asati ba lo7o qofaa yedhdhi aadhdhidi abba bolla metoy iza bolla gakkiin waayettiza markabe mala ba ammano dhayssida.
054	1TI	001	020	Istta giddon Xoossa cash aggidi taamarana mala tani Xala7es aaththa immidayti Hemenewoosinne Iskindiroosi deettes.
054	1TI	002	001	Hessa gishshas ubbaafe koyro hara asas shoobeththa woosa, gaannateththa woosanne galata woosa asa ubbaas kawotassinne dere ayssizaytas ubbaas woossana mala ta nena qofsays.
054	1TI	002	002	Hessika Tumu Ayana duussaninne geeshshateth ubbaan nuni saroteththaninne wogan daana malassa.
054	1TI	002	003	Hayssi nuna ashshiza Xoossaa achchan lo7onne ufayssizaaza.
054	1TI	002	004	Izi asi wuri attana malanne tumaa erana mala koyees.
054	1TI	002	005	Issi Xoossi xalla dees; qasseka Xoossassinne asas giddon issi giigsiza gaannay dees; izikka as gidida Yesus Kirstoosa.
054	1TI	002	006	Izi bana asa ubbaas aaththi immides; hessika heerakka wodey aadhdhontta izas markkattides.
054	1TI	002	007	Tanikka hayssas mishiraachcho qaala yootanaas kiitettidaade; qasseka deretas tumu ammano astamaare gidada shuumettadis; hessaka ta wordotontta tumu yootanaassa.
054	1TI	002	008	Hessa gishshas attuma asay ubbason hanqoy bayndanne palamay baynda ba geeshsha kusheta pude dhoqqu histtidi woossana mala ta koyays.
054	1TI	002	009	Hessaththoka maccassati bonchchora bana shiishshi ekkidi bessiza may7o may7etto attiin ba hu7e daddi ekkidi woykko al7o may7o, worqqanne inqqu aaththidi walqqi walqqi gooppetto.
054	1TI	002	010	Gido attiin Xoos woossoos giza maccassati isttas ooththana bessiza lo7o ooson lo7etto.
054	1TI	002	011	Maccassi co7u gaada kumeththara azazeteth tamaaru.
054	1TI	002	012	Maccassi co7u gaanaappe attiin iza tamaarsana mala woykko adde bolla godatana mala ta koykke.
054	1TI	002	013	Gaasoykka koyro Addaamey medhettides; kaallada Hewaana medhettadus.
054	1TI	002	014	Qasseka koyro balettiday Addaame gidenna; balettada Xoossa wogaappe aadhdhiday maccassayo.
054	1TI	002	015	Gidikkoka maccassi ammanoninne siiqon geeshshateththan barkka bana haaron minniko naa yelon attana.
054	1TI	003	001	«Oonikka Woosa Keeththa cima gidana koykko lo7o ooso amottees» giza qaalay tuma.
054	1TI	003	002	Hessa gidikko Woosa Keeththe kaaleththizaadey borey bayndaade, issi machcha diza adde, ginara dizaade, bana haarizaade, wogara aqizaade, imath mokkizaade, tamaarsanaas dandayzaade,
054	1TI	003	003	maththottonttaade, oosh ooyettonttaade, qasse maarage as, asara palamettonttaade, miish gooddonttaade gidanaas bessees.
054	1TI	003	004	Ba nayta azazettizaytanne as bonchchizayta histti dichchidi ba keeththa asaa wogara ayssizaade gidanaas bessees.
054	1TI	003	005	Issaadey ba keeththa asaa wogara ayso erontta aggiko Xoossa Woosa Keeththe wostti naagana dandayzee?
054	1TI	003	006	Otoreteththan puuridi Xala7ey kundida pirdan izi kundontta mala oorath ammanizaade gidoppo.
054	1TI	003	007	Qasseka iza sunththan boretontta malanne Xala7e narxan izi gelontta mala ammanontta asaa achchan lo7o markkateththi daanaas koshshees.
054	1TI	003	008	Daaqonetikka hessaththo bonchchettidaytanne ba gida qaalaa laammi laammi yeggonttayta, daro woyne ushshas amottonttayta, ogey baynda go7a gooddonttayta gidanaas bessees.
054	1TI	003	009	Ammano xuura, lo7o qofara naaganaas bessees.
054	1TI	003	010	Haytantika koyrotti paacettetto; issi iitay istta bolla beettontta aggiko hessafe guye daaqoneteththan ooththetto.
054	1TI	003	011	Macca daaqonetikka bonchchettidayta, zigironttayta, qasse wogara dizayta, hano ubbaan ammanettidayta gidanaas bessees.
054	1TI	003	012	Daaqoneti issi machchi azina gidanaas bessees; qasseka ba naytanne ba keeththa asaa wogara ayssizayta gidanaas bessees.
054	1TI	003	013	Wogara ooththidayti baas gita bonchchonne Yesus Kirstoosan isttas diza ammanon daro xalateth demmana.
054	1TI	003	014	Ta neekko elle baana koykkoka hayta azazota nees xaafays.
054	1TI	003	015	Ta hanno nees xaafizay ta gam7izaa gidikkoka asay Xoossa Keeththan waani daanaakko ne erana mala gaadakko! Keeththay de7o Xoossaa Woosa Keeththa; hessika tumu tuussinne xapho.
054	1TI	003	016	Tumu Ayana duussa xuuray sidhey baynda gita; izikka, «Ase gidides; iza Xilloteththi Xillo Ayanan qonccides; kiitanchchatas beettides; dere ubbaas sabbakettides; alamen dizaytan ammanettides; bonchchora pude dendi bides» gizayssa.
054	1TI	004	001	Wode wurseththa bolla issi issi asay ammano aggidi baleththiza ayanatanne iita ayana timirte kaallanayssa Xillo Ayanay qonccera yootees.
054	1TI	004	002	Hessa mala timirtey istta qofay bonqo biratan xuugettida mala geellateththan doccida qoodheppe qommon haniza wordanchcha asatappe yaana.
054	1TI	004	003	He asati asay ekkontta malanne gelontta mala diggana; ammanizaytinne tumaa shaakki eriza asay Xoossi medhdhida kath galatarakka ekkizayti montta mala diggananne azazana.
054	1TI	004	004	Xoossi medhdhiday wurikka lo7o; asi galatara ekkiko wora wodhdhizay issinakka deenna.
054	1TI	004	005	Wurikka Xoossa qaalaninne woosan geeyana.
054	1TI	004	006	Hayssa ha azazoza ammaniza asaa ne qofsikko, ammano qaalaninne ne ekkida lo7o timirtezan minnada Yesus Kirstoosas lo7o oosanchcha gidandasa.
054	1TI	004	007	Xoos bonchchisontta go7ay baynda haysi7eppenne cima maccassata haysi7eppe haakkada tuma ayana oosos ne asateth giigsa.
054	1TI	004	008	Asateththaa asho ogen dosisoy guuththa wodes go7ees shin Tumu Ayana duussas bana tamaarsoy gidikko hayssa ha alamezassinne buro yaana duussaas hidotay diza gishshas ubbaas go7ees.
054	1TI	004	009	Hayssi ha qaalay ammanettidayssanne ubbay ekkanaas bessiza qaala.
054	1TI	004	010	Nu hessas giidi dafettoossinne daaburoos; hessika asa ubbaas harappeka ammanizaytas ashshiza de7o Xoossaan nu hidota ooththiza gishshassa.
054	1TI	004	011	Hayta yo7ota azazanne tamaarsa.
054	1TI	004	012	Ne yelagateththaa oonikka leqqofo; gido attiin neni haasayan, duussan, siiqon, ammanoninne geeshshateththan ammanizaytas lo7o leemiso gida.
054	1TI	004	013	Ta hee baana gakkanaas qaalaa nababanaas, zoranaassinne tamaarsanaas minna.
054	1TI	004	014	Cimati ne bolla ba kushe woththi woossishin, nees imettida tinbite imoteththaa leppi histta aggofa.
054	1TI	004	015	Asi wuri ne dichchaa beyana mala ha yo7ota lo7eththa minththada dandayan pola.
054	1TI	004	016	Ne duussaa gishshassinne ne tamaarsiza timirtezas naagetta; haytan minna; ne hessa ooththiko nenanne ne gizayssa siyizayta ashshana.
054	1TI	005	001	Cima asaa ne Aawaa mala bonchchora zora attiin dom7ofa; naateththa attuma nayta ne ishata mala xeella.
054	1TI	005	002	Hessaththoka cima maccassata ne aayi mala, naateththa maccassata qasse ne michcheta mala suure wozinappe xeella.
054	1TI	005	003	Addafe metotettida am7eta lo7eththa naaga.
054	1TI	005	004	Issi am7eys nay woykko naa nay dizaa gidikko he nayti baso asata maaddanaassinne bana yelidaytas kase istti ooththidayssa kushe zaaron harappe kasetidi ba ammano ooson bessanaassinne tamaaranaas bessees; hessika Xoos ufayssizayssa.
054	1TI	005	005	Qasse tumappe maadoy baynda barkka diza am7eya Xoos xalla xeellawus; woosassinne Xoossafe maado demmanaas gallassinne qamma minettawus.
054	1TI	005	006	Ha biittaa lo7o duus xalla koyza am7eya gidikko iza paxa dashe hayqqidaaro.
054	1TI	005	007	Oona bollaka wosoy dontta mala hayssa azazoza asas aaththa.
054	1TI	005	008	Issi asi ba dabbota harappeka baso asaa maaddonttayssa gidikko izi ammano kaddidaadenne ammanontta asappeka aadhdhi iita asa.
054	1TI	005	009	Izis layththay usuppun tammu layththafe garsan diza am7ey sunth am7eta mazgaban xaafoppa; qasseka iza kase issaade xalla gelidaaro gidanaas bessees.
054	1TI	005	010	Nayta dichoninne imaththa mokon, ammanizayta toho meechchan, metotidayta maadoninne lo7o ooso ubbaan bana aaththa immada lo7o oosonkka keeha erettidaaro gidanaas bessees.
054	1TI	005	011	Naateththa am7eta gidikko hessa mala mazgaban xaafoppa; gaasoykka isttas diza azinara daana amoy istti Kirstoosas ooththana gi gelida qaalaappe bollara aadhdhiza wode adde gelana koyeettes.
054	1TI	005	012	Istti kase caaqqida qaalaa miza gishshas he yo7ozan ba bolla pirda eheettes.
054	1TI	005	013	Hessafekka ooso ooththanaappe yuuyi yuuyi asa keeththe gelana doseettes; ooso ixo xalla gidontta haasayanaas bessonttayssa haasayshe zigirzaytanne koshshontta asa yo7o giddo coo woxxi gelizayta gideettes.
054	1TI	005	014	Hessa gishshas azinati hayqqida naateththa maccassati adde gelana mala, nayta yelana malanne baso as ayssana mala, morkkeyka istta bolla woththiza miishshe demmontta mala ta zorays.
054	1TI	005	015	Addaka hayssafe kase issi issi asati Xala7e kaallana guye sher7i gida.
054	1TI	005	016	Ammaniza maccassi oonikka baso asaa giddon am7eti dizaa gidikko Woosa Keeththi tumu am7eta xalla maaddana mala izakka ba baggara ba am7eta maaddu attiin Woosa Keeththas tooho gidana mala aggufu.
054	1TI	005	017	Woosa keeththaa lo7eththi ayssizayti harappeka sabbakoninne tamaarson minniza cimati gidikko dakko maado maadettanaas bessees.
054	1TI	005	018	Maxaafan, «Kath bukkiza boora doona qachchofa.» qasseka, «Ooso ooththizaadey damoza ekkana bessees» gees.
054	1TI	005	019	Nam7u markkay woykko heedzdzu markkay markkattontta dishin cima bolla shiiqiza mooto ekkofa.
054	1TI	005	020	Harati be7idi naagettana mala nagara ooththizayta asa ubbaa sinththan hanqa.
054	1TI	005	021	Xoossaninne Yesus Kirstoosan doorettida kiitanchchata sinththan hayta azazota oonakka maaddontta ne naagana malanne issi miishshika ta goorippe ziqqi dhoqqu histtontta mala ta nena hadara gays.
054	1TI	005	022	Xoossa oosos dooranaas, oona bollaka ne kushe woththa woossanaas eesotoppa; qasse haratara nagara ooththanaas zuppetoppa; nagarappe nena xilloteththan naaga.
054	1TI	005	023	Nena qanththan sakkizayssassinne ubba wode sakkiza sakoza gishshas woyne cajjefe guuth gujjada uya attiin hayssafe guye haaththe xalla uyoppa.
054	1TI	005	024	Issi issi asaa nagaray pirday yaanaappe kasetidi qonccees; baggayta nagaray gidikko pirdafe guye qonccees.
054	1TI	005	025	Lo7o oosoykka hessa mala qoncce; qoncconttay diikkoka qotetti attenna.
054	1TI	006	001	Xoossa sunththinne iza timirtey cayettontta mala aylleteththa qambara giddon dizayti wuri ba godaas kumeththa bonchchoy bessizayssa eretto.
054	1TI	006	002	Ammaniza godati diza ammaniza ashkarati godati isttas ishata gidida gishshas godatas bessiza bonchcho immetto; harappeka istta ooson maadettiza ammaniza godati isttas dosettidayta gidida gishshas nekka haytantta mala yo7ota tamaarsanaassinne zoranaas bessees.
054	1TI	006	003	Oonikka wordo timirte tamaarsiko Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa lo7o qaalanne Ayana tumateththaa minththiza timirtera gaaggonttayssa gidikko,
054	1TI	006	004	hessaadey otoreteththan kumidessinne aykkoka yuushshi qoppenna; issi issi qaalata gishshas palamettanaassinne ooyetanaas iita amoy izan dees; heytikka qanaateteth, oosh, cash, iita sidhe kaaleththeettes.
054	1TI	006	005	Tumay isttafe eketti gidiin Ayana ooson wodhe demmana misatiza asatanne qofa pace asata giddon gooshettidi duuxxontta oosh eheettes.
054	1TI	006	006	Gido attiin Tumu Ayana as gideththi nuus dizayssan woppu giidi duussara gita wodhe.
054	1TI	006	007	Gaasoykka nu hayssa ha alameza yishe aykkoka ekki yibeekko; bishekka qasse aykkoka ekki bookko.
054	1TI	006	008	Gido attiin nuus maanayssinne nu may7anayssi diikko gidana.
054	1TI	006	009	Dure gidanaas koyzayti gidikko gede paaceninne narxan gelidi oykettizayssa mala daro hadaninne iita amon un7etteettes.
054	1TI	006	010	Gaasoykka miishsha siiqoy iitateth ubbaas xapho; issi issi asati dure gidana giidi amottida amoppe dendidayssan ammano ogeppe balettidi haraso bidanne barkka bana daro meto giddo gelththida.
054	1TI	006	011	Nenoo Xoossa asoo! Ne hessa ubbaafe baqata; xilloteth, Tumu Ayanan duus, ammano, siiqo, dandayanne ashketeth kaalla.
054	1TI	006	012	Ammano baaxe lo7eththa baaxeta; daro markkatta sinththan lo7o ammaneteththan ne markkattidayssanne ne izas xeygettida mernaa de7oza lo7eththa oykka.
054	1TI	006	013	Ubbaasikka de7o immiza Xoossaa achchan hessaththoka Phanxoosa Philaxoosa sinththan tumaa markkattida Yesus Kirstoosa sinththan ta nena hadara gizay,
054	1TI	006	014	Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi qonccana gakkanaas nees imettida oosoza wosoy baynda ne polana mala bessees.
054	1TI	006	015	He qoncceththi anjjettidayssi barkka ubbaa haarizayssinne kawota kawoy, godatas Goday izi ba woden bessana.
054	1TI	006	016	Izi xalla hayqqonttayssa; oonikka shiiqanaas dandayontta poo7o giddon dees; iza be7ida asi oonikka baa; beyana dandayzaadeyka deenna; izas wolqqaynne bonchchoy mernaappe mernaas gido. Amiin.
054	1TI	006	017	Hayssa ha alamezan duretidayti otorettontta mala azaza; nu ufayettana mala wursika darssi tirfisidi nuus immiza Xoossaan attiin ammanththontta miishshaan ammanettontta mala asaas yoota.
054	1TI	006	018	Lo7o ooththana malanne lo7o ooson dureta gidana mala, kiyatanne shaakki immanaas dosizayta gidana mala asaa azaza.
054	1TI	006	019	Hessaththoka tumu gidida de7o demmana mala buroppe yaana wodes asay mino xapho gidiza haaro baas shiishshana.
054	1TI	006	020	Ximtoosaa! Ne hadara ekkidayssa wursa naaga; Xoossaa bonchchisontta hada doona lom7ulom7afenne wordo erateth geetettiza asi baappe medhdhi kessida timirtefe haakka.
054	1TI	006	021	Nuus hessa mala erateththi dees giza issi issi asati hessaththo ooson ammano ogeppe balettida; Xoossa kiyateththi inttenara gido.
#
# BOOK	055	2TI	2 Timothy	2Ximtoosas
055	2TI	001	001	Yesus Kirstoosara issifeteththan diza de7o hidota qaala gishshas yootana mala Xoossa shenen Yesus Kirstoosa Hawaare gidida Phawuloosappe,
055	2TI	001	002	dosettida ta naa Ximtoosas kiyateththi, maaroteththinne saroteththi Xoossaa Aawappe Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe nees gido.
055	2TI	001	003	Pacey baynda gallassinne qamma ne gishshas woosan qofsashe kase Aawati ooththida mala geeshsha wozinara ta goynniza Xoossaa ta galatays.
055	2TI	001	004	Kase ne afunththaa qoppa ekkada ta nena beyada ufayettana laamotays.
055	2TI	001	005	Qoodheppe qommon gidontta ne ammanoza ta qoppays; he ammanoykka koyro ne aayey aayin Loydininne qasseka ne aayeyin Ewonqen dees; ha7i qasse ne bolla dizayssaka ta eradis.
055	2TI	001	006	Hessa gishshas tani ta kushe ne bolla woththiin ne ekkidayssa ne bolla diza Xoossa imotaa ne denththeththana mala ta nena qofsays.
055	2TI	001	007	Xoossi nuus nuni nu hu7e haaranaas Xoossa wolqqa eranaassinne siiqettana Ayana immides attiin babo ayana immibeenna.
055	2TI	001	008	Hessa gishshas Godaa gishshas markkattanaas woykko Godaa gishshas qashettida tanan yeellatoppa; gido attiin Xoossa wolqqara mishiraachcho qaalaa gishshas ne tanara meto ekka.
055	2TI	001	009	Nu aykkoka ooththida gishshas gidontta dishin ba qofaa malanne ba kiyateththaa mala nuna ashshidessinne nuna baas dummasidi xeygides. He iza kiyateththi mernaa wodeppe kase Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nuus imettides.
055	2TI	001	010	Ha7i qasse izi hayqo ubbaa dhayssidi mishiraachcho qaalaa baggara nuna poo7on kessida nu dhale Yesus Kirstoosa yuussaan qonccides.
055	2TI	001	011	Tanikka hayssa ha mishiraachcho qaalaa yootizaade, kiitettidaadenne astamaare gidada shuumettadis.
055	2TI	001	012	Tani meto be7izaykka hessa gishshassa; gidikkoka ta oona ammanizaakko tani ta ammanizaade shaakka eriza gishshas izan yeellatikke. Ta izas immida hadaraa he gallassiya gakkanaas izi naaganaas dandayzayssa ta shaakka eradis.
055	2TI	001	013	Ne taappe siyida timirteza Yesus Kirstoosara issifeteththan diza ammanoninne siiqon leemiso histta oykka.
055	2TI	001	014	Nees imettida lo7o hadaraa nunan diza Xillo Ayanan naaga.
055	2TI	001	015	Iisiya awuraajja giddon dizayti wurikka tana aggidayssa ne eraasa; Filgoosinne Hermogeneesi tana aggida asaara deettes.
055	2TI	001	016	Henesifoore soo asaa Goday maaro; ays giikko izi tana daro wode minththeththidessinne tani sansalatan qashetta dishin tana be7idi yeellatibeenna.
055	2TI	001	017	Harappeka izi Oroome yida wode tana koyi koyidi demmides.
055	2TI	001	018	Wurseththa pirda gallas Goday iza pirdafe ashsho; izi tana Efesoonen ay mala maaddidaakko ne lo7eththa eraasa.
055	2TI	002	001	Hessa gishshas ta naazoo neni Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththan minna.
055	2TI	002	002	Daro markkatta sinththan ne taappe siyidayssa harata tamaarsanaas dandayzaytassinne ammanettida asatas hadara imma.
055	2TI	002	003	Yesus Kirstoosas ammanettida lo7o wottadara mala tanara meto ekka.
055	2TI	002	004	Wottadarateththan ooththizaadey ba halaqaa ufayssanaas dafettees attiin hara bana qaxeththiza ooson geli erenna.
055	2TI	002	005	Hessaththoka gaadde woxxizaadey woththa woga naagontta woxxiko xoono akilile ekkenna.
055	2TI	002	006	Gooba goshshanchchay ba goyi kessida kaththa xeera mizaade gidanaas bessees.
055	2TI	002	007	Ta nees gizayssa ne wozinan woththa siyikko Goday nees yo7o ubbaan akeeka immana.
055	2TI	002	008	Hayqoppe dendida Dawite zereth gidida Yesus Kirstoosa qoppa; ta yootiza mishiraachcho qaalaykka hessa.
055	2TI	002	009	Hessa gaason iita ooththida asa mala qashettana gakkanaas waaye beyays; gido attiin Xoossa qaalay qashettenna.
055	2TI	002	010	Hessa gishshas Kirstoosa baggara diza atoteththinne mernaa bonchcho demmana doorettidayta gishshas gaada wursaka dandayadis.
055	2TI	002	011	«Nu izara issife hayqqiko nu izara de7on daana.
055	2TI	002	012	Dandayan minniko nu izara kawotana. Nu iza kaddiko izikka nuna kaddana.
055	2TI	002	013	Nu izas ammanettonttayta gidikko izi mernaas ammanettida mala daana. Izi barkka bana kaddana dandayenna» geetettida qaalay ammanettidayssa.
055	2TI	002	014	Hayta ha yo7ota gishshas asaa qofso aggofa; asay ba giddon issoy issaara qaalaa gaason palamettontta mala Xoossa sunththan zora; hessa mala yo7oy siyizayta moorees.
055	2TI	002	015	Tumu Xoossaa qaala yootizaade, yeellachchontta oosanchchanne asi ne gishshas lo7o markkattizaade gidada nenateththaa wursa Xoossa sinth shiishshanaas minna.
055	2TI	002	016	Coo mela doona lallabeteththafe haakka; hessa mala yo7on waaxettida asati Xoossafe haakki haakki beettes.
055	2TI	002	017	Istta timirtey sakkidi paxontta gede gujji gujji daaketti biza madunththa mala; Hemenewoosinne Qasse Filxoosa geetettizayti hessa mala timirte tamaarzayta giddon deettes.
055	2TI	002	018	Heyti tumateththafe haakkidi coo mela waayeettes; isttika, «Hayqoppe denththi hayssafe kase hani aadhdhides» giidi issi issi asaa ammano shiri yeggeettes.
055	2TI	002	019	Gido attiin, «Goday baas gidizayta erees.» Qasseka, «Godaa sunth xeygizay wuri iitappe haakko» giza maatamey iza bolla diza laamettontta Xoossaa yochchay laamettibeenna.
055	2TI	002	020	Issi gita keeththan worqqafenne birappe xalla gidontta miththafenne urqqafe oosettidayti dizayssaththo heytanttafekka baggayti bonchcho oosos, baggayti qasse hiraysso oosos eketteettes.
055	2TI	002	021	Hessa gishshas oonikka hayta ta gida iita yo7otappe bana geeshshiko; hessaadey bonchcho oosos gidizaadenne anjjettidaade; Godaa go7izaadenne lo7o oosos giigettidaade gidana.
055	2TI	002	022	Panththateththa iita amoteththafe baqata; geeshsha wozinara Godaa xeygiza asatara xilloteth, ammano, siiqonne saroteth kaalla.
055	2TI	002	023	Go7aynne hidotay baynda eeyata palamappe haakka; gaasoykka hessantta malay oosh kaaleththizayssa ne eraasa.
055	2TI	002	024	Godaa oosanchchay asara ooyettanaas bessenna; hessafe bollara asa ubbaa achchan kiya, as tamaarsanaas dandayzaadenne mino as gidanaas bessees.
055	2TI	002	025	Izi banara eqettiza asata ashketeththara oykkizaade gidanaas bessees; oonee erizay istti tumaa erana mala Xoossi isttas maarettanaas wode immana dandayees.
055	2TI	002	026	Hessika istti yuushshi qoppi simmidi iza shene kunththana mala istta di7i efida Xala7e narxafe istti kessi ekkana.
055	2TI	003	001	Gido attiin wode wurseththan as metiza wodey yaanayssa ne era.
055	2TI	003	002	Asay bana dosizaade gidana; miish siiqizayta, banan ceeqettizayta, otoranchchata, cashshanchchata, bana yelidaytas azazettonttayta, galatonttaytanne geeshshateththi bayndayta,
055	2TI	003	003	siiqoy bayndayta, atto gi maaronttayta, asa sunth moorizayta, barkka bana haaronttayta, menxe iitata, lo7o miish dosonttayta,
055	2TI	003	004	kaddizayta, naagettonttayta, coo mela otoreteththan kumidayta, Xoossafe aaththidi lo7o deeth dosizayta gidana.
055	2TI	003	005	Ammaniza as misatana shin ammanos diza wolqqaa kaddana; heyta malatappe ne haakka.
055	2TI	003	006	Heytantti issi issi keeththe kalxi gelidi daro deexo nagaraninne dumma dumma iita amoteththa gars gelidi yaanne haa qaaxxiza ammanon laafa maccassata qaxi oykkeettes.
055	2TI	003	007	Heyta mala maccassati ubba wode tamaareettes shin tumaa erettenna.
055	2TI	003	008	Iyaneessinne Iyanbaraasi Muse bolla dendida mala haytikka istta qofay moorettiin baas ammanoppe kundida gishshas tumateth ixxeettes.
055	2TI	003	009	Gido attiin istta qofay kumenna; gaasoykka Iyaneesanne Iyanbaraasa eeyateththi asaas qonccida malakka hayta hanoykka ubbaas qonccana.
055	2TI	003	010	Ne gidikko ta timirteza, ta duussaa, ta waanna qofaa, ta ammanoza, ta dandayaa, ta siiqozanne ta minoteththaa ubbaa eraasa.
055	2TI	003	011	Ta goodeteththaanne ta waayeza Anxokiyan, Iqoniyooninne Listtirankka ta bolla gakkidayssa ubbaa tani dandayan ekkidayssa ne eraasa; gidikkoka Goday hessa ubbaafe tana ashshides.
055	2TI	003	012	Tumappe Yesus Kirstoosa geeshsha wozinappe ammani daana gizayti wurikka goodettizayta gidana.
055	2TI	003	013	Iita gidida baleththiza asati baas balettidi asaa baleththishe iitateththaa bolla iitateth gujji gujji baana.
055	2TI	003	014	Ne gidikko kase ne tamaarada erida ogen minna; hessa oonappe tamaardaakko ne eraasa.
055	2TI	003	015	Ne guuththa naateththafe ha7i gakkanaas Yesus Kirstoosa ammanon atoteththi beettiza timirte immiza Geeshsha Maxaafata lo7eththa eradasa.
055	2TI	003	016	Geeshsha Maxaafati wurikka Xoossa Ayanay kaaleththiin xaafettidayta; isttika as tamaarsanaas, hanqanaas, suurisanaas qasseka xilloteththa ogen kaaleththanaas go7eettes.
055	2TI	003	017	Hessika Xoossa asi lo7o ooso ubbaas bessizaade gidana malassa.
055	2TI	004	001	Xoossa sinththaninne hessaththoka paxa dizayta bollanne hayqqidayta bolla pirdanaas diza Yesus Kirstoosa sinththan iza qoncceththaanne iza kawoteththaa qofara hayssa nees hadara gays.
055	2TI	004	002	Qaalaa sabbaka; nees giigiin woykko giigontta aggiin neni ne baggara giigetta utta; daro dandayara tamaarson asaa suurisa; hanqanne zora.
055	2TI	004	003	Gaasoykka asay wuri suure gidida timirte ekkontta ixxana wodey yaana; hessafe bollara asay ba amora gaaggizayssa istta hayththi siyana koyzayssa xalla isttas yootana mala bana tamaarsana daro astamaareta ba ach shiishshana.
055	2TI	004	004	Tumaa siyanaappe ba hayth haraso zaaridi haysi7e bagga simmana.
055	2TI	004	005	Neni gidikko haniza yo7o ubbaan loddu ga; meto dandaya; mishiraachcho qaalaa yooto nees ooso histta; ne oosozakka pola.
055	2TI	004	006	Ta qasse yarshettanaas mata uttadis; hayssa ha alamezappe shaaketta buussa wodey taas gakkides.
055	2TI	004	007	Lo7o baaxe ta baaxetadis; ta woxxana woth wursadis; ammanokka naagadis.
055	2TI	004	008	Sinththafe taas akililey giigi uttides; hessika xilloteththa; hessaka tumu pirdiza Goday he gallas taas immana; hessika taas xalla gidontta iza yuussaa laamotizaytas ubbaasikka immana.
055	2TI	004	009	Taakko elela yaanaas nees dandayettida mala ooththa.
055	2TI	004	010	Deemaasi hayssa alameza siiqidi tana yeggi aggidi Tasolonqe bides. Qarqisi Galatiya bides; Titoosi gede Dalmaaxiya bides.
055	2TI	004	011	Luqaasi xalla tanara dees; Marqoosi tana ooson maaddiza gishshas iza nenara ekka ya.
055	2TI	004	012	Tiqiqoosa Efesoone yeddadis.
055	2TI	004	013	Ne haa yashe ta Xiro7aadan Karpuse achchan woththida ta Maaqanne maxaafata harappeka galban xaafettida maxaafata taas ekka ya.
055	2TI	004	014	Xarqimala qoxxiza Iskindiroosi ta bolla daro qoho gaththides shin Goday izas iza ooso mala immana.
055	2TI	004	015	Izi nu yootiza qaalaa keehi ixxides; nekka izappe naagetta.
055	2TI	004	016	Tana mootiza yo7ozas koyro tana ashshana markka ta shiishshiin oonikka tana maaddana yibeenna; gido attiin wurikka tana yeggidi bida. Hessaka istta bolla Xoossi qoho histti qoodoppo.
055	2TI	004	017	Gido attiin qaalaa kiitay ta baggara kumeth yootettana malanne dere asay wuri siyana mala Goday ta achchan eqqidi tana minththides; Gaammo doonappeka tana ashshides.
055	2TI	004	018	Goday iita yo7o ubbaafe tana ashshana; gede ba salo kawoteththas tana sarora gaththana; izas mernaappe mernaa gakkanaas bonchchoy gido. Amiin.
055	2TI	004	019	Phirsiqillas, Aqilas, Henesifoore soo asaasikka ta sarokaa gaththa.
055	2TI	004	020	Erisxoosi Qorontoosen attides; Xirofomoosi sakettida gishshas iza ta Miliixen aggadis.
055	2TI	004	021	Balgoy gakkanaappe sinththetada taakko haa gakkanaas nees dandayettida mala ooththa. Ewuguloosi, Phudeesi, qasseka Linoosi, Qilawudiyaynne ammanizayti wurikka nena saro saro gida.
055	2TI	004	022	Goday nenara gido; Godaa kiyateththi inttenara gido.
#
# BOOK	056	TIT	Titus	Titoosas
056	TIT	001	001	Xoossas doorettidayta ammanoninne Tumu Ayanan kaaleththiza tumaa erateththan dichchana mala Xoossa ayllenne Yesus Kirstoosa Hawaare gidida Phawuloosappe,
056	TIT	001	002	iza ammanoynne erateththay kaseppe oykkidi wordotontta Goday daro wodeppe kase ba immida mernaa de7o hidota mala.
056	TIT	001	003	Izi kase gida wodey gakkida mala nuna ashshida Xoossaa azazon taas sabbakanaas imettida hara baggara Xoossi ba qaalaa qonccisides.
056	TIT	001	004	Nuus koththe gidida ammano issifeteththaan, ammanon taas tumu naa gidida Titoosas, «Xoossaa Aawappenne nuna ashshida Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththinne saroteththi nees gido» gides.
056	TIT	001	005	Ta nena Qarxeesen aggiday buroppe giigana bessiza daro miishshi diza gishshas ne giigsanaassinne ta nena azazida mala katamay dizason Woosa Keeththa cimata ne dooranaassa.
056	TIT	001	006	Cimateththan doorettanayti istta bolla wosoy bayndayta, issi machchi azinata, nayti ammanizaytanne waayisonttayta woykko azazettiza nayta aawata gidetto.
056	TIT	001	007	Woosa keeththa cimay Xoossas ooththana hadara ekkidaade gidida mala iza bolla wosoy bayndaade gidanaas bessees; hessika ceeqettizaade, guuththa miishshan yiillotizaadenne maththottizaade, ushshanchchanne izas bessontta ogera go7a gididaaz gooddi ekki bizaade gidanaas bessenna.
056	TIT	001	008	Hessafe bollara izi imath mokkizaade, lo7o ooso dosizaade, barkka bana haarizaade, suure as, xillonne baas naagettizaade gidanaas bessees.
056	TIT	001	009	Hara asata lo7o timirten minththeththizaadenne he lo7o timirteza ixxizayta hanqanaas ba tamaarda mala qaalaan minnizaade gidanaas bessees.
056	TIT	001	010	Waayisizaytinne doonan xalla baleththizayti daroti deettes; harappeka heyti qaxxarettida Ayhuda asatappe ammanida asata baggata.
056	TIT	001	011	Heytantta co7u histteth bessees; gaasoykka istti bessontta ogera baas go7a demmanaas bessontta timirte tamaarson keeththa asaa wursi mooron deettes.
056	TIT	001	012	Istta nabetappe issaadey istta gishshas haasayshe, «Qarxeese asay ubba wode wordanchchata, iita do7ata, ganjamatanne azallata» gides.
056	TIT	001	013	He markkateththay tuma; hessa gishshas ne istta lo7eththa hanqetta; gaasoykka isttas tumu ammanoy daana malanne,
056	TIT	001	014	Ayhudata haysi7e woykko tumu yo7oppe haakkida asata azazo istti siyontta malassa.
056	TIT	001	015	Geeshshatas miishshi wurikka geeshsha shin tunatassinne ammanonttaytas gidikko wurikka tuna; harappeka istta qofay wurikka tunides.
056	TIT	001	016	Istti bana nuni Xoos eroos geettes shin ba hanoteththaan gidikko kaddeettes; istti harassizayta, azazettonttaytanne lo7o oosos bessonttayta.
056	TIT	002	001	Neni gidikko asaa tumu gididaaz tamaarsa.
056	TIT	002	002	Cima asay wozinama, bonchchettidayta, bana barkka haarizayta, ammanoninne siiqon, dandayankka lo7o gidana mala ne istta zora.
056	TIT	002	003	Hessaththoka cima maccassati ba diza duussan bonchchora dizaytanne lo7o hanoteth asa tamaarsizayta gidetto attiin asa sunth iissizayta woykko woyne cajje ushsha suuken waaxettidayta gidontta mala istta tamaarsa.
056	TIT	002	004	Hessaththo ooththiko naateththa maccassati ba azinatanne ba nayta dosana mala tamaarsanaas dandayeettes.
056	TIT	002	005	Xoossa qaalay oona achchanka cayettontta mala istti barkka bana haarizaytanne geeshshata, keeththa giddon istta oosoy oykkidaytanne asas kiyata, ba azinatas azazettizayta gidana mala cima maccassati istta tamaarsetto.
056	TIT	002	006	Hessaththoka yelaga attumasay barkka bana haarana mala ne istta zora.
056	TIT	002	007	Ay hanonkka ne asas lo7o leemiso gida; neni asaa tamaarsiza timirteza nenikka wozinappe tamaarsizaadenne naagizaade gida.
056	TIT	002	008	Nu gishshas iita haasayza asay haasayanaas iita demmontta aggidi yeellatana mala ne haasayza haasaya giddon borso yo7oy dooppo.
056	TIT	002	009	Aylleti aazankka ba godatas haarettana malanne ufayssana mala; qasseka awute zaarontta mala tamaarsa.
056	TIT	002	010	Hanizaazan ubbaan nuna ashshida Xoossa timirtey dosettana mala istti lo7o markkateth bessana mala ba godata miish kaysotoppetto.
056	TIT	002	011	Asas izappe maaroy beettiza Xoossa kiyateththi asa ubbaas qonccides.
056	TIT	002	012	He kiyateththika nuni nagaran duussinne ha alame amoteththaa kaddidi hayssa ha wodezan nurkka nuna haaridinne xilloteththan Tumu Ayana duus daanayssa nuna tamaarssees.
056	TIT	002	013	Hessika nuus anjjettida hidota gidida wogga Xoossaanne nuna ashshida Yesus Kirstoosa bonchchoy qonccanayssa naaganaassa.
056	TIT	002	014	Izikka nuna iitateththaafe wozzanaassinne lo7o ooththanaas minniza ba dere baas dooranaas bana nuus aaththi immides.
056	TIT	002	015	Hessa gishshas ne tamaarsanayti heytantta; hessaka ne kumeththa godateththara zoranne hanqa; nena oonikka leqqofo.
056	TIT	003	001	Asay dere ayssizaytas haarettana malanne lo7o gidida miish wursi ooththanaas giiga gidana mala asaa qofsa.
056	TIT	003	002	Qasseka oonikka asa bolla iita haasayontta malanne lo7o asa gidana mala asa ubbaas kumeththa wozinappe ba ashketeth bessana mala ubbaa qofsa.
056	TIT	003	003	Nunikka kase qofay bayndayta, azazettonttayta, balettizayta, dumma dumma amoninne lo7o duussas aylleteththan haarettizayta; asaranne nurkka nu garsankka ooyettishe iitateththaninne miqqayneteththan doos.
056	TIT	003	004	Gido attiin nuna ashshida Xoossaa kiyateththinne iza siiqoy qonccida wode nu ooththida Xilloteththaan gidontta dishin iza maaroteththa daron attidos; izi nuna ashshiday nam7anththo yeleteth gidida meechchaninne Xillo Ayanan ooraxeteththanna.
056	TIT	003	006	Hessaka Xillo Ayanay nu bolla nu Godaa Xoossi nuna ashshida Yesus Kirstoosa baggara darssi gussides.
056	TIT	003	007	Hessika nu iza kiyateththan xillidi mernaa de7o hidota oykkidi laattizayta gidanaassa.
056	TIT	003	008	Hessika ammanettida qaala; Xoossaa ammanizayti lo7o oosos bana aaththi immana mala hayssa wursa ne lo7eththa yootana mala ta koyays; hessika lo7onne ay asikka koyzaaza.
056	TIT	003	009	Qasseka hada palamappenne asay ba qommo qoodizaazappe, marshefenne woga gishshas dendiza ooshshafe ne haakka; heytantti go7ay baynda paththontta yo7o.
056	TIT	003	010	Asa giddon shaaketeth medhdhiza asi issito nam7uto ne zoriin ekkontta ixxiko izaadera nees issifeteththi dooppo.
056	TIT	003	011	Hessa mala asi balettida nagaranchcha asa; izaadey barkka ba bolla pirdidayssa ne era.
056	TIT	003	012	Arximoone woykko Tiqiqoosa ta neekko kiittiko ne taakko Niqopholiyoone yaanaas nees dandayettizaaz wursa ooththa; tani ha layththa balgo heen aaththana gaada qachchadis.
056	TIT	003	013	Woga eriza Zeemaasinne Aphiloosi bishin isttas koshshizaaz wursa kunththa maadda.
056	TIT	003	014	Nu baggatas hachchis hachchis istta koshshizaaz istti demmana malanne istta deeththay go7ay bayndaaz gidontta mala istti lo7o ooso ooththi minnana mala tamaaranaas koshshees.
056	TIT	003	015	Tanara dizayti inttena saro geettes; ammano gaason nuna siiqizayta ubbaa saro giite; Xoossa kiyateththi inttenara gido.
#
# BOOK	057	PHM	Philemon	Pilmoonas
057	PHM	001	001	Yesus Kirstoosa gishshas qashettida taappe Phawuloosappenne nu ishaa Ximtoosappe nu siiqo ishaa gididi nunara issife ooththiza Pilmoonas,
057	PHM	001	002	ne keeththan shiiqiza ammaniza asaassinne nu michcheyo Ampibyas qasseka nunara issife Kirstoosa wottadara gidida Arkiphaases,
057	PHM	001	003	Nu Aawaa Xoossaafe nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.
057	PHM	001	004	Tani ta woosan nena qoppashe ubba wode Xoossaa galatays.
057	PHM	001	005	Gaasoykka ne Xoossa asaa siiqizayssanne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosan ne ammanizayssa ta siyadis.
057	PHM	001	006	Nuni Kirstoosas gididayssanne nuus diza lo7o yo7oy wuri qonccen erettana mala nenikka ne ammano hara asas bessana mala ta nees minna woossays.
057	PHM	001	007	Ta ishazoo! Ne hanon Xoossa asaa wozinay ooraxida gishshas ne siiqoy ta wozina keehi minththides.
057	PHM	001	008	Hessa gishshas ne ooththanaas bessizayssa ooththana mala nena azazanaas taas Kirstoosan xalateththi deesikoshin.
057	PHM	001	009	Gidikkoka ta nena azazanaappe siiqora woossays; gaasoykka tani Yesus Kirstoosa gishshas qashettada qasho keeththan diza Phawuloosa.
057	PHM	001	010	Ta nena woossizay tani qasho keeththan dashe Yesus Kirstoosan yelida naa Anasmoosa gishshassa.
057	PHM	001	011	Anasmoosi hayssafe kase nena go7ibeenna shin ha7i gidikko izi nenakka tanakka go7izaade.
057	PHM	001	012	Ta ha7i iza neekko zaara yeddadis; tani neekko yeddizay iza gidontta ta wozina neekko zaara yeddiza mala qoodays.
057	PHM	001	013	Mishiraachcho qaalaa gaason ta haan qashetta dishin ne tana ooththa maaddanayssa izi tanara de7idaakko tana ufayssees.
057	PHM	001	014	Gido attiin ne lo7o oosoy ne dosanpe attiin wolqqara gidontta mala gaada nena oychchontta aykkoka ooththana koyabeekke.
057	PHM	001	015	Anasmoosi hanno gakkanaas neeppe guuththa wode shaakettikokka oonee erizay hayssafe guye ubba wode nenara daana dandayees.
057	PHM	001	016	Hayssafe guye izi nenara daanay aylle mala gidontta ayllefe aadhdhi nees asho isha mala gidana; izi taas dosettida isha; gido attiin izi nena ooththi go7ana as gidida gishshassinne izi nees Kirstoosa baggara isha gidida gishshas nees keehi dosettidaade gidana.
057	PHM	001	017	Nuus diza issifeteththaa gaason ne tana nees isha mala qoodizaa gidikko tana ne mokka ekkiza mala izakka mokka ekka.
057	PHM	001	018	Izi ne bolla gaththida qohoy diikko woykko ne acoy iza bolla diikko iza acoza ta bolla qooda.
057	PHM	001	019	Hekko ta Phawuloosi, «Iza acoza ta nees qanxxana» gaada ta kushera xaafadis; gidikkoka ne Kirstoosa ammaniday ta baggara gidida gishshas haray attoshin nekka taas qanxxana acoy dizaade gididayssa ta nena erisanaas koshshenna.
057	PHM	001	020	Hi7a ta ishazoo! Hessa lo7o ooso ne taas ooththana mala Godaa sunththan Kirstoosa gishshas gaada ne ta wozina shempisana mala ta nena woossays.
057	PHM	001	021	Ta nees hayssa xaafiday ne taas azazettanayssa ammanadakko! Ta nena oychchidayssafe ne aaththa ooththanayssa ta erays.
057	PHM	001	022	Xoossi intte woosaa siyidi ta intteko baana mala taas hidotay diza gishshas ta baada inttekon shempanaaso hayyana taas giigsa.
057	PHM	001	023	Yesus Kirstoosa gaason tanara qashettida Ephafiray nena saro gees.
057	PHM	001	024	Hessaththoka tanara ooththizayti Marqoosi Arsixirokoosi, Deemaasinne Luqaasi nena saro geettes.
057	PHM	001	025	Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththi inttenara gido.
#
# BOOK	058	HEB	Hebrews	Ibraawe Asaas
058	HEB	001	001	Beni wodeppe oykkidi Xoossi dumma dumma ogera nabeta baggara kase nu Aawatas daro wode yootides.
058	HEB	001	002	Qasse hayssa wurseththa wode bolla wursi laatissidaadenne ha alameza medhdhida ba naaza baggara nuus yootides.
058	HEB	001	003	Izikka Xoossa bonchcho bessizaadenne Xoossa Xoossateththaas lo7o leemiso gididi ba wolqqama qaalan wursika shiishshi oykkides; izi asaa nagarappe geeshshidaappe guye salon bonchcho Xoossaa ushachchan uttides.
058	HEB	001	004	Hessa gishshas izas imettida sunththay kiitanchchata sunththaafe aadhdhizayssa mala izikka kiitanchchatappe keehi aadhdhees.
058	HEB	001	005	Xoossi kiitanchchafe, «Neni ta naa; ta nena hach yeladis. Woykko ta izas Aawaa gidana; izikka ta naa gidana» oonas gidee?
058	HEB	001	006	Qasseka Xoossi ba bayra Naaza duge ha biittaa bolla yeddishe, «Xoossa kiitanchchati wurikka izas goynnetto» gides.
058	HEB	001	007	Kiitanchchata gishshas haasayshe qasse, «Kiitanchchata ayanata; ba oosanchchatakka tama laco kessees» gides.
058	HEB	001	008	Naaza gishshas qasse, «Godoo! Ne zufaaney mernaappe mernaa gakkanaas minni daana; neni ne kawoteththaa likke kaaleththaasa.
058	HEB	001	009	Neni xilloteth dosadasa; makkallaka ixxaasa; hessa gishshas Xoossi ne Goday nena ne laggetappe bolla kessides; nena ufayssa zayte tiydes» gees.
058	HEB	001	010	Qasse, «Godoo! Koyro neni biitta medhdhadasa; Salotikka ne kushen oosettida.
058	HEB	001	011	Istti dhayana; neni gidikko minna daana; istti wurikka may7o mala gal7ana.
058	HEB	001	012	Neni istta may7o mala qalam7ana; isttika may7o mala laamettana; ne gidikko aydekka neni nena; ne duussas wurseththi deenna» gees.
058	HEB	001	013	Xoossi kiitanchchatappe, «Tani ne morkketa ne toho garsan yedhisana gakkanaas ne ta ushachchan utta» oona gidee?
058	HEB	001	014	Kiitanchchati wurikka atoteth laattana asata ooththanaas Xoossafe kiitettiza oosanchcha Ayana gidettennee?
058	HEB	002	001	Hessa gishshas nuni siyida qaalaappe balettidi kundontta mala nu siyida qaalaa lo7eththi naaganaas bessees.
058	HEB	002	002	Aazas giikko kase kiitanchchata baggara yootettida qaalay tumu gidida he qaalaa yedhdhi aadhdhiday baas bessiza qixaate ekkees.
058	HEB	002	003	Nu qasse hessa mala gita maaroteth coo leppi histtiko waani attanee? Hayssi maaroteththay koyro Godaa baggara nuus yootettides; izappe siyidaytikka nuus geeshshi yootida.
058	HEB	002	004	Xoossi qasseka malaatata, malalisiza miishshata, dumma dumma malaatata oosoninne ba shene mala immida Xillo Ayana imotata baggara istta markkateththaa minththides.
058	HEB	002	005	Xoossi hayssa nu iza gishshas haasayza buro yaana alameza kiitanchchas haarisibeenna.
058	HEB	002	006	Gido attiin Geeshsha Maxaafay harason, «Ne izas yuushsha qoppanaas asi aazee? Izas ne qoppanaas asa nay izi aazee?
058	HEB	002	007	Ne iza kiitanchchatappe guuththara guuththadasa. Bonchcho zawudenne galata iza hu7en woththadasa. Neni iza ne kushe oosota bolla shuumadasa.
058	HEB	002	008	Ne wursaka iza toho garsan haarisadasa; Xoossi ubbaaka izappe garsara izas haarisishin attiday ay miishshika deenna. Gido attiin ha7i qasse wurikka izas haarettishin nu beyibeekko» gides.
058	HEB	002	009	Gido attiin Xoossa kiyateththan asa ubbaa gishshas hayqqanaas kiitanchchatappe guuththa wode guuxxida Yesusi waaye hayqo hayqqidi ha7i bonchchonne galata zawude ba hu7en woththidayssa nu beyoos.
058	HEB	002	010	Hanizay wurikka izappe izas medhettida Xoossi daro nayta bonchchos efanaas istta maaroteththas hu7e gidida Yesusi waayen polanaas koshshizaaz gidides.
058	HEB	002	011	As geeshshizaynne izan geeyza asay heyti issi keeththa asata. Hessa gishshas Yesusi istta, «Ta ishatoo» gi xeyganaas yeellatenna.
058	HEB	002	012	«Tani ne sunththan ta ishatas yootana shiiqida dereza sinththan nena galatiza mazamure ta yexxana.»
058	HEB	002	013	Hessaththoka, «Ta izan ammanettana» qasseka, «Taninne taas Xoossi immida nayti nu haan doos» gees Geeshsha Maxaafay.
058	HEB	002	014	Naytas ashoynne suuththi diza mala izikka istta mala asa; hessika hayqo bolla izas wolqqay diza daabulosa izi ba hayqo wolqqan zaaranaassa.
058	HEB	002	015	Hessaththoka ba diza wode ubbaan hayqos babon haaretti qashettidayta hayqoppe wozzanaassa.
058	HEB	002	016	Izi haa yiday kiitanchchata maaddanaas gidontta Abrahaame zereththata maaddanaas yides.
058	HEB	002	017	Hessa gishshas ubba baggara izi ba ishata misatanaas bessizaade gidides; izi hessa ooththiday maarizaadenne ammanettida waanna qeese halaqa gididi Xoossas ooththanaassinne dereza nagarappe maaranaassa.
058	HEB	002	018	Izi ba hu7en paacettidi meto ekkida gishshas paacettizayta maaddanaas dandayees.
058	HEB	003	001	Hessa gishshas saloppe xeyssi inttena gakkiin ammaniza nu ishatoo! Nu ammanos Hawaarenne qeeseta halaqa gidida Yesusa qopite.
058	HEB	003	002	Musey Xoossa Keeth ubbaa bolla ammanettidaade gidida mala Yesusikka bana shuumidaades ammanettidaade.
058	HEB	003	003	Keeththe keexxidaades keeththaafe bollara bonchchoy diza mala Yesusaska Museppe aadhdhiza bonchchoy bessizaade gidanaas bessees.
058	HEB	003	004	Keeththe ubbaasikka keexxidaadey dees; gido attiin wursika ooththiday Xoossa.
058	HEB	003	005	Musey tinbite markkattishe Xoossa Keeth ubba bolla issi ammanettida oosanchcha mala gidi de7ides.
058	HEB	003	006	Kirstoosi gidikko Xoossa Keeththaa bolla ammanettida naa mala. Nunikka iza bolla ammanettiza ufayssaynne ceeqettiza hidotaa lo7eththi oykkiko nu izas duussa keeththa.
058	HEB	003	007	Hessa gishshas Xillo Ayanay giza mala, «Intte hach iza qaala siyikko
058	HEB	003	008	bazzo biittan intte tana paaccida wode makkallidayssaththo intte wozina muumisopite.
058	HEB	003	009	Intte aawati kase heen tana paaccidanne tanara eqettida. Ta ooththidayssa wursi oyddu tammu layth gakkanaas be7ida.
058	HEB	003	010	He wode yeletata bolla ta hanqettin istta wozinay ubba wode balettees; istti ta oge eribeettenna.
058	HEB	003	011	Qasse, ‹Ta isttas immiza shemposo istti mulekka gelettenna!› gaada tani ta hanqon caaqqadis» gees.
058	HEB	003	012	Ta ishatoo! Inttefe oonikka de7o Xoossaafe haraso inttena haassiza iitanne ammanontta wozinay dontta mala naagettite.
058	HEB	003	013	Harappeka intte garsafe oonikka nagaran balettidi ba wozina muumisontta mala, «Hach» geetettishin hach hach intte intte garsan minettite.
058	HEB	003	014	Nuus kase koyroppe diza ammano nuni wurseth gakkanaas lo7eththi minththi oykkiko nuni Kirstoosara issife laattana.
058	HEB	003	015	Hessika, «Intte hach iza qaalaa siyikko kase makkallidaytayssa mala ha7ikka intte wozina intte minththontta mala» geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettidayssaththo hanides.
058	HEB	003	016	Siyidi makkallidayti istti oonanttee? Musey Gibxeppe kaaleththi kessidayta ubbata gidettennee?
058	HEB	003	017	Xoossi istta bolla oyddu tammu layth hanqettidayti istti oonanttee? Nagara ooththiin istta ahay bazzo biittan kundi attidayta gidettennee?
058	HEB	003	018	Izas azazettontta ixxidaytappe attiin iza shemposo gelontta mala izi caaqqi diggiday haray oonanttee?
058	HEB	003	019	Hessa gishshas istti gelontta attiday ammanoy baynda gishshas gididayssa nu eroos.
058	HEB	004	001	Gede shemposo gelanaas imettida hidotay ha7ikka naagetti diza gishshas intte giddofe oonikka hessas bessonttaade gidontta mala ane naagettoos.
058	HEB	004	002	Heytanttas sabbakettida mala nuuska mishiraachcho qaalay sabbakettides; gidikkoka siyida asatara siyida qaalay isttara ammanon walakettontta aggida gishshas istta go7ibeenna.
058	HEB	004	003	Nu qasse ammanizayti he shemposoza gelana. Xoossi, «Hessa gishshas tani ta hanqon, ‹Ta isttas immana gida shemposoza istti mulekka gelettenna› gaada ta caaqqadis» gides. Gido attiin hayssi alamey medhettoosoppe haa simmiin iza oosoy polettides.
058	HEB	004	004	Issi sohon laappunththa gallassa gishshas, «Laappunththa gallassi Xoossi ooso ubbaafe shempides» geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafaan xaafettides.
058	HEB	004	005	Qasseka he sozan, «Tumappe istti ta shemposo mulekka gelettenna» gees.
058	HEB	004	006	Iza shemposo buro gelana issi issi asati deettes; kase isttas mishiraachcho qaalay sabbakettidayti azazettontta ixxida gishshas iza shemposo istti gelibeettenna.
058	HEB	004	007	Hessa gishshas Xoossi, «Hach» giidi qasseka hara gallas woththides; hessika daro layththatappe guye Dawite baggara, «Hach intte iza qaalaa siyikko intte wozinaa muumisopite» geetetti kase yootettida mala hanides.
058	HEB	004	008	Iyaasoy isttas shempo immidaakko Xoossi hara gallas giidi yootennakoshin.
058	HEB	004	009	Hessa gishshas Sambata gallas shempoy Xoossa deres ha7ikka dees.
