059	JAM	005	004	Intte intte wozinan woththite; intte kath maxishe peydaytas istta wolqqa waagaa intte qanxxontta aggida gishshas intte bolla waassishe intte achchan deettes. Kath maxizayta waasoy ubba dandayza Godaa hayththan gakkides.
