060	1PE	002	005	Intte Godaa Yesusaakko shiiqanaykka de7o shuchchaa mala Xillo Ayana duussaso gidana mala oosetteeta; hessaththoka intte Yesus Kirstoosa baggara ufayssiza Ayana yarsho Xoossas shiishshanaas geeshsha qeeseta gidandeta.
