# BOOK	061	2PE	2 Peter	2Phexroosa Kiita
061	2PE	001	001	Yesus Kirstoosa oosanchchanne izan Hawaare Simoona gidida Phexroosappe, nu Godaappenne nu dhale Yesus Kirstoosappe beettida xilloteththa baggara nu demmida ammano mala bonchchettida ammano demmidaytoo!
061	2PE	001	002	Xoossaanne nu Godaa Yesusa eron kiyateththinne saroy inttes gido.
061	2PE	001	003	Ba bonchchoninne ba kiyateththan nuna xeygidayssa nuni iza erida gishshas iza Xoossateththaa wolqqay de7ossinne Xoos goynnanaas nuus koshshizaaz ubbaa immides.
061	2PE	001	004	Ba bonchchoninne ba kiyateththan bonchcho wogay dizayssanne keehi gita gidida iza hidotaa nuni demmidos; heytantta baggara intte iita amo gaason hayssa ha alamezan diza dhayoppe kessi ekkidi Xoossateththa hanozappe izara gishettizaadentta gidideta.
061	2PE	001	005	Hessa gaason hayssafe kaalliza miishshati inttes gujettana mala ane minnite. Ammano bolla kiyateth, kiyateththa bolla erateth,
061	2PE	001	006	erateththa bolla bana haaro, bana haaro bolla dandayan mineteth, dandayan mineteththa bolla Xoossas goyno,
061	2PE	001	007	Xoossas goyno bolla ishanttara doseteth, ishanttara doseteththa bolla siiqo gujjite.
061	2PE	001	008	Hayti inttes dari dizaaz gidikko heyti inttena intte Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa eron go7aynne ayfey bayndayta gidontta mala naagana.
061	2PE	001	009	Hayti ha miishshati baynda asi gidikko haahon diza miish demmontta qooqe asa mala; hessaadey kase aadhdhida ba nagarappe geeyidayssaka balettides.
061	2PE	001	010	Ta ishatoo! Hessa gishshas intte xeygettidayssanne doorettidayssa shaakki eranaas keehi amottizayta gidite; intte hessaththo ooththiko mulekka dhuphetteketa.
061	2PE	001	011	Intte hessaththo hankko mernaappe mernaas diza nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa kawoteththan gelanaas inttes kumeththa maatay imettana.
061	2PE	001	012	Intte hayta ha yo7ota eridinne intte erida tumaan minni de7ikkoka heyta tani inttena qofsanaappe guye giikke.
061	2PE	001	013	Tani paxa diza wode ubbaan inttena ubba wode denththeththanayssi bessizaaz misatidi taas beettees.
061	2PE	001	014	Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi taas qonccisida mala tani hayssa alamezappe elelada hayqqanayssa ta erays.
061	2PE	001	015	Tani ha7i minettizay ta hayqqada inttefe shaakettidaappe guye intte hayta ha yo7ota ubba wode qoppana malassa.
061	2PE	001	016	Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa wolqqafe izas yuussa gishshas nu inttes yootida wode nuni nu ayfera iza bonchchoza be7idi markkattoos attiin asi coo mela medhdhi ekkidi gene haasayza haysi7e mala gidenna.
061	2PE	001	017	«Tani izan ufayettizaadey ta dosiza ta naazi hayssa» giza qaala giirissay gita bonchchora izas yida wode izi Xoossaa Aawappe bonchchonne gitateth ekkides.
061	2PE	001	018	Nuni izara anjjettida zumaa bolla dishe hayssa saloppe ha yida giirissaa nuni nu hayththan siyidos.
061	2PE	001	019	Hessi wurikka kase nabeti yootidayssi tumu gididayssa lo7eththi qonccisees; hessa gishshas intte dhumason diza xomppes lo7eththi naagettizayssa mala kase nabeti yootidayssa lo7eththi naagettite. Intte hessaththo ooththanay gadey wonttanaas, bazzoy zo7ana gakkanaassinne wonti maaththa xoolinttezi intte wozinan poo7ana gakkanaassa.
061	2PE	001	020	Intte harappe aaththi qoppanaas bessizay Geeshsha Maxaafan diza tinbite qaalaan yootettida ay miishshika oonikka baas misatida mala birshanaas bessenna.
061	2PE	001	021	Ay tinbiteykka asa shene mala mulekka yibeenna; gido attiin tinbitey wurikka Xillo Ayanay kaaleththiin iza kaallida asati Xoossafe ekkidi yootidaaza.
061	2PE	002	001	Gido attiin beni wode wordo nabeti dere giddon dizayssa mala hessaththoka ha7i intte giddon wordo astamaareti de7andettes; heytantti asa dhayssiza wordo timirte qotara diccana mala ooththeettes; bana ashshida Godaakka kaddidi bana eeson dhayssizaaz ba bolla eheettes.
061	2PE	002	002	Hessa gaason daro asay yeellachchiza istta ogeza kaallees; he istta oosoza gaason tumaa ogey cayettees.
061	2PE	002	003	Heyti wordo astamaareti miishshas gaphigaphiza gishshas barkka medhdhi ekkida yo7o yooti yootidi inttes dizaaz baas bonqqi ekkeettes; beni beniisoppe pirday isttas giigetti uttides; addafe istta dhayoy naagees.
061	2PE	002	004	Haray attoshin nagara ooththida kiitanchchatas Xoossi mishettontta istti ciimma gidida dhuma olla giddon de7idi pirda gallas gakkanaas naagettana mala gede gaannamen yeggides.
061	2PE	002	005	Hessaththoka xilloteththa gishshas sabaake gidida Nohe hankko laappun asatara ashshidi Xoossas goynnontta asati diza alameza bolla dhayssiza haaththe ehishe qadhettidi kase he wode alameza maaribeenna.
061	2PE	002	006	Qasseka Xoos goynnonttayta qaxxayanaas ubbaas leemiso gidana mala Sodoomeynne Gamoora katamati bidinth gidana gakkanaassinne xuugetti dhayana gakkanaas istta bolla pirdides.
061	2PE	002	007	Wogay baynda yeellachchiza ooso ooththiza asata ooson ubba wode so77u gishe diza xillo Looxe gidikko ashshi ekkides.
061	2PE	002	008	He xillo addezi istta giddon dishin gallas gallas izi be7izayssaninne siyizayssan he wogay baynda asata oosozan iza shemppoya waayettadus.
061	2PE	002	009	Histtiin hessi wurikka hessa mala gidikko Goday baas goynnishe diza asata paaceppe ashshanayssanne nagaranchchatakka wostti qaxxayanaakkonne pirda gallassas wostti istta naagidi gaththanaakko hessa izi erees guussa.
061	2PE	002	010	Harappeka heyti tuna gidida ba asho amo kaallizaytanne Xoossa Godateth kadhizayta pirda gallassas naagi woththides. Heyti wordo astamaareti istti xalatanne otoranchchata gidida gishshas salo bolla isttas godateththi dizayta cayishe babbettenna.
061	2PE	002	011	Kiitanchchati isttafe bollara wolqqaynne godateththi dizayta gidikkoka Godaa sinththan istta bolla kadhe qaala kessi mootettenna.
061	2PE	002	012	Heyti wordo astamaareti gidikko baas erettontta ixxida miish ubbaa cash cayeettes; heytantti narxan oykettanaassinne hayqqanaas yelettida; coo mela ba shenen dizaytanne qofay baynda do7ata mala; do7ati coo mela dhayzayssaththo isttika mulera dhayana.
061	2PE	002	013	Qoho ooso ooththida gishshas istti mulera ba ooso waaga ekkana; istta ufayssi seeta gallas maththoteththinne wogay baynda buraqo; istti hessa mala wogay baynda gufan inttenara issife xeygettiza wode as baleththiza ba asho oosozan istti iitanne yeellachchizayta.
061	2PE	002	014	Isttas nagara oosoppe naagettontta amottiza ayfey dees; isttas nagara ooso siiqiza amoteththi ay wodekka simmenna. Ammanon buro minni eqqontta asata baleththeettes; miishshas gaphigapheettes; istti qanggettidayta.
061	2PE	002	015	Istti suure ogeza aggidi dhayda; iita ooso ooththidi demmiza miish siiqida Bi7oore naa Bala7aame oge biidi balettida.
061	2PE	002	016	Bala7aamey gidikko ba ooththida nagara gishshas seerettides shin haasaya erontta hareya asa qaalan izas haasayada he nabeza balaappe seera zaaradus.
061	2PE	002	017	Heyti he asati haaththi baynda pulttota; gote carkon biza shaara mala; istta sakkanna dhumay naagees.
061	2PE	002	018	Kase bala garsan diza asata giddofe kessi ekki yiidi daro gam7ontta asata; hada gidida otoro qaala haasayan, asho amoninne layman baleththeettes.
061	2PE	002	019	«Intte wozzettana» gishe inttes ufays immeettes; xoonettida asi bana xoonidaades aylle gidi haarettizayssaththo isttika baas nagaras aylle.
061	2PE	002	020	Nu Godaanne nuna ashshida Yesus Kirstoosa eridi ha alameza tunateththaafe kessi ekkidaappe guye qasseka guye simmidi he kase tunateththaan xoonettidi gelikko isttas kaseyssafe guyeyssi aadho iita gidana.
061	2PE	002	021	Istti xilloteththa oge shaakki eridaappe guye isttas imettida geeshsha azazozappe guye simmanaappe istti kase he xilloteththa ogeza erontta aggidaakko isttas lo7okkoshin.
061	2PE	002	022	«Kanay ba cooyida cooshshaa maanaas guye simmees.» Hessaththoka, «Guddunththi meecettidi guye simmi urqqan genderettees» geetettiza tumu leemisoy istta bolla gakkides.
061	2PE	003	001	Ta siiqotoo! Tani inttes xaafishin hayssi nam7anththo kiita; tani inttes nam7u kiitatakka xaafiday hayta ha yo7ota akeeki ekkidi intte suure qofa qoppana mala inttena beegoththanaassa.
061	2PE	003	002	Hayssafe kase geeshsha nabeti yootida qaalanne qasse Hawaareta baggara intte demmida nu Godaanne nuna ashshidayssa azazo intte yuushshi qoppana mala ta koyays.
061	2PE	003	003	Hara ubbaafe kasetidi hayssa yuushshi qopite; wurseththa gallassatan qidhizaytinne ba iita amo kaallishe as kadhizayti yaana.
061	2PE	003	004	Istti, «Godaa Yesusi, ‹Yaana› giza hidotay yootettibeennee? Histtiin izi awan dizee? Beni nu aawati hayqqoosofe haa simmiin, haniza miishshi wurikka medhettoosoppe haa simmiin hekko kase ba diza mala dees» geettes.
061	2PE	003	005	Heyti he asati kase daro wodeppe kase saloy Xoossa qaalan medhettoyssanne biittayka haaththafenne haaththan dizayssa erishe kaddeettes.
061	2PE	003	006	He wode diza alamezi haaththan mitetti dhaydes.
061	2PE	003	007	Hessaththoka ha7i diza saloynne biittay nagaranchchati dhayana diza pirda gallas gakkanaas tamas giigi uttida.
061	2PE	003	008	Ta siiqotoo! Intte gidikko Godaa achchan issi gallassi shii layththa mala; qasseka shii layththi issi gallassa mala gididayssa hessa he hanoza balopite.
061	2PE	003	009	Issi issi asatas misatiza mala Goday ba yootida hidota qaalaa polanaas gam7ennakoshin asi wurikka maarettana malanne ay asikka dhayontta mala koyidi izi intte gishshas takkees.
061	2PE	003	010	Godaa gallassay qasse kayso yeeththa mala qoppontta dishin gakki wodhdhana; he gallas saloti gita giirissan aadhdhana; medheteththi wurikka taman xuugetti dhayana; biittaynne iza bolla dizaazi wurikka xuugettana.
061	2PE	003	011	Hessa gishshas heyti wurikka hessaththo dhayanaaz gidikko histtiin intte geeshshateththan Xoossas goynnishe daanaas inttes waani bessennee?
061	2PE	003	012	Hessa gishshas Xoossa gallassay yaanayssa intte laamotizaytanne izi eleli yaana mala ooththizayta gidite. He gallas saloy taman xuugetti dhayana; medheteththatikka tama seelan seerana.
061	2PE	003	013	Gido attiin nuni izi nuus immida hidotaa mala xilloteththa oosoy oosettizaso ooraththa salonne ooraththa biitta naagoos.
061	2PE	003	014	Hessa gishshas ta siiqotoo! Hessi wurikka hanana gallas intte naagishe diikko Goday inttena intte bolla borey baynda dishin saroteththan demmana mala minni diite.
061	2PE	003	015	Nu Godaa dandayay inttena ashshanaas gididayssa intte erite; nu siiqo ishaa Phawuloosi baas imettida erateththa mala izi inttes xaafidayssi hayssa.
061	2PE	003	016	Izi hayssa ha hanoza gishshas ba kiitatan ubbaan hayssaththoka xaafides; iza kiitata giddon eranaas waayisiza issi issi hanoti deettes; erateththi isttas paccidaytinne nam7u qofan yooqu gizayti hara Geeshsha Maxaafata mirqqizayssaththoka haytakka istti mirqqana; istti hessaththo ooththizay baas dhayanaassa.
061	2PE	003	017	Ta ishatoo! Intte qasse hessa kasetidi erida gishshas hankko makkallata balaa gaason gooshetti biidi kase intte minni dizasoppe kundontta mala naagettite.
061	2PE	003	018	Hessafe bollara nu Godaanne nu dhale Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththaninne iza shaakki eron pude diccite; izas ha7ikka mernaaskka bonchchoy gido. Amiin.
#
# BOOK	062	1JO	1 John	1Yohannisa Kiita
062	1JO	001	001	De7o qaala gishshas koyroppe dizayssa nuni nu hayththan siyidayssanne nu ayfera be7idayssa lo7eththi xeellidayssa, nu kushera oykki be7idayssa gishshas haasayoos.
062	1JO	001	002	De7oykka qonccides; nunikka nu ayfera be7idi markkattoos. Izas iza Aawaa achchan dizayssanne nuuska qonccida mernaa de7o gishshas nu inttes yootoos.
062	1JO	001	003	Intteska nunara issifeteththi daana mala nuni be7idayssanne siyidayssa inttes yootoos; nu issifeteththayka Aawaranne iza Naa Yesus Kirstoosara.
062	1JO	001	004	Nu ufayssay kumeth gidana mala nu hayssa inttes xaafoos.
062	1JO	001	005	Nu izappe siyidi inttes yootiza kiitay, «Xoossi poo7o; iza achchan mulekka dhumay deenna» gizayssa.
062	1JO	001	006	«Nu dhuman simerettishe izara nuus issifeteththi dees» giikko wordotoos attiin tuman dookko.
062	1JO	001	007	Gido attiin izi poo7on diza mala nunikka poo7on simerettiko nu garsan nuus issifeteththi dees; iza naa Yesus Kirstoosa suuththi nuna nagara ubbaafe geeshshees.
062	1JO	001	008	Nuni nunan nagaray baa giikko nurkka nuna baleththoos; tumaykka nunan deenna.
062	1JO	001	009	Nuni nu nagaraa paaxikko izi nu nagaraa atto gaanaassinne nu qohoppe nuna wursi geeshshanaas izi ammanettidaadenne xillo.
062	1JO	001	010	Nuni nagara ooththibeekko giikko iza nu wordanchcha kessoossinne iza qaalaykka nunan deenna.
062	1JO	002	001	Ta naytoo! Ta inttes hayssa xaafizay intte nagara ooththontta malassa; gido attiin oonikka nagara ooththiko Aawaa achchan nuus xabaqay dees; izikka xilloza Yesus Kirstoosa.
062	1JO	002	002	Izi nu nagaray atto geetettana mala oge giigsizaade; hessika nuna xalla gidontta kumeththa alame asassara attiin nuus xalla gidenna.
062	1JO	002	003	Nu iza azazota polikko nu iza eridayssa hessan eroos.
062	1JO	002	004	«Ta iza erays» gishe iza azazo polonttaade gidikko hessaadey wordo asa attiin tumay izaaden deenna.
062	1JO	002	005	Qasse oonikka iza qaalaa naagikko tumu Xoossa siiqoy izaaden polettides; nuni izan dizayssa nu erizay hessanna.
062	1JO	002	006	Ta izan days giza asi oonikka Yesusi simerettida mala simerettanaas bessees.
062	1JO	002	007	Ta siiqotoo! Ta inttes xaafizayssi kase inttes dizaaro inttekon gam7ida azazoyo attiin hara ooraththa azazo gidenna; gam7ida azazoya kase intte siyida qaalayo.
062	1JO	002	008	Hara baggara ta inttes xaafizay Kirstoosa achchaninne intte achchan tumu gidida ooraththa azazo; gaasoykka dhumay aadhdhiin tumu poo7oy poo7isishe dees.
062	1JO	002	009	Poo7on days gishe ba ishaa ixxizaadey ha7ikka dhuman dees.
062	1JO	002	010	Ba ishaa siiqizaadey poo7on dees; hessaades dhuphe gidiza miishshi deenna.
062	1JO	002	011	Gido attiin ba ishaa ixxizaadey gidikko dhuma giddon dees; dhuman simerettees; dhumay iza qooqisida gishshas izi awa bizaakkonne ba bizaso erenna.
062	1JO	002	012	Ta naytoo! Intte nagaray Yesus Kirstoosappe dendidayssan atto geetettida gishshas ta inttes xaafays.
062	1JO	002	013	Aawatoo! Kase koyroppe dizayssa intte eriza gishshas ta inttes xaafays; naateththatoo! Intte Xala7e xoonida gishshas ta inttes xaafays.
062	1JO	002	014	Naateththa naytoo! Intte Aawaa erida gishshas ta inttes xaafays; aawatoo! Koyroppe dizayssa iza intte erida gishshas ta inttes xaafays. Naateththatoo! Intte minota gidida gishshassinne Xoossa qaalay inttenan diza gishshas intte Xala7e xoonida gishshas ta inttes xaafays.
062	1JO	002	015	Hayssa alameza woykko ha alamezan diza ay miishsheka dosopite; oonikka ha alameza dosikko Aawaa siiqoy izaade achchan deenna.
062	1JO	002	016	Gaasoykka ha alamezan dizay wuri asho amoteth, ayfes lo7onne duussan ceeqeteth; hayti alameppe attiin Xoossaa aawappe yizayta gidettenna.
062	1JO	002	017	Alameynne alamen diza amoteththi aadhdhana; Xoossa shene polizayti gidikko mernaas daana.
062	1JO	002	018	Naytoo! Hayssi wurseththa saate; intte siyida mala Kirstoosara eqettizaadey yaana; ha7ikka Kirstoosara eqettiza daroti yida. Hayssi wurseththa saate gididayssa nu hayssan eroos.
062	1JO	002	019	Istti nu giddofe kezida; gido attiin istti kasekka nu bagga gidettenna; istti nu bagga gididaakko nunara minni eqqana; gido attiin istti wuri nu bagga gidonttayssi erettana mala nuuppe shaakettida.
062	1JO	002	020	Inttena qasse Kirstoosi Xillo Ayanan tiydes; hessa gishshas intte wurikka tumaa ereeta.
062	1JO	002	021	Ta inttes xaafizay intte tumaa erontta gishshas gidenna; gido attiin intte tumaa eriza gishshassinne tumaa garsafe aykko wordoyka beettonttayssa intte eriza gishshassa.
062	1JO	002	022	Yesusa izi Kirstoosa gidenna gi kaddizaadefe hara wordanchchay oonee? Hessaadey Aawaanne Naaza kaddizayssi Kirstoosara eqettizaade.
062	1JO	002	023	Naaza kaddizaades oonaska Aaway deenna; Naaza ekkizaades ubbaas izas Aaway dees.
062	1JO	002	024	Intte koyro siyida qaalaya inttenan du; intte koyro siyidaara inttenan diikko intteka Naazaninne Aawaan daana.
062	1JO	002	025	Mernaa de7oy izi nuus immana gida hidota qaala.
062	1JO	002	026	Inttena baleththiza asata gishshas hayssa inttes xaafadis.
062	1JO	002	027	Intte qasse izappe ekkida Xillo Ayanay inttenan diza gishshas haray oonikka inttena tamaarsanaas bessenna; izi inttena tamaarsanayssi tuma attiin wordo gidenna; hessa gishshas Xillo Ayanay inttena tamaarsida mala Kirstoosan de7ite.
062	1JO	002	028	Ha7i ta naytoo! Izi qoncciza wode nuus xalateththi daana mala izi yiza wodekka nu iza sinththan yeellatontta mala intte izan de7ite.
062	1JO	002	029	Izi xillo gididayssa intte erizaa gidikko xillo ooththizay wuri izappe yelettidayssa intte ereeta.
062	1JO	003	001	Nuni Xoossa nayta geetettana mala Aaway darssi siiqida iza siiqoy nuus ay mala gitakkonne ane be7ite! Tumukka nu iza nayta; alamey nuna erontta aggiday iza erontta aggida gishshassa.
062	1JO	003	002	Ta ishatoo! Nuni ha7i Xoossa nayta; buro nu ay hananaakko ha7i qonccibeenna; Kirstoosi qoncciza wode nu iza beyanayssanne izakka misatanayssa nu eroos.
062	1JO	003	003	Hayssa izan hidota ooththizay wuri izi geesh gidida mala bana geeshshees.
062	1JO	003	004	Nagara ooththizay wurikka makkalla ooththees; nagaraykka makkalla.
062	1JO	003	005	Izi nagara dhayssanaas qonccidayssa intte ereeta; izan nagaray baawa.
062	1JO	003	006	Izan diza asi oonikka nagara ooththenna; nagara ooththizaadey oonikka gidikko iza beyibeenna woykko eribeenna.
062	1JO	003	007	Ta naytoo! Inttena oonikka baleththontta mala naagettite; izi xillo gidida mala xillo ooththizaadeyka xillo.
062	1JO	003	008	Nagara ooththizay Xala7eppe; gaasoykka Xala7ey koyroppeka nagara ooththizaade; Xoossa nay qonccidaykka Xala7e ooso laallanaassa.
062	1JO	003	009	Xoossafe yelettiday wuri nagara ooththenna; Xoossa zereththi izan diza gishshassinne izi Xoossafe yelettida gishshas nagara ooththana dandayenna.
062	1JO	003	010	Xoossa naytinne Xala7e nayti shaaketti erettizay hessanna; Xillo ooththonttaynne ba ishaa siiqonttay wuri Xoossafe gidenna.
062	1JO	003	011	Intte koyro siyidaara, «Nuni nu garsan siiqettana bessees» geetettida kiitaya hanno.
062	1JO	003	012	Iita bagga gididi ba ishaa wodhida Qayeele mala gidopite; izi aazas wodhidee? Gaasoykka iza oosoy iita; ishaa oosoy lo7o gidida gishshassa.
062	1JO	003	013	Ta ishatoo! Inttena alame asay ixxiko malalettofte.
062	1JO	003	014	Nuni nu ishata dosiza gishshas hayqoppe de7on pinnidayssa nu eroos; siiqoy bayndaadey wuri hayqo giddon dees.
062	1JO	003	015	Ba ishaa ixxizaadey shemppo wodhida asa mala; shemppo wodhidaades mernaa de7oy bayndayssa intte ereeta.
062	1JO	003	016	Yesus Kirstoosi ba shemppo nu gishshas aaththi immida gishshas siiqoy aazakko nu hessan eroos; nunikka nu shemppo nu ishata gishshas aaththi immanaas bessees.
062	1JO	003	017	Miishshi dizaadey oonikka ba ishay waayettishin be7idi izas mishettontta aggiko Xoossa siiqoy izan waani daanee?
062	1JO	003	018	Ta naytoo! Tumu oosonppe attiin coo doonaninne qaalan xalla siiqeteth ane aggoos.
062	1JO	003	019	Nuni tumu bagga gididayssa hayssan eroossinne nu wozinakka iza sinththan shempisoos.
062	1JO	003	020	Hessika nu wozinay nu bolla pirdiza miishshan ubbaan Xoossi nu wozina qofaappe bollara gidida gishshas izi ubbaa erees.
062	1JO	003	021	Ta ishatoo! Nu wozinay nu bolla pirdontta aggiko nuna Xoossa sinththan yashissana miishshi deenna.
062	1JO	003	022	Nuni azazota naagiza gishshassinne iza ufayssizaaz ooththiza gishshas nu iza woossizaaz wursi nu izappe ekkana.
062	1JO	003	023	Iza azazoykka nu iza Naaza Yesus Kirstoosa ammananassinne izi nuna azazida mala nuni nu giddon dosettana malassa.
062	1JO	003	024	Iza azazota naagizayti wuri izan deettes; izikka isttan dees; izi nunan dizayssa nu izi nuus immida Ayanan eroos.
062	1JO	004	001	Ta ishatoo! Ayana wursi ammanopite; gido attiin ayanati Xoossafekkonne paacci xeellite; gaasoykka daro wordo nabeti biitta bolla laalettida.
062	1JO	004	002	Intte Xoossa Ayana erana ogey, «Yesus Kirstoosi asa asho may7idi yides» giza Ayanay wuri Xoossafekko!
062	1JO	004	003	«Yesus Kirstoosi asa asho may7idi yides» gontta ayanay Xoossafe gidenna; kase izi yaana gishin intte siyida Kirstoosara eqettiza ayanay hessa; ha7ikka izi alame bolla dees.
062	1JO	004	004	Ta naytoo! Intte Xoossayta; Intte istta xoonideta; gaasoykka inttenan dizay alamen dizayssafe aadhdhees.
062	1JO	004	005	Istti alame baggako; hessa gishshas istti haasayzay wuri alameppe kezizayssa; alame asay istti gizayssa siyees.
062	1JO	004	006	Nuni gidikko Xoossa bagga; Xoos erizay nu gizayssa siyanashin Xoossa bagga gidonttaadey gidikko nu gizayssa siyenna. Tumu Ayananne wordo ayana nu shaakki erizay hayssanna.
062	1JO	004	007	Ta ishatoo! Siiqoy Xoossafe gidida gishshas nuni ane siiqettoos; as siiqiza asi wuri Xoossafe yelettidaadenne Xoos erizaade.
062	1JO	004	008	As siiqontta asi Xoos erenna; gaasoykka Xoossi siiqo.
062	1JO	004	009	Xoossay nu giddon ba siiqo qonccisiday nu iza baggara de7o demmana mala ba naa issineza haa duge ha alamezan yeddidayssana.
062	1JO	004	010	Nuni Xoos siiqibeekko shin izi nuna siiqides; nu nagaraa dhayssana mala ba naaza yeddides; siiqo guussika hessa.
062	1JO	004	011	Ta ishatoo! Xoossi nuna hayssaththo siiqikko nunikka nu giddon siiqettanaas bessees.
062	1JO	004	012	Xoos be7ida asi oonikka baa; nuni nu giddon siiqettizaa gidikko Xoossi nunan daana; iza siiqoykka nunan polettana.
062	1JO	004	013	Izi nuus ba Ayana immida gishshas nu izan dizayssanne izikka nunan dizayssa nu hessan eroos.
062	1JO	004	014	Aaway ba naaza hayssa ha alame asaa ashshanaas yeddidayssa nu be7idossinne iza gishshas markkattoos.
062	1JO	004	015	Yesusi Xoossa naa gididayssa ammanidi markkattiza ubbaan Xoossi deessinne izaadeyka Xoossan dees.
062	1JO	004	016	Hessa gishshas Xoossi nuna siiqiza siiqo nu eroos; nu iza siiqon ammanettoos; Xoossi siiqo; siiqon dizaadey Xoossan dees; Xoossika hessaaden dees.
062	1JO	004	017	Nuni hayssa biittaa bolla de7izay Kirstoosi de7ida mala gidida gishshas nuus pirda gallas baboy deenna; hessankka siiqoy nunan kumeth gidees.
062	1JO	004	018	Siiqo giddon baboy baa; tumu siiqoy gidikko babo kessi wora yeggees; baboy qixaatera issife oyketti dees; babbizaade siiqoy kumeth gidenna.
062	1JO	004	019	Izi kasetidi nuna siiqida gishshas nunikka iza siiqoos.
062	1JO	004	020	Oonikka Xoos siiqays gishe ba ishaa ixxiko hessaadey wordanchcha; ba ayfera be7iza ba ishaa siiqontta asi ba ayfen be7ontta Xoossaa siiqanaas dandayenna.
062	1JO	004	021	«Xoos siiqiza asi wurikka ba ishaa siiqanaas bessees» giza ha azazoza izi nuus immides.
062	1JO	005	001	Yesusi izi Kirstoosa gididayssa ammanizay wuri Xoossafe yelettides. Aawaa dosizay wuri naazakka izaththo dosees.
062	1JO	005	002	Nuni Xoos dosikkonne iza azazo naagikko nuni Xoossa nayta siiqizayssa hessan eroos.
062	1JO	005	003	Xoossa doso guussi iza azazo naago; iza azazoti deexo gidettenna.
062	1JO	005	004	Gaasoykka Xoossafe yelettiday wuri alame xoonees; alame xoonizaykka nu ammano.
062	1JO	005	005	Yesusi Xoossa naa gididayssa ammanizaadefe attiin alame xoonizay haray oonee?
062	1JO	005	006	Haaththaninne suuththan yiday hayssa Yesus Kirstoosa; izi haaththaninne suuththan yides attiin haaththan xalla yibeenna; hessaka iza gishshas markkattizay Ayana; he Ayanay tumu ayana.
062	1JO	005	007	Hessa gishshas izas heedzdzu markkati deettes.
062	1JO	005	008	Heytikka ayana, haaththenne suuth; heedzdzata qaalaykka issino.
062	1JO	005	009	Nu asa markkateth ammanikko Xoossa markkateththi hessafe aadhdhees; hessika izi ba naaza gishshas immida Xoossa markkateththa.
062	1JO	005	010	Xoossa Naan ammaniza ubbaa wozinan iza gishshas markkateththi dees; Xoos ammanonttay wurikka Xoossi ba Naaza gishshas immida markkateththaa ammanontta gishshas iza wordosees.
062	1JO	005	011	Iza markkateththika Xoossi mernaa de7o nuus immides; he de7oykka iza Naazan dees gizayssa.
062	1JO	005	012	Naazi dizaades de7oy dees; Xoossa Nay bayndaades de7oy deenna.
062	1JO	005	013	Inttes Xoossa Naan ammanizaytas mernaa de7oy dizayssa intte erana mala ta hayssa inttes xaafays.
062	1JO	005	014	Nu Xoossa sinth shiiqanaas nuus diza xalateththi hayssa; nu ay miishshika iza shene mala woossiko izi nu woosaa siyana.
062	1JO	005	015	Nu iza woossiza miish izi ubbaa siyizayssa nu erizaa gidikko nu woossida miishshaa ubbaa ekkanayssa nu eroos.
062	1JO	005	016	Oonikka ba ishay bana hayqos gaththontta nagara ooththishin beyikko izas woosso; Xoossika hayqos gaththontta nagara ooththidaytas de7o immana; hayqos gaththiza nagaraykka dees; hayqos gaththiza nagara gishshas woosso giikke.
062	1JO	005	017	Makkallay wurikka nagara; hayqos gaththontta nagaraykka dees.
062	1JO	005	018	Xoossafe yelettiday wuri nagara ooththenna; gaasoykka Xoossa Nay iza naagizayssanne iitay iza bochchonttayssa nu eroos.
062	1JO	005	019	Nuni Xoossafe gididayssanne alamey kumeth iita asa kushen dizayssa nu eroos.
062	1JO	005	020	Xoossa Nay yidayssanne nuni tuma Xoossaa erana mala akeeka izi nuus immidayssa nu eroos; nunikka tumu gidida iza Naaza Yesus Kirstoosan doos; Izikka tumu Xoossanne mernaa de7o.
062	1JO	005	021	Naytoo! Inttenateththaa eeqatappe naagite.
