063	2JO	001	007	Yesus Kirstoosi asa asho may7idi yibeenna giza ammanontta daro baleththizayti alame bolla laalettida; heyta malay ay asikka as baleththizaadenne Kirstoosara eqettizaade.
063	2JO	001	008	Intte gidikko intte daabura waagaappe mela attontta malanne kumeththa woyto ekkana mala intte hu7es naagettite.
