065	JUD	001	019	Heyti as issaa issaafe shaakkizayta; asho amoteth kaallizaytanne isttan Xillo Ayanay bayndayta.
065	JUD	001	020	Ta ishatoo! Intte gidikko ubbaafe bollara intte geeshsha ammanon minni eqqite; Xillo Ayanankka minni woossite.
065	JUD	001	021	Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi ba maaroteththan inttena mernaa de7on gaththanayssa naagettishe inttenateththaa Xoossaa siiqon naagite.
065	JUD	001	022	Sidhishe diza asatas mishettite.
