066	REV	001	004	Iisiyan diza laappun Woosa Keeththatas kasekka dizayssafe, ha7ikka dizayssafenne burokka yaana Xoossaafe iza alga sinththan diza laappun ayanatappe hessaththoka hayqoppe denththan bayra gididayssafe, ha biitta kawotas kawonne ammanettida markka gididayssafe, nuna siiqizayssafenne ba suuththan nuna nu nagaraappe geeshshida Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.
